INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('72a97e55-378d-4f5e-9a58-29408f811a50', 'CIRCUIT FITNESS Circuit Fitness Magnetic Upright Exercise Bike with 15 Workout Presets, 300 lbs Capacity AMZ-594U', 'stationary bike', '"Achieve a fitter and healthier body with the Upright Exercise Bike from Circuit Fitness! Never miss a workout. This revolutionary gear lets you train in the comfort of your home. Shed the extra weight by engaging in a fat-burning workout right in the comfort of your home with this exercise bike. This gear showcases a heavy-duty frame that effectively resists scratches and chips. heavy use. The bike’s large seat can be easily adjusted to accommodate users of different body sizes, allowing it to conform to each individual user’s height for exact motion. The gear’s engineered structure facilitates proper body form during movement, enabling your workout to take maximum effect on your specific target areas. This machine comes with a magnetic resistance system; 15 preset programs simulate the effects of biking on different terrains. The resistance settings can be selected on the screen, allowing you to control and customize your cardio training according to your skill level. The bike’s handy LCD display also tracks time, pulse rate, current speed, distance traveled, and calories burned for easier progress monitoring. To maximize comfort during workouts, the machine’s textured pedals are equipped with safety loops that stabilize your feet for comfortable cycling. This gear comes with transport wheels that enable you to conveniently move it from one room to another. An ideal addition to any home gym, this equipment also boasts a water-bottle holder and a media holder to keep you hydrated and entertained while you’re working out. Burn the extra calories and experience efficient cardio training—without having to pay for gym memberships—with the Circuit Fitness Upright Exercise Bike!"', 'CIRCUIT FITNESS', 'AMZ-594U', 'Black', 'Foam, Plastic');
