INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('8a0b591d-94c6-438a-9541-66e73b122c13', 'Stamina Wonder Exercise Bike | Build Upper and Lower Body Strength on One Machine | Includes Two Online Workout Videos, Chartreuse and Gray', 'stationary bike', 'Designed for convenience, portability, and versatility, the Stamina Wonder Exercise Bike is a compact exercise bike that provides an effective, efficient cardio and muscle-toning workout. The Stamina Wonder Exercise Bike packs a workout that''s good for the whole body. Engage your core and legs with this foldable workout bike that offers adjustable bike workout intensity. This foldable workout bike has an easy-to-reach tension dial for adjustable levels of magnetic resistance. This fitness bike comes with powerful, strength-training Wonder Arms with elastic bands that add upper-body resistance workout. The adjustable-angle arms allow multiple exercises that target your back, chest, shoulders, core, arms, and legs, including bicep curls, tricep extensions, lat raises, chest presses, leg kickbacks, and more. Tone your whole body with magnetic cycling resistance and bungee cord strength resistance. This home exercise bike includes textured pedals, padded hand grips, ergonomic handlebars, and a cushioned seat and backrest. The Wonder foldable exercise bike has a folding frame and built-in wheels for easy storage. Extra features help drive performance, including the multi-function LCD monitor, which tracks workout time, distance traveled, calories burned and speed. CONVENIENT SMART WORKOUT APP- This home gym equipment is fully supported by müüv, the all-in-one app that provides smart guided audio coaching, follow-along assembly videos, and personalized workouts, and helps you move 500+ minutes per month with the right mix of cardio, strength, and flexibility for a healthy and sustainable lifestyle. The all-in-one app comes with a follow-along assembly video, personalized workouts tailored to your strength training equipment, and an ad-free music listening experience from iHeartRadio. Download the müüv app on the Apple App Store or the Google Play store. Providing you with the best workout and fitness experience, get visible results, and track your progress with Stamina.', 'Stamina', 'Wonder Exercise Bike', 'Green', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('f4d8a694-bdad-445a-bd8d-96eb796d23b3', 'Sunny Health & Fitness Indoor Stationary Cycling Exercise Bike for Home Cardio Workout, 4-Way Adjustable & Cushioned Seat, Optional Magnetic Resistance & Free Exclusive SunnyFit App Bluetooth Link', 'stationary bike', 'Effective, Durable and Comfortable are the three main advantages of Sunny Health and Fitness SF-B1203 Chain Drive Indoor Cycling Bike. Starts pedaling towards fitness with the stationary bike that offers a smooth, quiet and lasting ride every time. Get rid of that stubborn stomach fat and start toning your core muscles and lower body.', 'Sunny Health & Fitness', 'SF-B122061_SF-B123033', 'Gray', 'Alloy Steel');
