INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('6759f56d-3470-43b8-811e-c58ca14739f1', 'Joist Mount Pull Up Bar by Ultimate Body Press', 'pull up bar', 'Joist Mount Pull Up Bar with 21 inch Parallel Grip SpacingThe Joist Mount Pull Up Bar from Ultimate Body Press is the bar to own if you have exposed ceiling beams in your home.The Rigid Mount BarThrough-bolted to the structure of your home, the Joist Mount Pull Up Bar is the final word in stability and makes pull ups be the challenge you can pursue without limits. Overhead mounting gives you full range of motion and preserves the flexibility of your floor space. Do wide-grip pullups, chin-ups, neutral-grip pullups, hanging knees raises and more.Designed for your WorkoutsMultiple grip positions isolate specific muscle groups. High density foam grips support endurance. The parallel grips are spaced 21" apart to target the upper lats and are a great fit for a broad range of shoulder widths.Designed in the USAUltimate Body Press is a North Carolina company committed to delivering better workouts every day. Includes Prime eligible shipping and USA customer serviceShop with ConfidenceThe Joist Mount Pull Up Bar is backed by Ultimate Body Press against manufacturer''s defects for 10 years', 'Ultimate Body Press', 'Joist Mount Pull Up Bar', 'Black', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('62df60a7-e610-4d5a-b0c7-e7522bf87532', 'Yes4All Rotating Pull Up Handles for Pull Up Bar/Pull Up Grips/Barbell handles with Non-Slip & Foam Pad Grips - Twist Motion for Strength Training Workout', 'pull up bar', 'UPGRADE YOUR PULL UP ROUTINE WITH YES4ALL ROTATING PULL UP HANDLES! Constructed of heavy-gauge steel, Yes4All Rotating Pull up Handles can withstand heavy weight without being out of shape, broken or damaged, max support up to 300lbs. The special design comes with 360° rotation to help you rotate your wrists to complete more challenging pull-up variations. Feature with foam padded handles, our Pull-up Bar Handle/ pull ups / neutral grip handles ensure a secure, comfortable grip & prevent sliding or interruption. Plus, the rubber pad provides good vibration absorptions & prevents the pull up handles from sliding when training. COMPACT & PORTABLE FOR ON-THE-WAY WORKOUT Take seconds to assemble Yes4All Rotating Pull up Handles / Pull up hand grips into your door gym, power tower, or any stable pull-up bar with 1. 5” diameter or less with the locking pin. You can space the handles to your preferred width or quickly change between narrow & wide grip pull-ups. GAIN MORE STRENGTH & BIGGER MUSCLES Our affordable fitness gear is designed for effective bodybuilding & upper body muscle development. With Yes4All Rotating Pull up Handles, you can pump up your arms, tone your shoulders & engage more muscle mass compared to practicing with an ordinary pull-up bar. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS Sold in set of TWO Rotating Pull up Handles Material: Solid steelMax weight capacity: 300lbsHandle’s dimensions: 5. 5” x 1. 5” (LxDia)Compatible with any door gym, power tower, or stable pull-up bar with 1. 5” diameter or less Rubber interior helps stabilize the handles & prevent slipping Smooth 360° rotation for maximizing strength & efficiency Revolving grip trains major muscles & stabilizes muscles in arms, shoulders, back & chest Foam padded handles provide a firm & comfortable grip Ideal for chin-ups, pull-ups, triceps dips, and more 1-year war and 60-day return', 'Yes4All', '1NHS', 'Rotating Pull Up Handles', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('3c2028bc-3319-4aad-bbfa-f330c5af1f58', 'JFIT Deluxe Multi Exercise Doorway Pull-Up Bar with Comfort Grips, 40-Inch', 'pull up bar', 'LONGEST LENGTH BAR AVAILABLE Made in Taiwan with high grade materials, this Pull-Up bar fits doorway openings up to 40” long. With a minimum length measuring 25.25” this bar can hold up to 300lbs. Only a screwdriver or drill needed for installing, this premium pull-up bar comes with the mounting bracket, screws, and sit-up plugs needed for safety. For safety and stability, screws are provided and required for mounting. Quality adjustable hand grips made with neoprene material and Velcro allowing these removable hand grips to be placed where they are comfortable for you. Not just for Chin-Ups and Pull-Ups, mount to the bottom of a doorway to maximize your sit-ups, crunches and even triceps dips, making it easy to move locations with extra door mounts available. For safety purposes, the bar extrudes from one telescopic point, as tighter threads and toggle ends make sure that bar is safely tight and secure. End caps for ultimate safety and rubber stoppers for metal doors.', 'JFIT', '20-0265-B', 'Chrome/Black', 'Metal');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('d41c3ec0-78da-4eb3-a0ec-ecd1e595d2b9', 'R2 Wall Mounted Pull Up Bar, (500 lbs) Weight Capacity, Heavy Duty Steel Chin up Bar/ Pull up Bar for Home or Commercial Gym Workout, Upper Body Workout Bar with One Year Warranty', 'pull up bar', 'This Pull-Up bar is a must have for any gym or home set up. The bar is easy to install into standard studs. Constructed with 11 gauge steel this bar is built tough and very economical. hardware for mounting not included.', 'Rage Fitness', 'RAGE Fitness R2 Wall Mounted Pull-up Bar', 'Black', 'Metal');
