INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('b8d5e9b6-4614-47c1-bff8-a6095e11ffe7', 'RHYTHM FUN Incline Foldable Treadmill, Walking Pad with Handle Bar 3 Level Incline, 300 Lbs Portable Treadmill for Home Office, Under Desk Compact Treadmill with LED Display Remote Control & APP', 'treadmill', 'Incline treadmill', 'RHYTHM FUN', 'M4138', 'Black with Incline', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('1de3f043-ca48-49f9-87a2-a717a5c44ee9', 'Under Desk Walking Treadmill with Low-Speed Silent Mode, Flat Walker for Home Office, Portable Indoor Fitness Equipment for Home Use, 45.28 x 22 inches, Black', 'treadmill', 'Transform your workspace into a fitness zone with this sleek Flat Walker treadmill designed for under-desk use. The compact dimensions of 45.28 inches in length and 22 inches in width make it perfect for any home office or living space. At just 38.58 pounds, this lightweight yet sturdy aluminum alloy construction allows for easy movement and storage. The low-profile design, standing at only 4.92 inches tall, fits seamlessly under standing desks, letting you walk while you work. This multifunctional walking platform supports an active lifestyle without disrupting your daily routine. The black, minimalist aesthetic complements any interior, while the durable build ensures lasting performance. Perfect for those looking to incorporate more movement into their workday, this walking pad offers a practical solution for staying active while managing desk-based tasks. Note: This equipment is designed for walking exercises only and should be used on level surfaces for optimal performance.', 'Generic', 'Under Desk Walking Treadmill Black', 'Black', 'Aluminum');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('55a8074b-e2b6-4b16-b458-f4c38561d662', 'ProForm Carbon TLX; All-New Treadmill for Walking and Running with Built-in Fan and Space-Saving Design', 'treadmill', 'Experience cutting-edge convenience at your fingertips by creating an iFIT account and connecting your own device with your Carbon TLX. Store your workout stats, access 10,000+ workouts, and watch your favorite entertainment. The treadmill''s large, easy-to-press buttons make it simple to change your speed and incline level in an instant. Control all aspects of your workout effortlessly.', 'ProForm', 'Carbon TLX', 'Black', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('b663b03d-dd8b-4306-a592-1e1d1acb7d63', 'Goplus 3HP Electric Folding Treadmill, Self-Standing Superfit Treadmill with APP Control, Blue Tooth Speaker, HD Touch Screen, Installation-Free, Walking Jogging Running Machine for Home Office', 'treadmill', 'DescriptionDo you want to build up your body and have a charming body shape? Just take this folding treadmill home and work on it! With a spacious running area and various running modes, everybody could run at a suitable speed. The high quality wear-resistant belt and steel structure have excellent shock absorption, providing comfortable exercise experience for you. With the Bluetooth, you could connect the treadmill to your mobile phone through the Gymax app, so you can track your fitness data while exercising. You can easily fold up the portable walking machine and store it under the desk or bed to save room space.Please do not place the treadmill on carpet during use to avoid motor overheatFeatures:Powerful 3.0HP silent motor allows you to run at the speed of 0.6-8 mile per hourThe speed of running belt is 0.6-5mph in the walking mode and 5-12.8mph in the running mode5-layer non-slip running belt and steel structure can absorb vibration to protect the kneeThe safety key can shut off the running machine immediately in case of emergencyHD digital touch display will track your performance, including time, steps, speed, distance and caloriesThe sturdy motorized treadmill can support up to 242.5 lbsEquipped with noiseless motor, this walking machine is ideal for home and office useUse the retractable phone holder to watch videos or chat with friends while runningConnect the phone to the treadmill through Bluetooth, you can listen to musicIt is out of the box and doesn''t need to be installedSpecifications:Color: Blue+Black /Red+BlackMaterial: Steel, ABSOverall Dimensions: 60.5” x 30.5” x 47.5” (L x W x H)Folding Dimension: 30.5” x 18.5” x 60.5” (L x W x H)Running Area Dimension: 48.5” x 16.7” (L x W)Net Weight: 101.5 lbsPeak Motor Power: 3.0 HPSpeed: 0.6-8 mphRated Voltage: 110 V/60 HzWeight Capacity: 242.5 lbs', 'Goplus', 'Goplus Folding Treadmill', 'Red', 'Alloy Steel, Acrylonitrile Butadiene Styrene (ABS)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('28e26270-794a-4670-9191-4a6ecf2c21c5', 'Goplus 4.75HP Folding Treadmill with 15% Auto Incline, Electric Superfit Treadmill w/Voice and APP Control, 20 Preset Programs, LED Touch Screen, Walking Jogging Running Machine for Home Office', 'treadmill', '', 'Goplus', 'Treadmill', 'Black', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('456eb1bc-c0b3-488d-b4be-45194858cd0f', 'Horizon Fitness 7.4 at Studio Series Smart Treadmill with Bluetooth and Incline, Heavy Duty Folding Treadmill 350 lbs Weight Capacity, Pro Running Machine for Home Exercise and Running with Apps', 'treadmill', 'The Horizon Fitness 7.4 AT Studio Series folding treadmill uses Bluetooth to connect with most live or on-demand fitness apps for an immersive home exercise experience. Get the flexibility and versatility you demand, for less than other popular treadmills or gym memberships. Horizon offers the best treadmills for home on the market. Instead of investing in an expensive touchscreen or membership, use your own device to stream whatever fitness classes or media you choose, from workouts to movies and podcasts. Exclusive technologies make this treadmill engineered for use with streaming interval classes. A tablet holder, built-in speakers, in-reach media controls and a rapid charging port make it easier than ever to enjoy the apps that keep you motivated.  This foldable treadmill has an over 300+ lb weight limit capacity for high-intensity running or interval training. Power your workouts with a Rapid Sync drive system for faster speed and incline changes.  Whether you''re a walker or runner, this 22" x 60" XL deck provides all the space and comfort you need to run at your pace. All Horizon treadmill decks are built with shock-absorbing 3-Zone Variable Response Cushioning to give you the ideal amount of flex and support. Horizon treadmills are sturdy and built to last. This deck and frame combination gives you the durability you demand at an unbeatable value. Effortlessly store between workouts with one-step hydraulic folding, plus a lifetime frame and motor warranty.', 'Horizon Fitness', 'Horizon Fitness 7.4AT-02 Advanced Training Smart Treadmill', 'Black', 'Aluminum, Plastic');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('110ea6cd-016c-469b-8f2e-9e89a0429f6c', 'Assault Fitness Runner Pro - Better Than a Motorized Treadmill - Great for HIIT, Cardio, and Endurance Training - Motorless', 'treadmill', 'The AssaultRunner Pro is specifically designed to help you meet and exceed your fitness goals. While other motorized treads make it easy to “zone out,” the AssaultRunner Pro constantly demands your full attention and requires nothing less than 100% effort. It’s also equipped with built-in training programs to help track your progress and keep your workouts fresh.', 'Assault Fitness', 'AssaultRunner Pro', 'Black Frame/Charcoal', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('1449e5f8-c60e-4a27-9857-9944bfeda4d2', 'Under Desk Treadmill for Home - Desk Treadmill with Remote Control, Ideal for Work from Home Fitness - Portable Treadmill Desk', 'treadmill', 'Are you looking for a convenient and effective way to stay active while working from home? Look no further than our under desk treadmill! This walking and standing desk treadmill is the perfect addition to your home office or workspace. Designed to fit seamlessly under any standing or sitting desk, it allows you to get in a workout without interrupting your work day. Whether you''re looking to burn calories, improve your cardiovascular health, or simply increase your daily step count, this under the desk treadmill is the perfect solution. With its compact size and lightweight design, the under the desk treadmill is easy to move and store. It features a slim, low-profile design that won''t take up too much space in your home office, making it the perfect cardio equipment for home workouts. Plus, it''s incredibly easy to set up and use - just plug it into a standard electrical outlet and you''ll be ready to go in minutes. One of the standout features of this treadmill is its quiet motor. Unlike noisy running machines that can disrupt your work or annoy your housemates, this under desk treadmill operates quietly and efficiently. You won''t have to worry about noisy distractions or disturbing others while you work out. Another great feature of this treadmill is its adjustable speed. Whether you''re looking for a brisk walk or a light jog, you can adjust the speed to suit your preferences. And because it''s designed for use with a standing or sitting desk, it''s perfect for people of all fitness levels. So if you''re looking for a convenient and effective way to stay active while working from home, look no further than our under desk treadmill. With its compact size, quiet motor, and adjustable speed, this workout equipment for home workouts is the perfect addition to your cardio routine. Shop today and discover the benefits of a treadmill under desk!', 'ENPAP', 'W13625', 'Black', 'Alloy Steel');
