INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('3ebdca67-8611-4462-8810-14bb5d95789c', 'Redmon Fun and Fitness Exercise Equipment for Kids - Tread Mill', 'treadmill', 'Product DescriptionFun and Fitness for Kids Treadmill promotes a healthy ''activity based lifestyle''. Heavy duty construction of steel tube for long lasting durability and function. Encourage fun active health. The electronic monitor features time lapse and auto off after 10 minutes (two AA batteries required but not included). For a complete gym see the entire Fun and Fitness for Kids collection for a variety of equipment sold separately (Treadmill, Stationary Bike, Walker, Weight Bench, Rower, Trampoline, Dumbbell Set, and Jump Rope with Full Video Instruction Program, Barbell Set, Fitness/Yoga Mat).From the ManufacturerFun and Fitness Health System for Kid''s-Treadmill is self propelled, manual operation for safety and promotes a healthy lifestyle for kids. Sturdy frame is made of powder coated steel. Some pieces have foam wrap over the metal tubing. Includes a multi-function battery operated (2AA not included) monitoring system. All tools included.', 'REDMON Since 1883', 'Fun and Fitness for kids - Treadmill', 'Tread Mill', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('cf9e7b86-d88a-4a43-85ea-deedc4a2a75c', 'Goplus 2 in 1 Folding Treadmill, 300 LBS Capacity Walking Pad with Handle Bar, Under Desk Treadmill with Remote & APP Control and LED Display, Foldable Portable Treadmills for Home Small, Office', 'treadmill', 'It''s time to step up and stride out towards a healthier you with our 2-in-1 folding treadmill.Its powerful yet whisper-quiet brushless motor supports a weight capacity of up to 300 lbs and operates under 45dB, allowing for early morning or late-night workouts without disturbing others. Additionally, the advanced dual shock absorption system, featuring a 7-layer anti-slip, diamond-textured running belt and 6 shock-absorbing rubber pads, ensures a smooth, stable and joint-friendly running experience. The intuitive LED display of this home treadmill, enhanced with a 10-minute data retention function, and the handy remote control make tracking and adjusting your workouts effortless. Plus, stay connected and motivated with smart app integration that not only tracks your progress but also allows you to share and engage with a community. When you''re done, simply fold the treadmill and roll it away with the built-in wheels for easy storage. 2-in-1 design for running machine (0.6-7.6 MPH) and walking pad (0.6-3.8 MPH)Powerful yet quiet motor for ＜45dB low noise and 300 lbs max loadProvide a stable and secure surface with a 7-layer anti-slip running belt6 rubber absorbers for knee protectionEnsure you stay informed and motivated every step of the way with an LED displayTrack the data of speed, time, distance and calories in real-timeFull-featured remote control for easy operationPress "Start/Stop" button on the remote to pair, success indicated by D.D.D sounds Keep your remotes organized and easily accessible with a remote control holderTake a water break without losing track of your workout progress with 10-min data retentionSmart Gymax app control for data recording and dynamic sharing in the communityIncline treadmill for increased calorie burn and reduced impact on joints2 built-in wheels for effortless movementEasy to store for space-saving thanks to its folding designThe device holder with clip ensures that your phone is held securelySpecifications:Color: BlackMaterial: Metal, Engineering Plastic, ABS, PC, PVC, RubberUnfolded Dimensions: 43" x 23" x 42" (L x W x H)Folded Dimensions: 45" x 23" x 5.5" (L x W x H)Size of Running Belt: 35.5" x 15" (L x W)Length of Power Cord: 5 ftNet Weight: 51 lbsWeight Capacity: 300 lbsMotor Power: 2.25 HPCurrent: 6.3AVoltage: AC 110VFrequency: 60HzSpeed Range: 0.6-7.6 MPH/1-12 KM/HPackage Includes:1 x Treadmill1 x Remote Control1 x Silicone Treadmill Lubricant1 x Instruction', 'Goplus', 'Treadmill', 'Black', 'Metal, Engineering Plastic, ABS, PC, PVC, Rubber');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('92544f6d-074a-4743-9b24-bfd94745048c', '3G Cardio Pro Runner X Treadmill - Heavy Duty Home Construction - FreeSync FTMS Bluetooth Connectivity - Low 6.5" Step-up Height - Foldable Compact Storage - Orthopedic Belt - 350 lb Capacity', 'treadmill', 'The 3G Cardio Pro Runner is the perfect treadmill for those who want quality but also need to conserve space. While there are many folding treadmills on the market today, the Pro Runner Treadmill offers users the unique ability to have a high quality and space saving treadmill all in one! Most folding treadmills lack the quality needed to run at higher speeds or longer distances but that is not the case with the Pro Runner Treadmill. It is important to take good care of your treadmill ( the walking surface or underneath the belt). Use a 100% pure silicon lubrication will also improve the performance of the treadmill by reducing the heat and friction that occur during workouts.', '3G Cardio', 'Pro Runner', 'Silver', 'Metal');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('2ca608a2-de4b-42ee-8b2f-3d5cce9e5049', 'Walking Pad with Auto Incline, Under Desk Folding Treadmill with Remote Control and LED Display for Home Office, 2.5HP Portable Walking Jogging Running Machine, 300 LB Capacity', 'treadmill', '', 'vanmed', '140B', 'black', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('195ab87a-0579-4a6e-8a50-9d2144b1f0e1', 'GYMAX Under Desk Treadmill, 3 in 1 Walking Pad Treadmill with 340LBS Capacity, App Control, LED Monitor & Wheels, 2.5 HP Folding Running Machine Small Treadmill for Home Office Walking Jogging', 'treadmill', 'Description:Enjoy exercise with GYMAX 3 in 1 walking pad treadmill just at home!The treadmill features speed range from 0.6 mph – 7.6 mph to meet multiple demands. The 7-layer non-slip running belt and shock reduction effectively protect your joints. The powerful 2.5 HP brushless motor operates quietly under 45 dB. With the Gymax App, you could enjoy multiple training courses, dynamic community, satisfying sports mall and record detailed workout data. Moreover, the compact design and built-in wheels ensures easy storage and mobility.Features:0.6-7.6 mph speed range meets your multiple demands7-layer diamond textured running belt for better running experienceShock-absorbing design for knee protectionFeatures clear LED display for real time fitness dataFitness data will be remained after pausingPress "Start/Stop" button on the remote to pair, success indicated by “drip drip drip” soundsInclude speed shortcut buttons for more convenience“Start” button for Starting/Pausing/Resuming2.5 HP brushless motor operates efficiently while with low noise2 built-in wheels for easy movementSpecifications:Color: Blue/RedMaterial: Metal, ABS, PC, PVCUnfolded Dimensions: 42.5” x 23” x 39.5” (L x W x H)Folded Dimensions: 45” x 23” x 5” (L x W x H)Size of Running Belt: 35.5” x 15” (L x W)Length of Power Cord: 4.9 ftNet Weight: 45 lbsWeight Capacity: 340 lbsMotor Power: 2.5 HPCurrent: 6.3AVoltage: AC 110VFrequency: 60HzSpeed Range: 0.6-7.6 MPHPackage Includes:1 x Treadmill1 x Remote Control1 x Treadmill Lubricant1 x Safety Key1 x Instruction', 'GYMAX', '3 in 1 Under Desk Treadmill', 'Red', 'PC, Polyvinyl Chloride (PVC), Metal, Acrylonitrile Butadiene Styrene (ABS)');
