INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('3387ab96-2134-4891-9d54-29ce317408d6', 'Valor Fitness Chest Press Machine – Independent Converging Arms - 9 Adjustable Positions - Flat Incline - 250 Pound Max - Home Gym Equipment BF-47', 'chess press machine', 'The Valor Fitness Adjustable Flat or Incline Chest Bench Press offers an innovative solution for training workouts, providing a safe and efficient way to build strength. Designed with independent converging arms that come together, it allows for varied weight levels on each arm, catering to individual strength needs or focused single arm training. Perfect for home gym and light-commercial gym settings, this bench press''s adjustable features and independent arms offer a tailored workout experience. The additional storage pegs help maintain a clean workout space, making it a valuable addition to any fitness enthusiast''s equipment collection.', 'Valor Fitness', 'BF-47', 'Metallic Grey and Black', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('d31b6098-7aba-40f4-830b-a049c301662e', 'Yes4All Sturdy Wall Mounted Workout Anchors, Suspension Straps Trainer Anchor Swing Battle Ropes Fitness Training Hammocks Olympic Rings Body Weight Strength Training Systems', 'battle rope', 'Be flexible, be tough with Yes4All Wall Mount Workout Anchors Looking for a fitness accessory to fill in your home gym? Anchor arms will be productive physical training routine. The combo of 3 stainless steel anchors in a G-shape convenient design and necessary setup fasteners make great space-saving equipment for developing multiple body parts. Thanks to the high capacity of 300 lbs, the product can support a wide range of workouts with resistance bands such as overhead extension, chest fly, row and lunge, kickback, and lift, you name it. Note: Resistance band is not included.', 'Yes4All', 'Wall Mount Anchors', 'B. Black Set Of 3 Hook', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('d86281a0-1912-46e1-b45f-dda017f8930d', 'Ropeless Battle Ropes for Home Gym, Weighted Battle Rope, Black Workout Ropes for Working Out, Fitness Heavy Rope for Exercise Training Rope for Home Workout - 2PCS', 'battle rope', 'ASIEIT 2Pcs Ropeless Battle Ropes for Home GymWeighted Battle Rope | Workout Ropes for Fitness Training | Ideal for Home Workouts - Black💪 PortabilityThis battle rope simulates traditional rope swinging training while eliminating the bulkiness associated with conventional ropes. Its portable design allows you to exercise anywhere, anytime.💪 Durable & Wear-ResistantOur cordless battle rope is crafted from high-quality steel and features an anti-wear protective cover. Its compact design prevents deformation, making it more durable than traditional battle ropes—no need to worry about breakage.💪 User-Friendly DesignThis battle rope includes a spiral-textured, non-slip handle that ensures a secure grip for optimal performance. It also comes with a hanging rope for easy carrying, and the middle protective cover safeguards the rope from damage.💪 Easy to UseOur battle rope requires no installation, allowing you to work out whenever and wherever you want—no complicated setup or fixation like traditional battle ropes. It’s the perfect choice for fitness enthusiasts looking to exercise at home or outdoors!💪 Suitable for All Fitness LevelsBattle ropes are easy to use and carry, making them safe for men and women of all fitness levels. Whether you’re a beginner or a seasoned fitness enthusiast, and whether you prefer working out in the gym or at home, this battle rope is your best choice!Choose ASIEIT Battle Ropes for an efficient and convenient workout experience!', 'ASIEIT', '1ar4zy1mg5vg1ns2bh3D01-lp', 'Black', 'Stainless Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('2f199df5-77c9-4dbc-87e0-61e08ebfaefe', 'Yes4All Battle Rope with Protective Cover – Steel Anchor & Strap Included - Poly Dacron 1.5in - 30ft', 'battle rope', 'If you’re looking for a way to get in full body, intense daily workouts that affect your overall fitness in a positive way, there’s not a better tool to accompany you than Yes4All Battle Rope with Cover!DURABLE AND PRACTICALMade of high quality poly dacron material with nylon covering on the outside, the battle rope is extremely durable and can protect itself against friction damage, fraying and keeping itself clean, fitting for all kinds of environments. The handles are 10” long, providing plenty of space for you to comfortably grip the handles. They’re also heat shrink to prevent slipping and offer extra protection for your hands.PRACTICE YOUR WAYYes4All Battle Rope is available in 6 different options with different measurements, so no matter your level of fitness you can get the right type of rope for your exact needs. Also comes with the battle rope are an anchor and a strap to provide another way to train, helping to add variety to your exercises and more safety by keeping the rope stable in place.GET UNLIMITED BENEFITS FROM OUR BATTLE ROPESGreat for full body workoutVersatile rope options for your needsAdditional ways to practice with the included anchor and strapHelps burn fat, build strong, lean musclesEnables you to train anywhere and anytime with ease.', 'Yes4All', 'LDKA', 'Black', 'Nylon, poly dacron');
