INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('d790d403-5543-4675-af6b-689a61ea5167', 'Ultimate Body Press Dip Bar Fitness Station - Adjustable Folding Dip Stand,White/Black', 'shoulder press machine', 'The Dip Bar Fitness Station The patented Dip Bar Fitness Station by Ultimate Body Press is the only width adjustable Dip Station to fit you and your family. At 19 inches, Position I sets the handles much narrower than other dip stations and is a correct fit for most users, even younger athletes. Position II at 24 inches, accommodates builds from 190 - 350 lbs. Proper fit and form engages the correct muscles and reduces strain on the shoulders, elbows and wrists so you can focus on repetition to get the results you want in less time.  Ultimate Results • Dips get the look and performance you want - fast • Angled grips support proper form for tricep dips and chest dips • Bodyweight rows balance chest and shoulder development • Knee raises and L-sits strengthen core and lower back • Stable construction is always ready for your most strenuous workouts.  Ultimate Versatility • Two width positions provide a correct fit for everyone in your family • Assisted exercise variations let you complete full sets every time • Stores easily, folds and locks for closet and under-bed storage • Upgrade to full body workouts with Ultimate Body Press Bodyweight Resistance Trainers and Weighted Dip Belt and Agility Trainer. (accessories sold separately) • Compact design preserves floor space and is perfect for small spaces.  Ultimate Value • Adjustable leveling feet are stable on any surface • Multiple exercises, one piece of gear • Fun and rewarding exercises deliver quick results • Exceptional engineering enhances the look of your space • Supported with our workout guides and 100+ online workouts, all free!  Shop with Confidence At Ultimate Body Press we are proud to serve your gym needs and want to exceed your expectations for customer service. Customer service has complete resources to assist you and is available by phone or email. Order your Dip Bar Fitness Station today.', 'Ultimate Body Press', 'Dip Bar Fitness Station', 'White/Black', 'Metal');
