INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('a8197776-197e-48d8-81ee-5cf00a471bd5', 'Tib Bar, Tibialis Trainer, Tibia Dorsi Calf Raise Machine for Ankle/Shin Strength Training, Leg Workout, Fits 1" or 2" Weight Plates', 'calf raise machine', 'Shnlie Tib Bar, Tibialis Trainer, Tibia Dorsi Calf Raise Machine Accessories: 4 Foam Pads: Thickened foam adds friction and softness for better control, allowing one to focus on exercise and stay comfortable, can be used even with shoes off. Clamps Collar: Effectively fix the weight plate to prevent back and forth shaking. Limit Pin: Innovative designs, double protection and fixation to prevent the buckle from slipping. 2 inch diameter / 1 inch diameter: 2 sizes to choose from. Suitable for 2 inchd Olympic Plates or 1 inch dumbbell pieces (depending on the size you purchase). Function: Strengthen your leg muscle and level up your regular leg exercise.  Strengthen the tibialis anterior, improves lower body movement. Helps to avoid the potential problem to the knee, shin, and ankles.', 'Shnlie', 'Black, Fits 2" Weight Plates', 'Black, Fits 2" Weight Plates', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('019b6847-0337-4b45-a0e8-5926678bc7ee', 'Tib Bar-Tibialis Anterior Exercise Equipment, Tibialis Trainer Calf Raise Machine for Strength Training, Fits 2" Weight Plates…', 'calf raise machine', '', 'WINBOX', 'TIB01', 'black', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('051a1034-470c-4027-98a5-fea0b6000bbc', 'Tib Bar Tibialis Trainer Pro, Tibia Dorsi Calf Machine, Professional Knees Over Toes Equipment for Strength Training Shins/Ankles/Calves, Fits 1" and 2" Olympic Weight Plate (Black)', 'calf raise machine', 'The Tib Bar is your ultimate solution for building leg, tibialis, and hamstring strength. Designed to fit both 1-inch and 2-inch weight plates, this versatile equipment ensures you can customize your workout to meet your fitness goals. Whether you''re targeting the tibia, calf, or ankle muscles, this tool adapts seamlessly to your training routine. Ideal for both home and gym use, it''s perfect for exercises like squat, tib raises, and calf extensions.Enhance your nordic and sit-up training with the included adjustable strap and foam pad. This set provides the necessary support to reduce strain on your foot, toes, and knees, ensuring a comfortable and safe experience during intense exercises. The foam pad also makes floor workouts more enjoyable, especially for barefoot movements. Whether you''re performing hamstring curls or dorsi flexion, the Tib Bar allows you to target key muscle groups with ease.Built with durable materials, the Tib Bar offers long-lasting performance for strength and fitness enthusiasts. Its portable design makes it easy to use anywhere, while its compatibility with a variety of weights and attachments allows for versatile training. Whether you''re focusing on anterior tibialis exercises or working on your glute and shin muscles, this device is perfect for all levels of training. The single bar setup helps streamline your routine, making it a go-to piece of equipment for targeting lower body muscles.With its thoughtful design, the Tib Bar also includes an attachment holder for quick setup, ensuring a seamless experience whether you''re using a rack, bench, or door. Its multifunctional nature means it’s not only great for tibia and ankle strengthening, but also for exercises like sit-ups, toe raises, and glute extensions. This makes it an ideal choice for those looking to boost overall lower body strength and flexibility.Invest in the Tib Bar for effective, targeted training that helps improve performance and prevent injury. Whether you''re a beginner or an experienced athlete, this tool is designed to optimize your fitness journey.', 'mucnfts', 'JGP-B01', 'Black', 'Metal');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('ff790767-fc23-469b-9400-65a0c2cf00e9', 'Squat Wedge Block 2Pcs - for Professional Trainer Athletes Portable Slant Board for Squats Weightlifting Calf Raise Block Improve Mobility and Performance', 'calf raise machine', '', 'HarderWill', 'Squat Block', 'black', 'Polypropylene (PP)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('34dee689-b8ce-49a2-bef7-1a20166eecba', 'Squat Wedge Block 2Pcs - for Professional Trainer Athletes Portable Slant Board for Squats Weightlifting Calf Raise Block Improve Mobility and Performance', 'calf raise machine', '', 'HarderWill', 'Squat Block', 'black', 'Polypropylene (PP)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('ffbb0111-b26d-435b-86e5-5eb4cdd75829', 'Squat Wedge Height Adjustable Slant Board for Heel Elevated Squats Calf Stretcher Block Enhance Mobility And Strength Performance', 'calf raise machine', '', 'HarderWill', 'TKA-3986', 'B: Black-Metal-5Heights', 'Alloy Steel, Metal');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('aaa7245f-bc0c-43ce-b779-c78df09f05bf', 'Tib Bar Tibialis Trainer Pro, Tibia Dorsi Calf Machine, Professional Knees Over Toes Equipment for Strength Training Shins/Ankles/Calves, Fits 1" and 2" Olympic Weight Plate', 'calf raise machine', 'Discover the ultimate solution to leg training with our innovative Tib Bar, a marvel in fitness technology designed to elevate your leg workouts to new heights. Crafted from premium alloy steel, our Tib Bar is the sturdy backbone of your fitness journey, ensuring durability and reliability that withstands the test of time and intense workouts alike.Our Tib Bar seamlessly blends functionality with comfort. With four thick foam pads, we guarantee an enhanced foot comfort that caters to your intensive workout sessions. The additional two flat foam pads, tailored for shoe-wearers, ensure cleanliness and ease of maintenance, making your workout both efficient and hygienic. Our unique design accommodates various foot sizes, thanks to the ingenious combination of different foam pads, ensuring a snug fit and maximum effectiveness for every user.Gone are the days of cumbersome workout equipment. Our Tib Bar comes with a portable storage bag, allowing you to take your workout anywhere. Whether you’re at home, in the gym, or on the go, your leg training need not suffer. This feature, coupled with its compatibility with both 1-inch and 2-inch weight plates, makes our Tib Bar a versatile tool for your fitness arsenal.The 12.9-grade strength screws included ensure your workouts are safe, allowing you to focus on your training without worries. This ease of assembly, disassembly, and switchability between different weight plates is unmatched, providing you with a hassle-free workout experience every time.Our Tib Bar is not just another piece of workout equipment; it’s a comprehensive solution for those aiming to enhance their leg strength, flexibility, and overall fitness. From calf raises to leg extensions, pilates, and more intense leg workouts, our Tib Bar supports a wide range of exercises. It’s your personal leg extension machine, calf raise machine, and pilates bar all rolled into one.Elevate your workout regime with our Tib Bar and join the ranks of fitness enthusiasts who demand more from their equipment. It''s time to transform your lower body training with a tool that offers unparalleled versatility, durability, and comfort. Add it to your cart now and take the first step towards achieving the toned, strong legs you''ve always desired. Don''t settle for less when you can have the best. Our Tib Bar is not just an investment in your fitness equipment; it''s an investment in your health, strength, and future.', 'acenfc', 'JG03-B01', 'Black', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('99f7047f-305c-45d2-b03a-7d8f78800430', 'ECHANFIT Rowing Machine for Home Use - Rower with 16 Levels Adjustable Resistance, Ergonomic Seat, Tablet Holder, LCD Monitor and 350 LB Weight Capacity', 'rowing machine', '', 'ECHANFIT', 'CRW4416', 'Blue', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('3939370d-0c2b-40b5-932f-53daeb7720ed', 'Double Circle Squat Wedge – Professional Squat Ramp for Weightlifting and Fitness – Squat Platform for Heel Elevated Squats and Calf Raises – Heavy-Duty Anti-Slip Squat Blocks', 'calf raise machine', 'Double Circle focuses on providing professional fitness equipment meant to help you maximize your athletic performance and promote a healthy and strong body. We rely solely on premium materials and advanced technology that enable us to deliver durable and reliable equipment guaranteed to make your training safer and more enjoyable. Not completely pleased with your purchase? Our customer care department is always within your reach!Professional Gym-Grade Squat Wedge for All Fitness LevelsOur squat wedge for weightlifting is exactly what you need to improve your training performance by offering optimal elevation that can help keep your posture upright, allowing deeper squatting and enhanced muscle engagement. This professional squat platform is made with durable metal and has a sturdy structure for excellent stability and security during your workout. With a 4.7-inch elevation, this pair of squat wedges are perfect for calf raises and heel elevated squats that will make those muscles burn!Still not convinced? Here are some of the amazing features of this product:Professional squat wedge by Double Circle;Professional squat wedge by Double Circle;Suitable for beginners and advanced users;Suitable for beginners and advanced users;Heavy-duty metal construction;Heavy-duty metal construction;Special slots for resistance bands;Special slots for resistance bands;Anti-slip design with a textured surface and rubber bumpers;Anti-slip design with a textured surface and rubber bumpers;Up to 4.7-inch elevation;Up to 4.7-inch elevation;Convenient and affordable;Convenient and affordable;Ideal for heel elevated squats;Ideal for heel elevated squats;Excellent support and mobility;Excellent support and mobility;Can help increase squat depth;Can help increase squat depth;Stable and reliable;Stable and reliable;Comfortable to use;Comfortable to use;Get deeper squats now with our squat wedge!', 'Double Circle', 'Squat Wedge 10 Degree', 'Black', 'Metal');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('47ab3de6-51fd-4f2b-a56f-ac015201d646', 'Tib Bar Tibialis Trainer Pro, Tibia Dorsi Calf Machine, Professional Knees Over Toes Equipment for Strength Training Shins/Ankles/Calves, Fits 1" and 2" Olympic Weight Plate', 'calf raise machine', 'Discover the ultimate solution to leg training with our innovative Tib Bar, a marvel in fitness technology designed to elevate your leg workouts to new heights. Crafted from premium alloy steel, our Tib Bar is the sturdy backbone of your fitness journey, ensuring durability and reliability that withstands the test of time and intense workouts alike.Our Tib Bar seamlessly blends functionality with comfort. With four thick foam pads, we guarantee an enhanced foot comfort that caters to your intensive workout sessions. The additional two flat foam pads, tailored for shoe-wearers, ensure cleanliness and ease of maintenance, making your workout both efficient and hygienic. Our unique design accommodates various foot sizes, thanks to the ingenious combination of different foam pads, ensuring a snug fit and maximum effectiveness for every user.Gone are the days of cumbersome workout equipment. Our Tib Bar comes with a portable storage bag, allowing you to take your workout anywhere. Whether you’re at home, in the gym, or on the go, your leg training need not suffer. This feature, coupled with its compatibility with both 1-inch and 2-inch weight plates, makes our Tib Bar a versatile tool for your fitness arsenal.The 12.9-grade strength screws included ensure your workouts are safe, allowing you to focus on your training without worries. This ease of assembly, disassembly, and switchability between different weight plates is unmatched, providing you with a hassle-free workout experience every time.Our Tib Bar is not just another piece of workout equipment; it’s a comprehensive solution for those aiming to enhance their leg strength, flexibility, and overall fitness. From calf raises to leg extensions, pilates, and more intense leg workouts, our Tib Bar supports a wide range of exercises. It’s your personal leg extension machine, calf raise machine, and pilates bar all rolled into one.Elevate your workout regime with our Tib Bar and join the ranks of fitness enthusiasts who demand more from their equipment. It''s time to transform your lower body training with a tool that offers unparalleled versatility, durability, and comfort. Add it to your cart now and take the first step towards achieving the toned, strong legs you''ve always desired. Don''t settle for less when you can have the best. Our Tib Bar is not just an investment in your fitness equipment; it''s an investment in your health, strength, and future.', 'acenfc', 'JG03-C01', 'Orange', 'Alloy Steel');
