INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('32fb9740-0a53-49f8-93b7-b1b8b240e983', 'Body-Solid Powerline Cable Crossover Machine - High and Low Pulleys Gym Equipment for Home, Functional Trainer, Total Body Exercise, Cable Fly and Crossover Workouts', 'cable machine', 'Product DescriptionAchieve total body conditioning with the free motion Powerline by Body-Solid Cable Crossover Machine. An extra-wide and tall mainframe offers easy access to a virtually endless array of high and low pulley exercises, letting you exercise almost every major muscle group in your body. The fully functional professional carriage system utilizes four high resin pulleys on each side with patented nylon bushing technology and eight sealed ball bearings for smooth, continuous movement during your cable workout. The top and bottom pulleys swivel smoothly with more than 180-degrees of motion for frictionless training in all directions. This cable cross machine accepts both Olympic and standard plates (each sold separately) and comes with two cable handles and one ankle strap. When assembled, the Powerline Cable Crossover Machine measures 112 by 39 by 82 inches (L x W x H) and weighs 133 pounds. It is backed by the Powerline 10-Year In-Home , which covers the frame for 10 years and all other parts for one year. Add the Lat Pull-Up/Chin-Up Station (GCA2) to add even more versatility (sold separately).Amazon.comThe Cable Crossover Machine from Powerline offers smooth and friction-free 180-degree motion that allows you to exercise virtually every major muscle group in your body. The system features a wide and tall mainframe with a sturdy build, that provides access to a variety of high and low pulley exercises. The professional carriage system utilizes patented nylon bushing technology and eight sealed ball bearing with large-diameter high resin pulleys to guarantee smooth operation. The top and bottom pulleys swivel with over 180 degrees of movement for frictionless guidance in all directions. The system includes the mainframe as well as two cable handles and one ankle strap. Chin-up handles, standard and Olympic weight plates, and collars can be used with this system but are sold separately.Features and Specifications:Professional carriage system Professional carriage system Patented nylon bushing technology Patented nylon bushing technology Eight sealed ball bearing Eight sealed ball bearing High resin pulleys High resin pulleys Top and bottom pulleys offer over 180 degrees of movement Top and bottom pulleys offer over 180 degrees of movement Accepts both Olympic and standard plates Accepts both Olympic and standard plates Chin-up handles, weight plates, and collars optional (sold separately) Chin-up handles, weight plates, and collars optional (sold separately) Assembled dimensions: 82 by 112 by 39 inches (H x L x W) Assembled dimensions: 82 by 112 by 39 inches (H x L x W)', 'Body solid', 'Crossover', 'Black', 'Aluminum');
