INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('a1f16b1c-ffad-48ad-820e-acf0af3479ca', 'Water Rowing Machine for Home Use, Foldable Rower Machine with Dedicated Monitor & Bluetooth App, Upgraded Handle, Adjustable Footpad, Tablet Holder Water Rowing Machine', 'rowing machine', 'Are you ready to take your fitness journey to the next level? Check out the Topiom rowing machine. A generation... This state-of-the-art equipment redefines what is possible for home training and provides a first-class boating experience that is both effective and stimulating.  Highlight 1. The oak frame of the rowing machine is strong and durable. 2 . The rowing machine is equipped with smooth rotation, precise electronic instrumentation, transparent circular water tank and comfortable ergonomic seats. 3 . The family rowing machine is smooth, wear-resistant, and is equipped with a noise-free aluminum track sled.  p >  p >  1 innovation improvement. Larger size to accommodate larger users. 2 . Enhanced finger surface with hand-sewn leather to improve comfort and reduce hand friction. 3 . Better grip at the end of the sled makes it easier to handle rowing equipment. 4 . The wood is larger in volume (0.85 square meters in the second generation and 1.35 square meters in the third generation) and has a higher value. 5 . p >  2° track tilt to minimize damage to the knee during the return trip. 6 . p >  The seat height has been increased to 420 mm (the height of the dining chair) to improve comfort and a smooth experience. 7 . Adjustable width and inclined foot support to suit different body types.', 'TOPIOM', 'TOPIOM Water rowing machine', 'Dark Rower Machine', 'wood');
