INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('af524c9e-6f86-4037-bbc2-08e38a7caf7a', 'Premium Barbell Pad Set for Hip Thrusts - Squat Pad for Barbell Lunges, Bench Press, with 2 Gym Ankle Straps, Hip Resistance Bands – Gym Accessories for Women with Carry Bag, Towel', 'barbell', 'Aggress Sports is a trusted, well-experienced brand that focuses on delivering innovative, cost affordable exercise & fitness equipment meant to make your workouts easier and more rewarding, without interfering with your safety or comfort. We make it a rule from working only with premium grade materials and carefully selected manufacturers, in order to meet every customer’s rigorous quality expectations. Should you encounter any issue with your purchase, tell us everything about it and our friendly customer care department will quickly address the situation!  All In One Barbell Pad Set of 8 With Accessories   The Aggress Sports barbell set was designed having in mind a proper training session that will help you achieve the desired results, boosting your strength and optimizing technique. Made with premium high density EVA foam, with all needed accessories included, this bar pad with gym straps will become your go-to solution for maximizing results, sculpting your main muscle groups in a rapid and efficient manner!  Not entirely convinced? Here are some of the amazing features of this Olympic barbell pad for squats:  Set includes: 1 x barbell pad, 2 x ankle straps, 2 x weight strap, 1 x microfiber towel, 1 x resistance band and 1 x carry bag; High grade materials and finishes; Designed for long-lasting intensive use; 2D rings ankle straps; Quick absorbing microfiber fitness towel ideal for sweat; Sturdy carrying handle bag; Original gift idea for fitness enthusiasts.  You’ll fall in love instantly with this complete barbell pad set for women!', 'AGGRESS SPORTS', 'AGGRESS 8Pcs Barbell Pad Set Black', 'Black', 'Polyurethane (PU), EVA foam, Neoprene');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('b1e0868f-aa15-472c-8620-bfdffeccd653', 'CAP Barbell 57" Standard Solid Threaded Bar with Star-Lock Collars, 1-inch', 'barbell', 'Build and engage your upper body muscles with the CAP Barbell 57" Standard Solid Threaded Bar with Star Lock Collars in Black. This bar measures 57 inches in length and accommodates weight plates with 1 inch center holes. Constructed from solid steel and finished with a black powder coat, this bar is sleek and durable. The included star lock collars prevent the weights from slipping when weightlifting, adding safety to your daily workout routine. Strengthen and engage your arms, shoulders, and back muscles by adding this bar to your home gym. Recommended weight capacity of 150 pounds.', 'Cap Barbell', 'RB-57TB', 'Black', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('fc291a77-16b2-493e-b49f-0ed8c0ac450e', 'Yes4All Barbell Bomb - Transform Your Workout with Landmine Attachment for Barbell, Landmine Base - Presses, Rows, Rotations, Split Squats - Fits 2'''' Olympic Bars', 'barbell', 'Transform your workouts with the Yes4All Barbell Bomb - the landmine attachment for your barbell. This versatile accessory allows you to enhance your fitness routine with exercises like landmine press, rows, split squats, and more. Its durable design, including the barbell landmine handle and row bar attachment, ensures stability and supports up to 450 lbs of weight. Unlike traditional T-bar row attachments, the Yes4All Barbell Bomb requires no installation or fixing screws and bolts. Its portable and space-saving design makes it ideal for home gyms. Use it for landmine squats, T-bar rows, one-arm rowing, presses overhead, and oblique rotations to target different muscle groups. Trust the Yes4All brand for exceptional quality and customer satisfaction. The Barbell Bomb comes with a 30-Day Return and 1-Year Warranty, ensuring peace of mind with your purchase. Take your workouts to heights with the Yes4All Barbell Bomb - the ultimate landmine attachment for your barbell. Order and experience its versatility and convenience firsthand.', 'Yes4All', 'A. Barbell Bomb', 'A. Barbell Bomb', 'TPR (Rubber & EVA Foam)');
