INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('a8020dc7-d110-4c6a-a46b-38f02bb06f14', 'Weighted Slam Ball by Day 1 Fitness – 15 lbs RED - No Bounce Medicine Ball - Gym Equipment Accessories for High Intensity Exercise, Functional Strength Training, Cardio', 'medicine ball', 'Slam Ball New Color Red 15lbs', 'Day 1 Fitness', 'Slam Ball', 'Red', 'Plastic');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('ffb624f3-5728-445a-b5fa-bb58902f7da4', 'JBM Medicine Ball for Workouts Exercise Strength Training', 'medicine ball', 'Medicine BallWeight and Color  Option 2 lbs (teal blue) 4lbs (yellow) 6lbs (orange) 8lbs (green) 10lbs (purple) 12 lbs (red) 15 lbs (royal blue)Material  Material: rubber Surface: Textured and non-slip rubber The medicine ball is durable with textured and non-slip rubber which provides a comfortable and easy grip, making an excellent bounce when using our medicine ball.Plyometrics & Core Training  Medicine ball exercise can make your strength improved by taking diverse weights. The medicine ball workouts include lunges, squats, single-leg V-ups, kneel to push ups and other strength training; thus stretching your muscle and improving your strength. Plyometrics and core training can be more effective via using different weights of medicine ball. Coordination & Balance  By using medicine ball, you can greatly improve your coordination and balance. For example, using medicine ball to do burpee can train your body balance well. When using the medicine ball to do the exercise, for example, swinging the medicine ball and maintain good posture, which can higher the core stability and body coordination and balance.Cardio Exercise', 'JBM', 'medicine ball', 'Red - 12LB', 'Rubber');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('8dec29d9-f196-49b3-9836-8150bcc29a2a', 'GYMENIST Kettlebell Fitness Iron Weights with Neoprene Coating Around The Bottom Half of The Metal Kettle Bell', 'kettlebell', 'DETAILS:THIS IS MADE OUT OF SOLID IRON METAL AND COVERED WITH NEOPRENE COATINGThis Exercise Kettle Bell Weights is ideal for building muscle and getting fit. The kettlebell can be used in various exercises and used by everyone from beginners to athletes, and fitness classes in their training routine.Using a kettle-bell in a workout has proven to increase strength, endurance, agility and balance in addition challenging the individual further through all body movements.Comes in Different colors 5 LB-PINK 7 LB-LAVENDER 10 LB-RED 12 LB-PURPLE15 LB-LIGHT BLUE18 LB- YELLOW20 LB-LIGHT GREEN25 LB-LIGHT GREY30 LB-TEAL35 LB-DARK BLUE40 LB-ORANGE50 LB-DARK GREYNEOPRENE COATED: These kettlebells are covered with color coded Neoprene and marked on each end for easy weight identification,The bottom half of Our Neoprene Kettlebells Are Covered in Soft Durable Neoprene, to Protect the Floor if it Gets Dropped, and also gives it a real nice modern lookHandles Designed to Fit Comfortably in Your hands, Perfect For Enhancing Your Daily WorkoutEXERCISES:kettlebell exercises build strength and endurance, particularly in the lower back, legs, and shoulders, and increase grip strength. The basic movements, such as the swing, snatch, and the clean and jerk, engage the entire body at once, and in a way that mimics real world activities.KETTLEBELL WORKOUTS:Kettlebell exercises work several muscles simultaneously and may be repeated continuously for several minutes or with short breaks. In one study, kettlebell enthusiasts performing a 20-minute snatch workout were measured to burn, on average, 13.6 calories/minute aerobically and 6.6 calories/minute anaerobically during the entire workout - "equivalent to running a 6-minute mile pace". Because of their high repetitionsKETTLE-BELL PROGRESSION SHOULD START SLOWLY TO BUILD MUSCLE ENDURANCE.', 'GYMENIST', 'G326-12', '10LB - Yellow, 12LB - Red, 3LB - Lavender, 15LB - Light Blue, 8 LB - Light Blue, 5LB - Green, 4LB - Pink, 6 LB - Purple', 'Neoprene, Metal');
