INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('041520c3-51a9-4314-af82-68048d390da1', 'Body-Solid Pro Clubline (LVSR) Leverage Seated Row Machine - Unilateral Dual-Axis, Adjustable Gas-Assisted Chest Support, 360-Degree Grips', 'seated row machine', 'The Body-Solid Leverage Seated Row Machine (LVSR) helps users build depth in the middle back and train the lower lats with biomechanically-correct movements. Featuring dual-axis diverging arms, this rowing machine lets each arm move independently, with sealed bearing pivot points for smooth, uninterrupted movement. 360-degree articulating hand grips provide a natural range of motion while you pull, while the gas-assisted chest support delivers total isolation of back muscles while supporting users of various arm lengths. Made with a heavy-duty 2 by 3-inch 11-gauge steel mainframe and double-stitched upholstery, this seated row machine is durably constructed to stand up to rigorous use in gyms and clubs. It uses Olympic weight plates for resistance (weight plates sold separately). When assembled, the Body-Solid Leverage Seated Row Machine measures 65 by 35 by 44 inches (L x W x H) and weighs 158 pounds. It is backed by the Body-Solid Lifetime In-Home Warranty and Full Commercial Warranty.', 'Body solid', 'Body-Solid LVSR Pcl Leverage Seated Row', 'Black', 'Alloy Steel');
