INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('a1e7587f-525a-4831-b9e8-0f69db772092', 'Peloton Row | Rowing Machine with 24” HD, Swiveling Touchscreen', 'seated row machine', 'Peloton Row Rowing Machine with 24” HD Swiveling TouchscreenPeloton Row is the ultimate machine to unlock classes that combine cardio and strength. It’s designed for ultra-efficient workouts that are low-impact and high-reward. The 24" swiveling HD touchscreen and front and rear-facing speakers offer studio-quality sound. Immerse yourself in classes where you can work 86% of your muscles in just 15 minutes or less. Peloton Row has a compact footprint, complete with a folding arm for upright storage.Unlock thousands of classes, both on and off the Row, like strength, Row Bootcamp and balance classes. Explore our lineup of 50+ instructors. Track your progress class after class using on-screen metrics like output, distance, pace and stroke rate. Your Peloton Row is compatible with any ANT+ heart rate monitor, Apple Watch, Strava, or any Android watch running Wear OS 3 or higher.All-Access Membership must be purchased separately in order to access Peloton classes.You’ll pay one monthly fee for your entire household, so everyone can access our entire library of classes that range from 5 to 90 minutes. With workouts that fit your experience level, mood, goals, music style, and schedule, you’ll be ready to train on and off your Peloton Row.', 'Peloton', 'Peloton Rower', 'Black', 'Alloy Steel, Aluminum');
