INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('598ad06f-6098-4e2e-8508-7392c366b84f', 'Smith Machine for Home Gym, 2000LBS Power Cage Squat Rack with Smith Bar, Two LAT Pull-Down Systems, Cable Machine, Chest Fly Machine and More Cable Attachment', 'chest fly machine', 'Multi-Functional Smith Machine: This is a multi-functional Smith machine that combines a Smith machine, power rack, squat rack, butterfly clip chest arms and a pull rope machine to provide a comprehensive total body workout. Use this fitness system for an effective workout without the time and expense of traveling to and from the gym. (Exercise chair and bell pads not included)Suitable For All: Whether your goal is to build strength, regain fitness or improve your overall health this Smith Fitness machine is a great fit. It provides extra balance support and safety so you can strength train efficiently and safely, perfect for home fitness beginners and exercise professionals alikeDurable Construction: Constructed from robust 50mm x 50mm steel tubing, this Smith machine home gym guarantees exceptional stability and long-lasting durability, capable of supporting up to 2000 lbs, making it perfect for all your strength training needs.Versatile Exercise Options: Featuring 13 adjustable cable positions and a variety of attachments, this chest workout machine offers over 75 cable exercises, including chin-up variations, cable crossovers, and more, greatly enriching your home Space-Saving Design: The compact design of this Smith rack makes it an excellent weight cage for home gyms, optimizing your workout space while allowing for a diverse range of exercises from squats to deadlifts.', 'HarmonyHealth', 'ikAShmn7pzMMoSaeob1dQATzut7Q', 'black', 'Carbon Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('8978ce4d-f1af-448f-b1c6-03bb1f565e86', 'Sunny Health & Fitness Adjustable Multi-Function Incline Decline Weight Bench w/Optional Barbell Rack, Leg Developer, Preacher Curl for Full Body Workout, Chest Exercise, Strength Training, Home Gym', 'dumbbell', '', 'Sunny Health & Fitness', 'Adjustable Incline Flat Bench', 'Black', 'Alloy Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment VALUES ('9f33ad0b-6c05-440b-a4fb-5723ade51933', 'Body-Solid Pro ClubLine (LVIP) Incline Press Leverage Gym Bench - Converging Chest & Shoulder Press Machine with Sealed Bearings and Gas-Assisted Start Positions', 'chest fly machine', 'Experience intense lifting workouts in home or professional gyms with the Body-Solid ProClubLine Leverage Incline Press (LVIP). A converging press arm and independent, unilateral arm action deliver balanced muscle development for the upper body. Ergonomic hand grips offer different positional options, with gas-assisted start positions to get your lift started right. The press arms are adjustable to fit users of all sizes. With a 2- by 3-inch 11-gauge steel mainframe and durable double-stitched upholstery, this leverage incline machine is durably constructed to stand up to rigorous use in gyms and clubs. Sealed bearing pivot points provide smooth, friction-free movement through every intense workout. Weight plate holders are built into the machine for easy storage (plates sold separately). When assembled, the Body-Solid ProClubLine Leverage Incline Press measures 71 by 53 by 41 inches (L x W x H) and weighs 167 pounds. It is backed by the Body-Solid Lifetime In-Home Warranty and Full Commercial Warranty.', 'Body-Solid', 'Body-Solid LVIP Pcl Leverage Incline Press', 'Black', 'Alloy Steel');
