INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('735da702-ff30-429e-83ce-0aa714597064', '6c58eba9-2590-47a3-a3eb-452a6f9cc68e', '8-Level Adjustable Magnetic Resistance: Experience smooth and silent workouts with exercise bike, thanks to its magnetic technology. The 8-level magnetic resistance adjustment of the stationary bike caters to diverse fitness needs, offering a customizable and effective workout session. This innovative technological design of the exercise bike brings users a more convenient and enjoyable fitness experience, making each workout full of motivation and vitality');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('83609ad6-e838-41b7-813d-8b63c55f7a84', '6c58eba9-2590-47a3-a3eb-452a6f9cc68e', 'LCD Display & Device Holder: Stay informed about your workout progress with our exercise bike''s LCD monitor, which tracks time, speed, distance, calories burned, and heart rate in real-time. Plus, stationary bike comes with the convenient device holder, you can enjoy your favorite shows or music while you exercise. The combination of the multifunctional LCD display and device holder makes this exercise bike more intelligent and user-friendly');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e0e8bdd5-febf-4c7d-b710-8446a15fbd65', '6c58eba9-2590-47a3-a3eb-452a6f9cc68e', 'User-Friendly Design: With recumbent exercise bike, you can exercise in both upright and semi-reclining positions, catering to various workout preferences. The 3 in1 recumbent exercise bike meets your daily exercise needs.The built-in iPad mount of recumbent exercise bike allows you to keep your devices within reach for entertainment while you exercise, ensuring a comfortable and enjoyable workout experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('169d70fa-daf2-4a57-a2e4-72189534ef86', '6c58eba9-2590-47a3-a3eb-452a6f9cc68e', 'Adjustable Seat & Spacious Cushion: The recubment exercise bike is equipped with a large, 12-inch wide seat cushion, stationary bike ensures comfort for users of all sizes. Easily adjustable to accommodate heights from 4''9'''' to 6''1'''', the exercise bikes supports users up to 265 lbs, providing a comfortable and secure riding experience. The adjustable seat and spacious cushion design of this stationary bike are intended to provide users with the best comfort and convenience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('895e5741-28b4-4e32-b872-80be0ae870a9', '6c58eba9-2590-47a3-a3eb-452a6f9cc68e', 'Foldable Exercise Bike: Exercise bike is designed to save space and enhance convenience. Easily foldable exercise bike for storage and effortlessly move it around with its transportation wheels. Compact and space-saving, the folding exercise bike is perfect for home use. The foldable exercise bike comes with convenient transport wheels, allowing you to easily move it to the desired location. Whether it''s to the balcony, living room, or storage room, moving stationary bike becomes effortless');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0457f0ae-8cd4-4c9a-b411-2ce0b06067f6', 'f500612f-5959-4f93-af29-0d415aec7a72', 'Ergonomic Thicker Seat and Backrest： Embrace comfort with an ergonomic high-density soft sponge cushion and breathable mesh backrest. Stationary bikes for adult seniors aim to help knee and lower back arthritis patients work their mobility and recover from replacement surgery');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1e39dba6-6875-4def-9572-efa2dd5e5590', 'f500612f-5959-4f93-af29-0d415aec7a72', 'Tailored Comfort： Instruction and tools are included, and installation is a breeze. Recumbent exercise bikes embrace comfort with an ergonomic high-density soft sponge cushion and breathable mesh backrest. Aim to help knee and lower back arthritis patients work their mobility and recover from replacement surgery');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('97c663f9-80cb-40e0-b48a-ed1beeb69b42', 'f500612f-5959-4f93-af29-0d415aec7a72', 'Adjustable Resistance Levels: Customize your workout with 8 levels of magnetic resistance, a recumbent exercise bike suitable for users of all fitness levels. Easily adjust the intensity to meet your training goals, ideal for gentle physical therapy and relaxing cardio exercise by recumbent exercise bike');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2e534d7b-6fad-4374-8753-a75e517fb628', 'f500612f-5959-4f93-af29-0d415aec7a72', 'Advanced LCD Monitor Display: The recumbent exercise bike tracks your progress in real time with the multifunctional LCD monitor. Monitor your speed, distance, time, calories burned, and heart rate to stay motivated and achieve your fitness targets by exercise bike');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1f76570c-4a06-490c-af7b-805581113f85', 'f500612f-5959-4f93-af29-0d415aec7a72', 'Smooth and Quiet Operation: Recumbent exercise bikes experience a whisper-quiet workout with the precision-balanced flywheel and belt drive system. Use a recumbent exercise bike to enjoy smooth pedaling motions, no disturbance to family and neighbors, and foster harmonious home fitness');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('18143a08-c7e4-49dd-879e-31462e30d60f', 'f500612f-5959-4f93-af29-0d415aec7a72', 'Compact and Space-Saving Design: Designed for home use, this recumbent bike combines a sturdy steel frame with a compact footprint. Enjoy a robust workout experience without sacrificing space in your home gym. Recumbent exercise bike with robust & heavy-duty frame for longer service life, excellent stability, and safety');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a6fca6bd-b7c7-437d-b11a-e0ee00dd791b', '55a66a9d-497f-4149-8f63-2db4ce9a6299', 'Converging CrossRamp technology');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('48f1d289-5254-4452-80e5-e27a968357e8', '55a66a9d-497f-4149-8f63-2db4ce9a6299', 'Moving Handlebars');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('dab97746-9b08-48f8-ae68-e3875614edcf', '1dcb20d2-3577-40f9-bd72-bb831e8209c3', '🥰【BLUETOOTH CONNECTIVITY】Step into the immersive world of virtual cycling with exercise bike, seamlessly compatible with Kinomap and Zwift. Transform your home into a dynamic cycling arena.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('00888643-80a1-4501-9f26-929c4b765397', '1dcb20d2-3577-40f9-bd72-bb831e8209c3', '🥰【STABILITY REDEFINED】Crafted with reinforced Carbon Steel frame tubes, the indoor cycling bike boasts a solid build that conquers the instability issues common in many stationary bikes. Experience a ride without any wobbling or creaking, whether you''re cycling seated or standing.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('dfbf7865-92e2-4557-8644-9192f359d6e0', '1dcb20d2-3577-40f9-bd72-bb831e8209c3', '🥰【MAGNETIC MAGIC】Revolutionize your workout with magnetic resistance. Through the ingenious use of magnets, our bike ensures a silent and smooth operation. The flywheel dances effortlessly, whispering through your workout. Paired with a belt drive, the bike guarantees minimal maintenance.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('242cd53f-b3c7-4956-bde4-24414a009b47', '1dcb20d2-3577-40f9-bd72-bb831e8209c3', '🥰【SMART METRICS】The Digital Monitor not only tracks your exercise metrics in real-time — time, speed, distance, calories, and pulse — but also allows on-the-fly adjustments to your workout plan. The sleek design includes a red lever that indicates resistance levels, ensuring a personalized and efficient workout. Enhance your experience further with the convenient phone/tablet holder for entertainment during your exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('abc9ca07-cba1-49f4-a8f1-2cc851e7a628', '1dcb20d2-3577-40f9-bd72-bb831e8209c3', '🥰【FULL-COVERAGE DESIGN】Experience elegance with our flawless, fully-covered shell. Our advanced bonding technique eliminates gaps or seams, providing a sleek look. The hidden console wire and flywheel create a minimalist aesthetic. Unlike traditional metal flywheels, our impact-resistant plastic cover ensures durability, protecting against cracks and damage.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f3e4ea7b-7019-49ca-b01f-bd08e27f6215', '1dcb20d2-3577-40f9-bd72-bb831e8209c3', '🥰【CUSTOMIZED WORKOUTS】Tailor your workout to your preferences. Adjust the handle and seat height to accommodate users of different sizes. The toe-caged pedals, complete with adjustable straps, cater to various foot sizes. Make exercise a family affair with yoyomax, where everyone can join in and stay fit.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2638b323-5cf0-4b82-8637-4ab8e5a00a5d', 'dcd845d3-c2f2-41b4-8209-a38dcc38b3c6', 'EXERCISE BIKE: Our exercise bike boasts 16 distinct resistance levels for tailored workouts, accompanied by a whisper-quiet 30 dB operation. Achieved through the incorporation of a state-of-the-art, non-friction magnetic resistance system, ensuring silent adjustments for your convenience. With versatile resistance range, it caters seamlessly to fitness enthusiasts. Furthermore, the ultra-low decibel performance ensures your workouts remain a peaceful pursuit, without disturbing those around you.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d7a8c980-5efa-410d-ac79-66da46a3a80e', 'dcd845d3-c2f2-41b4-8209-a38dcc38b3c6', 'EASY ASSEMLY: Tailored for all skill levels, from beginners to experts, our stationary bike offers a stressless assembly experience. With clear, comprehensive instruction and an accompanying installation video, you''ll have your bike set up in no time, regardless of your technical proficiency.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7071995a-a087-4ae2-b6d0-28b3e84f58c7', 'dcd845d3-c2f2-41b4-8209-a38dcc38b3c6', 'SCIENTIFIC STRUCTURE 300LBS CAPACITY: The max weight capacity of this exercise bike is 300 lbs. It uses high quality steel and is designed with a double golden triangle frame that is stronger and more stable than other bikes.It is also equipped with an ergonomic and highly resilient cushion, so your butt won''t hurt no matter what kind of body type you are, even if you ride for a long time!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7208d7b5-aaf1-44f5-a3c6-6e6d066b0819', 'dcd845d3-c2f2-41b4-8209-a38dcc38b3c6', 'AJUSTIABLE AND SUITABLE FOR 4.6-6FT: This indoor exercise bike has 5 level adjustable seat height.It is suitable for a height range of 4.6-6 ft. This is perfect for home that have different body types.They can all share the use of the exercise bike. And the front and back support tubes can be fine-tuned in 6 levels, which can perfectly deal with uneven floors.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('51659352-e29e-4f55-b1ef-f2f460772de7', 'dcd845d3-c2f2-41b4-8209-a38dcc38b3c6', 'SATISFACTION COMMITMENT: We offer a prompt telephone message service, ensuring to attend to buyers'' inquiries within 12 hours. Rest assured, we stand behind our products with a comprehensive one-year service commitment. Any issues you encounter with your purchase will be promptly addressed until you are fully satisfied.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6e36ece5-f755-4450-ba87-1a830f316a78', 'dcd845d3-c2f2-41b4-8209-a38dcc38b3c6', 'REAL-TIME FITNESS DATA: The stationary bike can record your fitness data including pulse rate, calorie, time, distance, speed. These data will be displayed on LCD screen. And the work out data can auto start and auto close, As long as you start to ride immediately automatically record the exercise data, and it will turn off automatically after you stop using it for a few minutes.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d9a20aad-d05d-41fe-81ee-4c5ab0de391c', '9ba484ac-ead3-428f-8693-001ccd5c94d2', '✅【BOOST YOUR IMMUNE SYSTEM】An ideal exercise bike for seniors/women/men to help safeguard your health and stay in shape when working/entertaining at home. You can workout while watching TV, recreational web surfing, or listening to music');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6c63ddcf-1d4c-415b-85b8-b1636db45fee', '9ba484ac-ead3-428f-8693-001ccd5c94d2', '✅【3-IN-1 Fitness Bicycle】Part exercise bike, movable chair, and standing desk. This creative 3-in-1 stationary bike has a large enough desk to accommodate a laptop, notebook, and mobile phone, and is suitable for everyone in the family（5’1”- 6’2”）');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3749c206-7a8c-41ce-bfd3-21c4e8dcf085', '9ba484ac-ead3-428f-8693-001ccd5c94d2', '✅【Adjustable Resistance】Tailor your experience with 8-speed resistance settings. Our exercise bicycle adapts to your fitness level and goals, enabling quiet pedaling and promoting blood flow and muscle engagement all day');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7afb8ed8-9f6e-49c6-984b-e30108c66cef', '9ba484ac-ead3-428f-8693-001ccd5c94d2', '✅【LCD Exercise Tracker】Monitor your workout stats on the built-in LCD. Keep tabs on real-time data such as time, speed, distance, calories burned, total distance covered, and rotation speed.ATTENTION: the battery is not included');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7e0e0317-68b2-4ac4-a1cc-47d7f24fff22', '9ba484ac-ead3-428f-8693-001ccd5c94d2', '✅【Durable Material】Crafted from premium materials, our desk bike offers comfort and robust support. Our products have been thoroughly tested and specifically certified by TUV SUD. Hold up to 350lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c8b50f43-94a2-4caf-8faf-9d01fcaa4a26', 'f491b157-5473-4b96-bb0f-953494ad789a', '[Value-packed membership] A Peloton All-Access Membership must be purchased separately in order to access Peloton content on your Bike+. You’ll pay $44/mo for your entire household and get unlimited access to our entire library of content available on your Bike+ and the Peloton App. Age, height, and weight restrictions apply. Your account can be activated during Bike+ setup');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1b72ed1f-0ea4-48d7-ae92-543ec2ca9c2b', 'f491b157-5473-4b96-bb0f-953494ad789a', '[Add on more than cardio with the turn of a screen] ROTATING TOUCHSCREEN: Effortlessly move from cycling to the floor with a screen that has 360° of movement. 23.8” ANTI-GLARE HD TOUCHSCREEN: Designed so you can see your workout at any angle. STUDIO-QUALITY SOUND: Front and rear-facing speakers immerse you in sound.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8ba74e63-cb33-4e51-aa5a-1c9da78e3b3c', 'f491b157-5473-4b96-bb0f-953494ad789a', '[New ways to keep you motivated] INTRODUCING PELOTON ENTERTAINMENT: You can now stream TV shows, movies, and live sports with Peloton Entertainment. NEW AND IMPROVED FEATURES: Releasing updates and new features based on Member feedback ensures you have the tools to stay focused and meet your goals. NEW CONTENT: We’re always exploring new ways to train with gamified workouts, scenic rides, training programs, and more');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5e9970be-f1ac-45c8-b2a3-301f79182179', '2dbb0098-c5d3-4d0e-8ed3-7d1b0195834f', '【Adjustable Design】ZIDAFIT rehab machine offers adjustable tension and height for personalized arm and leg workouts. Safe, low-impact exercises from a chair or sofa, perfect for seniors, stroke recovery, and physical therapy, ensuring comfort and effective rehabilitation.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4889a9e3-30d2-45ca-ab6b-ea6eb473ae7c', 'f491b157-5473-4b96-bb0f-953494ad789a', '[The ultimate cycling experience] AUTO RESISTANCE: Go hands-free and have your resistance automatically adjusted to match instructor callouts. ON SCREEN CONTROLS: Use Auto-resistance when you want and easily turn it off when you don’t with a tap of the lock icon. TRACK YOUR OUTPUT WITH CONFIDENCE: Bike+ automatically re-calibrates at the beginning of every ride, reliably measuring your watts and resistance');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fe9a2549-d0da-4c0f-abf8-9f85a7f32860', 'f491b157-5473-4b96-bb0f-953494ad789a', '[Find, plan, and customize workouts] CUSTOM-BUILD YOUR WORKOUT: Line up classes and easily go from one to the next with Stacked Classes. Add on things like warm-ups, stretching, yoga, and more to your workout. FILTER TO FIND CLASSES: Sort by length, difficulty, class type, music, instructor, and more. PREVIEW CLASS PLANS: See the movements you’ll do in class, segment breakdowns, and the music playlists before jumping in.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('29ad8edf-71a8-44d3-ade4-cbea944bbba6', 'f491b157-5473-4b96-bb0f-953494ad789a', '[Monitor heart rate, workout performance, and more] CONNECT HEART RATE MONITORS: Easily connect any ANT+ heart rate monitor to your Peloton Bike+. TRACK PERFORMANCE: Pair your Apple or Wear OS watch to the Peloton Watch App to track heart rate and workout metrics in any class. REAL-TIME METRICS: See in-class metrics like cadence, output, resistance, heart rate, distance and more.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b094e175-60db-418d-bc1e-453cc1dda571', 'f491b157-5473-4b96-bb0f-953494ad789a', '[On screen metrics] TRACK PROGRESS OVER TIME: Check workout streaks, personal bests, goals achieved, and more. LEADERBOARD: See who’s in class, give out high-fives, and chase others up the Leaderboard for some friendly competition.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5ff7e528-a311-477b-91f4-3cbe0fbee566', 'f491b157-5473-4b96-bb0f-953494ad789a', '[Workout in compact spaces and beyond] 4’x2’ FOOTPRINT: Peloton Bike+ only needs the space the size of a small yoga mat. WORKOUTS BEYOND BIKE+: Add on strength, yoga, HIIT, and more off to the side of Peloton Bike+ or anywhere you’d like using Peloton App, included with All-Access Membership.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('223551f3-2f9a-4df9-9ed7-9952bfcd5e3c', 'f491b157-5473-4b96-bb0f-953494ad789a', '[Measurements & requirements] We require leaving 24” on all four sides to store and train on your Bike+. Keeping your Bike+ in a room with a minimum ceiling height of 8’ will ensure adequate headroom while riding. Dimensions: 59” L x 59” H x 22” W; Screen: 24” diagonal; Weight: 140 lbs; Power cord length: 10’. User requirements – Height range: 4’11”–6’5”; weight maximum: 297 lbs; age minimum: 14.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('eaf59dd5-5b09-488e-a91a-83a0b6e44f63', 'f491b157-5473-4b96-bb0f-953494ad789a', '[Self assembly] The Bike+ package is extremely heavy and might require more than one person to lift or carry. Use lifting aids and proper lifting techniques when moving or assembling the Peloton Bike+. A second person may be helpful when raising and lowering the Bike+. Lifting heavy objects can cause muscle strain and back injuries. Heavy objects can also fall and cause injury and physical damage.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a02f293b-6e30-4485-903b-0b4e6c643023', '8a27a546-d6af-4aa7-93aa-4ced3e173129', '16-LEVEL MAGNETIC RESISTANCE SYSTEM: The exercise bike allows for 16-level magnetic resistance and a silent ride below 20dB. It utilizes a non-friction magnetic resistance system that takes advantage of silent and smooth adjustments.Multiple levels of resistance meet the workout needs of beginners to professionals. Less than 20dB noise level allowing you to focus on exercise without outside interference.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8f7757c1-0b30-49d9-b8e9-4a9c14ded916', '8a27a546-d6af-4aa7-93aa-4ced3e173129', '70% PRE-ASSEMBLED & SAVING 30% TIME: The portable bike is almost 70% assembled. You only need to install some large components like the mainframe, handlebars, monitor as well as very few screws. The entire process takes less than an hour. Clear instructions and videos make assembly effortless for anyone. You''ll have your bike set up in no time, regardless of your technical proficiency.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8ce1df66-853d-4cf8-b202-444f20d98ecd', '8a27a546-d6af-4aa7-93aa-4ced3e173129', 'SCIENTIFIC STRUCTURE 260LBS CAPACITY: The max weight capacity of our bike is 260 lbs. It uses high-strength steel and is designed with a double golden triangle frame that is stronger and more stable than other bikes.Our exercise bike for seniors is also equipped with an ergonomic and highly resilient cushion, so your butt won''t hurt no matter what kind of body type you are or long ride!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c9e6adf0-9582-4022-93ae-47b18898f4fe', '8a27a546-d6af-4aa7-93aa-4ced3e173129', 'ADJUSTABLE AND SUITABLE FOR 5''0''''-6''1'''': This indoor exercise bike has 5 level adjustable seat height.It is suitable for a height range of 5''0''''-6''1''''. This is perfect for family that have different body types. You can all share the use of the exercise bike. And the front and back support tubes can be fine-tuned in 6 levels, which can perfectly deal with uneven floors.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2e50cb4a-cb8d-4985-bbd3-eb83e788876a', '8a27a546-d6af-4aa7-93aa-4ced3e173129', 'REAL-TIME FITNESS DATA MONITOR: The stationary bike can record your fitness data including pulse rate, calorie, time, distance, speed. These data will be displayed on LCD screen. And the workout data can automatically start and close, As long as you start to ride immediately record the exercise data, and it will turn off after you stop using it for a few minutes. What''s more, your phone on the holder will not block the LCD display, you can see exercise data while watching a good movie!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b2f3f3cb-0d7a-4ac6-b697-7198684408a1', '8a27a546-d6af-4aa7-93aa-4ced3e173129', 'WHAT YOU GET: X-Bike 816, Product manuals, A small packet of installation tools, Our 12-month commitment of carefree protection, friendly customer service and telephone message service.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c599734a-e6f5-4cea-ac5f-e1aafaa07159', '33701455-8602-49dd-afe9-33bd05cbbd43', '【HEAVY-DUTY 40 LB FLYWHEEL】This exercise bike is equipped with a 40 LB heavy-duty flywheel that delivers a natural, smooth, and consistent cycling workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('be5b4973-dc4d-432a-96d9-a3bee9f90674', '33701455-8602-49dd-afe9-33bd05cbbd43', '【AUTHENTIC ROAD EXPERIENCE】Micro-adjustable felt pad resistance that simulates real road biking, giving you an immersive and authentic riding experience at home.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2a005946-32e6-4647-8b51-5014ec95ad49', '33701455-8602-49dd-afe9-33bd05cbbd43', '【ERGONOMIC DESIGN】High-quality non-slip handlebar and micro-adjustable leather resistance deliver a comfortable and authentic workout experience at home, reducing fatigue during extended sessions.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8507b814-5ce2-4b28-abcb-c0643ffe5535', '33701455-8602-49dd-afe9-33bd05cbbd43', '【QUIET & SMOOTH OPERATION】Features a belt drive system for a quieter and smoother workout, allowing you to focus on your exercise without any distracting noise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('48bd947f-8c64-4c92-a3a5-3f9337231a53', '33701455-8602-49dd-afe9-33bd05cbbd43', '【CUSTOMIZABLE COMFORT】Offers a 4-way adjustable seat and a 2-way adjustable handlebar to tailor the workout to your specific needs and preferences.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('42e37aff-d587-4059-95bb-8e627be31e2a', '33701455-8602-49dd-afe9-33bd05cbbd43', '【SUPERIOR CAPACITY】With a strong and durable heavy-duty frame, this stationary bike can accommodate a maximum user weight of up to 265 LB.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('89542dc4-ec31-46da-a437-0abcd8626ca5', '33701455-8602-49dd-afe9-33bd05cbbd43', '【SECURE RIDE】Comes with caged pedals for enhanced security and safety stop feature to quickly halt the spinning motion.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d752ab30-a667-4a51-824c-e02966a4cf70', '33701455-8602-49dd-afe9-33bd05cbbd43', '【EASY ASSEMBLY WITH DIGITAL MONITOR】The average installation time is just 30 minutes, getting you up and running quickly and effortlessly. The included digital monitor helps track important workout data.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d411421e-d65e-40eb-ab40-9309cba5b53e', '33701455-8602-49dd-afe9-33bd05cbbd43', '【EASY STORAGE AND CONVENIENT】The transportation wheels make it easy to move and store when not in use. Comes with a water bottle holder for easy hydration access during workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e2e3dcc1-c6d7-4eb6-b220-b7fe7e0c3784', '33701455-8602-49dd-afe9-33bd05cbbd43', '【PROVEN QUALITY】This exercise bike is a product of Sunny Health & Fitness, a trusted brand with over 20 years of experience in the fitness equipment industry. You can trust in the durability, reliability, and efficiency of this stationary bike.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9cb8a865-983b-453f-b61d-ba785cb1b237', '2dbb0098-c5d3-4d0e-8ed3-7d1b0195834f', '【Hassle-Free Setup】Set up your exercise bike easily with a user-friendly design. Assembly requires only a few simple steps, with all necessary tools included. Ideal for seniors, enabling immediate use with minimal effort, making fitness accessible for all.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4064ad8c-5468-46e8-bc6f-c66d643a96bf', '2dbb0098-c5d3-4d0e-8ed3-7d1b0195834f', '【Intuitive One-Button LCD Monitor】The LCD monitor shows essential data like time, distance, calories, and counts. Easy to use, especially for seniors, with simple one-button operation. Long press resets data, providing effortless tracking of fitness progress in each session.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9d073b91-5a2f-43ad-b4b0-db653f5789a9', '2dbb0098-c5d3-4d0e-8ed3-7d1b0195834f', '【Stable & Heavy-Duty Pedal Exerciser】Crafted with rustproof metal tubes, this durable pedal exerciser supports up to 265 lbs and features 4 suction cups for floor stability. The slip-resistant rubber pedals ensure safety during workouts. Ideal as an exercise bike with arm workout, it’s perfect for stroke recovery therapy, leg strengthening, and knee rehab. A must-have for seniors, it serves as both an arm and knee exerciser for rehabilitation.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('054c15de-d477-46a4-84aa-bc0999fd0e08', '2dbb0098-c5d3-4d0e-8ed3-7d1b0195834f', '【Support for Stroke and Muscle Weakness Patients】This versatile peddler exerciser is designed to aid in stroke recovery and muscle weakness,offering effective arm and leg workouts. Use it as a sit-down pedal exerciser, arm exerciser, parkinson''s exercise equipment. It’s ideal rehabilitation equipment, a small exercise bike,including two gloves for comfort.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ce61d893-2e13-44d9-8a86-6e9afdf11cff', '2dbb0098-c5d3-4d0e-8ed3-7d1b0195834f', '【Perfect for Daily Exercise and Rehabilitation】The ZIDAFIT mini pedal exerciser is ideal for seated arm and leg workouts, enhancing joint flexibility and muscle strength. As versatile home fitness equipment, it doubles as a hand bike, stationary pedal exerciser. This portable pedal exerciser is perfect for seniors and rehab patients, making it a thoughtful gift for health and wellness.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8b83a0b1-7893-42ef-a8d8-d0ff4b7cb549', '78ab4153-85bc-41cd-800d-6d4c7ea6ac49', 'Solid Build: heavy-duty steel frame and 30lbs flywheel of the exercise bike guarantee the stability while cycling. The belt driven system provides a smooth and quiet ride experience. It won''t disturb your apartment neighbors or sleeping kids');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('552ad6dd-2f31-4c32-babd-4246024b55ff', '78ab4153-85bc-41cd-800d-6d4c7ea6ac49', 'Fully Adjustable: 2-ways adjustable non-slip handlebar, 4-ways padded seat (inseam height 25-35in) and a large range of resistance gives users a comfortable indoor riding experience. Workout your muscles / lose weight / enhance heart /lung function');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('19f11cad-0cee-4e5d-9f2d-3ac4c64f10a4', '78ab4153-85bc-41cd-800d-6d4c7ea6ac49', 'LCD Monitor and Tablet Holder: The Digital Monitor will real-timely track and record your exercise time, speed, distance, calorie, odometer, so that you can know your progress and adjust your exercise plan in time.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('42607e63-e25e-4c58-9e58-0501a398877d', '78ab4153-85bc-41cd-800d-6d4c7ea6ac49', 'Safe & Convenient: Press the resistance bar to stop the flywheel immediately. Monitor holder can support the tablet, phones, water bottle. Transport wheels help you easily move the exercise bike. There is also a convenient adjustable knob, with a simple twist, you can adjust the resistance to fulfill different workout plans.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('064a9f81-e732-4097-85fd-eae299d2465b', '78ab4153-85bc-41cd-800d-6d4c7ea6ac49', 'Effective Exercise Bike- More down at less time. Riding can burn fat quickly, build core muscles and strengthen heart, but reduce injuries. Multi-grip handlebar, with adjustable resistance, our stationary bike meets the needs of beginners to professionals.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('54107363-eef9-4a10-a75f-463f16d2a988', '78ab4153-85bc-41cd-800d-6d4c7ea6ac49', 'No Worry Buying: pooboo cycling bike is a good choice to use it to your families. We are so confident that you will love this indoor bike. We provide the customers a 12-month parts replacement and your concerns are answered within 24 hours. 100% satisfied customer service! CONTACT US: Login your amazon account > choose "Your orders" > find the order ID > click "Contact seller"');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('171bd030-c110-40ce-b1b0-0e7b8ba35366', '78ab4153-85bc-41cd-800d-6d4c7ea6ac49', 'About pooboo: pooboo exercise bike has served more than 1,000,000 families. We are so confident this pooboo stationary bike can be your fitness partner.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b973641e-fc7d-4df3-93e0-6f1cd348a11b', 'e4d90096-55c0-40f6-bccb-5cb61abc3ee6', 'CONVENIENT AND ADJUSTABLE: Experience the comfort of our stationary bike, designed for home use with a 4-way adjustable seat featuring an air-permeable cushion and an adjustable handlebar for your ease. This exercise bike includes a phone/tablet holder, enhancing your workout bike sessions with entertainment.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f4f66c06-974a-4130-a78f-fa86828344e1', 'e4d90096-55c0-40f6-bccb-5cb61abc3ee6', 'ENGINEERED FOR SIGNIFICANT SUPPORT: Our stationary exercise bike, a robust piece of exercise equipment, supports up to 275lbs, ensuring a safe and effective training session. This gym bike for home is an ideal bicycle exercise machine for every fitness enthusiast.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1f368620-a517-454e-bf06-86087ed2202f', 'e4d90096-55c0-40f6-bccb-5cb61abc3ee6', '8 LEVELS OF RESISTANCE FOR CARDIO TRAINING: Elevate your indoor cycling bike experience with 8 levels of resistance, perfect for varying your workout intensity. Suitable for everyone from beginners to professionals, this exercise bike offers a dynamic cardio workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5dd201d1-055a-48c2-817e-c22c445c9ad1', 'e4d90096-55c0-40f6-bccb-5cb61abc3ee6', 'LCD MONITOR FOR TRACKING: Keep an eye on your progress with this cycling bike''s LCD monitor, displaying time, speed, distance, and calories burned. Its advanced features, including an auto shut-off, make it a highly efficient workout bike machine.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('faff2206-481a-457d-a687-114cd5177a54', 'e4d90096-55c0-40f6-bccb-5cb61abc3ee6', 'PREMIUM QUALITY MATERIALS: Crafted as a premium indoor bike, this durable and sleek cycle bike is ideal for home workouts, offering a high-quality cardio training experience akin to bikes for home.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('53fb3c36-16a5-4a36-a6a3-e5ca57f55c05', 'f7ebcb0a-aa36-461e-9b13-f80f256d31e5', 'TOTAL-BODY FITNESS - Our recumbent exercise bike provides effective, efficient cardio and muscle-toning workout. The built-in upper hand pedals offer multiple grip positions for the upper body to engage the back, arms, shoulders, chest, and core.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3e6edc21-5d77-4b35-8401-d64f892448b2', 'f7ebcb0a-aa36-461e-9b13-f80f256d31e5', 'TRACK YOUR PROGRESS - This exercise bike features a multi-function LCD monitor that displays your workout time, calories burned, distance, speed, and repetitions per minute, and lets you switch between hand and foot functions.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9d3363fc-c900-4da9-873c-3542a94ba1a7', 'f7ebcb0a-aa36-461e-9b13-f80f256d31e5', 'DYNAMIC RESISTANCE LEVELS - This workout bike offers 8 levels of magnetic resistance for the lower body and adjustable tension dial resistance for the upper body. Experience total body workout and boost your endurance with this recumbent bike.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b53989cc-0ce6-4cfa-a5c2-b68643e6e06f', 'f7ebcb0a-aa36-461e-9b13-f80f256d31e5', 'ENHANCED COMFORT - This fitness bike includes textured pedals, padded hand grips, ergonomic handlebars, and an extra-large cushioned, upholstered seat and backrest. This arm bike has a folding frame and built-in wheels for easy storage.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('59f158c2-3fc8-4bbe-b7db-cb12c79aa125', 'f7ebcb0a-aa36-461e-9b13-f80f256d31e5', 'SMART WORKOUT APP - Experience connected fitness with this home gym equipment with the müüv app. With smart guided coaching, exercise demo videos, personalized workouts, assembly videos, and more, müüv provides the best workout and fitness experience with your Stamina Bike.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a7668cbc-450d-4cc5-a527-29583b0fd760', '735c4267-758d-4d4a-b86e-7f8c1f015f3d', 'VALUE-PACKED MEMBERSHIP: A Peloton All-Access Membership ($44/mo) must be purchased for your entire household to get unlimited access to our entire library. Age, height, and weight restrictions apply.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('91d8c289-7e0f-48c3-b426-719be5ca5d48', '735c4267-758d-4d4a-b86e-7f8c1f015f3d', 'PELOTON ENTERTAINMENT: You can now stream TV shows, movies, and live sports with Peloton Entertainment.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6ee56e0a-c392-4adc-a30d-1ce62b6400e1', '55a66a9d-497f-4149-8f63-2db4ce9a6299', 'P82 Touch Screen Console');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('195ddea6-e9af-4bf0-a6a5-0149d31f75a6', '735c4267-758d-4d4a-b86e-7f8c1f015f3d', 'CUSTOM-BUILD YOUR WORKOUT: Line up classes and easily go from one to the next with Stacked Classes. Add on things like warm-ups, stretching, yoga, and more to your workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('82d17376-07b6-4d39-a15f-5ee1a0f99b34', '735c4267-758d-4d4a-b86e-7f8c1f015f3d', 'TRACK PERFORMANCE: Pair your Apple or Wear OS watch to the Peloton Watch App to track heart rate and workout metrics in any class.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('abcc9a2c-1a7e-49d0-a92f-fe4170acd901', '735c4267-758d-4d4a-b86e-7f8c1f015f3d', 'TRACK PERFORMANCE: Pair your Apple or Wear OS watch to the Peloton Watch App to track heart rate and workout metrics in any class.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ccb3ff15-dc7a-4cca-a29c-1dff3b2a49d2', '735c4267-758d-4d4a-b86e-7f8c1f015f3d', '4’x2’ FOOTPRINT: Peloton Bike only needs the space the size of a small yoga mat.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('49ae889a-49ff-44fe-82e7-489d8c8e26b9', '735c4267-758d-4d4a-b86e-7f8c1f015f3d', 'MEASUREMENTS: Dimensions: 59” L x 53” H x 23” W; Screen: 22” diagonal; Weight: 135 lbs; Power cord length: 10’. User requirements – Height range: 4’11”–6’5”; weight maximum: 297 lbs; age minimum: 14.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('21731d8f-aafb-4664-8142-a4e9554eaf6e', '735c4267-758d-4d4a-b86e-7f8c1f015f3d', 'REQUIREMENTS: We require leaving 24” on all four sides to store and train on your Bike. Keeping your Bike in a room with a minimum ceiling height of 8’ will ensure adequate headroom while riding.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('20365b0a-fcd9-49da-907e-aa1cdd752f6b', '735c4267-758d-4d4a-b86e-7f8c1f015f3d', 'WHAT’S IN THE BOXES: Instructions, Bike frame, stabilizers, handlebars, water bottle holders, pedals, weight holders, touchscreen, and toolkit are included. Some parts are located in the touchscreen box.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b79b70f0-e7b0-48c4-a57d-9ad844e259c3', '6e3ff1af-9e29-4474-9e5c-e79392c16de6', 'EXERCISE BIKE: Our exercise bike allows for 16 levels of resistance adjustment and 30 dB silent ride. That''s because it utilizes a non-friction magnetic resistance system that takes advantage of silent and smooth resistance adjustments.Multiple levels of resistance to meet the workout needs of beginners to professionals. and he low decibel ride keeps you from disturbing others.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('77ef0880-e6f7-4092-94b4-a2866ee7da65', '6e3ff1af-9e29-4474-9e5c-e79392c16de6', 'EASY ASSEMLY: Tailored for all skill levels, from beginners to experts, our stationary bike offers a stressless assembly experience. With clear, comprehensive instruction and an accompanying installation video, you''ll have your bike set up in no time, regardless of your technical proficiency.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5ffcbdd9-a00b-48e1-939b-4096a94064e9', '6e3ff1af-9e29-4474-9e5c-e79392c16de6', 'SCIENTIFICALLY ENGINEERED FOR 300LBS CAPACITY: This exercise bike boasts a robust construction with a maximum weight capacity of 300 lbs, making it suitable for a wide range of users. Crafted from premium-grade steel and reinforced with a double golden triangle frame design, it offers unparalleled strength and stability. Furthermore, it features an ergonomic seat cushion that combines comfort with durability, ensuring a painless ride even for extended sessions, regardless of your body type.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('88acca7f-f14e-4b00-a4f5-1f2c64ef76ac', '6e3ff1af-9e29-4474-9e5c-e79392c16de6', 'VERSATILE FIT FOR 4.6-6FT: Our indoor exercise bike accommodates a diverse range of heights, from 4.6 to 6 feet, through its 5-level adjustable seat height mechanism. This feature ensures that individuals of varying body types can comfortably enjoy their workouts at home, fostering a shared fitness experience. Additionally, the bike''s front and rear support tubes feature 6 levels of fine-tuning, effectively compensating for uneven floor surfaces, ensuring a stable and secure ride for all users.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('39740828-17bb-4f54-8c09-a3e1247c24f0', '6e3ff1af-9e29-4474-9e5c-e79392c16de6', 'SATISFACTION COMMITMENT: We offer a prompt telephone message service, ensuring to attend to buyers'' inquiries within 12 hours. Rest assured, we stand behind our products with a comprehensive one-year service commitment. Any issues you encounter with your purchase will be promptly addressed until you are fully satisfied.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7b1dc766-b17a-494d-acdc-913cac5234bd', '6e3ff1af-9e29-4474-9e5c-e79392c16de6', 'REAL-TIME FITNESS DATA: The stationary bike can record your fitness data including pulse rate, calorie, time, distance, speed. These data will be displayed on LCD screen. And the work out data can auto start and auto close, As long as you start to ride immediately automatically record the exercise data, and it will turn off automatically after you stop using it for a few minutes.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('33476c44-a5cc-4752-b88d-4460c7a6b2ae', '2005b229-ef48-4d4a-9371-2f4a432c00b3', 'ADVANCED PERFORMANCE MONITOR: You can keep track of speed, distance, time, calories, odometer, RPM, Pulse, and Auto On/Off or use Scan to cycle through each metric.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cbccb830-b046-4419-ab4c-13c6c027ecb4', '2005b229-ef48-4d4a-9371-2f4a432c00b3', '40 LB FLYWHEEL: Designed for speed and stability to create more momentum for longer periods of time keeping your workout going.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('466d673c-8954-4dde-a00b-33629c388932', '2005b229-ef48-4d4a-9371-2f4a432c00b3', 'PULSE SENSOR: Helps track your target heart rate and maintain it during extended workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ed00ff45-04dc-479f-b888-8f9c2b74b1e6', '2005b229-ef48-4d4a-9371-2f4a432c00b3', 'ADJUSTABLE FRICTION RESISTANCE: The dual felt pad resistance system gives you the sense of being on the road and the micro-tension controller provides just the right amount of resistance you need.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9f95b134-e0c6-41c6-8f12-61cab7967e21', '2005b229-ef48-4d4a-9371-2f4a432c00b3', 'DEVICE HOLDER: Place your device above the digital monitor and start your workout routine by watching your favorite online training videos by Sunny Health & Fitness.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d7e13dd7-d5b8-4cde-957a-d02d3446c924', '7610db5a-7a48-4821-a428-8fca1db9124a', 'FREE CONNECTED APP: Enjoy FREE access to the SunnyFit App with every Sunny Health & Fitness product—no membership fees! Dive into 1,000+ trainer-led workouts, explore 10,000+ virtual scenic tours, track your progress, challenge others, and much more!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c1444dd0-7c83-485d-b89e-292943c62536', '7610db5a-7a48-4821-a428-8fca1db9124a', 'ELECTROMAGNETIC RESISTANCE: With 16 different levels of electromagnetic resistance, you will be able to set your workout intensity level to perfectly meet your needs. Crank up the resistance for a challenging full-body workout, or dial it down for a low-impact and low-intensity recovery session.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a0cb67f6-151c-405f-b978-4061049ae3cd', '7610db5a-7a48-4821-a428-8fca1db9124a', 'WORKOUT VARIETY: Take the guesswork out of your exercise session and use one of the 12 pre-programmed elliptical workouts built into the machine. If you prefer to customize your own workout, the Smart Recumbent Elliptical Cross Trainer allows you to create up to 4 unique user programs for a personalized workout experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('970ee593-05a7-4287-9780-2db734470db6', '7610db5a-7a48-4821-a428-8fca1db9124a', 'DESIGNED FOR LOW-IMPACT: Protect your joints while still challenging yourself. Our recumbent elliptical allows you to improve cardiovascular health and build strength but is also gentle on your body.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1aa877e8-02f5-4a1d-bfbb-67d88eb6cbd8', '7610db5a-7a48-4821-a428-8fca1db9124a', 'FULL BODY WORKOUT: Work various muscle groups in both your upper and lower body by simultaneously using the moveable handles and elliptical-sized foot pedals. If you want a more focused workout, use the handles or foot pedals independently for a targeted upper or lower body burn.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b1b23348-af6f-4a6d-9f45-9dfdedb6a877', '7610db5a-7a48-4821-a428-8fca1db9124a', 'EASY ON AND OFF: The easy on-off design provides a simple, hassle-free transition from start to finish. With minimal obstruction between the handlebars and the seat, you can step through your machine and sit down safely before starting your workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('29ec9f22-8d6f-4363-97e2-53199796e17e', '7610db5a-7a48-4821-a428-8fca1db9124a', 'COMFORTABLE RIDE: Enjoy the padded seat and contoured mesh back support for a more comfortable and pleasant workout. With the easy seat adjuster, you no longer need to get off the machine to adjust the seat to your height. Simply engage the handle by your side and adjust to your comfort level.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fb1e46d6-3c9e-461a-987b-853af2808514', '7610db5a-7a48-4821-a428-8fca1db9124a', 'MAXIMUM WEIGHT CAPACITY: The sturdy, premium-quality design allows for weight capacities of up to 300 lbs.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('456c2cc6-f818-45b5-98dd-a541223be25b', 'b200481c-f14f-4c47-bbce-a474f4bdc14c', 'Dual Bluetooth Speakers, Water Bottle Holder, AutoBreeze workout Fan, Front-mounted transport Wheels');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('77fc9568-38ff-46d9-b6b9-7b4313fe2386', '7610db5a-7a48-4821-a428-8fca1db9124a', 'SUNNY STATE OF MIND: In our 20 years of serving the fitness community, we have impacted the lives of over 10 million customers, and we are confident that our equipment is not only built to last but will also enable you to achieve your cardio goals. Our vision and core mission is to stand beside you throughout your entire process. We enable you to enjoy your workouts with our products and our SunnyFit app which comes with over 1000+ workouts taught by our professionally certified Sunny Trainers.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('10e7e652-85d1-4ab4-8b6b-4e1c26564621', '7610db5a-7a48-4821-a428-8fca1db9124a', 'PERFORMANCE MONITOR: Track various fitness metrics during each workout. View your time, speed, RPM, distance, Watts, calories, heart rate, target heart rate, and resistance on the digital performance monitor. Train at your perfect intensity level every workout!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('59134481-d261-4468-8376-0a71a9f56b7b', 'f196dd22-7a58-4d8f-8238-d8ddd3d5b511', '[Motorized Pedal Exerciser] Physiotherapy rehabilitation bike for low impact arm and leg exercises, motorized assisted pedal exercise trainer, motorized rehabilitation pedal exercise bike, ideal for long term care and rehabilitation.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('45cfa9e5-e887-4535-8184-c81e4f0ae82e', 'f196dd22-7a58-4d8f-8238-d8ddd3d5b511', '[Configuration options] 60W motor with timer function. Set timer for 1 to 15 minutes. Automatic procedures. P1-P5 mode switching, gear function. The speed is adjustable from 1 to 12. Different gears can be adjusted to suit different speed trainings. Rotation function: clockwise, counterclockwise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4b358029-9539-472a-8f9d-898763d800e0', 'f196dd22-7a58-4d8f-8238-d8ddd3d5b511', '[Remote Control - Display] The remote control makes it unnecessary to squat. The multi-function LCD display on this mini pedal exerciser tracks your time/distance/speed/calories as you ride, making it easy to read.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1ca7ecc7-c64d-4645-96c0-f028c067b9d8', 'f196dd22-7a58-4d8f-8238-d8ddd3d5b511', '[Exercise Program] This compact pedal exerciser can be used to strengthen arms and legs, effectively increase blood circulation, improve endurance, reduce stress, stimulate muscle movement to stimulate nerves; compress muscle tone, improve joint range of motion, reduce spasms and soften the body; maintain or restore walking ability, enhance limb coordination and promote health');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6b8c5444-e5f5-40dc-9900-b43b211851f9', 'f196dd22-7a58-4d8f-8238-d8ddd3d5b511', '【Applicable to the crowd】 Motorized pedal gym is suitable for the elderly and tetraplegic patients, exercise the knee, foot, leg and arm. Special Note: This product is an electric assisted trainer with adjustable speed of 1-12 and no resistance function. (Suitable for the elderly, post-operative rehabilitation and low-intensity training people exercise). If you experience limb discomfort while using this product, then you must stop using it and consult your personal physician.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3f1cabe8-4527-430a-a21a-59de390c7cfb', 'f196dd22-7a58-4d8f-8238-d8ddd3d5b511', 'What you get We offer one year of free replacement parts for our physical therapy equipment. Our customer support team will answer any questions within 24 hours and ensure that we have the right solution for you within a short period of time.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0ad89a2d-f8fb-48a7-a34a-b8763500d27d', 'a014f5f2-676a-4fe1-99b6-f3e6ffce3955', '3G Cardio, an Arizona-based company with a combined 50 years of experience in the fitness industry, provides commercial-level quality and superior value. We offer an unmatched lifetime frame warranty, 7-year parts, and 1-year in-home labor (scroll down for commercial warranty), and you are only a phone call away from 5-star customer service 9-5 weekdays PST.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7b9e35c5-efef-43d5-8f42-e4d790e9a9ec', 'a014f5f2-676a-4fe1-99b6-f3e6ffce3955', 'FreeSync FTMS Bluetooth Connectivity and Interactive 3rd Party Fitness App Connectivity. Non-coded wireless heart rate strap included.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1d79267c-1aed-4f03-b32d-418dbfdf8e89', 'a014f5f2-676a-4fe1-99b6-f3e6ffce3955', 'Our oversized, highly adjustable cushioned seat provides incredible comfort and for most users between 5’ and 6’5”. Seat tilts 5 positions and forward/back 25 positions.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f04b90b3-fcf6-4ad7-9678-1c89a792d875', 'a014f5f2-676a-4fe1-99b6-f3e6ffce3955', 'The Airflow Mesh Flex backrest tilts and adjusts to conform to your body shape and size (up to 350 lbs.), keeping your back cool.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5c25ae66-44eb-436f-afc8-8e0227ff48e1', 'a014f5f2-676a-4fe1-99b6-f3e6ffce3955', 'Overall, small compact size (49" L x 27" W x 43" H), allows our bike to easily roll (115 lbs.) through a standard doorway. Metal handle and wheels built into frame.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('39dece50-0371-4ab9-b68c-764b9fb43aa7', 'a014f5f2-676a-4fe1-99b6-f3e6ffce3955', 'Handheld heart rate sensors & wireless heart rate strap (included) keep you informed as you challenge yourself through 16 levels of magnetic resistance. Includes 12 preprogrammed and 3 heart rate workouts. Preset calories, time, wattage, and distance goals as desired.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bafaeb1b-677f-4bc8-86e9-6daff554a2d6', 'a014f5f2-676a-4fe1-99b6-f3e6ffce3955', 'Narrow Q factor distance between pedals makes for an extremely ergonomically correct ride.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4be43a3d-6d90-42ee-9991-244af5cc9b81', 'a014f5f2-676a-4fe1-99b6-f3e6ffce3955', 'NO MEMBERSHIP REQUIRED with our equipment! BYOS = Bring your own screen with FTMS Bluetooth. Tablet shelf included.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f8664485-6f4d-4001-9147-e8e91a749f23', 'a426634b-8baf-49d0-8175-dd035be5b690', 'Excellent Customer Service: Niceday is designed for long-term durability; We are committed to providing our customers with an excellent product and service; If you have any questions, we will try our best to help you');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e0c0fc45-532d-4e7b-a300-62e48871be4a', 'a426634b-8baf-49d0-8175-dd035be5b690', 'Ideal for Physical Therapy: Niceday recumbent exercise bike greatly reduces the burden on the back and puts less pressure on the joints; Aim to help knee and lower back arthritis patients work their mobility and recover from replacement surgery');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6239e132-ca97-486a-be09-077519382bcb', 'a426634b-8baf-49d0-8175-dd035be5b690', '16-Level Progressive Resistance: Niceday Recumbent Bike offers 16 levels of progressive resistance, suitable for the diverse exercise needs of the whole family; The mechanical knob allows precise control of resistance changes, ensuring seamless transitions between intensity levels; Ideal for gentle physical therapy and relaxing cardio exercise');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ce86e4e1-5614-4bb1-8481-e93f8e3d3aba', 'a426634b-8baf-49d0-8175-dd035be5b690', '15LBS Quiet Flywheel: The precisely engineered 15LBS flywheel combined with the magnetic control system, ensures smooth and quiet operation; No disturbance to family and neighbors, fostering a harmonious home fitness');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('126a5906-82c7-45a8-8d8c-f560e1c9d561', 'a426634b-8baf-49d0-8175-dd035be5b690', '400LBS Weight Capacity: Robust & heavy-duty frame for longer service life, excellent stability and safety; Maximum weight capacity is up to 400 LBS; Meet the exercise needs of the entire family');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('29a9c59f-ab7e-4c65-9be1-e8f0e0579014', 'a426634b-8baf-49d0-8175-dd035be5b690', 'Ergonomic Seat & Backrest: Bid farewell to hip discomfort. Embrace comfort with ergonomic high-density soft sponge cushion and breathable mesh backrest; 8 seat position is easy to adjust, providing ample leg room for user height up to 6''7"');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5eba5239-fce1-4843-931d-70933278e9c3', 'a426634b-8baf-49d0-8175-dd035be5b690', 'Smart Data Interaction: LED digital monitor effectively tracks exercise data; Integrated iPad holder added exercise fun; Connecting with the Kinomap & Z-WIFT app via Bluetooth takes your workouts to the next level');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7dca179d-ead7-48c6-99f5-d4d463467394', 'a426634b-8baf-49d0-8175-dd035be5b690', 'Say Goodbye to Complex: 90% pre-assembled, instruction and tools included, installation is a breeze; Integrated transport wheels and wireless cable are designed for daily mobility and storage, suitable for home gym');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('514ef8c4-55f6-4162-a4b4-aa4cff6c97d2', '3f5273eb-e459-44d2-8790-e98f5b3bb7bb', 'Low-impact Workout: The recumbent exercise bike is ideal for casual ride. The movement that engages the whole body, virtually anyone to start a comfortable and low-impact workout, especially seniors and deconditioned people.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('df643183-a49a-4140-ac94-2fc74d505902', '3f5273eb-e459-44d2-8790-e98f5b3bb7bb', 'Bluetooth Connectivity Function: Elevates your workout experience with Kinomap, and ZWIFT apps via Bluetooth wirelessly. Activity reports and workout stats, personalized workout programs, coaching sessions, etc.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1f7dc093-f893-4a9c-8795-851dc66cc3ef', '3f5273eb-e459-44d2-8790-e98f5b3bb7bb', '16 Levels Magnetic Resistance: Our recumbent stationary bike with 16 levels of tension control give you enough and more uniform resistance to meet different intensity needs. The cooperation of magnetic flywheel and belt drive system offers a whisper-quiet riding experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('134aedcf-98dc-4e01-a9ce-6e402954355b', '3f5273eb-e459-44d2-8790-e98f5b3bb7bb', 'Quick Seat Adjustment: The comfortable seat can be easily adjusted with the quick release lever without getting off the bike, fits for 4''9"-6''3" heights, inseam length 27.56"-37.5". Give every user an ideal workout posture while sitting.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('223b28dd-b7c5-4226-a39d-f57110134cad', '3f5273eb-e459-44d2-8790-e98f5b3bb7bb', 'Easy 30-Min Assembly: With 90% of the recumbent bikes for adults pre-assembled, the setup process is quick and hassle-free. In just 30 minutes, you can have your recumbent exercise bike fully ready for use, allowing you to start your fitness journey almost immediately without the frustration of complicated assembly.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('828ee27c-a9fa-4347-8955-d015bc85c1e4', '3f5273eb-e459-44d2-8790-e98f5b3bb7bb', 'Movable for Storage: There are two front-mounted transport wheels up front in the exercise bike for simple storage to make moving it around your home gym easier. Just lift the rear tube frame then move.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('118c2267-5e90-4e28-b1d2-d69ffddb8c1a', '3f5273eb-e459-44d2-8790-e98f5b3bb7bb', 'LCD Digital Monitor: Our recumbent exercise bike for seniors with the LCD monitor, you can set, track, and monitor progress including Time, Speed, Distance, Calories, Total Distance, and Pulse, specific to your training goals.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e99d1cee-0859-4ef9-a640-6d079f3ae103', 'f6ae305d-5564-4afa-87f0-2094b494e0ff', '4 in 1 Exercise Bike: The upright posture of this recumbent exercise bike provides you with high-intensity exercise and helps you burn more calories. The semi-recumbent posture with a low impact and more comfortable riding experience. This recubment exercise bike also comes with arm resistance bands, which helps to tone your upper muscles and your whole body workout. Let this all-around, multifunctional home recumbent exercise bike become your trusted assistant for a healthy life');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c06eca25-c290-4b1a-9df5-c719b1796327', 'f6ae305d-5564-4afa-87f0-2094b494e0ff', '10 Level Adjustable Magnetic Resistance: Our exercise bike is equipped with an advanced 10-level adjustable magnetic resistance system, providing you with a variety of resistance options ranging from light to intense. Whether you''re a fitness novice or an enthusiast seeking a challenge, you can find the perfect workout intensity with this exercise bike. To ensure comfort and tranquility during home workouts, the stationary bike features a silent magnetic flywheel that operates almost without any abnormal noise, allowing you to fully concentrate on your exercise');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a0f242a5-fe6e-4efb-bea0-70f8dbf2671c', 'f6ae305d-5564-4afa-87f0-2094b494e0ff', 'Multifunctional LCD Display & Tablet Holder: Our exercise bike comes with LCD monitor, exercise bikes for home tracks your time, speed, distance, calories burned, and heart rate while you are cycling--offers a scientific real-time exercise data. The data from this exercise bike can not only help you plan your workout intensity scientifically but also allow you to clearly see your progress and achievements after each session. Place your phone or tablet on the stationary bike''s holder and watch your favorite shows at the same time');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c428d1cb-2788-48ed-b527-ef3a08bca699', 'f6ae305d-5564-4afa-87f0-2094b494e0ff', 'Oversized Adjustable Seat Cushion: The exercise bike aims at improving the experience of home fitness, we use large and soft seat cushion to provide you with the most comfortable support. With the adjustable seat, stationary bike suits most of the people in your family. Moreover, the seat height of the exercise bike is also adjustable, accommodating the height requirements of most people. These detailed designs of the exercise bikes for home are intended to meet your usage needs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0c4a8cbd-32b1-401e-8a4b-de7c568ef437', 'f6ae305d-5564-4afa-87f0-2094b494e0ff', 'Folding Design And Easy to Move: The folding exercise bike is extremely suitable for the small living room because it doesn''t take up too much space. And foldable exercise bike can be fully folded up to occupy minimal space for storage when not in use. Foldable exercise bike comes with transport wheels for you to move this 4 in 1 exercise bike easily from room to room');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5de3929f-2318-4f6d-9555-76e03fa183f3', 'faf1a854-c8ff-460b-a45d-f36d74aa31fc', '3 IN 1 FOLDING EXERCISE BIKE : Folding exercise bike has three movement modes: upright, horizontal and folding, which can help you exercise different muscle groups. Stable triangular structure that can support up to 300 pounds of trainers, safe and easy to assemble');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('323b5cfa-35b2-40c3-bd95-8e616d798d64', 'faf1a854-c8ff-460b-a45d-f36d74aa31fc', '16-LEVEL ADJUSTABLE MAGNETIC RESISTANCE : The foldable stationary bike gives you more options for adjustable weight, and our quiet, smooth magnetic flywheel ensures that you exercise at home or at the office without abnormal noise. 16 level resistance adjustment for more challenging training');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('051e0b58-1568-4748-b49e-6899485d6c48', 'faf1a854-c8ff-460b-a45d-f36d74aa31fc', 'MULTI-FUNCTION LCD MONITOR : We choose multi-function LCD with clear screen that can track distance, heat, pulse, time, scan, speed and Odo. Real-time monitoring of movement data, can be viewed and recorded at any time. And equipped with an IPAD stand will bring more fun for your home training');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7c139c00-302c-41fd-a098-2318b7b7daa9', 'faf1a854-c8ff-460b-a45d-f36d74aa31fc', 'STURDY FRAME WITH LESS NOISE : Our indoor foldable sports bikes are made of robust alloy steel with a robust, stable, and durable frame that greatly reduces the noise generated during exercise and provides you with a quieter and more comfortable exercise experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6335d28a-3def-439f-922e-b8ad1368a61b', 'faf1a854-c8ff-460b-a45d-f36d74aa31fc', 'SPACIOUS AND SOFT CUSHIONS: Our seats have been enlarged and widened to an overall size of 11.02 "* 7.88". And with a new and upgraded leather design, with thick and soft sponge cushions, so that you can exercise without any stress');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('34769bd3-a7a7-4258-8805-f5547adc0d5f', 'faf1a854-c8ff-460b-a45d-f36d74aa31fc', 'WHAT YOU GET : We offer a 12-month replacement service and a strong after-sales team. This is a great gift for home, family, friends. Experience the pinnacle of convenience, efficiency and performance with our folding sport bikes');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1e089331-55c7-4a3e-8cf2-3f3cbbe76c03', 'a034c612-46a1-4456-a8ef-d6286a11ac52', '【SMART RECUMBENT BIKE FOR LOW-IMPACT FITNESS】This joint-friendly bike, compatible with the SunnyFit app, is ideal for low-impact workouts, especially for seniors. The cushioned, adjustable seat maximizes comfort, and built-in resistance bands provide options for upper body exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('03dbeea8-10c5-4bf7-a65f-4b8c6b15f7e2', 'a034c612-46a1-4456-a8ef-d6286a11ac52', '【FREE FITNESS APP CONNECTION】 Enjoy FREE access to the SunnyFit APP with NO membership fees! Dive into 1,000+ trainer-led workouts, explore 10,000+ virtual scenic tours, track your progress, challenge others, and much more!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('862c5f1a-5561-4c0f-af50-a55797d76d24', 'a034c612-46a1-4456-a8ef-d6286a11ac52', '【QUIET & SMOOTH OPERATION】 Featuring a magnetic belt-drive mechanism, this bike offers a quiet and smooth workout experience with 16 levels of magnetic resistance to match your fitness level.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fea39ae2-a51c-47f1-93b3-d55ea0a18e43', 'a034c612-46a1-4456-a8ef-d6286a11ac52', '【ADJUSTABLE CUSHIONED SEAT, EASY ON/OFF DESIGN】 The wide, cushioned, adjustable seat and padded backrest, along with the flip-able side handle for easy on and off, allow you to exercise with optimal comfort, while the long inseam accommodates users of various heights.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('518989aa-8879-4368-be15-cbf7ae18e8d2', 'a034c612-46a1-4456-a8ef-d6286a11ac52', '【FULL-MOTION EXERCISE BANDS】Includes two 20LB resistance bands with foam grips. The pulley and swivel system provides a full range of motion to effectively engage major muscle groups.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ca5c026d-ed78-4462-9335-ff5ef0d7d209', 'a034c612-46a1-4456-a8ef-d6286a11ac52', '【BUILT TO LAST WITH 300LB WEIGHT CAPACITY】 Constructed from high-grade steel, this robust bike supports up to 300LB, with a curved rear bar for enhanced stability and safety.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7051e9e8-9a82-4c62-865c-1fc1434c3885', 'a034c612-46a1-4456-a8ef-d6286a11ac52', '【ADVANCED DIGITAL MONITOR】 Personalize your training by setting time, distance, calorie, and heart rate goals. Track progress in real-time with the advanced digital monitor and use the built-in pulse sensor for precise workout metrics.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d138ac13-ffdf-4e09-8351-b84581b296f3', 'a034c612-46a1-4456-a8ef-d6286a11ac52', '【ENHANCED CONVENIENCE】Stay entertained with the built-in device holder, hydrated with the easy-access bottle holder, and enjoy added flexibility with a dumbbell holder. Bulit-in transportation wheels ensure a stable and convenient workout experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bf153e6c-cb8e-43bb-a98d-c3d24ba359bc', 'a034c612-46a1-4456-a8ef-d6286a11ac52', '【SAFE WORKOUT DESIGN】 Self-leveling pedals and adjustable foot straps ensure secure footing, while the curved rear base adds stability, providing peace of mind for a safe, steady workout every time.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7ef1c710-e2f9-4c71-840d-003af44d698e', 'a034c612-46a1-4456-a8ef-d6286a11ac52', '【20+ YEARS OF EXCELLENCE】Sunny Health & Fitness, a U.S.-based company, offers top-quality equipment with a commitment to excellence. Our dedicated U.S. customer service team and certified trainers ensure a truly unmatched FIT FOR EVERYONE experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f1c1d06b-6951-4e3b-ae4c-616344403b65', '42cfc766-bbbc-4394-9911-655438f74ea1', '【JOINT HEALTH MATTERS】Our recumbent bike offers a low-impact workout that reduces stress on joints and provides better back support with its reclining position. It''s ideal for all-purpose exercise, rehab, cardiovascular health, and muscle toning.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f866bcaa-42c3-41e2-b52f-0b2e91102878', '42cfc766-bbbc-4394-9911-655438f74ea1', '【FREE CONNECTED APP】 Enjoy FREE access to the SunnyFit App with every Sunny Health & Fitness product—no membership fees! Dive into 1,000+ trainer-led workouts, explore 10,000+ virtual scenic tours, track your progress, challenge others, and much more!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('550e2f8a-3e0f-4689-9d35-34875785ea40', '42cfc766-bbbc-4394-9911-655438f74ea1', '【UNDISTURBED EXPERIENCE】The ultra-quiet and smooth ride with 8 levels of magnetic tension and a belt drive mechanism is ideally for home. Effortlessly switch intensity with a simple dial turn. Immerse yourself in tranquility with our recumbent bike.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7f2cca2e-e833-4796-8e2d-169ccc295182', '42cfc766-bbbc-4394-9911-655438f74ea1', '【DESIGNED FOR ULTRA COMFORT】Indulge in comfort with an extra-wide 17x12x2" cushion seat. Enjoy the adjustable seating and stable footing with adjustable foot stabilizers. Effortlessly move it around with carrying wheels, perfect for any terrain.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6054ba74-2d1c-4064-be2e-9c09e251ddd1', '42cfc766-bbbc-4394-9911-655438f74ea1', '【DURABILITY & RELIABILITY】Experience peak performance with 300LB weight capacity, featuring a convenient device holder, cup holder, and anti-slip feet with straps adjustable, all designed to keep you focused on your workout for superior results!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('67be0e77-e399-4505-84fb-dc786108b016', '42cfc766-bbbc-4394-9911-655438f74ea1', '【TRACK YOUR PROGRESS】Track various metrics by comprehensive dashboard. View your time, speed, distance, calories, heart rate, target heart rate, and odometer on the digital performance monitor. Train at your perfect intensity level every workout!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0e2aa9a9-8cf0-4c5f-bf11-16a5a9ba27d8', '42cfc766-bbbc-4394-9911-655438f74ea1', '【FIT FOR EVERY ROOM】Effortlessly transport your machine with the front stabilizer''s end cap carrying wheel, ensuring convenience at every turn. Moreover, for most uneven surface, fine-tune stability in with the rear stabilizers adjustable end cap.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('10028c80-3720-4556-bd25-e6c2977b4e68', '42cfc766-bbbc-4394-9911-655438f74ea1', '【HASSLE-FREE ASSEMBLY】Say goodbye to complicated setups with our straightforward instructions, including a user manual, adjustment guide, and video tutorial. Sunny customer service is ready to assist! Focusing on your fitness goals right-away!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5d764ea8-9b21-4ee3-a005-6a52acae1c52', '42cfc766-bbbc-4394-9911-655438f74ea1', '【WHY PULSE SENSORS?】Pulse Sensors & Heart Rate Monitor offers real-time heart rate feedback, allowing precise workout adjustments and ensuring training within target zones and alerting if heart rate exceeds safe limits during intense exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a52f2e83-77d8-416b-9735-cf7da7012833', '42cfc766-bbbc-4394-9911-655438f74ea1', '【20+ YEARS OF EXCELLENCE】Sunny Health & Fitness, a U.S Company, offers top-quality equipment with a commitment to excellence. Our dedicated U.S. customer service team and certified trainers ensure a truly unmatched FIT FOR EVERYONE experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a6132045-dc82-473c-8c47-e90bc39134c9', '2fea6c46-7c27-4608-914e-149df6a66727', 'Solid X-frame foldable design — folds to just 20.5" x 20.5" of floor space when not in use');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('06d38586-2e35-47a4-bac3-ae57293ce983', '2fea6c46-7c27-4608-914e-149df6a66727', 'Ergonomically designed for comfort — large contoured seat with back pad and multi-grip padded handlebars');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('dc2ce914-7146-4551-b8a0-59a5fb51eb40', '2fea6c46-7c27-4608-914e-149df6a66727', '2" x 1" LCD window — clearly displays speed, distance, time, calories, and pulse');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cada3af3-f3f2-48da-b706-b9d54fbced59', '2fea6c46-7c27-4608-914e-149df6a66727', '8 levels of manual resistance — easily controlled with large dial tension knob for users of all fitness levels');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('791745e1-82c1-4dd6-9c7d-26bc500e3723', '2fea6c46-7c27-4608-914e-149df6a66727', 'Handlebar mounted hand-pulse sensors — monitor your heart rate and stay in your target zone');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5861977b-9f0a-418e-a443-845563318a22', '72a97e55-378d-4f5e-9a58-29408f811a50', 'HEAVY-DUTY CONSTRUCTION: Manufactured from high-grade plastic and steel, this bike features a durable frame that combines design and performance. The design facilitates quick entry and exit from the bike and it can support a user weighing up to 300 lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cb24fbcb-76b9-4c22-9bde-6abaff9ae774', '72a97e55-378d-4f5e-9a58-29408f811a50', 'CUSTOMIZABLE CYCLING WORKOUT: Designed for fitness enthusiasts of all skill levels, this bike comes with 15 modes of preset levels that simulate the effects of biking on different terrains. Simply select the desired program to personalize your training');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b8e5d7e7-5a94-4c44-b84a-2510c7aa54e8', '72a97e55-378d-4f5e-9a58-29408f811a50', 'ERGONOMIC HANDLES AND SAFETY PEDALS: This gear has textured pedals with straps to prevent your feet from sliding. The bike’s pair of contoured handles allow for comfortable gripping and provide superior support to your upper body');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('33218bba-d098-4a58-8b48-a3dc9d9573b2', '72a97e55-378d-4f5e-9a58-29408f811a50', 'PULSE SENSORS AND EASY-TO-READ MONITOR: This exercise bike comes with an LCD monitor that keeps track of distance traveled, time elapsed, calories burned, and current speed. Equipped with pulse sensors, it also monitors your heart rate');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e5e2817b-ac49-4f4d-a852-283fe4e54697', '72a97e55-378d-4f5e-9a58-29408f811a50', 'LARGE ADJUSTABLE SEAT: This stationary bike boasts an adjustable padded seat that can be moved up, down, forward, and backward to accommodate each user’s leg length. The seat’s locking-screw adjustment knob ensures a comfortable riding position');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fb602bcf-e301-48f4-8e41-b7a5adf63244', '8e02ff5d-bd81-4ea9-a087-954151cb5e9b', 'Low-Cost & Efficient Workouts: JEEKEE has always been committed to combining life with exercise. A proper exercise bike is important for the elderly, obese, pregnant and those with knee and waist injuries');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('86f26cda-5779-4aa4-a3a9-d5975664095e', '8e02ff5d-bd81-4ea9-a087-954151cb5e9b', 'Adjustable Exercise Bike: The stationary bike has 53.5 inch frame and 9 position-adjusted seats for adults and seniors who are 4'' 9 "to 6'' 5"， inseam length 27" to 39" inseam, and loads up to 300 lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4db49578-a001-444b-a65b-94f240b61949', '8e02ff5d-bd81-4ea9-a087-954151cb5e9b', 'Smooth and Quiet Recumbent Bike: The stationary recumbent bike uses strong neodymium magnets. The resistance is more uniform and the service life is longer. In addition, the craftsmanship of double belt system makes the experience smoother and quieter');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('291f5924-3df5-40ac-b744-3c983e630d8b', '8e02ff5d-bd81-4ea9-a087-954151cb5e9b', 'Ergonomic Design Seat & Backrest: The backrest adopts high-quality sports sponge and ergonomic design with a forward tilt of 10°. Exercise bikes can provide comfort during long periods of exercise and protect your lower back and knees from injury');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('196242ad-ec35-4cca-b0de-19ff6b4a60cd', '93af5f70-f690-492a-ab1c-fb60d4752e6f', 'Set a calorie, distance, or time target goal with the advanced computer display ; Integrated messaging to help inspire you keeps the workout fresh');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bdbe3db3-9cdb-4bdf-9bb0-1bc49fe87b32', '8e02ff5d-bd81-4ea9-a087-954151cb5e9b', 'Science Workout: LCD monitors track your fitness data such as time, speed, distance, calories and odometer. The iPad holder lets you watch TV or movies while riding. You can use the data to understand exercise effect and achieve your exercise goals');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f544e325-c47f-41b8-9029-c020076fe023', '8e02ff5d-bd81-4ea9-a087-954151cb5e9b', 'Easy To Move: Adult backrest bicycle covers a small area, the front and rear legs built-in handle and pulley, cable free design, convenient for daily movement and storage');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('01384087-800a-40ea-96e5-2d3deb250862', '8e02ff5d-bd81-4ea9-a087-954151cb5e9b', 'QUALITY SERVICE: JEEKEE is committed to providing quality service to every customer who buys our recumbent exercise bike. We have a professional after-sales team to solve any problems for you, reply to your message within 24 hours');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ad5d8995-80da-42e6-9b8a-67a967c0464e', 'b1dfce1d-aca6-456b-897e-04d3f76c0ac1', '[Newest Exercise Bike & Trustworthy Brand] Wenoker is launching a new industry-standard incredibly sturdy, solid frame aluminum steel construction and a sturdy exercise bike that has multi-point handlebar grips providing you with different cycling ways. We offer an exceptional stationary bike that’s designed to last and can handle a high user weight of 350 pounds. Its multi-triangle structure and weighted flywheel ensure you are stable and avoid jolting as you ride.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f3944f0f-3974-47ee-a634-276790d40a8a', 'b1dfce1d-aca6-456b-897e-04d3f76c0ac1', '[Quiet As Ever & Smooth] Unlike the deceptive bikes that have a noisy iron sand flywheel, problems of a belt falling off, and pulley breaking, WENOKER exercise bike always adopts an inertia-enhanced flywheel, ABS material belt pulley, and industrial-grade bearings, making the bike more reliable and quieter. The belt drive mechanism offers smooth pedaling and ensures you exercise silently. This means you can use the spin bike in virtually any room of your house.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cf1d2b6a-29cb-4cb4-8c0e-7816b73903bc', 'b1dfce1d-aca6-456b-897e-04d3f76c0ac1', '[Customized Your Workout Plan] The monitor can capture your time, spd, dst, cal, odo, and keep track of exercise progress in real-time. The unlimited tension adjusting levels allow for various uses, from a quick change of pace to full-scale cross-training, from warming up to cooling down before and after a workout. It’s one of the rare indoor exercise bikes suited to every type of rider, whether your priority is spinning, simulating outdoor training, or just pedaling while you watch TV.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e3bec2fe-e6fe-4f90-b969-35f41a4ebe4f', 'b1dfce1d-aca6-456b-897e-04d3f76c0ac1', '[Considerate Indoor Bike] This spin bike has a tablet holder, water bottle holder and caged pedals. Extended reach from saddle to handlebar enables space for all sizes of riders. In addition, the featured transport wheels are mounted on the front to make moving the stationary bike around at home easier.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('01f49044-3bb2-4045-86d3-b16b3b8d5351', 'b1dfce1d-aca6-456b-897e-04d3f76c0ac1', '[Choose Wenoker] Wenoker, as a professional brand, is dedicated to developing products that help people enjoy the fun of exercise, serving over 1 million households worldwide. Even if you cannot go to the studio or exercise outdoors, you can still work out at home to boost your immunity, enhance cardiovascular function, and strengthen muscles. It is perfect for your family''s health.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a5493284-b140-45a7-b2ca-6ca0cc0dbb0b', 'b1dfce1d-aca6-456b-897e-04d3f76c0ac1', '[Reliable Customer Service] WENOKER provides free parts replacement for 12 months. 70% pre-assembled exercise bike comes with tools pack which allows you to install in 20 mins. If you have any questions, please contact us. The factory engineer provides professional guidance on video. Double guarantee of quality and service. Choose WENOKER won''t let you down.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c1250a7c-6e2e-4d54-b190-609835db0af8', 'f5b21514-d250-4a8e-8a62-04b806cbe30a', 'WHISPER QUIET & SMOOTH: The QLSPTFTS exercise bike features an inertia-enhanced flywheel, ABS material pulley, and industrial-grade bearings to provide a reliable and quiet workout experience. The new generation magnetic resistance system minimizes noise during movement.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('652281fc-6123-4758-a7aa-9c9b579d25c9', 'f5b21514-d250-4a8e-8a62-04b806cbe30a', 'CONSIDERATE INDOOR BIKE: This spin bike comes with LCD display, water bottle holder,The adjustable handlebar allows for different riding styles. Featured transport wheels make it easy to move the bike around the home.The size is very compact (floor space:<5 sq ft)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9a825539-6b10-413a-9c3e-55c30b91b196', 'f5b21514-d250-4a8e-8a62-04b806cbe30a', 'CUSTOMIZED YOUR WORKOUT PLAN: The exercise bikes monitor captures time, speed, distance, calories, odometer, and tracks exercise progress in real-time. Unlimited tension adjustment levels offer a variety of uses and cater to every type of rider.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('454ee65b-b224-4ab1-b53a-b2e6fc3c2e82', 'f5b21514-d250-4a8e-8a62-04b806cbe30a', 'SAFE & CONVENIENT: This stationary bike has a heavy-duty frame that supports a maximum user weight of 264 lbs. It features 4-way adjustable seats and 2-way adjustable handles. Transport wheels and a convenient adjustment knob make it easy to use and move.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('efecb570-eaad-4146-81e4-94456a563894', 'f5b21514-d250-4a8e-8a62-04b806cbe30a', 'EFFECTIVE EXERCISE BIKE: Burn fat fast, build core muscles, strengthen the heart, and reduce injuries with versatile stationary bike. Suitable for everyone from beginners to fitness enthusiasts. Perfect as a gift for women.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('daf7a20c-ff8d-4a23-8af4-fcb4f7119d50', '568926e2-f9ec-48b7-855d-df41dec58996', 'MORE STABLE AND SAFER - The frame of our exercise bike is crafted from high-strength steel, with multiple triangular support structures and a 15 lbs heavy duty cast iron flywheel ensuring stability during rides. Even at full sprint, it offers a safe and reliable training experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('39f45379-0b53-4b32-8c83-36c720d3cb56', '568926e2-f9ec-48b7-855d-df41dec58996', 'FULLY ADJUSTABLE - The Spring pull pins allow for easy adjustment of handlebar and seat positions. The handlebars are adjustable in two directions (up and down), and the seat is adjustable in four (up, down, fore, and aft), fitting users with a height of 5 ft to 6.2 ft. With an infinite resistance knob, you can freely adjust the intensity of your workout. One exercise bike meets the workout needs of your entire family.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a95def23-d907-4e26-ad81-2ea793b92c38', '568926e2-f9ec-48b7-855d-df41dec58996', 'SILENT AND SMOOTH - Our cutting-edge stationary bike features a silent magnetic control system, noise-free bearings, and a self-generating power system that eliminates electrical hum. Experience a smooth, quiet ride that allows you to focus on your workout without distractions. Elevate your fitness journey with innovation and tranquility.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3bf3ff84-1be1-41ee-bc69-bb26b96627ba', '568926e2-f9ec-48b7-855d-df41dec58996', 'LCD MONITOR AND TABLET HOLDER - The LCD monitor tracks speed, distance, calories, ODO, and RPM, so that you can know your progress and adjust your exercise plan in time. The tablet holder accommodates phones, iPads, or other devices, making your workout more enjoyable.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('54775647-65aa-48c4-b5f2-409a2b66016b', '568926e2-f9ec-48b7-855d-df41dec58996', 'USER-FRIENDLY DESIGN - This exercise bike comes equipped with a water bottle holder and a dumbbell rack, allowing you to hydrate and engage in diverse training. The resistance knob allows for emergency braking, and the transport wheels help you easily move the bike.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('81d3ed3e-5276-41c3-8215-ca7bd2729dcd', '568926e2-f9ec-48b7-855d-df41dec58996', 'QUICK AND EASY ASSEMBLY - Experience the convenience of setting up your exercise bike with ease. Your package arrives with a comprehensive instruction manual and all the necessary tools. We''ve designed the assembly process to be so straightforward that you can have your exercise bike ready to ride in just 30 minutes.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1112d616-09cc-4e71-9c21-a0d1c4983327', '568926e2-f9ec-48b7-855d-df41dec58996', 'SPACE-SAVING - Our Indoor stationary bike is compact in size, covers only 5.9 square feet of space -- perfect for your home gym! Engineered for efficiency, it''s designed to fit seamlessly into any room without compromising on performance. Enjoy a full-body workout with minimal footprint. Get ready to pedal your way to health!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5791ba87-e463-4b9d-90ec-6f989da2fa52', 'ef594196-9dd1-47c6-a9e7-345c7d1ae499', 'YOSUDA light commercial exercise bike L-007C');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f34da6c3-547d-4fa1-b266-3af13e9e47b2', 'ef594196-9dd1-47c6-a9e7-345c7d1ae499', 'Smart exercise bike with bluetooth: take your fitness to the next level with sports apps support. With real-time recording of exercise data and exercise courses, you can stay motivated and achieve your fitness goals like never before');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('79ca41c7-607f-4909-9eea-d23b9c6e0e8c', 'ef594196-9dd1-47c6-a9e7-345c7d1ae499', 'Hyper quiet magnetic system: the latest technology magnetic system controls the sound at 20 dB even after millions of workouts. No disturbances in working, reading, or sleeping at home');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f84e9c81-50cb-449e-81da-a2ca85d579f0', 'ef594196-9dd1-47c6-a9e7-345c7d1ae499', '350 lbs capacity: unique curved stabilizers greatly enhanced bearing capacity, it suport users up to 350 lbs. Heavy steel pipe makes this stationary bike a rock solid build. It’s for a long-term workout, but not simple product for only a few months');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('491b474f-d52c-4263-b5a0-ea7744476c2c', 'ef594196-9dd1-47c6-a9e7-345c7d1ae499', '40 lbs flywheel with 100 micro-adjustable resistance: 40 lbs flywheel inspires your potential, no matter you’re beginner or fanatic. 100 micro-adjustable magnetic resistance levels, easy to customize exercise routine like burning calories, lose weight');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('abd489e0-afd2-4b45-84c5-0b5bd77cc787', 'ef594196-9dd1-47c6-a9e7-345c7d1ae499', 'Super large screen monitor and tablet holder: the easy-to-read large screen monitor clearly displays RPM, time, speed, distance in miles, calories, and odometer. The tablet holder allows you watch movie when cycling');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('84c7ac8b-af84-47d6-8aaa-4e085413e44c', 'ef594196-9dd1-47c6-a9e7-345c7d1ae499', 'Personalized fit: this cycle bike is easy to adjust handlebar and seat to fit users with different heights (inseam height 25-36 in) . The toe-caged pedals are designed with adjustable straps, fit for different size feet well');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e4327cda-2acf-488f-a015-d0081606b21c', 'd6ee8a57-87a6-4faf-a0b6-1981392798a6', '【Why was X2PRO born?】- JOROTO has been serviced for over 30 million families worldwide in three decades, we always put customers'' experience as first priority, and X2PRO Bluetooth exercise bike with magnetic resistance and belt drive are designed and improved based on the customer’s suggestion for JOROTO X2. This stationary bikes for home can fulfill the different cycling exercise demands from beginner to enthusiast.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4d191813-9c5c-4235-a39b-6709a4deb428', 'd6ee8a57-87a6-4faf-a0b6-1981392798a6', '【Full Readable Digital monitor】- The digital monitor of this magnetic stationary bike is self-developed, it not only shows the TIME, SPEED, DISTANCE, CALORIES but also shows LOAD ( magnetic resistance levels from 1% to 100%), WATT, RPM( cadence). What’s more, it has a Bluetooth function, allowing users to connect to the APP to do cycling classes.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ba574867-38cc-4a23-a412-1fd76224ff51', 'd6ee8a57-87a6-4faf-a0b6-1981392798a6', '【Unique Updated Designs】- ① Unique 12.6” enlarged tablet bracket, it can support objects from mini to big such as mobile, books, tablets, and laptops; ② Unique resistance and urgent stop system, 5 stronger magnets to create magnetic resistance and extra leather brake pad to make urgent stop safer, and won’t affect the magnetic resistance in the normal cycling workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('172fa764-a6ec-4961-bca7-b90f40082e9f', 'd6ee8a57-87a6-4faf-a0b6-1981392798a6', '【Sturdy, Stable, and Safe】- The AV type frame, 35lbs chromed flywheel, 50mm thickened frame tube and updated 300lbs max user weight give this indoor bike a rock solid build. With 4 horizontal adjustment knobs under the front and rear stabilizer to keep the bike stable on different surfaces, X2PRO fitness exercise bikes will provide you a safer riding.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('47165ff0-3800-4d51-b090-aaa8d30838fa', 'd6ee8a57-87a6-4faf-a0b6-1981392798a6', '【Fully Adjustable for Whole Family】- The wide seat and handlebar are both 4-way adjustable to fit all the family members with different heights (Suitable inseam: Max 36.2" -Min 27.5"). The steel toe-caged pedals are designed with adjustable straps, they can fit different sizes of feet well. There is also a convenient adjustable knob, with a simple twist, you can adjust the resistance to fulfill different workout plans.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e86379fd-1c56-4329-a0b3-c2a6cd9e0ecf', 'd6ee8a57-87a6-4faf-a0b6-1981392798a6', '【30 DAYS EXTENDED KINOMAP SUBSCRIPTION】Joroto has developed a deep cooperation with Kinomap - One of the Top Training Apps on market! Joroto offers an Extended 30 Days Kinomap Subscription for Joroto trainers, with the 14-day trial period you will be able to use all functions and join all courses in Kinomap for 44 days in total with no cost! Contact Joroto after purchase to get the Kinomap activation code!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7ce9f42d-9951-4d2b-b098-a315dd7eecc0', 'd6ee8a57-87a6-4faf-a0b6-1981392798a6', '【Buy JOROTO with Confidence】- This X2PRO indoor cycling bike''s shipping weight is 102 lbs, itself weighs 92 lbs while its flywheel weighs 35 lbs, which is much heavier than other brands. For all JOROTO bikes, the measurement and capacity are the actual results, NOT a mendacious number! The package included installation tools. The brand-new bike has 1-year without any costs replacement parts! Customer support team response within 24 hours! Satisfied solution if any issue!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('38d569b4-cd6e-4195-983b-157e41d9518b', '21df6445-9dc3-4e8f-ad80-a6e462dcb9e9', '16-LEVEL MAGNETIC RESISTANCE SYSTEM: Our exercise bike allows for 16 levels of resistance adjustment and 20 dB silent ride. That''s because it utilizes a non-friction magnetic resistance system that takes advantage of silent and smooth resistance adjustments.Multiple levels of resistance to meet the workout needs of beginners to professionals. and he low decibel ride keeps you from disturbing others.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5994e996-b2ca-45b9-84f9-2fa0ae0d7522', '21df6445-9dc3-4e8f-ad80-a6e462dcb9e9', '70% PRE-ASSEMBLED & SAVING 30% TIME: The portable bike you get is almost 70% assembled.You only need to install the mainframe, handlebars, monitor, pedals, seat and bike feet as well as very few screws. The entire process takes less than an hour. Clear instructions and videos make assembly effortless for anyone. With clear, comprehensive instruction and an accompanying installation video, you''ll have your bike set up in no time, regardless of your technical proficiency.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4e463864-e223-402f-b98a-50c11f8dff62', '21df6445-9dc3-4e8f-ad80-a6e462dcb9e9', 'SCIENTIFIC STRUCTURE 260LBS CAPACITY: The max weight capacity of this exercise bike is 260 lbs. It uses high quality steel and is designed with a double golden triangle frame that is stronger and more stable than other bikes.Our exercise bike for seniors is also equipped with an ergonomic and highly resilient cushion, so your butt won''t hurt no matter what kind of body type you are, even if you ride for a long time!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c42609c2-31ea-4864-8855-2140b154efd7', '21df6445-9dc3-4e8f-ad80-a6e462dcb9e9', 'ADJUSTABLE AND SUITABLE FOR 4''11''''-6''6'''': This indoor exercise bike has 5 level adjustable seat height.It is suitable for a height range of 4''11''''-6''6''''. This is perfect for home that have different body types.They can all share the use of the exercise bike. And the front and back support tubes can be fine-tuned in 6 levels, which can perfectly deal with uneven floors.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b8a49fac-101d-4cb4-880e-725b6434565b', '21df6445-9dc3-4e8f-ad80-a6e462dcb9e9', 'WHAT YOU GET: X-Bike 816 White, Product manuals, A small packet of installation tools, Our 12-month commitment of carefree protection, friendly customer service and telephone message service.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d0b61f58-cc7f-41cc-aa73-a73299afbced', '21df6445-9dc3-4e8f-ad80-a6e462dcb9e9', 'REAL-TIME FITNESS DATA: The stationary bike can record your fitness data including pulse rate, calorie, time, distance, speed. These data will be displayed on LCD screen. And the work out data can auto start and auto close, As long as you start to ride immediately automatically record the exercise data, and it will turn off automatically after you stop using it for a few minutes.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5768ce18-b0e9-43d1-bf77-7aeae8a4129d', '99be1610-b3f1-492f-82bb-8b3fa64ab3d5', 'Buy with Confidence: With 20 years of experience in designing and producing exercise machines, serving over 3 million families, this recumbent bike is your reliable fitness partner');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ae30a566-b395-40c0-a911-cfc5c3296567', 'a5be83e1-db11-4c5b-bfe0-3059f85593b9', 'ADJUSTABLE & DURABLE – Extendable rod can be adjusted to fit inside of doorframes between 24”-39”; Holds up to 220 pounds');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0dac6eb8-0cd2-44cd-b826-dd3cffd9459b', '99be1610-b3f1-492f-82bb-8b3fa64ab3d5', 'Safe, Low-Stress Workouts: Protect your joints with the YOSUDA recumbent bike, designed with rehab professionals for seniors, the obese, pregnant, and those with knee or waist injuries');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1bb4a241-2874-4e27-904f-51a0371e1db6', '99be1610-b3f1-492f-82bb-8b3fa64ab3d5', 'Quick and Easy Adjustments: Adjust the seat position and height effortlessly during your workout—no need to stop or get up. Just flick the handle by your side. The infinitely adjustable seat and backrest ensure comfort for users up to 6''5"');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6c2cf510-a17a-4e92-a291-cb16cc3672b4', '99be1610-b3f1-492f-82bb-8b3fa64ab3d5', 'Full-Body Workout: Target both upper and lower body muscles by using the detachable resistance bands and foot pedals simultaneously');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8bbf6a36-c76d-458d-bb0c-05af29999ca1', '99be1610-b3f1-492f-82bb-8b3fa64ab3d5', 'Silent Exercise Anytime: The YOSUDA recumbent bike offers a quiet workout, perfect for watching TV or reading without disturbing others');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('46c26cbd-42e7-40f3-a71f-85eac87ce797', '99be1610-b3f1-492f-82bb-8b3fa64ab3d5', 'Smart Data Interaction: The LED monitor tracks your workout data, while the tablet holder adds fun. Connect to sports apps for an immersive experience with online coaching');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c18e6016-6e78-4165-831a-50539dfbaf56', '99be1610-b3f1-492f-82bb-8b3fa64ab3d5', 'Easy Assembly: Most parts come pre-installed, and clear instructions with video make setup easy. Effortless to move after assembly');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9e5a9996-ad36-4c8c-8780-736746e0df2c', '99be1610-b3f1-492f-82bb-8b3fa64ab3d5', 'Premium Fitness Companion: Built with a sturdy frame of light commercial-grade steel for durability, stability, and safety, supporting up to 350 lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ec69f9d0-8c9b-4072-b62a-732d62748cbd', '99be1610-b3f1-492f-82bb-8b3fa64ab3d5', '16 Levels of Resistance: With 16 resistance levels providing up to 60 lbs, this bike suits beginners to pros. Select your level for optimal workout efficiency');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('23e607dc-709f-4101-b134-07ef368d70f3', '99be1610-b3f1-492f-82bb-8b3fa64ab3d5', 'Comfort and Consistency: A thoughtfully designed padded seat and backrest provide comfort for your hips, back, and spine, making workouts enjoyable and helping you stay consistent');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d1f299c9-3ff7-40de-babf-c72a200b5f3e', '0a778c2a-77e2-45da-882a-7485b87c6ab1', '5-IN-1 MULTI-FUNCTIONAL EXERCISE BIKE: With just a simple height adjustment, you can transition between three unique riding positions: Upright-Competitive for an intense cardio workout, Semi-Recumbent for a more relaxed ride, and Upright-Standard for the classic cycling experience. But that''s not all. This bike also boasts dual hand pull cords for effective arm stretches and dual leg pull cords for strengthening your lower body.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8d2ec3cf-4559-4b9c-b92e-ed10a97af5fa', '0a778c2a-77e2-45da-882a-7485b87c6ab1', '16-LEVEL MAGNETIC RESISTANCE SYSTEM: Elevate your workout with our bike''s 16-level magnetic resistance system! Featuring four high-grade magnets and a 5.5-pound aluminum-rimmed flywheel, the indoor bike offers incredibly smooth resistance adjustments that are whisper-quiet during use. Whether you''re a beginner or a seasoned athlete, you''ll find the perfect challenge to push your limits.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('289e724f-8069-4817-b55f-e45601eada2d', '0a778c2a-77e2-45da-882a-7485b87c6ab1', 'ULTRA-QUIET 20dB RIDING: At home, silence is gold during workouts. Our bike features a high-quality flywheel & braided elastic band for minimal friction noise, ensuring a peaceful ride (<20dB)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e57f0c9f-f1e2-4fcb-a181-6c7cbc6f3f87', '0a778c2a-77e2-45da-882a-7485b87c6ab1', 'PRE-ASSEMBLED 70% & SAVING 30% INSTALLATION TIME: The portable exercise bike you get is almost 70% assembled.You only need to install the mainframe, handlebars, monitor, pedals, seat and bike feet as well as very few screws. The entire process takes less than an hour. Clear instructions and videos make assembly effortless for anyone. It enables you to enjoy a riding experience faster.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('33d51bd9-9a93-4216-b362-9ca0297fb404', '0a778c2a-77e2-45da-882a-7485b87c6ab1', 'IMPORTANT DETAILS: (1) This workout bike is suitable for riders ranging from 4''11" to 6''6" tall, accommodating a max weight of 300 pounds. (2) The cycling bike folds completely for compact storage, and comes with wheels for seamless transportation. (3) Boasting an LCD display, the folding bike keeps track of key stats like time, speed, and calories burned. Plus, it includes a handy phone holder for entertainment while you work out.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e47def81-5f12-42c9-a638-b94c9a1e7e82', '0a778c2a-77e2-45da-882a-7485b87c6ab1', 'What You Get: X-Bike 817, Product manuals, A small packet of installation tools, Our 12-month commitment of carefree protection, friendly customer service and telephone message service.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('33494c8a-6581-4f79-8438-cebfbae74872', 'fa7e745e-57be-4da0-9929-aae55fece408', '16-LEVEL MAGNETIC RESISTANCE FOR ULTIMATE WORKOUT CONTROL: Take your workout to the next level with our bike''s 16-level magnetic resistance system! Equipped with four high-grade magnets and a 6.6-pound aluminum-rimmed flywheel, this indoor bike provides seamless and whisper-quiet resistance adjustments. Whether you''re just starting out or a seasoned athlete, you can easily find the ideal challenge to push your limits.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('401bebf6-b2fa-49ee-bece-0da15651cacd', 'fa7e745e-57be-4da0-9929-aae55fece408', 'PRE-ASSEMBLED 70% & SAVING 30% INSTALLATION TIME: The portable exercise bike you get is almost 70% assembled.You only need to install the mainframe, handlebars, monitor, pedals, seat and bike feet as well as very few screws. The entire process takes less than an hour. Clear instructions and videos make assembly effortless for anyone. It enables you to enjoy a riding experience faster.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('af9bcfd0-ea76-41d2-b606-957ccf378f53', 'fa7e745e-57be-4da0-9929-aae55fece408', '20dB NEAR-SILENT RIDING: For indoor home workouts, low noise is key. Our exercise bike uses a high-quality flywheel to reduce friction, and a braided rope for the elastic band further cuts down noise. Result: ultra-quiet operation (<20DB).');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8f7629c6-8730-4dc6-9613-3eafd4385f73', 'fa7e745e-57be-4da0-9929-aae55fece408', 'SAVE SPACE & MOVE EASILY: The portable bike is easily adjustable, allowing for quick folding and upright. Its design enables easy storage in a small area, making it an ideal choice for small apartments or offices. The foldable bike comes with rollers on the front feet, facilitating effortless movement. Whether you''re aiming to save space or seeking a portable exercise option, this workout bike for home gym is the ideal solution.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('66162bfd-b6fb-4972-9c4c-0eb6cd71b95c', 'fa7e745e-57be-4da0-9929-aae55fece408', 'KEY FEATURES: (1) Our workout bike is designed to accommodate riders from 4''11" to 6''6" in height, with a maximum weight capacity of 300 pounds. (2) The foldable design allows for compact storage, and built-in wheels ensure easy transportation. (3) Equipped with an LCD display, this bike tracks essential metrics such as time, speed, and calories burned. Additionally, it features a convenient phone holder for entertainment during workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b98c4220-68b1-451a-bdcd-66dae0bc913e', 'fa7e745e-57be-4da0-9929-aae55fece408', 'INCLUDED IN YOUR PURCHASE: X-Bike 817, Product manuals, A small packet of installation tools, Our 12-month commitment of carefree protection, friendly customer service and telephone message service.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4de7adce-04ab-4e57-9bd1-097660f0624b', '60410de9-fdca-4735-ad97-c9a95fdf163f', '🥰【BLUETOOTH CONNECTIVITY】Step into the immersive world of virtual cycling with exercise bike, seamlessly compatible with Kinomap and Zwift. Transform your home into a dynamic cycling arena.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f9e50a8a-4062-4149-b915-275739d8643c', '60410de9-fdca-4735-ad97-c9a95fdf163f', '🥰【STABILITY REDEFINED】Crafted with reinforced Carbon Steel frame tubes, the indoor cycling bike boasts a solid build that conquers the instability issues common in many stationary bikes. Experience a ride without any wobbling or creaking, whether you''re cycling seated or standing.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4eeb1f61-3a16-4f12-8917-923f2f894223', '60410de9-fdca-4735-ad97-c9a95fdf163f', '🥰【MAGNETIC MAGIC】Revolutionize your workout with magnetic resistance. Through the ingenious use of magnets, our bike ensures a silent and smooth operation. The flywheel dances effortlessly, whispering through your workout. Paired with a belt drive, the bike guarantees minimal maintenance.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2b841fc1-e9e0-47f3-b454-eef282d25427', '60410de9-fdca-4735-ad97-c9a95fdf163f', '🥰【SMART METRICS】The Digital Monitor not only tracks your exercise metrics in real-time — time, speed, distance, calories, and pulse — but also allows on-the-fly adjustments to your workout plan. The sleek design includes a red lever that indicates resistance levels, ensuring a personalized and efficient workout. Enhance your experience further with the convenient phone/tablet holder for entertainment during your exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4569a4e5-f32a-4fbe-b7ba-1fc4aa72fcb3', '60410de9-fdca-4735-ad97-c9a95fdf163f', '🥰【FULL-COVERAGE DESIGN】Experience elegance with our flawless, fully-covered shell. Our advanced bonding technique eliminates gaps or seams, providing a sleek look. The hidden console wire and flywheel create a minimalist aesthetic. Unlike traditional metal flywheels, our impact-resistant plastic cover ensures durability, protecting against cracks and damage.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('20c83c93-d478-4a4a-bc40-d47d3a27c081', '60410de9-fdca-4735-ad97-c9a95fdf163f', '🥰【CUSTOMIZED WORKOUTS】Tailor your workout to your preferences. Adjust the handle and seat height to accommodate users of different sizes. The toe-caged pedals, complete with adjustable straps, cater to various foot sizes. Make exercise a family affair with yoyomax, where everyone can join in and stay fit.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6c7b28ae-161e-422f-b057-27fe6639f95e', '93d4d362-c866-458f-bf50-de5362546d85', '[Sturdy Indoor Stationary Bike]:Flywheel And Heavy-Duty Steel Frame Of The Exercise Bike Guarantee The Stability While Cycling; The Drive System Provides A Smoother And Quieter Ride Experience;It Won''T Disturb Your Family Members');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a26f760b-69cc-4e8a-b8bc-fa67b6addcc3', '93d4d362-c866-458f-bf50-de5362546d85', 'Sturdy Indoor Stationary Bike:Flywheel And Heavy-Duty Steel Frame Of The Exercise Bike Guarantee The Stability While Cycling; The Drive System Provides A Smoother And Quieter Ride Experience;It Won''T Disturb Your Family Members');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1d47e769-6d1b-4d44-a7ad-1c8d9fee2f2b', '93d4d362-c866-458f-bf50-de5362546d85', 'Brake And Resistance:Simply Turn The Knob To Increase Or Decrease The Adjustment To The Different Levels That Best Suit You; Push The Same Knob To Stop Quickly And Safely; Convenient Operation Makes The Movement More Simple And Efficient');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7b747f05-e01b-4eb5-8281-830c365a57c6', '93d4d362-c866-458f-bf50-de5362546d85', 'LCD Monitor & Ipad Holder:Multi-Function Digital Display Can Track Your Exercise Time, Speed, Calories Burned, Distance And So On;Help You Understand Your Exercise Progress And Adjust Your Exercise Plan;The Tablet Phone Bracket Easily Holds Mobile Devices,To Enjoy Exercising And Entertainment Simultaneously');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fb879a21-ec44-442c-af66-7ffccfdc35a2', '7933c63c-7723-4f82-9973-bc264cf63085', '5-IN-1 EXERCISE BIKE: Have 5 fitness modes: upright and semi-recumbent. Not only burn fat quickly, strengthen leg muscles, but also reduce waist injuries, the alternating mode can exercise more Core muscles. Arm resistance bands assist in stretching');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c0df6317-cfbc-4178-b87c-4b322bc7a9cc', '7933c63c-7723-4f82-9973-bc264cf63085', '16 MAGNETIC RESISTANCE: use a silent magnetic flywheel to ensure a noise-free home exercise experience. Can simulate more exercise scenarios and caloric consumption, making it easy to set the burning process from warm-up to intensive riding to relaxation');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d0571e16-03b8-401c-9ab7-0d47853583cf', '7933c63c-7723-4f82-9973-bc264cf63085', 'STABILITY AND COMFORT: Sturdy heavy-duty steel frame and stable triangular structure ensure safety during high-intensity workouts(300 lbs MAX). Also ergonomic seat design - large contoured seat with back cushion and padded multi-grip handle');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('965bb084-6e96-41a4-8490-9a8f606e22d0', '7933c63c-7723-4f82-9973-bc264cf63085', 'LCD DISPLAY AND HOLDER: tracks your fitness performance during your ride, including time, speed, distance, calories burned and heart rate. Placing your Pad on the holder allows you to watch exercise tutorials, helping you exercise scientifically');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b170daaf-c10c-4e51-be72-8622b61b5c67', '7933c63c-7723-4f82-9973-bc264cf63085', 'EASY TO INSTALL AND STORE: Folding design and pre-assembled in place, just assemble the large parts. The base is equipped with transport wheels, so even girls can easily store and move it freely');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('dd7d1039-176f-45e1-9be4-31f1c87df3a7', '7933c63c-7723-4f82-9973-bc264cf63085', 'GREAT VALUE GIFT: great choice for home, family and friends. The indoor exercise bike brings the ultimate fitness experience, is magnetically silent, easy to install and easy to fold and store. You will not regret your choice');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6e7c3463-dde5-4f70-9df4-8b1afe7f2812', 'ee506273-c865-4e38-b7f9-f6df1bd248ed', 'Multiple Mode Exercise Bike: Experience versatility with our exercise bike featuring 3 modes: Upright, Semi-recumbent, and Recumbent. And, the stationary bike also comes with resistance bands, allowing you to strengthen your arm muscles.The recumbent exercise bike''s stable triangle structure supports trainers weighing up to 265 lbs, easy assembly. The comprehensive design and functionality of this stationary bikes for home make it a versatile fitness tool, suitable for various workout goals and strengthening different parts of the body');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bd69db3a-b868-4be3-af65-4a37d00cbc0e', 'ee506273-c865-4e38-b7f9-f6df1bd248ed', 'LCD Monitor with Heart Rate Sensor: The exercise bike make you stay informed with the large-screen monitor displaying time, count, distance, speed, calories, and pulse accurately. The stationary bikes for home monitors your heart rate conveniently with the built-in Hand Pulse Sensors. Plus, enjoy comfortable support with the multi-grip handlebars of the recumbent exercise bike. This exercise bike also comes with a device holder, allowing you to easily place your phone, tablet, or other devices, so you can enjoy your favorite music, videos, or other entertainment content while exercising');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c97560b2-b24d-47b6-bd01-a0f55f291bec', 'ee506273-c865-4e38-b7f9-f6df1bd248ed', 'Designed for All Sizes: Exercise bike is meticulously crafted to accommodate a diverse range of heights, catering to individuals measuring from 4''9" to 6''1". The stationary bike’s adjustable large seat cushion ensures optimal posture and alignment, which are indispensable for achieving a successful and comfortable workout experience. The adjustable features of the recumbent exercise bike also make it convenient for every member of the family to use, catering to each person''s fitness needs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f35b78ea-d80f-4f62-8189-cb2158fcbc53', 'ee506273-c865-4e38-b7f9-f6df1bd248ed', 'Advanced Resistance Bands: The exercise bikes for home could maximize your workout potential with the included resistance bands offering 5-30 lbs resistance. The foam handle-equipped bands in the front of the exercise bike provide a comfortable grip. Additionally, hand resistance bands of stationary bike the target different muscle groups for a comprehensive exercise routine');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('50a61e99-88ed-4160-bcfd-3c1e1e3e3167', 'ee506273-c865-4e38-b7f9-f6df1bd248ed', 'Super Quiet: Enjoy a peaceful workout session thanks to the upgraded magnetic resistance of the stationary bikes for home, keeping the exercise bike exceptionally quiet.The exercise bikes for home comes with 10 levels of gear adjustment, you can ride freely. The heavy-duty steel frame of stationary bike, combined with an X-type design based on physical balance theory, promotes stability, supporting up to 265 lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e4e501ba-1e0c-4a66-af5b-e6ce3bb93292', '93af5f70-f690-492a-ab1c-fb60d4752e6f', 'Twenty Sealed Ball Bearings throughout the frame and pivot points to provide a smooth and durable feel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1fb2c8e9-aa8c-4d0f-bed1-d58327a8f92a', '93af5f70-f690-492a-ab1c-fb60d4752e6f', 'Unlimited Resistance for upper and lower body extremities based on Air Resistance; Get a complete Cross-Fit Workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('35921230-5870-46c8-b05b-fd6d7b960b61', '93af5f70-f690-492a-ab1c-fb60d4752e6f', 'Computer features motivational programs providing many programs (Tabata, Intervals, Watts, Heart Rate) to accomplish your fitness goals');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2794a0b6-c2e8-4ccd-b9db-94a3309b6d31', '93af5f70-f690-492a-ab1c-fb60d4752e6f', 'Maximum user weight: 350 pounds . Twenty Five inch diameter steel fan delivers maximum resistance, with six way adjustable seat fore and aft, up and down and tilt. Square-tapered design');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1dc768cc-5c61-48e8-b815-59f2c7e0cba3', 'a5be83e1-db11-4c5b-bfe0-3059f85593b9', 'COMFORT GRIPS – 2 cushioned foam grips are more comfortable for hands and mini-mizes slipping and fatigue');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('dcc67e3b-8367-423a-83fd-3db50ad3e44a', '8787c844-a8ed-413a-8ad1-479daf7e822e', '🎄【Enhanced Comfort with Customizable Seating】 Our recumbent exercise bike is designed to maximize comfort with a high-density cushioned seat and backrest. The easy-to-use seat adjustment lever allows you to quickly and effortlessly find your ideal seating position, ensuring a comfortable and supportive workout experience for users of all heights.Designed with a high-density cushioned seat and ergonomic backrest, it provides maximum support for seniors and adults alike.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bd803da7-deff-4a1f-a1e5-278072705e46', '8787c844-a8ed-413a-8ad1-479daf7e822e', '🔇【Silent and Sturdy Construction for Lasting Stability】 Built with high-quality commercial-grade steel, our recumbent stationary bike offers exceptional durability, supporting users up to 400 lbs. Its solid construction ensures a stable workout environment for all fitness levels. Featuring advanced magnetic resistance technology, this recumbent bikes perfect for seniors and adults to exercise at home without disturbing family holiday festivities.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4dcac832-c60f-46b7-853e-4e8956f861d2', '8787c844-a8ed-413a-8ad1-479daf7e822e', '🎁 【Effortless Setup and Portability】 Designed for convenience, our recumbent bike with up to 85% of the pre-assembled, ensuring that setup is quick and hassle-free—usually taking just about 30 minutes. Additionally, the integrated front wheels allow you to easily move the stationary bike from one room to another, making it a perfect fit for any home gym setup.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e1b98fc1-c4eb-4f44-aa2e-b9974425f04e', '8787c844-a8ed-413a-8ad1-479daf7e822e', '🎄【Versatile Resistance Levels for Optimal Efficiency】 Offering 16 levels of resistance, our recumbent exercise bike provides a wide range of workout intensities, making it suitable for beginners and professionals alike. Whether you''re warming up, running body-building exercises, or engaging in fat-burning workouts, you can easily adjust the resistance to match your fitness level. It''s an excellent option for anyone looking for versatile stationary exercise bikes for home use, ensuring you achieve your fitness goals efficiently.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d6bb651b-215c-4d67-aa2c-5d7cfd2605ee', '8787c844-a8ed-413a-8ad1-479daf7e822e', '📊【Advanced LCD Display with Heart Rate Monitoring】 Exercise bike for home with comprehensive LCD screen provides real-time tracking of essential workout data, including time, speed, distance, calories, odometer readings, and heart rate. The built-in pulse sensors allow for precise heart rate monitoring, helping you optimize your exercise routine for better results.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('29648dd0-c725-4d41-a9aa-9adfc35dace6', '8787c844-a8ed-413a-8ad1-479daf7e822e', '🎄【XVGVSVC Assurance and Ongoing Support】 We are dedicated to ensuring your satisfaction with our recumbent stationary bikes. We back our product with a 12-month parts replacement guarantee and offer responsive 24-hour customer service, giving you confidence in your purchase and ongoing support throughout your fitness journey.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('27afda39-d236-4d0e-a37b-ba558ecca6d5', '8787c844-a8ed-413a-8ad1-479daf7e822e', '🎅 【The Perfect Christmas Gift for All Ages】Looking for the perfect Christmas gift? Our recumbent exercise bike is an excellent choice for seniors and family members of all ages. With its adjustable seat, 16 resistance levels, and low-impact workout design, it''s ideal for improving fitness and promoting healthy living. Whether for a parent, grandparent, or loved one, this bike provides a comfortable, customizable workout for every family member to enjoy');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4d2e1ead-610a-4ec4-9d09-6ee247c6278b', '4fd7a395-cafe-40c5-8b4e-185cfa755d9d', '✅【BOOST YOUR IMMUNE SYSTEM】An ideal exercise bike for seniors/women/men to help safeguard your health and stay in shape when working/entertaining at home. You can workout while watching TV, recreational web surfing, or listening to music');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7ad1348d-efcf-4ae8-a084-2c78d482710a', '4fd7a395-cafe-40c5-8b4e-185cfa755d9d', '✅【3-IN-1 Fitness Bicycle】Part exercise bike, movable chair, and standing desk. This creative 3-in-1 stationary bike has a large enough desk to accommodate a laptop, notebook, and mobile phone, and is suitable for everyone in the family（5’1”- 6’2”）');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('841088b5-f26d-48d4-bc1f-ddd8e5e2eccc', '4fd7a395-cafe-40c5-8b4e-185cfa755d9d', '✅【Adjustable Resistance】Tailor your experience with 8-speed resistance settings. Our exercise bicycle adapts to your fitness level and goals, enabling quiet pedaling and promoting blood flow and muscle engagement all day');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('af7ea610-ca9a-4ebd-99e8-fc599d67610d', '4fd7a395-cafe-40c5-8b4e-185cfa755d9d', '✅【LCD Exercise Tracker】Monitor your workout stats on the built-in LCD. Keep tabs on real-time data such as time, speed, distance, calories burned, total distance covered, and rotation speed.ATTENTION: the battery is not included');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4a92b4e9-0cb1-4223-afa7-867e63ba9a42', '4fd7a395-cafe-40c5-8b4e-185cfa755d9d', '✅【Durable Material】Crafted from premium materials, our desk bike offers comfort and robust support. Our products have been thoroughly tested and specifically certified by TUV SUD. Hold up to 350lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b6513a51-28ce-4e4d-a3b0-02f2760e93f0', 'd3a75c4a-c25e-41c5-bf87-9e2eb8cd7e21', '【Low Impact Exercise Companion】The under-desk pedal exerciser provides a low-impact workout, perfect for burning calories, and toning muscles, without putting strain on your joints. Reviewed by over 10000+ satisfied customers.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1ea016fb-9532-4dbc-ab0b-36d04876e797', 'd3a75c4a-c25e-41c5-bf87-9e2eb8cd7e21', '【Smooth & Silent Operation】 This mini elliptical, featuring a belt drive mechanism with magnetic resistance, ensures a quiet, smooth, and maintenance-free workout experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('637c1ce1-774b-451c-ac78-775bde06518f', 'd3a75c4a-c25e-41c5-bf87-9e2eb8cd7e21', '【Versatile Compact Design】 Engineered with an innovative pedal motion trajectory, this slim elliptical trainer tucks easily under most desks, ensuring a comfortable fit and smooth movement without the risk of knee contact. Its versatile build allows you to integrate exercise effortlessly into your daily life, whether at home or in the office.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('38bd5ebf-07f6-417c-a0e8-32468b8705e2', 'd3a75c4a-c25e-41c5-bf87-9e2eb8cd7e21', '【Comprehensive Digital Monitor】 Stay updated with your workout progress via our centrally located digital monitor. It offers real-time data on time, speed, calories, and distance.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2ff8a4d6-43da-4a35-bc32-2fd93d2b6b82', 'd3a75c4a-c25e-41c5-bf87-9e2eb8cd7e21', '【Customizable Magnetic Resistance】 With 8 levels of adjustable magnetic resistance, customize your workout to match your fitness level, enhancing muscular endurance over time.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('da691ded-c6b6-441c-aa21-59ac1193d108', 'd3a75c4a-c25e-41c5-bf87-9e2eb8cd7e21', '【Fully Assembled】 Our under-desk elliptical arrives fully assembled, letting you kick-start your fitness journey right out of the box.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9bb01baf-ce76-4047-96d4-79fccba6d978', 'd3a75c4a-c25e-41c5-bf87-9e2eb8cd7e21', '【Easy to Store & Transport】 Lightweight and compact, this elliptical is easy to store under desks or tables. Its integrated handgrip ensures effortless transportation.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d25535a9-effe-4eb9-9623-fad7cd75622d', 'd3a75c4a-c25e-41c5-bf87-9e2eb8cd7e21', '【Reliable Quality】 Trust in the durability, reliability, and efficiency of our under-desk elliptical, a product of Sunny Health & Fitness, with over 20 years of industry experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d792f19e-7013-4ede-b0b6-cabc5fa487ed', '4906c004-8be7-4604-a1a9-373c9a6fbe95', '【40 LB FLYWHEEL】The 40 LB chrome flywheel is engineered to provide exceptional stability and riding momentum, ensuring challenging workouts that engage your muscles and promote a smoother, more effective exercise experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ede840ec-518f-455b-acb2-26613bb9aeda', '4906c004-8be7-4604-a1a9-373c9a6fbe95', '【FREE CONNECTED APP】 Enjoy FREE access to the SunnyFit App with every Sunny Health & Fitness product—no membership fees! Dive into 1,000+ trainer-led workouts, explore 10,000+ virtual scenic tours, track your progress, challenge others, and much more!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8bea0e04-2385-4548-b068-1d90e6266537', '4906c004-8be7-4604-a1a9-373c9a6fbe95', '【QUIET OPERATION】The belt-drive mechanism offers a virtually maintenance-free solution. Its whisper-quiet operation allows you to exercise without disturbing others, creating a peaceful and uninterrupted workout environment.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('256d637c-7655-4140-90bd-244642b5b83e', '4906c004-8be7-4604-a1a9-373c9a6fbe95', '【STEPLESS RESISTANCE & SAFETY】Effortlessly adjust your workout intensity with the micro adjustable resistance knob. The dual felt pad resistance system allows seamless adjustments, and for quick stops, simply push down the resistance knob.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('45ec98a8-6e36-4e71-b936-5c4bc03c0efb', '4906c004-8be7-4604-a1a9-373c9a6fbe95', '【PERSONALIZED COMFORT】Easily adjust multi-grip handlebars and a two-way seat to match your riding style and leg inseam length (adjustable inseam height: Max. 41 in / Min. 29 in), ensuring a comfortable and customized cycling experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f9748fe1-c202-42c0-9958-9c2d8670efd7', '4906c004-8be7-4604-a1a9-373c9a6fbe95', '【ROBUST & STABLE】The heavy-duty steel frame provides a solid foundation, allowing you to confidently engage in any cycle-based workout. With a weight capacity of up to 275 LB, this frame ensures stability and durability.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0c2e95ca-a2df-4946-90d1-1bcff943a111', '4906c004-8be7-4604-a1a9-373c9a6fbe95', '【PERFORMANCE DIGITAL MONITOR】The LCD digital monitor tracks essential workout metrics, including time, speed, distance, calories burned, odometer readings, pulse rate, and RPM (revolutions per minute).');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('14b3f5cf-f550-4e7f-ba98-deeb029d81af', '4906c004-8be7-4604-a1a9-373c9a6fbe95', '【ULTIMATE CONVENIENCE】Stay entertained with a device holder, stay hydrated with a bottle holder, and seamlessly switch to strength training with a dumbbell holder—all within easy reach, enhancing your workout experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8437d701-3b96-4c2b-bfa8-e00d625f49c6', '4906c004-8be7-4604-a1a9-373c9a6fbe95', '【EFFORTLESS SETUP & MOBILITY】The bike offers easy assembly, allowing you to start your workouts quickly. With the transportation wheels, you can effortlessly move and store the bike as needed, making it a practical and versatile fitness solution.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c3838acd-2bd7-42f8-ac27-c6f4f9ce7268', '4906c004-8be7-4604-a1a9-373c9a6fbe95', '【Sunny Health & Fitness Commitment】A top fitness brand for 20+ years, offers superior products and a dedication to excellence. Count on our committed customer service and enjoy peace of mind with a 1-year warranty on the structural frame.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8230cc7d-6348-4a99-9dbd-df39e926aae0', 'a60983a2-229d-4326-bffb-84f5789d2ab0', 'Extra Cushion Ventilated Saddle: Experience unparalleled comfort with our wide, padded sport seat designed for optimal support. The extra cushioning and ventilated zones ensure airflow, reducing sweat buildup and keeping you cool during intense workouts. Dual rubber pillars enhance shock absorption for a smoother ride.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('81031b82-dca0-4b27-9f39-7d05aaacb112', 'a60983a2-229d-4326-bffb-84f5789d2ab0', 'Larger Tablet & Bottle Holder: Stay entertained and hydrated with dual cup holders on the handlebars, fitting bottles up to 3.2 inches in diameter. The extra-wide tablet mount holds devices up to 12.9", keeping your essentials within reach.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0adbabbf-cf9e-4aca-ae86-2757a451013c', 'a60983a2-229d-4326-bffb-84f5789d2ab0', 'Durability & Stability: Built with high-carbon steel and a triangular structure, this exercise bike offers superior durability and stability, supporting up to 300 lbs. The micro-adjustable tension system, ranging from 0 to 100 levels, allows for a customized workout experience, while the belt-driven system ensures a smooth and quiet ride.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f9329797-4dfe-413d-b7e1-2d9b397b17e6', 'a60983a2-229d-4326-bffb-84f5789d2ab0', 'Adjustable Seat, Post & Handlebar: Perfect for riders of nearly any size (4''8” to 6''5”), the CURSOR FITNESS stationary bike features a 4-way adjustable seat with 7 vertical settings (7.9”) and multiple horizontal levels (4.4”). The handlebar offers 5 vertical adjustment levels (4.8”), making it suitable for the whole family.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6917a50f-9654-4af4-aadb-1001171e38aa', 'a60983a2-229d-4326-bffb-84f5789d2ab0', '10-Minute Daily Fat Burn: Achieve your fitness goals with just 10 minutes of daily exercise. The built-in LCD monitor tracks key metrics like Time, Speed, Calories, Heart Rate, and Distance in real-time, ensuring an efficient and effective workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e158e1a0-5ad2-4673-82f3-4bd83b8ced39', 'a60983a2-229d-4326-bffb-84f5789d2ab0', 'CursorCare Service: Enjoy peace of mind with a 5-year warranty on the frame structure and a 1-year warranty on parts. Our Los Angeles-based CursorCare service team provides 24/7 support to guarantee 100% satisfaction, ensuring a worry-free shopping and usage experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('43941f0d-af63-41de-8705-af65ffaf1a29', '5352d462-5ce2-4e14-b722-7a5336d1f4b9', 'Single-stage belt drive keeps it running quietly');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f391ec0b-a365-4b44-b884-6d668cf37d7f', '5352d462-5ce2-4e14-b722-7a5336d1f4b9', 'Progressive wind resistance system offers infinite levels of challenge');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c2852ec2-70c7-447b-89da-4eea679c031b', '5352d462-5ce2-4e14-b722-7a5336d1f4b9', 'RevMeter RPM gage for interval training');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a33e9b55-bb52-459a-8a21-d4545fa6831e', '5352d462-5ce2-4e14-b722-7a5336d1f4b9', 'Self-balancing foot pedals with foot straps');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('162b9a27-1416-4405-b980-e66ea2d783e3', '5352d462-5ce2-4e14-b722-7a5336d1f4b9', 'Quiet, frictionless fan that keeps you cool');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('51235e81-8f44-4593-80a3-585f8127a0c9', '5352d462-5ce2-4e14-b722-7a5336d1f4b9', 'Sport type: Exercise & Fitness');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fb3b4f76-4df7-4fe5-9eec-46d8b37475af', 'd48ad0f8-1b92-4e96-ac3b-a08cc52a02b0', 'HARISON Magnetic Dual Belt Driven System: HARISON recumbent exercise bike features the advanced US Mate Magnetic System, delivering 16 levels of adjustable, ultra-smooth magnetic resistance. Effortlessly customize your workout with the tension knob, from a relaxed ride to a high-intensity challenge. With a dual driven belt system to provide you a smooth workout experience. Enjoy a whisper-quiet, maintenance-free experience, so you can stay fully focused on reaching your fitness goals without distractions.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b203d3be-2376-4680-82e4-f42501151132', 'd48ad0f8-1b92-4e96-ac3b-a08cc52a02b0', 'Premium Recumbent Bike with 400 lbs Capacity: Built with a durable stainless steel frame, this exercise bike offers an ergonomic design for maximum comfort and precise performance. Its convenient step-through structure allows for easy access, making it suitable for users of all fitness levels. Crafted from corrosion- and oxidation-resistant materials, it ensures long-lasting durability. With a sturdy construction that can support up to 400 lbs, this recumbent bike is ideal for anyone looking to enhance their workout experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7edd0d79-c809-4519-b0c0-bea73dd958be', 'd48ad0f8-1b92-4e96-ac3b-a08cc52a02b0', 'Easy Installation: With the 90% pre-assembled design, this HARISON indoor recumbent bike could be fully assembled in 20 minutes with the user guide and the assembly video provided by HARISON. Our professional customer service team will promptly reply your questions within 24 hours if you need any assistance!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('73bec0cc-ec22-4c02-ab68-eafd1af15d51', 'd48ad0f8-1b92-4e96-ac3b-a08cc52a02b0', 'Recumbent Bike for Adults with 2-in-l LCD Monitor &Tablet Holder: The HARISON recumbent bike features a multifunctional LCD display that provides real-time tracking of time, speed, distance, calories, RPM, odometer, and heart rate. For added convenience, it includes a 2-in-1 tablet holder and a water bottle holder, allowing you to enjoy entertainment or stay hydrated while you ride. Designed for seniors, adults, and the entire family, this bike makes cardio workouts fun and easily accessible for everyone.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('234a4c4a-9a89-4d5a-a41b-fcacbd6b2d9f', 'd48ad0f8-1b92-4e96-ac3b-a08cc52a02b0', 'Fully Adjustable Recumbent Bike: This HARISON exercise bike is equipped with a spacious, adjustable seat (11.4" x 15.7") designed for ultimate home comfort. Padded with high-density foam, the seat and backrest provide essential support for your hips and back, encouraging proper posture while maximizing comfort. Its sliding seat rail system easily adjusts to fit users from 4''8" to 6''4", ensuring a comfortable leg position for effective workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('16cae453-667d-4718-9cc6-6fa6735fc649', 'd48ad0f8-1b92-4e96-ac3b-a08cc52a02b0', 'Magnetic Recumbent Exercise Bike for Seniors: The HARISON recumbent bike is built for convenience, featuring transport wheels and a lifting handle for effortless mobility, making it especially suitable for seniors. Its sturdy steel construction ensures outstanding stability and safety, giving you confidence with every workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('026d372f-a3af-4118-8d5b-8fecc16dc910', 'a5be83e1-db11-4c5b-bfe0-3059f85593b9', 'UPPER BODY TRAINING – Perfect for at home-workouts to build upper body muscles, great for programs like P90X');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c57bae37-ee16-4877-89f7-457de2e5f479', 'd48ad0f8-1b92-4e96-ac3b-a08cc52a02b0', 'Recumbent Bike for Home Gym: The HARISON recumbent bike provides a comfortable, reclined seating position, making it perfect for seniors, those with joint issues, or individuals recovering from injuries. It helps lower the risk of heart disease and improves cardiovascular endurance. Additionally, it targets and strengthens key lower body muscle groups while supporting weight loss, making it an outstanding fitness solution for the whole family.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6e427ced-084f-4070-bb48-86c69fc37738', 'd48ad0f8-1b92-4e96-ac3b-a08cc52a02b0', '30-Day No-Cost Trial & 1-Year Warranty: HARISON recumbent exercise bike includes a 30-day no-cost trial and a 1-year warranty for your peace of mind. We are dedicated to providing high-performance premium features in our product, ensuring exceptional value for your investment. Our experienced team is dedicated to providing evidence of our commitment every day!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('69098768-7783-4dba-b970-092ea1f42234', '6da67838-0f71-4fce-a8b9-b36851cc1199', '【 8-Level Car-Style Adjustment Resistance System 】 Your Workout, Your Way - With just a simple shift of the lever. Whether you''re a seasoned pro or just starting out, our magnetic recumbent bike offers a versatile range of options to help you achieve your fitness goals.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5ee3d72a-0435-4702-aa7e-e7af862bb71a', '6da67838-0f71-4fce-a8b9-b36851cc1199', '【 Ergonomic Thicker Seat & Backrest 】 Tailored Comfort - Choose from 8 positions to easily adapt the seat to your specific needs and inseam length. Featuring a breathable mesh backrest and a thicker seat, enjoy cool and comfortable sessions, regardless of the intensity.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8cdba8d7-5eb7-48d3-b546-b37386dab5a7', '6da67838-0f71-4fce-a8b9-b36851cc1199', '【 Silent Dual-Belt Drive System 】 Smooth, Silent Operation - Featuring a high-speed, high-inertia design and a 6.6lb perimeter-weighted flywheel. Whether you''re in a shared space or aiming to be considerate to neighbors, our recumbent stationary bike is the ideal choice for noise-free, family-friendly exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3ddc7fec-86d5-4232-9526-2ec8394b08e9', '6da67838-0f71-4fce-a8b9-b36851cc1199', '【 LCD Display 】 Your Ultimate Workout Companion - Stay informed and motivated with our display showing key metrics like time, distance, speed, calories burned, and heart rate. The included iPad holder lets you stream shows or access the MERACH app during your ride, enhancing your workout experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('724b3fce-6a6d-471a-8a2c-ec4cb9c9b695', '6da67838-0f71-4fce-a8b9-b36851cc1199', '【 Free MERACH APP 】 Your Ultimate Fitness Companion - Designed by professional fitness trainers, our app offers a wide range of courses and training modes to help you achieve your fitness goals. With live metrics and progress tracking, you can monitor your performance in real-time and stay motivated every step of the way.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f33f3fb5-57b3-4de3-9888-98a9ad11b6ab', '6da67838-0f71-4fce-a8b9-b36851cc1199', '【 Heart Rate Tracking 】 Maximize Your Workout - Tailored for tracking your heart rate during workouts, our monitor ensures optimal performance in every session. By staying within your target heart rate zone, you can enhance the efficiency of your exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('77bf1de7-ad83-4607-b097-541469bad203', '6da67838-0f71-4fce-a8b9-b36851cc1199', '【 Frosted Handlebar 】 Standing out from the plastic handles in the market, our frosted handlebars not only keep sweat at bay during workouts but also provide a secure, non-slip grip. Our recumbent exercise bike is constructed from durable materials, these handlebars offer a blend of comfort, safety, and long-lasting quality.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('20f2d71f-93f6-4984-b5c5-bc0c2adf790d', '6da67838-0f71-4fce-a8b9-b36851cc1199', '【 Hassle-Free Assembly 】 Say goodbye to complicated assembly instructions and hello to easy setup with MERACH! Our magnetic recumbent bike for seniors is 80% pre-assembled. With an installation video included, even the most technologically challenged users can have it assembled within 30 minutes.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a50a11dc-7a49-4b55-9913-88fcf1951768', '6da67838-0f71-4fce-a8b9-b36851cc1199', '【 Recumbent Bike Dimensions 】 48.03L x 23.62W x 46.46H in | Product Weight: 57.32 Pounds | Weight Capacity: 330 Pounds | Inseam Length: 28.35-35.43 in | Flywheel Weight: 6.6 Pounds.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('195a0d5f-1a6e-4220-8c63-ad6bf3ca80dd', '6da67838-0f71-4fce-a8b9-b36851cc1199', '【 Customer Service 】 We''ve Got Your Back. At MERACH, we uphold the quality of our products and are dedicated to delivering outstanding customer service. When you invest in one of our recumbent exercise bikes, you benefit from a one-year "manufacturer''s warranty" for added assurance. In the rare event of any issues, just contact our friendly customer service team for swift assistance. We''re here to assist you every step of the way!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('82c3cd3b-ef7c-4d6a-9326-baae5b90e58e', '9fe59d86-32e8-46b9-8bc6-b47b7e9b7a53', 'DISCOVER DMASUN: DMASUN is a professional sports brand that seamlessly integrates the design, production, sales, and service of sports products. With over 30 years of experience, our products are widely distributed across the United States, Canada, Japan, Britain, Germany, and other countries. We have successfully delivered fitness products to more than 2 million households. This is a brand you can trust.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7676c360-9c34-449e-aabf-155c8234a16e', '9fe59d86-32e8-46b9-8bc6-b47b7e9b7a53', 'HOW CAN WE ENHANCE STABILITY AND SECURITY? The DMASUN exercise bike is equipped with a 40 LB fully filled solid flywheel and alloy steel that is thicker than other products (over 2 mm thick), ensuring a sturdy construction for a smooth ride. Users who weigh more than 350 LB can also use it with confidence. The products have been tested for anti-fall before leaving the factory, so they are of higher quality and more secure.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a92a2184-c869-40bf-bd4a-d4173ed6f902', '9fe59d86-32e8-46b9-8bc6-b47b7e9b7a53', 'JUST HOW QUIET AND SMOOTH ARE DMASUN EXERCISE BIKES? After testing, the sound produced by our stationary bikes does not exceed 20 dbs, providing an almost silent advantage that will bring you an immersive exercise experience without worrying about disturbing those around you. The rugged ABS pulley ensures smooth belt transmission and years of riding without belt breakage and wear.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('68e4fc66-6f1a-456c-9e2f-e5b5328efab7', '9fe59d86-32e8-46b9-8bc6-b47b7e9b7a53', 'RESISTANCE LEVELS VARY FROM EASY TO DIFFICULT: This workout bike features updated magnetic resistance, no squeaking of wool felt pads and no maintenance, and offers a wider adjustable range of resistance, with levels ranging from 0-20% for warm up, 20%-50% for running, 50%-80% for fat burning, 80%-100% for muscle strengthening. This 0-100% variation in resistance aligns with the daily exercise programs of individuals at different stages.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('199c49a6-bd1c-4b00-8c1a-6ea7ff050274', '9fe59d86-32e8-46b9-8bc6-b47b7e9b7a53', 'APP TAILORED TRAINING PLANS: DMASUN''s new upgraded version of the indoor bike can be connected to the APP via Bluetooth with Kinomap and Zwift for virtual training, racing, and challenges. Making it easy for you to track your progress with real-time metrics such as distance, time, calories, average BPM, and more. Provide the best experience for cycling enthusiasts (Attention: without LCD display).');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('df40c18d-d1ea-4b9b-b97b-cef9cedd54cd', '9fe59d86-32e8-46b9-8bc6-b47b7e9b7a53', 'EFFORTLESS AND USER-FRIENDLY BIKE: The DMASUN sports bike is equipped with an electronic device stand, water bottle holder, non-slip caged pedals, transport wheels, and level adjustment knobs. It features four-way seat adjustment and two-way handlebar adjustment to accommodate users ranging from 4.8 ft to 6.3 ft in height. DMASUN This exercise bike uses a unique round steel stability tube with four non-slip foot covers, which has obvious advantages in terms of stability.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9c67281f-9a6d-41e8-a379-026e9c3a514d', '9fe59d86-32e8-46b9-8bc6-b47b7e9b7a53', 'INSTALLATION IN 30 MINUTES: To ensure our customers can quickly start using our bikes, 70% of the installation has been pre-completed. Watch the installation video, and the remaining components can be easily installed within 30 minutes. You will only need to install the handlebar, seat, front and rear stability tubes, and pedals; The frame, flywheel, and crank are all pre-assembled.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7bcf89c2-5056-4ab2-ae5e-c2bcb80aea09', '9fe59d86-32e8-46b9-8bc6-b47b7e9b7a53', 'WE CHERISH EVERY CUSTOMER: We provide 12 months warranty. We constantly collect questions raised by customers and continue to optimize, if you have any questions, please contact us, and the factory engineer video provides professional guidance. Double guarantee of quality and service. Your inquiries will be addressed within 18 hours.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a5fe702f-3427-436a-9858-25e99646a5ea', '734b7333-9fbe-4803-9a73-3df80d37c3ac', 'Free Personalized AI Courses: Our exercise bike leverages advanced AI algorithms to generate tailored training programs based on your selected simulation scenarios. The AI intelligently adjusts resistance levels and body posture to replicate authentic uphill and downhill cycling experiences, ensuring you consistently train at your optimal level for more effective and enjoyable workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4bfb5c2f-037f-4768-9c16-68df3416a52c', '734b7333-9fbe-4803-9a73-3df80d37c3ac', 'Immersive Fitness Experience: Transform your home into a cycling adventure with scenic riding courses that replicate real-world landscapes. Experience iconic virtual settings such as highways, lakeside paths, and mountain roads, bringing the thrill of outdoor cycling indoors. This immersive environment keeps you engaged and motivated throughout your training sessions.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4d6851aa-306a-45ce-a356-a68b4cec21ec', '734b7333-9fbe-4803-9a73-3df80d37c3ac', 'Diverse Training Programs: Designed to accommodate all fitness levels and goals, our exercise bike offers a comprehensive range of training options. From endurance-building workouts to explosive power sessions and simulated hill climbs, each program is meticulously crafted to challenge and enhance your fitness. Whether your aim is to boost stamina, build strength, or conquer virtual elevations, there''s a customized workout ready to elevate your performance.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e462c46b-e4ed-411d-9e68-72390a5527a6', '734b7333-9fbe-4803-9a73-3df80d37c3ac', 'Flexible Resistance Options: Tailor your workout intensity with 36 levels of resistance for a personalized cycling experience. The bike features advanced magnetic resistance for smooth and silent adjustments, alongside AI-driven automatic resistance that dynamically responds during uphill or downhill simulations. For those who prefer manual control, options are available to ensure effective and efficient training.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f205fc9d-ecb4-4c8f-a8cd-86b073716e11', '734b7333-9fbe-4803-9a73-3df80d37c3ac', 'Ergonomic Comfort for Endurance: Prioritizing comfort and performance, the bike features a generously cushioned saddle designed for long rides. With adjustable handlebars and saddle positions, it ensures an optimal fit for riders of all sizes. This thoughtfully designed exercise machine combines comfort with challenge, making every ride a seamless and enjoyable experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('39d99afe-1206-446a-9863-cfc31c5d08fe', '2e342d12-685b-4274-b750-582a8b023dbf', 'EXERCISE BIKE AND WORKSTATION - Our Stamina Wirk Ride Exercise Bike is a compact exercise bike that provides an effective, efficient seated cardio exercise. Even while working, reading, or watching TV, make cardio easy with our stationary bike.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7580ad00-b56e-4f44-95ad-7aece7e9c9ad', '2e342d12-685b-4274-b750-582a8b023dbf', 'WORKING STATION - This workout bike has a wide cushioned seat with a backrest to effectively provide support and comfort. This stationary bike also has a height-adjustable desk prop for a tablet or book, a laptop strap, and a built-in cupholder.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('294e300c-c1dc-4967-a360-f7e2be09337a', '2e342d12-685b-4274-b750-582a8b023dbf', 'ULTRA QUIET MAGNETIC TENSION - This fitness bike offers adjustable, ultra-quiet magnetic pedaling tension to work your muscles and elevate your heart rate. The textured pedals with straps keep your feet in place while pedaling.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fca306fc-65b9-47a6-8961-1d8c8feac5cf', '2e342d12-685b-4274-b750-582a8b023dbf', 'SPACE SAVING DESIGN - This durable, foldable stationary bike is designed with built-in wheels for easy storage and is ideal for users with limited space. Our fitness bike provides high-quality cardiovascular workouts in the comfort of your home.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('aefba511-9295-4d93-ac41-0580957378cf', '2e342d12-685b-4274-b750-582a8b023dbf', 'SMART WORKOUT APP - Experience connected fitness with this home gym equipment with the müüv app. With smart guided coaching, exercise demo videos, personalized workouts, assembly videos, and more, müüv provides the best workout and fitness experience with your Stamina Bike.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b4600694-ddd7-4fba-92a6-413a70d4afac', 'ebb87626-9fbd-45e0-baf0-f214ed88ee17', 'PREMIUM STEEL CONSTRUCTION – This exceptional gym equipment features a premium steel frame. The sturdy steel tubing and molded ABS is reinforced with a powder-coated finish to ensure lasting durability');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b98dbdbf-2942-4575-9a70-70796a7d5c62', 'ebb87626-9fbd-45e0-baf0-f214ed88ee17', 'CUSTOMIZABLE CYCLING WORKOUT – Designed for all fitness enthusiasts, our bike comes with a manual magnetic resistance mechanism with 8 preset levels that simulate the effect of biking in different terrains, allowing you to personalize your training');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a820bf2e-b1c2-42c3-8c9e-bbd0914cf6c9', 'ebb87626-9fbd-45e0-baf0-f214ed88ee17', 'ADJUSTABLE SEAT HEIGHT – Designed to provide ample space for the legs, this exercise bike is built with an adjustable seat that accommodates each individual users’ leg lengths. Its quick release knob lock allows for rapid adjustment of the seat');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e297b977-f9b9-4585-b11f-75b9392b757e', 'ebb87626-9fbd-45e0-baf0-f214ed88ee17', 'EASY–TO-READ PROGRESS INDICATOR – This compact cardio bike comes with a functional LCD screen that lets you monitor distance traveled and current speed, while keeping track of time elapsed and calories burned');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9342d8f0-65d3-404f-9f02-a39d547ae377', 'ebb87626-9fbd-45e0-baf0-f214ed88ee17', 'COMFORTABLE PADDED HANDLES- Equipped with contoured handles with high-density foam, this innovative cycle ensures secure and comfortable gripping while simultaneously providing maximized support for the upper body');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('abb969c2-211b-4cba-ab23-24d1bbf57a19', 'f798ec56-b843-4bfe-8f6b-a97a14a8b4e6', 'FOLDING & SPACE SAVING DESIGN: Our Ativafit folding exercise bike allows you to easily store it in a compact space. With 7 adjustable seat height options, you can easily find the perfect position for optimal comfort. The recommanded Height is 5.8''''. The smooth-rolling wheels allow you to move the bike around your home.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fb5ca067-4ab2-4284-8043-441eb07b17ae', 'f798ec56-b843-4bfe-8f6b-a97a14a8b4e6', 'MAGNETIC DRIVEN: The Ativafit folding exercise bike for home has 8 adjustable magnetic resistance levels, which provides more challenging or less strenuous cardio training. Magnetic workout bike is often quieter than other types of resistance. This makes it ideal for use in shared living spaces like office or apartments where noise can be a concern.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b5a9d5a4-8e59-48b9-a15a-28c9d7534392', 'f798ec56-b843-4bfe-8f6b-a97a14a8b4e6', 'STUDRY FRAME: Crafted from a robust alloy steel material, our indoor foldable exercise bike has a sturdy frame which is stable and durable. The weight capacity is 265LBS.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c0b6ed9c-daa2-4f4e-8ff9-e620fb016cfa', 'f798ec56-b843-4bfe-8f6b-a97a14a8b4e6', 'LCD DISPLAY: Our indoor cycling bike for exercise features a wide display screen that is easy to read and shows all relevant workout information. Stay motivated and track your progress with the integrated LCD display which provides real-time feedback on essential workout metrics such as time, speed, calories and pulse, empowering you to monitor your performance');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2859b21a-7591-42b8-8fd7-f89c5e843cf9', 'f798ec56-b843-4bfe-8f6b-a97a14a8b4e6', 'IDEAL FOR YOU: It is a great choice for home, family, friends.Experience the pinnacle of convenience, efficiency, and performance with our folding exercise bike. Embark on your fitness journey today and elevate your workout routine to new heights.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('97a0630e-5e14-4bfd-af43-b030105a9a73', '49b13efa-d937-4b65-9cb3-46bfc9029b5b', '【About Yesoul】 Yesoul exercise bikes are trusted by over 1,000,000 households, known for their reliability and quality. Join the Yesoul community to see why our stationary bikes are the perfect fitness companion to help you achieve your goals.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d9d283c9-73ab-4fb8-842f-91248799e68a', 'a5be83e1-db11-4c5b-bfe0-3059f85593b9', 'MULTIPURPOSE – A convenient way to improve fitness with pull-ups, chin-ups, triceps dips, leg raises; can also be used as a foot anchor for crunches');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('43d6b512-b91d-4b3f-8725-71d219b1d01d', '49b13efa-d937-4b65-9cb3-46bfc9029b5b', '【Upgraded LED Display】 Compared to traditional displays, the LED screen provides clearer visuals, allowing you to track your workout time, speed, and distance in real-time. This helps you stay informed and adjust your workout plan for optimal results.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2def7a5b-f030-4fee-9009-73f1bba201e6', '49b13efa-d937-4b65-9cb3-46bfc9029b5b', '【Innovative Design】 Each bike is equipped with two resistance bands, which are unique to Yesoul bikes. The A1T bike not only supports aerobic training but also strength training, offering a variety of workout options.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2eaf316c-15f7-4225-ba78-3db4b540f5cc', '49b13efa-d937-4b65-9cb3-46bfc9029b5b', '【Smart App Connectivity】 Through Bluetooth, you can connect to the Yesoul-developed app, YESOULfitness, as well as other platforms like Zwift and Kinomap for training. The data-driven results enhance your workout effectiveness and make exercising more enjoyable.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9bc726c2-f495-408b-a3d6-748e7c301ce2', '49b13efa-d937-4b65-9cb3-46bfc9029b5b', '【Multi-Directional Adjustment】 The handlebars can be adjusted up and down, while the seat can be adjusted forward, backward, and vertically, accommodating users from 4''2" to 6''4" in height. This makes it suitable for all family members.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d69d748f-ee23-4665-a416-2a8290affad8', '49b13efa-d937-4b65-9cb3-46bfc9029b5b', '【High Weight Capacity】 With a maximum weight capacity of up to 300 lbs, the bike is designed for use by all family members.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cd837e86-71a8-4501-bf52-d0972a6d1d6f', '49b13efa-d937-4b65-9cb3-46bfc9029b5b', '【Worry-Free Purchase】 Enjoy 12 months of free parts replacement. This bike comes 80% pre-assembled and includes a tool kit, so it can be assembled in just 20 minutes. The Yesoul after-sales team provides technical support and ensures satisfaction with 12 months of free parts replacement. If you have any questions, feel free to contact us. Thank you for choosing us!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0f2d482c-da70-4f78-b87f-e998d1381ba0', '57cbe5a3-fc90-436b-b49e-eb7b83b54f57', 'Quiet and Smooth Belt Drive: Our indoor bike is equipped with a silent belt drive that generates noise levels below 25decibels, ensuring a smooth and quiet ride even at high speeds. It allows you to use the bike at home without disturbing others'' work, reading, or sleep.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('05214b9f-c5c0-43e1-9517-66cafc78261b', '92591678-70a2-493d-bed8-7512e118fdb9', '【Fully adjustable】The handles,overall height, the length of the base, all with an adjustable design. let you work arms and legs for safe, low-impact exercise all from the comfort of your chair or sofa.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cdcf1a64-82d3-4290-bd3a-56b1446e86a6', '92591678-70a2-493d-bed8-7512e118fdb9', '【Thoughtful design】Handles and soles have comfortball massage,exercise tired to massage the sole of the foot to relax.Stable triangular structure and 4 disc bases make exercise bike more stable');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d1a50eee-b3bf-4fc0-b06b-227d2894fedf', '92591678-70a2-493d-bed8-7512e118fdb9', '【Special gloves】In order to help stroke patients and muscle weakness patients, we have 2 special gloves to help them recover faster and better.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bf4da66e-6ff2-4822-a6d2-501c3308abf3', '92591678-70a2-493d-bed8-7512e118fdb9', '【Lightweight and Sturdy】The weight of the exercise bike is only 13lbs，can be moved and used in every part of the house.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d2951b76-7ba5-4d2d-b697-83333a28c8da', '92591678-70a2-493d-bed8-7512e118fdb9', '【Multiple Application】Suitable for sports enthusiasts who like indoor fitness and some patients who with cerebral palsy, stroke,hemiplegia, amputation, spinal cord injury, upper and lower limb dysfunction, convenient for limb exercise training to achieve fitness rehabilitation effect');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bbd4e4e3-cfbf-4ccb-a877-b78477088716', '0570decd-15db-45e5-86e2-d61006d0cfaf', '【Adjustable Recumbent Bike】Vanswe recumbent exercise bike with infinite slider seat adjustment which keeps your legs at a comfortable length for your height, better than other bikes with several fixed seat positions. Recommended inseam height from 29 inch to 37 inch and loads up to 380 lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('72bc2330-4af3-4f90-8b55-73d425788ca5', '0570decd-15db-45e5-86e2-d61006d0cfaf', '【16 Levels Magnetic Resistance】Vanswe stationary bike featured a 16-level magnetic tension control system with 10 neodymium magnets which supplies greater and more uniform resistance and longer life. The cooperation of the external magnetic flywheel, dual-belt system and needle roller bearing brings you smoother and quieter workout experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ee0c55d5-0a40-4dff-9710-b967624c9af7', '0570decd-15db-45e5-86e2-d61006d0cfaf', '【Digital LED Monitor】Vanswe exercise bike is fitted with an LED monitor with backlight which is really bright and clear to read the numbers.The monitor records your heart rate, speed, distance travelled, time spent, and calories burnt, all data is double-calibrated by strict algorithms, allowing you to understand your exercise effects, formulate a more reliable exercise plan, and accomplish your exercise goals. Additionally, the iPad holder makes it ideal to view movies or watch TV while riding');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9ab47e37-cba8-4d39-9aa2-cf87a98e9ad8', '0570decd-15db-45e5-86e2-d61006d0cfaf', '【Comfortable Padded Cushion】Vanswe recumbent stationary bike puts less strain on your joints and easy to balance on and sit comfortably. The thick and plush seat cushion (13 inch D x 16.5 inch W) and backrest provides added comfort while also ensuring proper posture throughout a lengthy workout or physical therapy session');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('838b18fa-23d6-4c87-b4da-d49f9b80839e', '0570decd-15db-45e5-86e2-d61006d0cfaf', '【Stable and Easy to Move】The main frame was meticulously designed to ensure the stability of the bike and two transportation wheels makes it really easy to move around your house');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3fcd8ac0-3287-45fa-a694-595a6b243a66', '0570decd-15db-45e5-86e2-d61006d0cfaf', '【Free App-Fitness Data】Vanswe workout bike also features Bluetooth Smart Technology which is compatible with iOS and Android systems. Free Fitness Data app is available to help recording your workout data. It also compatible with Kinomap and Zwift which will bring you more wonderful workout experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c8c03c36-edc3-43ee-8c8b-760dc52bd2ba', '0570decd-15db-45e5-86e2-d61006d0cfaf', '【Customer Service】Vanswe will provide customer service for every customer who purchases a Vanswe recumbent exercise bike. We have a professional after-sales team to resolve any problems for you, will respond to your message within 24 hours');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cc6a3d5c-f2c7-463d-8754-8b1af3ad578e', '94d16f1a-494f-445c-8351-e1d7b5f8ce4f', 'Improve upper and lower body mobility with this Sitting Elliptical Machine');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8188ce99-9dd0-4d11-9b17-4f94b16d4bda', '94d16f1a-494f-445c-8351-e1d7b5f8ce4f', 'Effortlessly Improve your Movement with the Chair Based Exercise Guide for under desk bike and exercise equipment');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b6995486-034d-4ee1-a857-684d6829f522', '94d16f1a-494f-445c-8351-e1d7b5f8ce4f', 'Tone muscles and boost circulation with the Eclipse Exercise Machine as seen on TV');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('60fe2cfa-56fa-41df-ad91-4b928a5d122d', '94d16f1a-494f-445c-8351-e1d7b5f8ce4f', 'Enjoy our 100% satisfaction guarantee with this Elliptical Machine for home use');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('74186dbd-5f42-4753-be97-b36875d6df7c', '8a0b591d-94c6-438a-9541-66e73b122c13', 'COMPACT CARDIO FITNESS BIKE - The Stamina Wonder Exercise Bike is a compact exercise bike that provides effective, efficient cardio and muscle-toning workout. Even while reading or watching TV, make cardio easy with our stationary bike.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('62033ff5-0843-49fb-9668-e3f7209075b2', '8a0b591d-94c6-438a-9541-66e73b122c13', 'BIKE WITH ARM WORKOUT - This fitness bike comes with powerful, strength training Wonder Arms with elastic bands that add upper-body resistance workout. The adjustable-angle arms allow multiple exercises that target your back, chest, shoulders, and core.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bef542ab-3239-4fc9-8cd9-8b084ecc1a12', '8a0b591d-94c6-438a-9541-66e73b122c13', 'DYNAMIC RESISTANCE LEVELS - This foldable workout bike has an easy-to-reach tension dial for adjustable levels of magnetic resistance. Tone your whole body with magnetic cycling resistance and bungee cord strength resistance.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fddb94a8-3171-44b3-a6af-88ba9bb8a372', '8a0b591d-94c6-438a-9541-66e73b122c13', 'ENHANCED COMFORT - This home exercise bike includes textured pedals, padded hand grips, ergonomic handlebars, and a cushioned seat and backrest. The Wonder foldable exercise bike has a folding frame and built-in wheels for easy storage.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f9d3771d-ca8b-4dbe-a602-ed6b7b8350e1', '23a6479a-9855-448f-a591-9c603c83c854', 'Nylon');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2c89fc3c-ed65-420b-a0ce-210aa92efc27', '8a0b591d-94c6-438a-9541-66e73b122c13', 'SMART WORKOUT APP - Experience connected fitness with this home gym equipment and the müüv app. With smart guided coaching, exercise demo videos, personalized workouts, assembly videos, and more, müüv provides the best workout and fitness experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cc39de8d-9e6e-48c9-b08a-38bf1cfe4716', 'f4d8a694-bdad-445a-bd8d-96eb796d23b3', '【TWO-STAGE TRANSMISSION SYSTEM】This innovative exercise bike deviates from traditional spinning models by incorporating a two-stage movement transmission system, offering enhanced realism, optimized muscle engagement.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0ea29faf-a687-481a-a376-ea9072ce7699', 'f4d8a694-bdad-445a-bd8d-96eb796d23b3', '【SILENT AND SMOOTH OPERATION】This cycling bike features magnetic resistance and a quiet belt ride, ensuring a silent and smooth ride but also the added benefit of 7 levels of resistance. Users can adjust the resistance to customize their workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c2ce3b01-076e-4681-bbea-b37423b3cc5e', 'f4d8a694-bdad-445a-bd8d-96eb796d23b3', '【FREE CONNECTED APP】 Enjoy FREE access to the SunnyFit App with every Sunny Health & Fitness product—no membership fees! Dive into 1,000+ trainer-led workouts, explore 10,000+ virtual scenic tours, track your progress, challenge others, and much more!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5c57f30c-7b1d-4a08-967d-986f465801d1', 'f4d8a694-bdad-445a-bd8d-96eb796d23b3', '【EMERGENCY BRAKE】The 7-level resistance lever can function as an emergency brake when fully depressed. This design enables swift adjustments and precise control over the flywheel, allowing users to instantly stop their workout in case of emergency.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2702d570-e41a-4411-ab6a-a917f49cba16', 'f4d8a694-bdad-445a-bd8d-96eb796d23b3', '【TRACK YOUR PROGRESS】The upright bike is equipped with a user-friendly LCD monitor displaying metrics, time, speed, distance, calories, pulse, and RPM. This tracking system provides real-time feedback, enabling users to monitor their progress.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b1038328-4b6e-4343-9fea-0006613b941a', 'f4d8a694-bdad-445a-bd8d-96eb796d23b3', '【CUSTOMIZED COMFORT】Featuring a 4-way adjustable seat and 2-way adjustable handlebars, this exercise bike offers comfort and adaptability. Users can personalize their riding experience by adjusting the seat and handlebars, ensuring the perfect fit.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fa6f44f2-e963-43bd-8106-a1fa8beccf8b', 'f4d8a694-bdad-445a-bd8d-96eb796d23b3', '【CONVENIENT ALL-IN-ONE DESIGN】This exercise bike offers ultimate convenience with its built-in device holder for entertainment, a water bottle holder for hydration, and a dedicated space for dumbbells, allowing users to stay connected.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a6a3986f-e10a-4eb5-9dda-40b2fc0caccc', 'f4d8a694-bdad-445a-bd8d-96eb796d23b3', '【INTEGRATED PULSE SENSORS】It features integrated pulse sensors that provide real-time heart rate data. You can optimize your workout intensity, ensuring a safe and effective cardiovascular session tailored to your fitness goals.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('88f84101-0191-4230-8023-4d8c9b5d65a2', 'f4d8a694-bdad-445a-bd8d-96eb796d23b3', '【STURDY AND EASY ASSEMBLE】This bike boasts a solid 265 LB weight capacity, making it suitable for a wide range of users. It is easy to assemble as well as the convenient transportation wheels, ensuring effortless setup and easy storage.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c01620a0-4642-4cb3-9389-060ef606d85e', 'f4d8a694-bdad-445a-bd8d-96eb796d23b3', '【Sunny Health & Fitness Commitment】A top fitness brand for 20+ years, offers superior products and a dedication to excellence. Count on our committed customer service and trainers for the best fitness experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('891febcd-f994-45e2-82c6-144afa480016', 'c4b52d21-0d26-4691-b52a-16797ca38311', 'HARISON Upgraded Magnetic Mute system: HARISON folding exercise bike HR-X3L is equipped with an upgraded megnetic mute system to provide you an ultra quiet and smooth riding. With 16 levels of resistance control, it meets the needs of various users, from beginners to advanced fitness enthusiasts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('01a4e1c0-f4a1-459b-ab84-96de5c7c11eb', 'c4b52d21-0d26-4691-b52a-16797ca38311', '4 in 1 Multifunction Foldable Exercise Bike: This innovative folding design provides riding modes such as relax riding,recumbent riding,upright riding,competitive riding.Featured with 6 levels of adjustable seat cushion to meet the demand of different users.The ideal cycling bike to explore diverse fitness options for a customized workout that targets every major muscle group in your body');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('929890dc-5ef7-455a-8cac-6f1b3754155d', 'c4b52d21-0d26-4691-b52a-16797ca38311', 'Exericse Bike with 2 in 1 LCD Monitor and Tablet Holder: The built-in LCD monitor of this stationary bike for home can track your real time exercise data such as time, speed, distance, calories burned and odometer. The tablet holder allows you to watch workout courses or entertainment videos while riding');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1bd984ce-76d1-43a7-aed0-27deeb0e3ed2', 'c4b52d21-0d26-4691-b52a-16797ca38311', 'Folding Stationary Bike with Transport Wheels: HARISON folding exercise bike can be fully fold up to 0.12 m³ to occupy minimal space for storage when not in use. It comes with transport wheels for you to relocate the bike easily during your home gym routine');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4b29bcb3-78d1-4c8d-b2d3-81d06e2d5c30', 'c4b52d21-0d26-4691-b52a-16797ca38311', 'Fully adjustable Upright Exercise Bike: Featured with 6 levels of adjustable seat cushion to meet the demand of different users, HARISON magnetic workout bike for home is suitable for whole family workout. The tablet holder allows you to watch workout courses or entertainment videos while riding! Transport wheels make it easy to relocate the bike effortlessly.It also equipped with a bottle holder, allows you to stay properly hydrated without interrupting your exercise routine');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7f91d967-8b7a-4adf-b758-08cb7b922d68', 'c4b52d21-0d26-4691-b52a-16797ca38311', 'Indoor Bike for Home with Bluetooth: HARISON stationary upright bike for home is compatible with a variety of fitness apps, which offer a wide range of workout courses, allowing you to customize your exercise plan and make your sessions more engaging and enjoyable');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3b8ed563-8bbf-4509-8abe-d9f4597f4ca2', 'c4b52d21-0d26-4691-b52a-16797ca38311', '30-Day No-cost Trial & 1-Year Warr-anty: HARISON fodable exercise bike HR-X3L comes with a 30 days no-cost trial and a 1-year warr-anty for your peace of mind. We are dedicated to delivering high-performance premium features in our product, ensuring an unmatched cost-performance. Our experienced team is committed to proving it every day');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f5be0b03-e136-416c-8e0c-904c447f85fe', '1144fb66-bdac-41b5-840c-01a41aac0a65', 'VERSATILE OLYMPIC BENCH – This training bench is great for a wide variety of full-body workouts. You can use it to develop both your upper and lower body, as the two-piece design allows for exercises that target both the arms and the legs.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7b805a52-ffac-440a-98fc-999874c6a935', '1144fb66-bdac-41b5-840c-01a41aac0a65', 'EXTRA COMFORT – This workout bench has padded vinyl foam seats and backrest pad for long-lasting comfort when lifting and sitting down. The rubber grips on the arm curl handle offer you added control, even when you sweat.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f113ea54-b513-40f8-a690-bcea9969dc4f', '1144fb66-bdac-41b5-840c-01a41aac0a65', 'ADJUSTABLE DESIGN – The Marcy Diamond Olympic Bench has an adjustable back pad and arm curl pad to accommodate incline, decline, and flat chest press exercises. You can also adjust the height of the barbell crutches for easier access.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6631ef29-ae3a-4816-8733-e5e9bbcd32d2', '1144fb66-bdac-41b5-840c-01a41aac0a65', 'SQUAT RACK – The separate squat rack can be used to perform walk-in squats and lunge exercises, giving you more flexibility in your training regimen.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('21f89c18-d1fd-46dd-ab34-cfeded0283ef', '1144fb66-bdac-41b5-840c-01a41aac0a65', 'TOUGH CONSTRUCTION – The bench has a powder-coated, 14-gauge tubular steel frame that is resistant against rust and water damage. It is compatible with mid- and Olympic-sized barbells and the safety locks keep you securely in place even performing reps');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('aea300ad-aa91-4bf1-99d3-18f308544da5', 'c46d27d5-0c92-43e3-8372-e0a97b8590d0', 'Nylon, Neoprene');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0b07d816-5dc0-4430-a7ed-357828f5a880', 'c46d27d5-0c92-43e3-8372-e0a97b8590d0', 'Imported');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('81815f87-b8e9-40b4-a79c-80d4199bd793', 'c46d27d5-0c92-43e3-8372-e0a97b8590d0', '✅ TONE and TIGHTEN LOWER BODY MUSCLES - Kickback ankle straps help you target calf, lower leg, lower body, and even glute muscles to help tone, strengthen, and tighten muscle groups to create a leaner, stronger body.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d6d687bd-4f8d-42dd-b4cb-a137a7a974e5', 'c46d27d5-0c92-43e3-8372-e0a97b8590d0', '✅ MULTIPURPOSE GYM EXERCISE ROUTINES - Gym ankle straps can be used with most standard cable systems, functional and resistance trainers, and similar equipment for leg extension, leg curls, hip abductors, and glute workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2a20b6de-0151-47a5-aa19-ff915b8f3d8a', 'c46d27d5-0c92-43e3-8372-e0a97b8590d0', '✅ STRONG, STABLE RESILIENCE - We use a sweat resistant, breathable neoprene ankle cuff that’s easier on your body, reinforced steel double D ring and double stitching to ensure long lasting equipment strength, and wide fastening comfort.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('34085123-e12c-4dac-af03-89e27b835674', 'c46d27d5-0c92-43e3-8372-e0a97b8590d0', '✅ CLASSIC COLORS and PATTERNS - These ankle straps for men and women also come in both singles or pairs as well as a variety of fun colors you’ll love including American pride, black, pink, red, magenta, grey camo, blue, and cyan.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ca7392f7-197b-4fd6-8d9f-8339ce8875a1', '14b98ee5-75e3-4196-a215-7aaa752d5757', 'EFFECTIVELY BUILD YOUR MUSCLES: Designed to help you execute proper sissy squats, this sissy squat machine is optimal for training abs, thighs, and glutes. An ideal equipment for building muscle, strength, balance, durability, and flexibility');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4a7bd36a-0532-4d59-b4ae-6a9977bf9468', '14b98ee5-75e3-4196-a215-7aaa752d5757', 'FOLDABLE AND ADJUSTABLE BENCH: Featuring an ergonomic design, this squat bench can be adjusted to fit different body shapes. It also has foldable and adjustable cushions and bench with adjusting foam foot holders for your convenience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ea3a8193-ac19-4b7e-9e6f-b14d06aba760', '14b98ee5-75e3-4196-a215-7aaa752d5757', 'NO ASSEMBLY NEEDED: This workout bench for squatting can be used immediately after unpacking as it does not require any further assembly. It is also easy to use, easy to store, and comfortable with its rear cushion for feet and legs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('03dca5b6-5689-4222-a537-07e3f415b907', '14b98ee5-75e3-4196-a215-7aaa752d5757', 'SAFE WITH HEAVY-DUTY CONSTRUCTION: With the frame made out of premium quality heavy-duty steel, this foldable squat bench ensures long lasting durability. It has a weight capacity of 440.9 lbs and a large non-slip footplate for your safety');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2a83b616-1950-4983-8ade-f2ee50c066be', '14b98ee5-75e3-4196-a215-7aaa752d5757', 'SPACE-SAVING DESIGN: Unlike other stationary fitness equipment, this bench for squatting only occupies minimal space for your workout station with dimensions of 41.7" x 20.5" x 25.2" -inches. An excellent choice of training equipment for small spaces');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5a29c9b5-ecd5-44ad-b922-6979c759ac1a', '238f0063-31c3-4763-bb91-9c715a2b6f5b', 'Benefits of Sissy Squat: Sissy squat is the best bodyweight exercise to train your abs, thighs and glutes. Sissy squats build muscle, strength, balance, durability and flexibility.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f6486413-6590-4743-b4e2-aca17001d370', '238f0063-31c3-4763-bb91-9c715a2b6f5b', 'Multi-function Home&Commercial Gym Station: This is the one home & Commercial gym workout station you can’t miss, extremely versatile, Deep sissy squat, band squat, hyper-extension (back extension), side extension, forward lunge, sit-up, push-up and even more.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('27d2ebb4-79ae-4e07-bc30-6f1385845f67', '238f0063-31c3-4763-bb91-9c715a2b6f5b', 'Premium Material for Quality: More than two decades in fitness business, we are veterans to build excellent equipment. Heavy duty steel main frame, foam foot holder, comfortable rear cushion, large steel non-slip footplate, every part is made by high quality material.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0035fc01-9f0a-4548-8e0f-1783713a11a8', '238f0063-31c3-4763-bb91-9c715a2b6f5b', 'Suitable Design for Everyone: Adjustable design makes this workout station fits different sizes and body shapes. Foot holder adjustable to fit your feet, rear cushion height adjustable to feet your legs, rear cushion angle adjustable to offer you more training options.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6e830d97-e341-438b-ac93-92e6e7dad7b2', '238f0063-31c3-4763-bb91-9c715a2b6f5b', 'Easy to Use, Easy to Store: It’s so simple to use, no assembly need, you unpack the machine, fix it with the pin, unfold the cushion, you are ready to go; And this deluxe machine also is foldable and space saving, super easy to fold it and store it.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('685c659c-7aa5-4ee4-abe0-df924c255269', 'b5fe3334-3285-4bc9-8be6-d1050e4a0f89', '[COMFORTABLE & STUDY ANKLE STRAP] Our ankle cuffs is made of EVA material, which around your ankles with a gentle hug, shielding you from any exercise-related injuries. With pearl textured nylon webbing and double reinforced stitching, it''s practically indestructible,so you cankill your workout and trainlike a pro!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bc652d6f-3357-49d3-a4c8-1a6781174322', 'b5fe3334-3285-4bc9-8be6-d1050e4a0f89', '[MULTIFUNCTIONAL ANKLE STRAP ASSISTANCE] These cable ankle straps are the ultimate partners in crime for your cable systems, functional trainers, and resistance trainers. Perform cable kickbacks, cable hip adduction and abduction, cable leg mountain climbers, cable lunges.Say goodbye to boring workouts and hello to a diverse range of ankle-supported exercises that will make you feel like a fitness superstar.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('30b812d5-8b5a-4411-bdf3-2eae6de7aee0', 'b5fe3334-3285-4bc9-8be6-d1050e4a0f89', '[ANKLE STRAPS FOR YOUR DREAM BODY] Our ankle straps will help you tone lower body muscles,Intensifies Your everyday workouts,strengthen your leg core in no time!Plus, cable ankle straps are lightweight and portable, making them the perfect addition to your gym bag. Get ready to give your booty the boost it deserves and become the envy of gym-goers everywhere.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('121e8c7f-a18d-4ce3-8f0a-43d68108a380', 'b5fe3334-3285-4bc9-8be6-d1050e4a0f89', '[EASY-ADJUST & UPGRADE ANKLE STRAP] Our ankle kickback strap made strapping up a breeze with our premium hook and loop material that adjusts to fit any size of men and women. Our gym ankle straps are equipped with electrophoretic welding D-rings that not easy to fall off and rust. We didn''t stop there! our cable machine ankle straps come with extra straps that act like bodyguards for your ankles, saving you from slipping.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7272758e-5ce9-4eac-b926-a519bd1fda4b', 'b5fe3334-3285-4bc9-8be6-d1050e4a0f89', '[WORRY-FREE ANKLE STRAP SERVICE] Your satisfaction is our mission.We''re so confident in cable machine ankle straps that we offer a 90-day, because who needs worries when you''ve got workout ankle straps happiness? We''ve got your back, your ankles, and your peace of mind.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('407621a3-5e92-46f0-97a6-c9dea3a792bb', '58062ae7-187f-4e68-8df9-349403800963', 'SOLID CONSTRUCTION: Built with 1.75” x 1.75” solid steel tubing, ensuring stability and support during intense leg workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('06adfed4-ef15-4db1-8ae4-565e2e829b11', '58062ae7-187f-4e68-8df9-349403800963', 'COMFORTABLE SUPPORT: Equipped with foam rollers that cushion the back of the knees and ankles, facilitating a comfortable, effective workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a39ab7bf-76c1-45c2-bc54-3ab22affcf86', '58062ae7-187f-4e68-8df9-349403800963', 'VERSATILE TRAINING OPTIONS: Enables you to perform both leg extensions to target the quadriceps and leg curls to focus on the hamstrings, adding variety to your lower body routine.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0a88b838-4d94-4995-b81d-b9cb9d2765ac', '58062ae7-187f-4e68-8df9-349403800963', 'ADJUSTABLE FOR PERSONALIZATION: Features multiple adjustment positions to accommodate users of different heights, ensuring an optimal fit and maximizing workout effectiveness.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ffe89b4c-c21b-4ba4-a5c4-436037400dee', '58062ae7-187f-4e68-8df9-349403800963', 'WEIGHT CUSTOMIZATION: Includes a plate peg compatible with both standard and Olympic plates, allowing you to easily adjust the intensity of your workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cb3d2b57-2964-466b-929f-f509dcabd060', '58062ae7-187f-4e68-8df9-349403800963', 'COMPATIBILITY: Specifically designed to attach to Valor Fitness BF-39, DD-4, and DD-25 benches, expanding the functionality of your equipment.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f7954829-fd52-499a-8e14-a079e57acbb9', 'd0c72880-a32e-49ca-a330-c3e7ebb15e3f', '【WHY SQUAT】Squats are not only effective for building an insanely strong lower body, but also because they deliver several ancillary physical benefits, including increased hormone release and improved flexibility');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('364ca1c5-7e52-4b0f-9d58-e0e285cca081', 'd0c72880-a32e-49ca-a330-c3e7ebb15e3f', '【HOW IT WORKS】Tone the lower body by using your glutes, quads, and hamstrings to push down to a squat. Work your shoulders, back, and chest as you push yourself up through every rep.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('58ed2847-0b25-4959-82a1-5e39717f8c20', '23a6479a-9855-448f-a591-9c603c83c854', 'Imported');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4cbdf001-2d8b-4f9e-9984-f2e4177950aa', 'd0c72880-a32e-49ca-a330-c3e7ebb15e3f', '【REDUCED JOINT IMPACT】Skip the weights, this squat trainer will reduce the amount of stress on the knees and joints that occurs when you squat incorrectly. Adding this to your workout will help you develop a proper form to get the perfect squat');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e662cf1d-186a-4b96-b85d-5267e121e23e', 'd0c72880-a32e-49ca-a330-c3e7ebb15e3f', '【TRACK YOUR FITNESS】The LCD monitor tracks your calories, scan, time, and count. This trainer gives you the freedom to add or remove tension, the three elastic bands can be clipped on or off the seat to adjust to any fitness level');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4915db69-6bb4-488b-9016-bcdbcf7ee852', 'd0c72880-a32e-49ca-a330-c3e7ebb15e3f', '【WORKOUT VARIETY】Not only does it offer the ability to do a full-range squat, but you can also add variety by doing high, median and low zone squats pulses. The all-in-one squat assist fitness solution for a well-rounded and diverse workout experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8d35d168-36a8-4a00-8956-73c6df702987', 'd0c72880-a32e-49ca-a330-c3e7ebb15e3f', '【CONVENIENT HASSLE-FREE SETUP】Assemble with ease and start your fitness journey without delay. Remove the knob, fold, and store. Self-leveling pedals and stability end caps ensure a smooth, stable workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e4f9cb28-db82-4d7a-bf7e-f7d23da6c21b', 'd0c72880-a32e-49ca-a330-c3e7ebb15e3f', '【COMPACT DESIGN】Crafted with you in mind, without compromising in performance or functionality or durability, the machine has a small footprint with our innovative design. Easily store almost anywhere in your home');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3d6111db-5382-41a9-9bfe-5eecbcc76eed', 'd0c72880-a32e-49ca-a330-c3e7ebb15e3f', '【IMPROVE YOUR GLUTE & LEG TONING】Squat, Row and Ride with precision, engage in dynamic rowing exercises, target your glutes and legs for real toning results within a few weeks, sculpt your abs, and undertake strength training');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('261fd453-0100-4525-a57b-802499b521e4', 'd0c72880-a32e-49ca-a330-c3e7ebb15e3f', '【SMOOTH GLIDE MANEUVER】With a full range of motion, activate your metabolism and engage your full body to feel the burn. Without complicated arrangements or expensive gym membership fees, from the comfort of your own home, at the time of your convenience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('47014e36-1aa5-4342-8db0-acda038130a5', '15fdcb3e-1114-46cf-a1f1-a3f5bedbc7e0', '【Exercise Stronger Tibialis Muscles】: Our Tibialis Trainer is designed to specifically target and strengthen your tibialis muscles, improving balance, agility, and reducing the risk of sports injuries.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0f85fbed-c728-4aad-8b4b-4fa3e524cb99', '15fdcb3e-1114-46cf-a1f1-a3f5bedbc7e0', '【Improve Your Workout Performance】: Regular use of this tibialis training bar can help enhance your athletic performance by improving your speed, strength, and power. Tibia Dorsi Calf Raise Machine helps in balancing the strength and development of the lower leg muscles');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('932376c5-8803-4511-8671-8ceaa85c8407', '15fdcb3e-1114-46cf-a1f1-a3f5bedbc7e0', '【Added Comfort with 4 Foam Pads】: This tib bar comes with 4 foam pads for added comfort during your workout sessions. The foam pads also help in reducing pressure on your shins and ankles.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2052f50f-e6a3-4f4c-8d69-bfcd9f945346', '15fdcb3e-1114-46cf-a1f1-a3f5bedbc7e0', '【Detachable and Portable】: Designed to be Detachable and portable, this tib bar equipment is the perfect addition to your home or gym workout routine. Easily carry it in your bag and fitness work out wherever you want.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('777fdd67-4618-43ac-9925-a90d2b48b174', '15fdcb3e-1114-46cf-a1f1-a3f5bedbc7e0', '【Versatile Use】: Ideal for a variety of workouts, Use the Tib Bar Equipment from to strengthen your tibialis, knees, shins and ankles, improving your overall leg strength.which is important for overall lower body strength and stability.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c169dfff-e55b-45a7-8d02-a6e62c278c5d', '89d54c5c-61b6-4849-a579-78660da5318b', '【FLYBIRD】Design and produce fitness equipment for 20 years. Especially in WEIGHT BENCH, the bench was designed with advice of professional coach. You need a durable bench, Not a one month bench.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bca9d0ed-2d55-49b0-a5a5-3414610d5cd9', '89d54c5c-61b6-4849-a579-78660da5318b', '【2021 High Quality Bench】Made of commercial thickness steel, past thousands of weight test to ensure safety for workout everytime, Not the mendacious bench.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c83654e1-a851-4f11-81fb-143c2cf2560b', '89d54c5c-61b6-4849-a579-78660da5318b', 'Secure, Steady, No Deform: FLYBIRD weight bench is sturdy and stable due to over 20 years of focus on quality; Every component of the FLYBIRD workout bench is made to strict standards, including high-ductility steel, high strength bolt, high sealing weld');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c4f5e16f-6406-42df-93dd-a331999285e9', '89d54c5c-61b6-4849-a579-78660da5318b', '800 LBS Rock-Solid Weight Capacity: FLYBIRD weight benches for home gym is made of high-strength steel and is designed with a balanced structural; Strict weight test ensures 800 LBS weight capacity and safety for workout; Sturdy and durable exercise bench');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8491bab0-7551-480a-ac2e-c27508d30ee6', '89d54c5c-61b6-4849-a579-78660da5318b', 'Adjust In One Hand: Designed with 8 back and 3 seat positions for full-body workout; You can simply pull the self-resilient spring lock to quickly adjust the incline from 90° to -30° that suit you; Superior lock cylinder provides secure locking capability');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('653aad01-e16a-4d99-9ff4-c3cc6a5357c6', '89d54c5c-61b6-4849-a579-78660da5318b', 'Strong Support & Better Forcing: 18.5 in Height of the adjustable weight bench offers good grip for feet, which is important to maintain the stability of the body; Padding of the cushion balances comfort and support; Hard-wearing leather provides friction');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('afa81ee8-1e8d-4ffd-a447-9714ab53043d', '89d54c5c-61b6-4849-a579-78660da5318b', 'Folded To Save 80% Space: FLYBIRD foldable workout bench is easy to carry and store; Simply adjust the lock to quickly fold, and put it in the corner or under the bed after you finish workout; Folded and stored upright, the occupied area is only 8.6*13 in');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('168015ef-a004-4052-bb31-84f60610d5e1', '89d54c5c-61b6-4849-a579-78660da5318b', 'Details Indicate Quality: FLYBIRD workout bench for home gym pay attention to every detail, including mat edge wrapping, steel welding, component connection, etc; Durable work out bench for long-term use; 1 year cover, contact us via Amazon for any query');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('22da0b27-2126-4fdd-af83-2858cdcd52cb', 'c2ac2f25-9186-4a9a-a97d-716934df9623', '【Multifunctional Home Gym】The latest pull-up bar supports push-ups, sit-ups, pull-ups, pull-ups, arm curls, arm and shoulder exercises, and other exercises. You can easily switch between multiple exercises without other fitness door bars to help you build strong upper body and core muscles.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6db4f6d9-0dfb-4277-80b6-4f6369db0078', 'c2ac2f25-9186-4a9a-a97d-716934df9623', '【Ergonomic Design】KAKICLAY Pull Up Bar is an ideal upper body exercise equipment with three grip positions, narrow, wide, and neutral. The handle is equipped with ergonomic comfort foam for a comfortable grip, non-slip and wear resistance to protect your wrists and relieve fatigue during exercising.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d2e79245-1e7c-42ee-aded-41b9ac432549', 'c2ac2f25-9186-4a9a-a97d-716934df9623', '【Door Frame Protection】The top of this pull-up bar is equipped with thickened foam to protect the top of the door frame from damage. Also the pull-up bar is equipped with foam handles on the outside and inside, which can effectively prevent damage to the sides of the door frame.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('de8c1180-78c3-49bb-bff4-1566e3050ac5', 'c2ac2f25-9186-4a9a-a97d-716934df9623', '【Easy Installation】Our door frame puller is simple to install with safety brackets, safety manuals and assembly tools, making it easy to install and remove in seconds. It uses leverage against the door frame, so there is no drilling required and no damage to the door. The pull up bar is 36.5" long and fits any standard door opening from 24" to 32" wide and 4" to 6.3" deep. It holds up to 440 lbs.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('76d42f8f-1a37-4f6e-aaeb-a98f34223a6d', 'c2ac2f25-9186-4a9a-a97d-716934df9623', '【No Worry Buying】Before using the upper body workout bar tug down on the grips to make sure the unit is securely installed into door frame. Any problems please feel free to contact us by email, we will solve it for you as soon as possible. And we offer 24 months manufacturer’s warranty.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e0bf77d0-f08e-47ac-8bf6-2ebda59dc514', 'a5be83e1-db11-4c5b-bfe0-3059f85593b9', 'DOORWAY MOUNT - Heavy-duty pull-up bar mounts in most standard doorframes; in-cludes end cap brackets and screws');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3ce6758b-d94b-491c-9da7-99a07741c0fe', '23a6479a-9855-448f-a591-9c603c83c854', 'Pull up Assistance Bands Set: It comes with 3 elastic bands, ideal for fitness pros & beginners. If you have a hard time getting chin-ups, you can try our pull up assist bands. Starting with 1 assist band, the pull-up band kit will allow you to gradually increase your strength until you can do a full pull-up entirely on your own.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2d72d762-3291-4277-9d4f-aaf0c88beebc', '23a6479a-9855-448f-a591-9c603c83c854', 'Adjustable Length According to Body Height: Connect it to any pull-up bar, just adjust the length to match your height. Many people do a few pull-ups at one height and then switch to a different height, customize it to be a regular part of your workout and enjoy better workout results.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c32023d3-3888-43e9-9c6c-e70ccdb2799a', '23a6479a-9855-448f-a591-9c603c83c854', 'New Upgraded Multifunctional Accessories: The patented pull-up helper band set is equipped with adjustable straps, 3 elastic bands, and 2 sponge pad sling hanging. You can achieve the purpose of exercising the whole body according to different combinations.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('25d0b976-b742-4b1e-a81e-08992686c494', '23a6479a-9855-448f-a591-9c603c83c854', 'Superb Craftsmanship: The metal steel buckle will be more stronger, durable, and safer. The cloth cover will slow down the oxidation speed of the latex tubes and protect our body from injury. The assistance adjustable steel buckle, which can adjust the length of the webbing, which is firmer and more durable.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cd23f122-a2f5-4d06-91d4-010c247bb25e', '23a6479a-9855-448f-a591-9c603c83c854', 'Complete Upper Body Workout: Our pull up assist bands target arms, shoulders, back, chest, and core muscles. Perfect for home gyms, these pull up bar bands help you build strength in multiple muscle groups efficiently, Build upper body strength quite quickly.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('51e49111-a8e7-440b-9b41-62649549e4be', '23a6479a-9855-448f-a591-9c603c83c854', 'Compatible with a range of workout equipment: Say goodbye to mundane workouts and hello to a new era of fitness excellence with our cutting-edge pull up bands. Engineered to seamlessly integrate with a myriad of workout equipment such as pull-up bars, pull up bar for doorway, pull-up assist machines, and wall-mounted pull-up bars,These resistance bands will become a must-have for your daily workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ab59cb91-8780-4f08-9b52-1b12af03659e', '23a6479a-9855-448f-a591-9c603c83c854', 'Easy to Carry: The pull up assistance bands set include a quality compact pouch for travel with excellent portability. This set will quickly become an indispensable part of your life, help you reach your fitness, strength, and weight loss goals much faster, maintain your ideal weight and strength over time.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('84fc548f-152e-4421-9435-72abded98e91', '6759f56d-3470-43b8-811e-c58ca14739f1', 'NEW IMPROVEMENTS: Target more muscles with four fully padded grip positions - Parallel | Narrow | Standard | Wide. Exclusive lowered parallel grips improve range of motion so you can focus on form and repetition');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('614d5b84-16ce-476d-a239-4acb61e2cdc4', '6759f56d-3470-43b8-811e-c58ca14739f1', 'PREMIUM FEATURES: Heavy-duty joist mounted pull up bar with parallel grips, mounting hardware and complete instructions. Thick welded steel construction is commercial-strength with premium high density foam pads over knurled steel grips');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('024e9200-c066-4cdc-a064-282339c50452', '6759f56d-3470-43b8-811e-c58ca14739f1', 'TOTAL COMPATIBILITY: Joist mounting gets your workout space away from the wall and your installation is easy with Instructions, template, and all hardware provided including thru-bolts and lag bolts for compatibility with thicker beams');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4cf4f53e-f374-40a4-b9c3-075a6a5703c9', '6759f56d-3470-43b8-811e-c58ca14739f1', 'THE ULTIMATE UPGRADE: Ultra stable and always ready, a mounted pull up bar is the ultimate upgrade from a doorway bar. 14” risers, 21” wide parallel grips, and a 42” wide bar define a generous workout space for your home gym');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('aa29d231-0fa5-421c-9a76-5f007f61eb5d', '6759f56d-3470-43b8-811e-c58ca14739f1', 'IDEAL ANCHOR FOR OPTIONAL ACCESSORIES: Build a full body gym with Ultimate Body Press Ab Straps and Gymnastic Rings for highly metabolic full body workouts and assisted pull up variations. (accessories sold separately)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('abb6dd4e-acc9-4281-98d3-4c6a0b58de85', '6759f56d-3470-43b8-811e-c58ca14739f1', 'DESIGNED IN THE USA: Ultimate Body Press is a North Carolina company committed to delivering better workouts every day. Includes Prime eligible shipping and USA customer service');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a87d9189-183c-448c-8788-4543fde5be6b', '6759f56d-3470-43b8-811e-c58ca14739f1', 'SHOP WITH CONFIDENCE: The Wall Mount Doorway Pull Up Bar is backed by Ultimate Body Press against manufacturer''s defects for 10 years');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6cc5a55d-ec96-47b9-a43d-b6bd4ee009ba', '62df60a7-e610-4d5a-b0c7-e7522bf87532', 'SET OF 2 STEEL ROTATING PULL UP HANDLES');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5113c12a-a61c-4723-b157-8bd93d472b81', '62df60a7-e610-4d5a-b0c7-e7522bf87532', 'ANTI-SLIP RUBBER PADDING: The rubber interior helps stabilize the pull up handles, lessen the stress on the bar, prevent sliding, and reduce vibration for a better workout performance');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('99be6670-6258-4596-be3e-72b93ed31b9e', '62df60a7-e610-4d5a-b0c7-e7522bf87532', 'THICK FOAM PADDED HANDLE: Feature with soft, comfortable, and tear-resistant foam grips, Yes4All Rotating Pull up Handles can withstand the load of your weights & movements without causing any abrasion or pain');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bf2d3ce0-17ec-456a-bd5b-421f22335a7c', '62df60a7-e610-4d5a-b0c7-e7522bf87532', 'EFFORTLESSLY ROTATE 360 DEGREES: The smooth, unrestricted rotation promotes wrist movement, requiring activation of your core and forearms for stability during pull-up exercises');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('36a94096-22e5-4dd9-9f1e-e179c4ce2923', '62df60a7-e610-4d5a-b0c7-e7522bf87532', '1-YEAR WARR – 60-DAY RETURN: Our Rotating Pull Up Handles stand up to 1 YEAR war or if you think it’s not for you');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1e226690-bf6b-4596-a98f-e7a278b0bcfd', '3c2028bc-3319-4aad-bbfa-f330c5af1f58', 'LONGEST LENGTH BAR AVAILABLE: Made in Taiwan with high grade materials, this Pull-Up bar fits doorway openings up to 40” long (with included hardware), minimum length measuring 25.25”, holding up to 300lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('610d1776-c733-4c0d-bb93-efd7a9e04add', '3c2028bc-3319-4aad-bbfa-f330c5af1f58', 'HARDWARE INCLUDED: This premium Pull-Up bar comes with all the hardware you will need, a set of safety brackets with screws, and set of sit up plugs, only a screwdriver or drill is required; For safety and stability, screws are required for mounting');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('99bb1fdf-c97f-4bf3-91a5-f4f0aaa5eea9', '3c2028bc-3319-4aad-bbfa-f330c5af1f58', 'ADJUSTABLE COMFORT HAND GRIPS: Made with neoprene material and easy to adjust Velcro, these removable hand grips allow you to place the grips where they are comfortable for you');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e3dbbd01-8b6c-48ca-a2d2-b4f135dab6b4', '3c2028bc-3319-4aad-bbfa-f330c5af1f58', 'VERSATILE WORKOUTS: Not just for Chin-Ups and Pull-Ups, mount to the bottom of a doorway to maximize your sit-ups, crunches and even triceps dips, making it easy to move locations with extra door mounts available');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6f496ad5-a3d1-439c-89a8-ea91e73e074d', '3c2028bc-3319-4aad-bbfa-f330c5af1f58', 'TELESCOPIC DESIGN: For safety purposes, the bar extrudes from one telescopic point, as tighter threads and toggle ends make sure that bar is safely tight and secure; End caps for ultimate safety and rubber stoppers for metal doors');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c2f0e015-53c6-4a53-acf1-f83b338564ff', 'd41c3ec0-78da-4eb3-a0ec-ecd1e595d2b9', '【 HEAVY-DUTY WEIGHT CAPACITY 】: With an impressive weight capacity of up to 500 lbs, this pull-up bar can handle the most intense workouts. It provides stability and confidence, supporting users of various sizes and fitness levels');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fd5b80b0-1345-4340-9700-da6f997473e5', 'd41c3ec0-78da-4eb3-a0ec-ecd1e595d2b9', '【 11 GAUGE STEEL CONSTRUCTION 】: Safety and stability are paramount when it comes to your workout equipment. The R2 Pull-Up Bar is constructed with 11 Gauge steel, ensuring exceptional durability and a secure training environment.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9b8a47a3-8947-435b-b23c-49b70d1b06c1', 'd41c3ec0-78da-4eb3-a0ec-ecd1e595d2b9', '【 36 INCHES OF WALL CLEARANCE 】: With 36 inches of wall clearance, our pull-up bar allows unrestricted movement for a wide range of exercises including chin-ups, pull-ups, hanging leg raises & more. Achieve optimal body positioning and maximize strength gains by targeting multiple muscle groups effectively.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a2b4134f-8b32-44ab-9a36-f9568137cd7c', 'b200481c-f14f-4c47-bbce-a474f4bdc14c', '22 Silent Magnetic Resistance levels, 45-48 cm adjustable strides, 11 kg Inertia Enhanced Flywheel, Oversized Cushioned Pedals');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f41ac0aa-4f65-48fc-9d23-e97106002385', 'd41c3ec0-78da-4eb3-a0ec-ecd1e595d2b9', '【 EASY INSTALLATION 】: The Rage Fitness R2 Pull-Up Bar can be set up vertically or horizontally on the ceiling or a concrete wall, accommodating different widths and adjustable to fit various ceiling heights or athlete heights. Mounting hardware is included for easy installation.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d6cbb11a-56a2-4ecd-981b-a2418f57af92', 'd41c3ec0-78da-4eb3-a0ec-ecd1e595d2b9', '【 VERSATILE SPACE-EFFICIENT DESIGN 】: The R2 Wall Mounted Pull-Up Bar is designed to optimize space utilization. It fits perfectly in any commercial or home gym, can be easily mounted on walls or ceilings, and is compatible with wooden and concrete surfaces. Maximize your upper body workout without sacrificing floor space.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b2c8848a-47a4-4139-b4c1-906de410036f', '63059b6d-c8d3-41dc-b1bf-45b20e0bd316', 'Steel');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('14494b7e-1f76-4445-887e-e0e3e9fce4d2', '63059b6d-c8d3-41dc-b1bf-45b20e0bd316', 'Imported');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b54847b3-d237-4660-af45-2730a0382821', '63059b6d-c8d3-41dc-b1bf-45b20e0bd316', 'HEAVY DUTY CONSTRUCTION: The Stamina Doorway Pull Up Bar Station comes with thick padding and non-slip comfort grips. The sturdy steel construction allows the workout bar to support up to 250 pounds. It won''t budge during your upper body workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2252be1c-1acf-4ee9-8fab-f676b3ec4cae', '63059b6d-c8d3-41dc-b1bf-45b20e0bd316', 'MULTI-FUNCTION PORTABLE HOME GYM: The door gym has multiple grip positions making it the perfect piece of upper body exercise equipment. Use on a doorway as a pullup bar or hanging bar. Use on the floor as a push up bar, sit up bar or for tricep dips.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('57a196e0-1972-4970-a254-741b63676391', '63059b6d-c8d3-41dc-b1bf-45b20e0bd316', 'SMART WORKOUT APP: This Door Gym comes with muuv, the all-in-one app that provides personal coaching, a follow-along assembly video, and workouts tailored to your fitness goals and the workout equipment you own.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('15673a1d-03d3-40f8-b0ad-7766fce6af49', '63059b6d-c8d3-41dc-b1bf-45b20e0bd316', 'EASY TO INSTALL, PORTABLE PULL UP BAR: The portable pull up bar fits standard doorways with trim. It''s easy to install, and it attaches and removes easily from the doorframe with no need for hardware. The lightweight design allows you to take this portable pull up bar anywhere for a portable home gym. Assembled Dimensions: 37" x 16" x 11"');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f56066d0-4ab4-4774-ab15-1c59293d872a', '63059b6d-c8d3-41dc-b1bf-45b20e0bd316', 'UNIQUE ROCK CLIMBING GRIPS : Unique rock climbing hand holds on the Stamina X Boulder Fit Doorway Trainer provide an advanced grip to challenge you during your workout and will ultimately build grip and forearm strength for all your outdoor adventures');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3734b1b1-d5a2-407b-a208-df7ca644a4b7', 'f5dc680b-38e8-4ec0-a135-a36be30b9236', 'Before purchasing, please make sure that the size of your door frame is 29.5 in-37 in (75 cm-94 cm). This Chin up Bar is not suitable for door frame widths outside this range; The width of the door frame must be wider than the width of the anti-slip pads at both ends of the pull up bar');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a1c732fc-e46b-43a9-a937-66a96d21fb66', 'f5dc680b-38e8-4ec0-a135-a36be30b9236', 'To ensure safety, the manual specifies a maximum load of 297 lbs (135 kg). Testing shows the product can handle up to 744 lbs (337.5 kg) of instantaneous load, meeting a 2.5x safety factor. However, the pull up bar''s capacity also depends on the usage environment. Users should strictly adhere to the 135 kg limit');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3b897dfe-8528-419d-8700-64865191d859', 'f5dc680b-38e8-4ec0-a135-a36be30b9236', 'No Drilling, No Traces: The pull-up bar uses innovative fixative technology to stay in place. It features two large 6.5 x 1.8-inch PVC mats for added friction and stability. Four metal fixed points connect the base and bar, ensuring a secure, fall-proof design even under heavy loads');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('dd3f3f04-824d-4b64-ad08-884d60f1775f', 'f5dc680b-38e8-4ec0-a135-a36be30b9236', 'Heavy Duty Construction: Our Pull Up Bar supports up to 440 lbs (200 kg) with its 2 mm outer and 1.5 mm inner steel pipes. This pull-up bar built to last without deforming or breaking, ensuring durability for your home gym. Note: Longer use distances may reduce the load of chin-up bar');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3bcd25b1-e1c9-44a3-856c-a059f7eaf944', 'f5dc680b-38e8-4ec0-a135-a36be30b9236', 'Upgraded Mechanic Lock System: This push-up bar features a new 360-degree rotatable dual gear lock on both ends to protect the bar from loosening. The doorway exercise bar has passed extensive testing, ensuring safety and sturdiness for confident use');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('67c8223b-d68b-4013-bf68-25d623247bac', 'f5dc680b-38e8-4ec0-a135-a36be30b9236', 'Easy Installation: Install quickly with detailed instructions, a video guide, and arrow markers on the chin-up bar. Spirit levels on both ends ensure correct setup. Ensure your doorway or wall is solid; avoid ceramic tiles, glass or non-solid doorframe. Note: Verify the marked rotation direction; reversing it may cause locking');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5e15581d-31a0-49f9-81d4-6cf0e3500ab9', 'f5dc680b-38e8-4ec0-a135-a36be30b9236', 'Integrated, Extensible Structure: Unlike most 2-section foam bars, this doorway pull up bar features an ultra long, integrated anti-slip cotton handlebar for a flexible grip. It''s sweat-resistant, odorless, and durable. Twist the bar to adjust its length from 29.5 to 37 inches (75 to 94 cm) for various workouts like pull-ups, sit-ups, push-ups, stretching and more');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('abfd93c9-ee03-4b83-a531-cecc85847049', '6e7c02bd-a493-4d95-a763-6c3f6a2cbca3', 'STURDY CHROME PLATED STEEL BAR: Train like a pro with the tough and secure exercise trainer supporting tough workouts. When mounted properly, the fitness bar holds up to 220 pounds giving you full support for pull-up and chin ups.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('adf826bb-e2ca-4899-8745-1d7922f1d235', '6e7c02bd-a493-4d95-a763-6c3f6a2cbca3', 'ADJUSTABLE LENGTH: Easily adjust this exercise bar so you can take your fitness on the go! Adjustable length (24. 5 to 36 inches) provides a customizable workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d8fff7e1-661f-4a12-bf6b-7db6fd3c255b', '6e7c02bd-a493-4d95-a763-6c3f6a2cbca3', 'COMFORT GRIPS: Minimize risks of calluses or hand cramping with padded handles. Non-slip extra-long foam grips for extra comfort to minimize hand fatigue. Put the door bar lower to the ground and use it to help you perform push-ups!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5043dc7a-ab10-4321-923c-e6091f6cf6a9', '6e7c02bd-a493-4d95-a763-6c3f6a2cbca3', 'MAXIMUM STABILITY: Includes weight bearing brackets for maximum stability during your chin-ups and non-weight bearing brackets for sit-ups. Fits into any standard door frame');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9a38f441-6941-4e3a-8791-5d179f267b89', '6e7c02bd-a493-4d95-a763-6c3f6a2cbca3', 'EASY STORAGE: Set up in seconds in almost any doorframe and easily store away in a closet. Adjustable length (24. 5 to 36 inches) provides a customizable workout for your home and body.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1b9d0511-8be3-4d2f-ad6c-1f396b272579', '6e7c02bd-a493-4d95-a763-6c3f6a2cbca3', '*TO ENSURE USER SAFETY, PLEASE READ INCLUDED INSTRUCTIONS. ALL NECESSARY SCREWS AND PARTS MUST BE PROPERLY INSTALLED BEFORE THE DEVICE SHOULD BE USED*');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('28927052-f895-473b-ab3b-0d8f54fe99a9', 'acc6dcae-9222-4ef5-bf6a-f4f8fe05de03', 'All-in-One Exercise Solution: Engineered for versatility, the KT folding free standing pull up bar KT1.1518 is ideal for a variety of workouts, including pull-ups, aerial yoga, calisthenics, street workouts, and gymnastics training. Designed to accommodate both children and adults, it is perfect for promoting height growth in kids and teens, while enhancing overall physical health and fitness levels for users of all ages at home, in schools, offices, and beyond');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ae61a207-a107-4872-b491-e3e6ebd54581', 'acc6dcae-9222-4ef5-bf6a-f4f8fe05de03', 'Sturdy and Durable: Crafted from high-strength alloy steel with a scientifically designed A-frame structure, our KT heavy duty workout frame offers remarkable stability with a 93% reduction in wobble. Despite its compact design, it features exceptional durability and force-bearing capacity, making it capable of supporting even the most intense workouts without degradation or structural failure');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2666b821-0f89-4aa2-9973-3010b5cacf93', 'db47e776-dd0a-4ddf-a806-847191c3c346', 'Pull Up Bar For Doorway: Easy install any doorway and become your home workout gym.It instantly attaches to Or removes from your door frame.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('47064bd3-5388-4959-bd83-3a0bcb1236ca', 'db47e776-dd0a-4ddf-a806-847191c3c346', 'Ideal For Upper Body Workout: Pull up bars is perfect for upper body exercise equipment, It is fit for wide grip push- ups, pull-ups, chin-ups, sit-ups, dips, arm and shoulder exercises .');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2994f179-03e1-49ba-838e-273e10d6fb4c', 'acc6dcae-9222-4ef5-bf6a-f4f8fe05de03', 'Adjustable Height: Effortlessly adjust the horizontal handle-bar from 46.45'''' to 89.37'''' to fit any room without touching the ceiling. This feature makes the KT pullup aerial yoga stand ideal for use as a gymnastics bar, supporting children''s growth from early childhood through to adulthood, promoting increases in height and overall health. It also allows adults dealing with spinal conditions like sciatica or herniated discs to set the perfect height for safe and effective daily stretching');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e1f8f0e0-48c5-4da9-b7b9-5798ac1a9d69', 'acc6dcae-9222-4ef5-bf6a-f4f8fe05de03', 'Compact Design: With a compact footprint of 44.09" x 48.03" and an adjustable spread range, the KT home gym exercise stand KT1.1518 is ideal for apartments or spaces where room is at a premium. Despite its light weight of only 35.27 lbs, it offers a stable and secure platform that supports up to 440.9 lbs (200 kg) for a variety of workouts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('51885a8f-c904-489f-b066-cee1ee9de4e6', 'acc6dcae-9222-4ef5-bf6a-f4f8fe05de03', 'Space-Saving & Portable: Quickly fold the KT pullup stand in under 10 seconds to free up space for additional activities. While it’s not designed for easy travel without disassembly, its portability is ideal for use within local environments like homes, schools, and offices. Position it wherever suits you best to maximize convenience, saving time and facilitating quick workouts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c579c87e-940f-459e-8fdc-703991ba59c1', 'acc6dcae-9222-4ef5-bf6a-f4f8fe05de03', 'Versatility for Family Use: More than just a tool for fitness, this KT chin-up air yoga hanger supports swing chairs, hammock chairs, climbing ropes, Therapy Sensory Swing and can even be transformed into a play tent for children. It brings fun and active play options for kids, becoming a valuable asset to any home by enhancing both fitness and leisure activities for every family member to enjoy');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('18d7aa31-5df3-4480-acea-c9f286e5330c', 'acc6dcae-9222-4ef5-bf6a-f4f8fe05de03', 'Spinal Decompression Made Simple: Naturally hang on our KT Lumbar Relief Support Equipment to stretch your spine and relieve back pain without the need for an inversion table. Recommended by healthcare professionals, this secure Lower back Traction Therapy Device effectively prevents and treats lumbar strain, sciatica, herniated discs, and other spinal issues. Simply adjust and set the height, secure your grip, and enjoy the benefits of gravity-assisted spinal stretching - no complex setup required');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a017b77a-d654-46d1-be4c-2e4059fe0a96', 'acc6dcae-9222-4ef5-bf6a-f4f8fe05de03', 'Built to Last: Invest in a KT collapsible gymnastic arial yoga rig and experience the pinnacle of product quality. Each frame is precisely manufactured on semi-automatic lines, with robots expertly handling the intricate welding and painting. We implement strict quality controls, aiming to deliver a superior product that will serve you reliably for many years');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bd490b83-48a7-4aba-b591-2c48cd6ce2e5', 'acc6dcae-9222-4ef5-bf6a-f4f8fe05de03', 'Don''t wait and no need to search further! The KT freestanding suspension machine is your perfect solution. Avoid the hassle of drilling and potential damage to door frames. Effortlessly hang your essentials. Should you have any questions, contact us for a swift and satisfying resolution within 12 hours');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4dc6838c-65a5-4edd-82ad-eb717490ec3a', 'c8bb1c16-e17f-4552-901f-9a4a0101aeea', 'INCREASE STRENGTH & MOBILITY: Doorway pull-up bar creates better workouts on the wall and floor');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0c41c66e-1fa0-4952-80bc-d7a2817747f6', 'c8bb1c16-e17f-4552-901f-9a4a0101aeea', 'BENEFITS ALL FITNESS LEVELS: Great for tall users and all fitness levels, 10-inch wall clearance gives you a full range of motion with more headroom; Premium high-density foam pads reduce strain to comfortably support your stamina over longer workouts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b3e59f0b-2ee3-4491-ac15-3e40bcce1153', 'c8bb1c16-e17f-4552-901f-9a4a0101aeea', 'DURABLE CONSTRUCTION: Quality steel construction lets you focus on form and repetitions without worrying about stability; Heavy-duty hardware and ABS couplers stabilize you throughout your fitness journey');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('41271eaf-96d8-412c-9df7-c3a86888baf8', 'c8bb1c16-e17f-4552-901f-9a4a0101aeea', 'UNIVERSAL FIT: Universal-fit, expandable bar fits doorways 24 to 36 inches wide with up to 3.5-inch wide molding; No permanent mounting required, allowing you to use as a brace for floor exercises');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a3c0573c-a1b3-4a06-a322-ebdfce348c5e', 'c8bb1c16-e17f-4552-901f-9a4a0101aeea', 'WEIGHT: Supports fitness enthusiasts up to 300 pounds; Dimensions (L x W x H): 41 x 22 x 11 inches');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6e8bded3-35d8-4a9b-a712-11d51a3539aa', 'fddd6527-cd10-4023-9ab9-1c4abab0bc34', 'Wide Applications: Target various muscles in the shoulders, back, arms, and abdomen for comprehensive upper body strengthening and toning. An effective tool for achieving complete muscle activation and development');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f0b5c872-7600-4718-be41-7180ff534918', 'fddd6527-cd10-4023-9ab9-1c4abab0bc34', 'Workout Tool: Achieve a complete exercise routine with our pullup bar for doorways. This versatile equipment strengthens core muscles while also offering assistance for sit-ups');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('18b7513c-c873-453c-88d1-ebc83c5959f0', 'fddd6527-cd10-4023-9ab9-1c4abab0bc34', 'Strong Steel: Our pullup bar doorway is constructed with heavy-duty steel, holding up to 300 pounds for a safe and dependable workout experience at home');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e78fc92f-bb02-4abe-b7ca-5d136cb2c50a', 'fddd6527-cd10-4023-9ab9-1c4abab0bc34', 'Convenient to Install: Simplify your fitness routine with our pullup bar doorway; its easy installation allows for a seamless setup to start your workout promptly');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('582d98c2-9aca-4891-bc74-d310f5c21d3d', 'fddd6527-cd10-4023-9ab9-1c4abab0bc34', 'Extensive Applicable: Our pullup bar doorway fits effortlessly on door frames ranging from 24-32 inches wide. Installing and removing it is easy, allowing you to get in a quick workout anytime');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('512c333e-35f6-4494-9471-a2e918ac233c', '52846a40-4eda-4dd9-b13a-e4074e8096f4', '2024 Men’s Health favorite Multi Grip Pull Up Bar');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fac8d006-7b69-4853-aaca-61dd1b24d66c', '52846a40-4eda-4dd9-b13a-e4074e8096f4', 'Multiple Grip Options: Wide, standard, narrow, angled and neutral grips');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('62b3fa0e-ac6b-48a3-8eb0-4216f59c1e65', '52846a40-4eda-4dd9-b13a-e4074e8096f4', 'Versatile: Add straps, pull-up bands, or suspension training straps');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bed36921-b9ed-4e5f-b245-016a96c75b0b', '52846a40-4eda-4dd9-b13a-e4074e8096f4', 'Bar Diameter: 28mm (1.10")');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('756cf05b-3309-4815-bc70-4e5e26236549', '52846a40-4eda-4dd9-b13a-e4074e8096f4', 'Heavy weight capacity: 850 lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4c0bb48e-da56-413a-908b-0022293917f3', '52846a40-4eda-4dd9-b13a-e4074e8096f4', 'Dimensions: 50 ¼” x 23” x 23 ¾” bolts on 16” stud wall');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('010f14a0-dd55-4fb9-85ae-a848e1c294e0', '52846a40-4eda-4dd9-b13a-e4074e8096f4', 'Material: 11-gauge black powder coated alloy steel with knurling');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c7a1e1a8-3bb2-4b56-a28d-b09eb6981e64', 'd7c92b74-105a-4af4-91e8-f21ef1532c7d', 'IDEAL FOR 8'' CEILINGS: Add gym-grade workouts to any room with 8 foot ceilings or any space where 14” risers suit your needs. Straight 48 inch bar offers ample room to build arms, chest, shoulders, back and core with full range of motion workouts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0d881107-4ae4-4d23-9c74-bfeb4cae20e8', 'd7c92b74-105a-4af4-91e8-f21ef1532c7d', 'UNIVERSAL CEILING MOUNT: 48 inch on-center mounting plates fit all joists in typical residential framing. 48 inches spans two 24 inch joists at the top of your house and below floors, the bar spans three 16 inch joists. Complete hardware is included');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bd2ad595-c209-44d7-b2fe-2ccf184e7c08', 'd7c92b74-105a-4af4-91e8-f21ef1532c7d', 'NEW THROUGH-BOLT BAR FOR 2020: Jig welded square tube steel risers are through-bolted to the bar to eliminate rotation under heavy power. Results pile on fast with an ultra stable bar that is always ready to go');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2640060f-5774-463a-b516-870b10f8e057', 'd7c92b74-105a-4af4-91e8-f21ef1532c7d', 'IDEAL ANCHOR FOR OPTIONAL ACCESSORIES: Anchor Ultimate Body Press Ab Straps and Gymnastic Rings for highly metabolic full body workouts and assisted pull up variations. (accessories sold separately)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ec167359-f5d9-45fa-8dbc-e6e1e3e47960', 'd7c92b74-105a-4af4-91e8-f21ef1532c7d', 'DESIGNED IN THE USA: Ultimate Body Press is a North Carolina company committed to delivering better workouts every day. Includes Prime eligible shipping, USA customer service and 30 day no-hassle return policy');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('22033777-418e-4e3d-a06c-ea5dd224f110', 'd7c92b74-105a-4af4-91e8-f21ef1532c7d', 'SHOP WITH CONFIDENCE: The Elevated Doorway Pull Up Bar is backed by Ultimate Body Press against manufacturer''s defects for 10 years');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f7a61d2e-1915-45c0-8361-cafa26779296', 'db47e776-dd0a-4ddf-a806-847191c3c346', 'Protection For Door Frame:We have upgraded the traditional foam that contacts the door frame to elastic silicone material.Permanent use,better fits and protects door frame without marks.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4413d24f-05a6-4d2d-a059-1200ce0221ad', 'db47e776-dd0a-4ddf-a806-847191c3c346', 'Durable: Made of 1.7mm thickened refined heavy steel and the fine powder coating prevent rust and corrosion.It is much better than others just for the extra safety .It can hold up to 300 pounds. And the handles are coated with high fiber foam, comfortable grip, multi-function, anti-slip and wear resistance.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3a44c971-ce85-4fa6-8745-809f86f9dd97', 'db47e776-dd0a-4ddf-a806-847191c3c346', 'Best Pull Up Bar For Home Gyms :Tone your back, arms, and core with this doorway pull up bar! This pull up bar workout tool''s adjustable design allows it to fit door frames that are 31.5" wide.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('80dc5a14-7fc3-4dce-94f5-fa655a73019f', '900c90a6-ee8d-4d99-a337-e16e740b897d', 'This is a powerful fitness aid tool; Very suitable for fitness professionals and beginners. If you are a beginner and find it difficult to perform pull ups, it allows you to independently, completely, and correctly perform pull ups without any assistance. It can help you better perform pull-up strength training, gradually increasing your strength and enjoying better exercise results.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('81569eca-b499-45c7-93be-0126463d174b', '900c90a6-ee8d-4d99-a337-e16e740b897d', 'Pull up Assist Belt Set: Tailored for fitness professionals and beginners, this pull up assist belt comes with 3 elastic resistance bands, 2x70 pounds, and can achieve up to 210 pounds of resistance. One double knee support ankle strap, when using the pull up assist strap to move up and down, using the ankle strap is safer and more efficient. 1 adjustable auxiliary belt.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fd042629-5272-4b64-88d5-025c49807cf8', '900c90a6-ee8d-4d99-a337-e16e740b897d', 'Complete upper body exercise: Our pull up assist band targets multiple upper body and core muscles. Using the assist band, you can effectively exercise your chest, arms, back, abdominal muscles, and core muscles. Enhance the strength of multiple muscle groups and quickly strengthen the upper body.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d4c4180d-69f0-4276-bffa-d9b0f0cc0faa', '900c90a6-ee8d-4d99-a337-e16e740b897d', 'Height adjustable design: Suitable for different ages, body shapes, and heights, the length can be adjusted according to your body height to match your height. The auxiliary strap is equipped with adjustable steel buckles and adjustable auxiliary straps, just adjust the length to match your height or adjust the length to change resistance, switch to different heights, and customize different exercise experiences.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('12c51ce1-6bb6-4be5-a0ef-6e30da02f21d', '900c90a6-ee8d-4d99-a337-e16e740b897d', 'Excellent durability: The pull up auxiliary strap set design balances durability and safety, and the metal steel buckle will be stronger, more durable, and safer for secure connections. High quality protective nylon sleeve auxiliary strap, each pull up resistance strap is wrapped in a durable nylon sleeve to minimize latex tube oxidation, extend product service life, and ensure safe and effective exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d2b4aa49-8b96-48fc-b5c4-b303ec6812c1', '900c90a6-ee8d-4d99-a337-e16e740b897d', 'Easy to carry and install: The pull up auxiliary strap is equipped with a high-quality compact storage bag, which has excellent portability. Help you achieve your fitness, strength, and weight loss goals faster. With easy assembly, you can immediately set up an auxiliary pull up strap and start your pull up workout immediately.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8ac9f3d6-764b-46e0-abe6-14d1aea626cf', '7d6acfd4-b82c-4f13-8595-d12f63f93def', 'UMAY Desk Elliptical: Work while workout, Your go-to mini ellipse leg exerciser for seamless workouts or rehabilitation, right from the comfort of your home or office chair. Whether you''re working, reading or watching TV, transform your sitting time into an opportunity for exercise with this innovative pedal exerciser. Burn calories, lose weight, and feel great with elliptical machines for home use');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4f0b89b5-f7e2-4ac0-8dad-878a97e84ed3', '7d6acfd4-b82c-4f13-8595-d12f63f93def', 'Auto & Manual Modes: UMAY elliptical provides Auto & Manual Modes for you, elderly people can choose 1-4 levels of low speed for leg exercise and relaxation. In Manual mode, you can set workout time of 15-30min, 12 speeds and forward&backward direction by remote control or button of the elliptical machine. The speed and direction have been programmed in Auto mode, you can adjust P1-P12 mode by press mode button, the speed changes every minute and the direction changes every 3 minutes');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('70e29dad-c756-40bb-85b5-1ffefdf6789e', '7d6acfd4-b82c-4f13-8595-d12f63f93def', 'Forward & Backward: More targeted exercising the front & back of ankle and thigh muscles to boost circulation. The LCD monitor tracks time, diatance, counts and calories burned in real-time. and comes with a remote control to control the machine, allowing you to adjust it without bending over. It is perfect for the elderly and people with limited mobility. Please do not standing up use the elliptical machine');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3739a677-52fe-4744-8b77-29ab46b52385', '7d6acfd4-b82c-4f13-8595-d12f63f93def', 'Mute Setting: UAMY pedal exerciser equipped with the latest mute system<15dB, which ensures a ultra quiet workout even at a high speed for you worry free use. When plugged in, long press the Power button to turn off the screen, and long press the Direction button on the machine for 1.5 seconds. After two beeps, cancel the sound prompt, and follow the same steps to restore normal sound');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d8d464c5-13ac-4007-9445-c204a530b0fd', '7d6acfd4-b82c-4f13-8595-d12f63f93def', 'Perfect Gift Companion: For elders, nothing is more precious than health. It can be an ideal gift for parents or grandparents, encouraging regular use to ensure proper leg blood circulation and muscle health. This pedal exerciser is equipped with a quieter and smoother mute system, ensuring noise-free exercise even at high speeds. It allows you to exercise anytime, anywhere without disturbing your colleagues or family members');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1ddf1c9d-bfba-4b59-99f5-92b64da11092', '7d6acfd4-b82c-4f13-8595-d12f63f93def', 'UMAYCARE SERVICE: Our California-based team provides complete after-sales and technical support, ensuring any issues with your order or product use are resolved to your satisfaction. From shipping damage and parts issues to product usage, installation, and maintenance, we''re here to offer tailored solutions for you');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cd94a962-aefc-41a2-861b-c713c58f37d7', '281680b1-4a48-4c62-816e-acceb5318afc', '【JOINT-FRIENDLY, LOW-IMPACT WORKOUT】The Pedal Exerciser offers a low-impact, full-body workout with a smooth gliding motion that minimizes stress on joints, promoting healthy levels of calorie burn, cardiovascular health, and muscle toning.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1bcff4e6-2653-4171-866f-1bb443f3fa3b', '281680b1-4a48-4c62-816e-acceb5318afc', '【FREE FITNESS APP CONNECTION】Enjoy FREE access to the SunnyFit App with NO membership fees! Dive into 1,000+ trainer-led workouts, explore 10,000+ virtual scenic tours, track your progress, challenge others, and much more!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('99fbc038-aa5a-4634-9969-cdd05ca6e20a', '281680b1-4a48-4c62-816e-acceb5318afc', '【HEAVY-DUTY EQUIPMENT】This heavy-duty elliptical supports up to 300LB, featuring a robust build with industrial-grade Q235 material for long-lasting durability, ensuring a stable and safe workout experience every time.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a4c8df4a-85a2-443a-a82a-6030de0e5784', '281680b1-4a48-4c62-816e-acceb5318afc', '【WHISPER-QUIET EXERICSE】Enjoy a low-noise workout with our elliptical’s belt drive system and 15 levels of magnetic resistance. Ideal for solo sessions and family fitness, ensuring a quiet and smooth exercise experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a6398508-335c-4a7e-beab-5532754505b5', '281680b1-4a48-4c62-816e-acceb5318afc', '【ADJUSTABLE RESISTANCE FOR EFFECTIVE TRAINING】Experience a dynamic workout with 15 levels of magnetic intensity, to suit your fitness needs. The 12-inch stride length ensures sufficient motion range for effective exercise, while the arm exerciser enables a comprehensive full-body workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fd49982f-33b8-4185-8646-efddda5f7587', 'cec9cc57-9f78-499b-b140-1d066fd54c8e', 'HEART RATE MONITORING Contact heart rate sensors on moving multigrip handles and stationary grips, telemetry heart rate monitoring and includes a wireless chest strap with console');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e21e3dd2-904a-409f-957f-6fe493bab84d', '281680b1-4a48-4c62-816e-acceb5318afc', '【ULTIMATE COMFORT】Customizable foot pedals with an anti-slip design serves various body types for comfortable & effective workout. The ergonomic design & comfortable handle grip enhance your workout experience, providing stability and ease of use.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e7aa4f19-d097-4ad9-a84a-641d993d9eaf', '281680b1-4a48-4c62-816e-acceb5318afc', '【BULIT-IN PULSE SENSORS & ADVANCED MONITOR】The comprehensive digital performance monitor tracks time, speed, distance, calories, heart rate, target heart rate, and odometer, allowing you to train at your perfect intensity every workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5610cf7c-2129-4b24-95dc-7fb242497259', '281680b1-4a48-4c62-816e-acceb5318afc', '【CONVENIENCE AND EASE】Stay hydrated and entertained with the built-in bottle and device holder. The elliptical requires no plug for a seamless start. Move the elliptical effortlessly with built-in wheels for easy storage and placement.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2ace607e-03da-440a-90b7-68c1742c5717', '281680b1-4a48-4c62-816e-acceb5318afc', '【SUNNY ASSEMBLY SUPPORT】Easy setup with straightforward instructions, including a user manual, adjustment guide, and video tutorial. Sunny customer service is ready to assist, focusing on your fitness goals right away.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ab61d66e-0799-4442-af4b-988e67362958', '281680b1-4a48-4c62-816e-acceb5318afc', '【20+ YEARS OF EXCELLENCE】 Sunny Health & Fitness, a U.S. company, offers top-quality equipment with a commitment to excellence. Our dedicated U.S. customer service team and certified trainers ensure a truly unmatched fit-for-everyone experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6ca74098-0ed3-40b1-8b6a-b4138ab9ac8f', '62d57f1e-cf21-4343-bd6b-86b90dd02e28', 'ADJUSTABLE STRIDE - Stride adjusts electronically from 18" to 24" so exerciser can choose from a variety of challenging and effective workouts with SMOOTH NATURAL MOTION - Extensive biomechanical research is used to create a fluid motion with an elliptical path that feels natural and comfortable. Also comes with WHISPERSTRIDE TECHNOLOGY Maintenance-free ball bearings reduce friction and ensure nearly silent operation, which is ideal for home use.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e15c0678-7dff-4eca-829a-cdef956cdebc', '62d57f1e-cf21-4343-bd6b-86b90dd02e28', 'APPEALING VARIETY - Multigrip handles contain heart rate sensors, with integrated stride and resistance controls for on the fly adjustments, allow for varying exercise motions. The system also includes telemetry heart rate monitoring (wireless chest strap included with console)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('34871d2f-ac8b-44d9-b78b-d128646338c7', '62d57f1e-cf21-4343-bd6b-86b90dd02e28', 'CONNECTED EXPERIENCE - Enable Bluetooth on your mobile device to push data to a growing list of partner apps. Sync with many fitness devices by enabling proximity login on the LFconnect app. Or, connect to interactive apps for an engaging workout experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cdd9fe1a-84d3-4a5d-9f98-226cc9cca4b6', '62d57f1e-cf21-4343-bd6b-86b90dd02e28', 'DUAL-ZONE DESIGN 1. ENTERTAINMENT ZONE - Placed at eye level for an ideal viewing experience. The compression rack securely holds all smartphones and tablets, even those with a protective case. 2. WORKOUT ZONE - The lower half of the console offers convenient workout setup and in-workout control. It features capacitive touch keys that illuminate when usable and dim when not in use.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b21649fa-09ed-4c04-a52c-72db34235acc', '62d57f1e-cf21-4343-bd6b-86b90dd02e28', 'SPECIFICATIONS - Includes Activity Zone that targets specific muscle groups with LegSculptor and Total Body Trainer workouts. Has a 18-24 inch stride length that is electronically adjustable and contains 2 cup holders. Integrated moving arm features - multi-grip to enable choosing most comfortable hand grip. Max user weight is 400 pounds. Contains 20 electro-magnetic resistance levels.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fa3b2187-0d51-4319-a43d-c0c793271570', '62d57f1e-cf21-4343-bd6b-86b90dd02e28', 'The Go Console combines ease of use with a variety of engaging and motivating workout programs. Intuitive functionality with a simple, attractive design and eye-catching blue LCD screen makes it great for exercisers looking for a straightforward experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('710fcb66-a50e-4f36-91c3-107177138539', '63a6f12a-784a-4259-bfe5-d93db41b9712', 'HEAVY-DUTY FRAME: Confidently enjoy long-lasting climbing and striding sessions when you exercise on the steel climber frame that has a user weight limit of 260 lbs.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('48b761dc-027f-4918-92d8-fe5b0abe7d51', '63a6f12a-784a-4259-bfe5-d93db41b9712', 'CLIMB AND STEP: This versatile machine combines the best of stepping and striding in one intense movement. Climb to a vertical height of 9 inches and stride a horizontal distance of 5 inches.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9f258491-f814-4bb6-ae1d-7f480b200f8f', '63a6f12a-784a-4259-bfe5-d93db41b9712', 'SMOOTH OPERATION: Perfect for shared spaces, it has a smooth belt-drive mechanism that makes minimal noise during your workout. Engage the 14lb inertia-ready flywheel to perform challenging strides and climbs with ease.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ad2d01bd-a3c2-4fb4-ba2f-5849d0b4e608', '63a6f12a-784a-4259-bfe5-d93db41b9712', 'PULSE-SENSING GRIPS: Monitor how hard your work out when your measure your heart rate by grabbing onto the integrated pulse sensors, which can also be used for additional support while exercising.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a1947c4f-3e49-4a2a-ad82-84a05cb1678c', '63a6f12a-784a-4259-bfe5-d93db41b9712', 'PERFORMANCE MONITOR: Monitor your progress when you track your time, RPM, speed, distance, calories, and pulse. Packed with extra goal-oriented functions, it has a calendar, clock, and thermometer. Product dimensions- 44 L x 25 W x 64 H inches');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1d02a3e8-035b-407e-a7f2-18014ccf364d', '63a6f12a-784a-4259-bfe5-d93db41b9712', 'MAGNETIC RESISTANCE: The 8 levels of magnetic resistance make working out easy when you want it, hard when you need it. Switch up the intensity to boost or lower your challenge based on your comfort level.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('927097ac-cf5a-470d-ad08-4581c3e862c5', '63a6f12a-784a-4259-bfe5-d93db41b9712', 'BOTTLE HOLDER: Conveniently located at just an arm''s length away from hydration. Stay cool and refreshed with your favorite mid-workout beverage.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ae24b822-44f7-4466-b7a6-55f5c7e91b32', '63a6f12a-784a-4259-bfe5-d93db41b9712', 'TRANSPORTATION WHEELS: Enjoy a portable cardiovascular machine that can roll from room to room in your home for easy storage.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c0ad7490-9c3e-474d-b62e-a8ecf28f24d2', '75311a5c-81f8-4e8d-8d1e-61256883d4d2', 'Excellent Quality and Durability: Our elliptical exercise machine is manufactured using the highest quality materials to ensure stability and durability over long-term use. Every detail is carefully designed to provide you with the best exercise experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('edb4f988-43a8-4c81-994d-1a4066f3bd8d', '75311a5c-81f8-4e8d-8d1e-61256883d4d2', 'Joint-Friendly Exercise: Stair stepper workouts help prevent, alleviate, and relieve cervical spondylosis, shoulder periarthritis, and upper back pain. They also avoid the impact force generated during running, offering better joint protection and a higher safety factor.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('dd8e3504-a513-4796-97eb-3de2553c4a78', '75311a5c-81f8-4e8d-8d1e-61256883d4d2', 'Wide Applicability: Ellipse leg exercises are suitable for many people. For healthy individuals, they enhance fitness and improve physical condition. For those with knee and ankle joint issues, the impact on joints when walking or running often causes pain. Using an elliptical training machine is a safer and more comfortable option.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('afc0d92f-bd1b-434c-97ff-53221e456bb7', '75311a5c-81f8-4e8d-8d1e-61256883d4d2', 'Quiet and Non-Disruptive: Our ellipse by exercise employs advanced technology to ensure nearly silent operation during exercise, without disturbing your work or rest environment. This quiet design is particularly suitable for office or home use.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1c9fb5b0-b28a-46bb-befb-455315cdbd02', '75311a5c-81f8-4e8d-8d1e-61256883d4d2', 'Space-Saving Convenience: The seated pedal exerciser can easily fit under a desk or beside a chair without requiring additional space, making it ideal for home use. You can exercise while watching TV, reading, or working, saving time and space.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('13553461-cfdd-47f9-a116-4508123400fa', 'cec9cc57-9f78-499b-b140-1d066fd54c8e', 'A COMBINATION OF EFFECTIVENESS AND EASY-TO-USE FUNCTIONALITY The E1 Elliptical Cross-Trainer provides natural movement exercise, quiet operation and a premium look with eye-catching titanium finish');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('42956855-6dad-425d-af1d-c63dfda7d43b', 'cec9cc57-9f78-499b-b140-1d066fd54c8e', 'SMOOTH NATURAL MOTION Extensive biomechanical research is used to create a fluid motion with an elliptical path that feels natural and comfortable');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5ded26a1-f1d6-419d-af02-260fcf61e5d5', 'cec9cc57-9f78-499b-b140-1d066fd54c8e', 'WHISPERSTRIDE TECHNOLOGY Maintenance-free ball bearings reduce friction and ensure nearly silent operation, which is ideal for home use');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('612a707b-308a-43b3-95b5-4cb3544a01b5', 'cec9cc57-9f78-499b-b140-1d066fd54c8e', 'The Go Console combines ease of use with a variety of engaging and motivating workout programs and its intuitive functionality with a simple, attractive design and eye-catching blue LCD screen makes it great for exercisers looking for a straightforward experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9c5d3433-67b1-435f-95bb-78dc6cb7d9fa', '1086bcaf-b5ff-42bc-a78d-9439cba45a63', '【LOW-IMPACT FULL BODY WORKOUT】The Pedal Exerciser offers a low-impact, full-body workout with a smooth gliding motion that minimizes stress on joints, promoting healthy levels of calorie burn, cardiovascular health, and muscle toning.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('902d738d-f693-48a1-a70f-b41e1db81288', '1086bcaf-b5ff-42bc-a78d-9439cba45a63', '【FREE CONNECTED APP】 Enjoy FREE access to the SunnyFit App with every Sunny Health & Fitness product—no membership fees! Dive into 1,000+ trainer-led workouts, explore 10,000+ virtual scenic tours, track your progress, challenge others, and much more!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('241ceddc-dbdf-4852-9111-ba64631348b1', '1086bcaf-b5ff-42bc-a78d-9439cba45a63', '【QUIET AND SMOOTH】Enjoy a low-noise workout with our elliptical’s belt drive system and 15 levels of magnetic resistance. Ideal for solo sessions and family fitness, ensuring a quiet and smooth exercise experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2d42f87a-625d-49a0-a2b1-d6eb879bfb60', '1086bcaf-b5ff-42bc-a78d-9439cba45a63', '【EFFECTIVE CUSTOMIZABLE WORKOUT】Experience a dynamic workout with 15 levels of magnetic intensity, to suit your fitness needs. The 12-inch stride length ensures sufficient motion range for effective exercise, while the arm exerciser enables a comprehensive full-body workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c0a8d40f-aa60-4a22-9acf-7eeb3fb88857', '1086bcaf-b5ff-42bc-a78d-9439cba45a63', '【STURDY FRAME】This heavy-duty elliptical supports up to 300LB, featuring a robust build with industrial-grade Q235 material for long-lasting durability, ensuring a stable and safe workout experience every time.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('760b1d9f-403b-45b7-bc19-98247c78722c', '1086bcaf-b5ff-42bc-a78d-9439cba45a63', '【ULTIMATE COMFORT】Customizable foot pedals with an anti-slip design serves various body types for comfortable & effective workout. The ergonomic design & comfortable handle grip enhance your workout experience, providing stability and ease of use.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fefce743-67d7-4310-aa66-cf03559de21a', '1086bcaf-b5ff-42bc-a78d-9439cba45a63', '【DIGITAL MONITOR】The comprehensive digital performance monitor tracks time, speed, distance, calories, heart rate, target heart rate, and odometer, allowing you to train at your perfect intensity every workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b18cca54-c17d-4751-9fed-f8064a41cd8e', '1086bcaf-b5ff-42bc-a78d-9439cba45a63', '【CONVENIENCE AND EASE】Stay hydrated and entertained with the built-in bottle and device holder. The elliptical requires no plug for a seamless start. Move the elliptical effortlessly with built-in wheels for easy storage and placement.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('931b0494-354e-4d7c-a3bb-d9441a099156', '1086bcaf-b5ff-42bc-a78d-9439cba45a63', '【HASSLE-FREE ASSEMBLY】Easy setup with straightforward instructions, including a user manual, adjustment guide, and video tutorial. Sunny customer service is ready to assist, focusing on your fitness goals right away.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0d12449e-7961-4c37-b5b9-44ca5c95adfa', '1086bcaf-b5ff-42bc-a78d-9439cba45a63', '【20+ YEARS OF EXCELLENCE】 Sunny Health & Fitness, a U.S. company, offers top-quality equipment with a commitment to excellence. Our dedicated U.S. customer service team and certified trainers ensure a truly unmatched fit-for-everyone experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c8434cc0-0254-45cf-8fa9-9f7222349052', 'a1ccbc5b-9405-49bf-8969-396598f47ea3', '【95% Pre-Installed Assembly & Space-Saving】Elliptical trainer is designed to be 95% pre-assembled, making it incredibly easy for anyone to finish installation in just 30 minutes. Plus, when not in use, it can be quickly and easily folded up for compact storage, saving valuable space in your home. Perfect for busy individuals who want a convenient and effective workout solution.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('68d5c1b3-746c-4397-a24e-76e00b4a987a', 'a1ccbc5b-9405-49bf-8969-396598f47ea3', '【22 Levels of Adjustable Resistance for Every Fitness Level】Newly upgraded elliptical workout equipment features 22 levels of adjustable resistance, providing a challenging workout for every member of your family, no matter what their fitness level may be. From beginners to fitness enthusiasts, everyone can find a suitable resistance level to meet their needs. Go ahead and challenge yourself with the highest level of resistance on our elliptical machine!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3fab4d21-9ffe-4545-825f-d85be4c6b90d', 'a1ccbc5b-9405-49bf-8969-396598f47ea3', '【Large Monitor and Convenient Tablet Holder】Elliptical exercise equipment is designed with an easy-to-read LCD monitor that displays your Time, Speed, Distance, Calories Burned, Pulse Rate, and Scan. Additionally, pulse pads on the stationary handlebars allow for convenient heart rate monitoring during your workout. And for added convenience, we''ve included a tablet holder, so you can enjoy your favorite videos or music while exercising.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6a66d34c-bdb2-4c5b-b2f5-f3ac3a67b431', 'a1ccbc5b-9405-49bf-8969-396598f47ea3', '【Hyper Quiet Magnetic Drive System】YOUNGFIT elliptical exercise machine is designed with a magnetic resistance system that provides an unbelievably smooth and nearly silent workout experience. You can exercise indoors without worrying about disturbing your family or roommates, and the machine requires virtually no maintenance. Enjoy a peaceful and effective workout in the comfort of your own home.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('39d21fde-1128-4e8f-a043-6e05141e4bb3', 'a1ccbc5b-9405-49bf-8969-396598f47ea3', '【Full-Body Workout for Maximum Results】Our elliptical home gym equipment is designed to engage up to 90% of your body''s muscle groups, providing a full-body workout with every use. The smooth and natural motion of the elliptical fitness is ideal for working your legs, core, and arms, while burning a high number of calories. This makes it perfect for a wide range of fitness goals, including rehabilitative YFatment, weight loss, body shaping, sYFngth training, and more.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('81b8dab9-986a-4ee8-b2e1-2ef4562bfe15', '7b7c9148-a2a1-4b45-98c8-8a2da3e053ae', 'The Perfect Health Gift Choice: This ANCHEER under desk elliptical is an ideal home fitness companion, offering an easy way to stay active at home, especially suitable for seniors. With its lightweight design, simple operation, and safe, reliable construction, it helps improve circulation and joint flexibility. If you''re looking for a Christmas or birthday gifts for men, women, dad, mom, grandma, grandpa, or him/her, this is the perfect health gift');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f6e8c61f-e095-4ebf-873d-e181bbfe13d9', '7b7c9148-a2a1-4b45-98c8-8a2da3e053ae', 'Built-in Quiet and Stable Enhanced Flywheel: The ANCHEER under desk elliptical is equipped with an enhanced flywheel that ensures quiet and stable operation. Whether you''re at home or in the office, you can enjoy a noise-free workout experience without disturbing others'' rest or work');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('54010f32-7771-41c3-900a-8a72f90eb864', '7b7c9148-a2a1-4b45-98c8-8a2da3e053ae', 'Clear Display for Real-Time Workout Tracking: This ANCHEER ellipse leg exerciser as seen on tv that it features a built-in high-definition display that tracks and shows your workout data in real-time. Time, distance, speed, calories burned, and total laps are clearly displayed, helping you better monitor and adjust your exercise plan for optimal fitness results');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7d0e2810-4a98-4c64-bdac-7e9a5e5cf483', '7b7c9148-a2a1-4b45-98c8-8a2da3e053ae', 'Upgraded Dual-Mode Exercise Function: The ANCHEER under desk elliptical machine offers Auto Mode(P1-P12 modes for your choose) and Manual Mode (1-12 Speed levels & Pedal running direction can be adjusted). Light workouts or high-intensity training, this desk elliptical provides the appropriate exercise intensity. Equipped with a remote control, easy operation, controling any mode without bending over, workout experience hassle-freely and easily');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('01e53c65-5a77-4b8d-8d22-9722f2f01885', 'b200481c-f14f-4c47-bbce-a474f4bdc14c', 'Immersive 7-inch interactive HD touchscreen streams on-demand iFIT workouts directly to your equipment and provides easy stats tracking');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('495892b7-9eba-4bf3-9aca-d7050e3b565a', '7b7c9148-a2a1-4b45-98c8-8a2da3e053ae', 'Low Impact & Zero Pressure：This eclipse leg exerciser is designed with a low-impact and zero-pressure exercise mode, effectively reducing the strain on your joints. Whether for daily workouts or rehabilitation training, it provides a comfortable exercise experience. This makes it particularly suitable for users who need joint protection, especially good leg exerciser while sitting for seniors, allowing them to easily maintain your health');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3dfb3ce2-7fcb-448f-b48f-6122d370d470', '7b7c9148-a2a1-4b45-98c8-8a2da3e053ae', 'Compact and Portable with Fully Assembled: This electric foot pedal exercise machine is designed compact and portable, measuring just 17*15*9IN and weighing only 12LB, making it easy for seniors to move. And this elliptical stepper comes fully assembled and ready to use straight out of the box. Ideal for home, office, or any setting, it allows for convenient, anytime exercise');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('41a9492c-0c4a-4e80-add0-7a51cfff01d3', '7b7c9148-a2a1-4b45-98c8-8a2da3e053ae', '24/7 Customer Support: This seated elliptical includes a detailed user manual for easy operation and comes with a one-year warranty. Our 24/7 customer support team is always available to assist with any issues, ensuring a seamless and worry-free experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9819718d-f9f8-4bfb-a50f-fb5d2e0f3d00', '01c02699-ea82-4ba7-b206-98e4bc0b17c8', 'COMPUTERIZED RESISTANCE: Easily cycle between 16 levels of computerized resistance with a press of a button by using the on-console controls.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('469be240-83f3-454a-9917-327b3c906a6f', '01c02699-ea82-4ba7-b206-98e4bc0b17c8', 'PROGRAMS FOR FITNESS: Enjoy 24 presets that can power your fitness routine. Take advantage of the goal-oriented programs based on watt generation, BMI data, heart rate, and custom user values.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b725a8e8-6103-46bd-bce9-9a08c1847f74', '01c02699-ea82-4ba7-b206-98e4bc0b17c8', 'DEVICE HOLDER: Be in control of your workout entertainment when you place your favorite personal device on the built-in tablet holder. Combine this elliptical with your favorite workout videos and in-workout applications.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d69cb757-7d81-40d0-adbb-df652c5053c2', '01c02699-ea82-4ba7-b206-98e4bc0b17c8', 'MANUAL MODE: No electricity? No problem. This elliptical trainer can function without being plugged into a power source. When not plugged in, this elliptical exercise machine uses the last computerized resistance setting.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4116b16e-fb8f-4918-acfc-a22c7a9684f9', '01c02699-ea82-4ba7-b206-98e4bc0b17c8', 'PERFORMANCE MONITOR: Use the digital display to track time, distance, speed, calories burned, heart rate, wattage production, and rotations per minute.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e2eed867-b705-4bd0-bef8-f425d362c095', '531545cd-f6e1-48d6-9acb-1cd0ce922131', '【LOW IMPACT DESIGN】Our recumbent elliptical bike enhances cardio health and strength while safeguarding joints. Tailored for low impact, it ensures a smooth, engaging workout experience. Prioritize your fitness without compromising joint health.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('874a9e80-1a44-4231-ac65-04f3bcbb36e0', '531545cd-f6e1-48d6-9acb-1cd0ce922131', '【FULL-BODY EXERCISE】Engage multiple muscle groups effectively by utilizing both the moveable handles and elliptical-sized foot pedals. For a targeted burn and specific upper or lower body workouts, versatile fitness tailored to your needs.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('49d02c27-e575-4eb2-bdc4-b614df989eb0', '531545cd-f6e1-48d6-9acb-1cd0ce922131', '【MAGNETIC RESISTANCE】Experience ultimate control with our recumbent elliptical bike featuring 8 levels of smooth magnetic resistance. Easily adjust intensity for the perfect workout challenge tailored to your fitness goals.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('11faf5b8-51be-423d-8c6e-155d9aa40db7', '531545cd-f6e1-48d6-9acb-1cd0ce922131', '【SMOOTH & QUIET】Featuring a belt-drive mechanism, our recumbent elliptical bike exerciser ensures minimal friction and noise disturbance, allowing for undisturbed workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e97c1751-7e9e-4786-9c4b-63c150934163', '531545cd-f6e1-48d6-9acb-1cd0ce922131', '【FREE CONNECTED APP】 Enjoy FREE access to the SunnyFit App with every Sunny Health & Fitness product—no membership fees! Dive into 1,000+ trainer-led workouts, explore 10,000+ virtual scenic tours, track your progress, challenge others, and much more!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('47461906-5fe7-4665-8bd8-248014688c91', '531545cd-f6e1-48d6-9acb-1cd0ce922131', '【RIDE WITH COMFORT】Enjoy extra wide, cushioned, and adjustable seat. Non-slip handlebars and textured footplates keep you secure. Easy on-off design for hassle-free transitions. Minimal obstruction allows safe stepping through.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('379a73d9-518f-48d4-9322-d8d37d9fc4f4', '531545cd-f6e1-48d6-9acb-1cd0ce922131', '【DIGITAL MONITOR】Monitor your fitness journey with precision: time, speed, RPM, distance, calories, heart rate, and resistance on the digital monitor & pulse sensors on seat handlebars. Keep entertained by securing your device in the central holder.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('860186d0-26a3-46e9-8b02-bee2d9bdb1d3', '531545cd-f6e1-48d6-9acb-1cd0ce922131', '【EASY-TRANSPORTION】Our elliptical bike, weighing 86 LB and measuring 63" x 48" x 28.9", features effortlessly relocate your machine using user-friendly transportation wheels for convenient storage when not in use.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('435cf0c0-f68c-479b-937a-97a3ea9dff6f', '531545cd-f6e1-48d6-9acb-1cd0ce922131', '【SOLID BUILT】Utilize floor stabilizers for secure positioning during intense workouts. Made from premium alloy steel and durable plastic, our recumbent bike ensures reliable daily performance. 3-year warranty on structural frame & 180 days parts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5b539b88-9e2a-499c-98e8-d611bd601262', '531545cd-f6e1-48d6-9acb-1cd0ce922131', '【20+ Years Of Excellence】As a premier brand, Sunny Health & Fitness delivers top-notch equipment dedicated to excellence. With our devoted support team and certified trainers, enjoy an unmatched FIT FOR EVERYONE experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('90210e83-74b1-4431-ad63-062b9e351f38', 'f4197506-e368-4d01-94ec-2247b4301241', '🎁 🌟 The Ultimate Wellness Gift: Seniors'' Workouts Elliptical Trainer🌟 🎁');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('602efd36-b85f-4c3f-952a-1cf78e4bd933', 'f4197506-e368-4d01-94ec-2247b4301241', '🚶‍♂️Elevate Cardiovascular Health for Your Loved Ones**: Seniors'' Workouts presents the perfect under-desk elliptical, specially tailored for the elderly and those in leg rehabilitation. This low-intensity exercise not only burns calories and strengthens muscles but also aids in quick leg adaptation and recovery.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('730eb2bb-61b9-4d8c-bb2f-b21d73731527', 'f4197506-e368-4d01-94ec-2247b4301241', '🔇Silent Exercise for Anytime Enjoyment: Crafted with a steel flywheel and a noiseless friction pad, Yolid''s ellipse leg exerciser provides a silent exercise experience. Easily integrate it into your daily routine—whether working, watching TV, or reading—without disrupting your family or colleagues.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('838f51a0-bd93-40b9-a302-b6f85a3a10d1', 'f4197506-e368-4d01-94ec-2247b4301241', '📊 Real-Time Monitoring with Digital Display: The Yolid elliptical comes equipped with a digital display screen, offering insights into time, speed, distance, and calories burned during your elliptical training sessions. Take control of your fitness journey with real-time data mastery.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b7764b73-151b-4d19-99e2-0879e765a1b2', 'f4197506-e368-4d01-94ec-2247b4301241', '🏋️‍♂️Tailored Movement Options for Every Need: Seniors'' Workouts elliptical trainer offers Auto mode (P1, P2, and P3 modes) and Manual mode (5-levels speed) to suit your preferences and abilities. Pedals can move forward or backward, targeting different muscle groups. Note: Designed for seated use.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b1fc0772-b2d0-4fa1-92a0-7faffb331807', 'f4197506-e368-4d01-94ec-2247b4301241', '🏥 Post-Surgery Rehabilitation Ally: Ideal for post-surgery patients, our elliptical aids in breaking down fascial adhesions, expediting post-surgery recovery. Gentle, low-impact exercise promotes blood circulation, flexibility, and comfort.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d11f00e3-4c29-4830-aae3-974404e60e23', 'f4197506-e368-4d01-94ec-2247b4301241', '👨‍⚕️ Personalized Recovery Plans for Optimal Healing: With Yolid''s elliptical, enjoy a personalized recovery journey tailored to different stages of rehabilitation. Gradually increase intensity safely, ensuring a progressive and secure rehabilitation process.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e855d802-acbf-43a1-9de1-9d45dd5b6fa0', '56c9b542-79a0-46a6-8aa0-67c732446314', '【For Life After-Sales Service】Everyone who owns an under desk elliptical machine can enjoy a 30-day return policy and permanent after-sales service. For any questions about the seated elliptical, you can contact us through Amazon messages.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1ed0d816-e0db-4998-9950-39a5659d57f4', 'f4197506-e368-4d01-94ec-2247b4301241', '🌈 YOLID Lifetime After-Sales Service: Choose Yolid with confidence, backed by our lifetime after-sales service. Every owner enjoys a three-month return service and lifelong support. Contact us through Amazon messages and emails for any inquiries about your seated elliptical.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e2538f18-dbb5-4948-bc9a-3cd7a19137ab', 'f4197506-e368-4d01-94ec-2247b4301241', 'Upgrade your wellness journey effortlessly with Seniors'' Workouts—where innovation meets ease.🌐💪');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5a745054-20e7-4d06-80f9-f6ebe6edf69e', 'c254f608-5984-45bc-8532-779e64f5b9e4', 'Precor Cross Ramp technology adjusts the shape of the elliptical path your feet travel so you can target specific muscles');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d16daec8-2aed-4cd8-aede-8e28a6fb2425', 'c254f608-5984-45bc-8532-779e64f5b9e4', 'Patented elliptical path perfectly mimics a natural running stride, allowing exercisers to keep their heels down and maintain proper biometrics');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9d629497-f6b4-4ad7-a7dc-75e810c6ea85', 'c254f608-5984-45bc-8532-779e64f5b9e4', '10 preset workouts help you stay challenged; built-in Work Out Accelerators suggest ways to get more out of your workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('74636aac-55d0-4de8-a351-92ab45586f28', 'c254f608-5984-45bc-8532-779e64f5b9e4', 'Use the console''s headphone jack and on-screen volume control to safely & securely listen to music from your own player');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6e4b1ac3-1d56-48a9-b840-143f4c8f208e', 'c254f608-5984-45bc-8532-779e64f5b9e4', 'Touch sensor and wireless heart rate monitoring; works with any Polar-compatible wireless heart rate transmitter (sold separately)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('709b13a5-3d8d-4567-8650-890fcbb677d9', '7fa25234-fecc-47e5-b378-cbb9c8db6959', 'Light-commercial Grade Ellipticals: The precision-engineered magnetic system delivers an ultra-smooth elliptical exercise; The 15.5-inch natural stride minimizes knee stress, accommodates heights up to 6''4"; The extreme comfort makes sticking to your workout routine a breeze; With every step, you''ll be encouraged to stride even further');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b7e3845a-9c5d-4ebf-8af6-040bc85fed3f', '7fa25234-fecc-47e5-b378-cbb9c8db6959', 'Ultra-silent Magnetic Drive: The internal magnetic drive system provides an exercise experience even quieter than breathing; Whether it''s early morning or late at night, your workout will never disturb your neighbors or family''s sleep, and it won''t interfere with your enjoyment of music and TV shows');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f6825410-b45d-47ab-8463-59c5b16841da', '7fa25234-fecc-47e5-b378-cbb9c8db6959', 'Built with Gym Quality: The 100LBS mainframe provides secure support for users up to 400LBS; The sturdy construction and premium materials are aimed at long-term durability, accompanying you on your journey to becoming a better version of yourself');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d0e33dc9-fa9f-4cae-903d-dd2f11588b42', '7fa25234-fecc-47e5-b378-cbb9c8db6959', '16 Dynamic Resistance Levels: The magnetic drive system and 16LBS flywheel ensure stable tension output; Whether you aim for cardio or weight loss, the 16 challenging resistance levels allow you to find the excellent exercise resistance for your needs; Gear up to embrace a more vibrant you');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c36a69ec-be0d-429e-86a2-e02655cc2bc2', '7fa25234-fecc-47e5-b378-cbb9c8db6959', 'Record Your Progress: The digital monitor tracks 5 key data including TIME, SPEED, DISTANCE, CALORIES, and PULSE, every step is in your mind');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e64a3f68-2620-4377-b770-d451ea686fbf', '7fa25234-fecc-47e5-b378-cbb9c8db6959', 'Effortless 10% Assembly: The Niceday elliptical machine comes 90% pre-assembled and includes all the necessary tools; Guided by a detailed user manual and installation video, you can complete the setup within just 20 minutes; Kickstart your elliptical workout with ease');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d09f6958-c867-443a-866b-6ccd8cfa280c', '7fa25234-fecc-47e5-b378-cbb9c8db6959', 'Customized Size for Home: The compact design allows it to fit into any corner of your house; Handy transport wheels enable you to move it to any location; No need for any electric power source, simply place it in your preferred exercise spot and start working out');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('81c6d128-5b66-4cf9-9a41-9b4c78a6b001', '7fa25234-fecc-47e5-b378-cbb9c8db6959', 'Lifelong Service: Niceday guarantees a lifelong service for all products and offers free replacement of all accessories; Our devoted customer service team pledges to respond within 12 hours, don''t hesitate to reach out to us with your needs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('aee12803-b8f9-42c4-a578-10b730f22d99', '04da8f94-acbb-4040-85ac-e8cac165ba11', 'HIGH SPEED: The Me-Mover Speed PRO combines high speed with incredible stability. If you are looking to travel fast and further the Speed PRO will be the right companion.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b24dc837-e6ed-42e1-8aca-95ebcd6437a6', '04da8f94-acbb-4040-85ac-e8cac165ba11', 'LOW IMPACT ON JOINTS: A great alternative to running by offering intense exercise with lower impact (acceleration forces) on the joints and tendons. Ideal for both rehabilitating and preventive purposes to sport injuries.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('52a13931-1c03-42e6-bb4d-42115dded3d7', '04da8f94-acbb-4040-85ac-e8cac165ba11', 'BURN UP TO 50% MORE CALORIES: The Me-Mover will give you an almost full-body outdoor workout. The upright position offers ergonomic mobility with a motion resembling a mix of skiing and running - ideal for your mind and body. Get all the benefits of activating 6 major muscle groups combined with the low impact on joints, reducing the usual risk of sports injuries. Training Cardio, Core and Caloric burn has never been so fun and efficient.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4beb33b2-29cf-4cdd-9b01-e961483124b2', '04da8f94-acbb-4040-85ac-e8cac165ba11', 'RECOVER & REGAIN: Me-Mover will assist a faster recovery and help you regain balance, strength and stability. The upright position and low impact on joints delivers freedom to move and build muscles for recovering injuries or weaknesses in back, knees, hips, and ankles. On the Me-Mover you will be able to mind your training and get back in shape.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4ea9533e-04f0-4e37-ae29-1d90b8960455', '04da8f94-acbb-4040-85ac-e8cac165ba11', 'BOOST YOUR PERFORMANCE: And reduce risk of sports-injuries – Research has found that using the Me-Mover helps to build resistance against acute or stress-related injuries.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('dcdbbbb2-a46c-4881-b51a-3fca2b52cf0c', '04da8f94-acbb-4040-85ac-e8cac165ba11', 'FOLDING MECHANISM: The easy folding mechanism allows you to bring the Me-Mover along for your trips by train, car or plane.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('098a4f7d-9a6c-4cfd-8794-b626c9f3d03a', '56c9b542-79a0-46a6-8aa0-67c732446314', '【Portable and Easy to Use】The YOUNGFIT Leg Exercise Machine redefines fitness flexibility with its built-in wheels and telescopic handle. Easily move and store it in any space, whether you''re at home or in the office. Staying active has never been easier!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b76dd2d4-39e5-4177-852d-83e72abeb74e', '56c9b542-79a0-46a6-8aa0-67c732446314', '【Low-Intensity Workout】Our elliptical exercise machine under desk provides a low-intensity workout ideal for seniors and office workers. It promotes better blood circulation, improves cardiovascular health, and strengthens muscles, all without putting excessive strain on your joints. Make this YOUNGFIT leg exerciser while sitting the perfect fitness present for yourself or a parent or grandparent.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a52db27c-a782-49e3-a4f2-9e4c1a3f5839', '56c9b542-79a0-46a6-8aa0-67c732446314', '【Customizable Fitness Journey】With the FITSHOW APP, you can easily control and track your workout data. The legxercise pro machine for seniors on sale is customizable for a personalized workout, whether you''re targeting endurance, mobility, or weight loss. YOUNGFIT adapts to your fitness journey, helping you achieve your goals.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a28eebaf-c3ab-45cd-ac58-417b66d785b2', '56c9b542-79a0-46a6-8aa0-67c732446314', '【Versatile and User-Friendly】The leg exerciser offers multiple workout modes while sitting. In HA mode, you can manually adjust the direction (forward and reverse) and speed (1-5 levels) using the remote control. The P1/P2/P3 modes come with pre-set programs, that automatically adjust the running speed and direction. Please do not stand on the foot pedal exercise machine.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a20f3113-5051-4cf7-9ac8-1ee066191ae5', '56c9b542-79a0-46a6-8aa0-67c732446314', '【Full Body Workout】In addition to working out your legs, the YOUNGFIT electric under desk bike pedal exerciser comes with 2.2 lbs dumbbells. This allows you to exercise your arms, shoulders, and chest, providing a full-body workout experience. Train your upper body while working out your legs, maximizing the benefits of your exercise routine. Note that the machine is 98% pre-assembled, so you can be up and running in just 10 minutes.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ca5cb817-9b32-40c5-bffc-f8b9a718359d', 'c70f9f34-2ab2-4b00-be4f-5469636eb338', '【Maintain Physical Activity】Chained to your desk all day? Legs feeling like rusty hinges? Say hello to our new ellipse leg exerciser! Perfect for desk jockeys, seniors, and anyone looking to get their legs back in the game. Now you can give those muscles a workout and get your blood pumping while you crunch numbers, dive into a book, gab with friends, watch TV, or scroll through social media. Multitasking just got a healthy upgrade');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('50f69936-2aa6-4046-8e26-a731da6c096f', 'c70f9f34-2ab2-4b00-be4f-5469636eb338', '【12 Adjustable Speed】Get ready to take control of your workout! elliptical exercise machine isn''t just a one-trick pony - it''s got manual mode plus 12 pre-programmed options to keep things interesting. Want to switch things up? No sweat! Pedal forward or backward to give different muscle groups some love. And here''s the kicker: we''ve thrown in a remote control so you can tweak the speed and direction on the fl');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e227b508-f45c-43fa-9f7a-e0a57f2f223b', 'c70f9f34-2ab2-4b00-be4f-5469636eb338', '【Silent & Grip & Portable】ANCHEER under desk elliptical features advanced noise-reduction technology, enabling discreet exercise at any time without disturbing colleagues or family members. This pedal exerciser quiet performance allows users to maintain their fitness regimen while respecting others'' concentration. Additionally, The legxercise is heavy enough to stay in place when in use but light enough to grab and move using the integrated handle');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('eb5a64f3-eee2-4589-a35f-a718ec939414', 'c70f9f34-2ab2-4b00-be4f-5469636eb338', '【Package Description】 When your package arrives, you’ll receive: an FCC-certified exercise equipment for home, one power cord, one remote control, one product manual, and a free cleaning and maintenance kit. The leg exerciser while sitting for seniors comes ready to use. Just plug in the power cord and you''re all set to start working out.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e906406f-0e84-40ab-8246-7dcd3463f2f6', 'c70f9f34-2ab2-4b00-be4f-5469636eb338', '【ANCHEER Service】At ANCHEER, we''re committed to enhancing your lifestyle through our innovative products. Our growth is inseparable from your understanding and feedback. We welcome any questions or concerns you may have, our dedicated support team is always ready to assist you. Your satisfaction is our priority');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a961622a-edfa-4793-9c6b-0cb4842c7246', '1e1c7ed4-54cf-4529-8260-538870279992', 'MULTI-TASK: Our premium quality under desk bike pedal exerciser can help you burn calories, boost your energy level, increase productivity and reduce stress as you work.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('04e61839-3c5c-4868-ae17-724fa77ecbe0', '1e1c7ed4-54cf-4529-8260-538870279992', 'MAGNETIC RESISTANCE: This compact elliptical exercise machine has ultra-smooth magnetic resistance, a superior flywheel and a sturdy base. It''s whisper quiet, so you''ll never bother those around you.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4c724c0e-5ad9-4ec2-bbbf-f7b95395d5fc', '1e1c7ed4-54cf-4529-8260-538870279992', 'EASY TO USE: Large 6-Function LCD display tracks revolutions, RPM, time, calories burned and more. For easy reading, remove the display from under the desk and set it up on your table with the included display stand.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('25f94001-b3b6-45f7-a24b-472dadb8c04c', '1e1c7ed4-54cf-4529-8260-538870279992', 'BUILD UP STRENGTH: Choose from 8 different resistance levels, from very easy to really hard! This seated elliptical machine is the perfect leg exercise bike for seniors, physical therapy, or anyone who wants to get more active.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5f5feb78-3510-4883-958a-8a415a9623da', '1e1c7ed4-54cf-4529-8260-538870279992', 'SWITCH IT UP: Extra long and wide pedals allow you to adjust the shape of your elliptical motion by where you place your feet; place them on top of the pedal to maximize up/down movement, or towards the bottom for more horizontal strides.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b13d4749-12db-41a9-ba10-024b06ba280c', '6e2835cc-44ee-435f-b250-a1fe94325d67', 'INDUSTRY LEADER: For 30+ years, Body Solid has held the widest array of products designed to meet the demands of the ever-changing fitness industry (home gym, free weight machines, treadmills, bikes, ellipticals, weight plates, kettlebells, dumbbells, flooring, accessories and more). Our products are cutting edge and reliable and are built for LifeYour Life');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4e3412bc-0a6b-4bec-b86f-1186dafca0b4', '6e2835cc-44ee-435f-b250-a1fe94325d67', 'TOTAL BODY WORKOUT MACHINE: The eliptical trainer Body-Solid cross trainer provides cardio training without impact in a very compact space. This elliptical uses synchronized arms that engage your upper body with your legs in the workout routine, providing a smooth, calorie-burning, full-body cardio workout. This elliptical has an adjustable 17-21 stride to ensure the best fit for all users.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1a2305e6-ab1e-4304-9263-f1ea3e549464', '6e2835cc-44ee-435f-b250-a1fe94325d67', '20 LEVELS MAGNETIC RESISTANCE: This elliptical Crosstrainer offers twenty levels of gentle magnetic resistance that simulates a running/stair climbing motion to tone and strengthen your legs while getting your heart rate up. This machine also programmable with six preset programs, five heart-rate programs, manual mode and two user profiles.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2fb2b453-5535-4a36-b3f8-eefe6a5f26ca', '6e2835cc-44ee-435f-b250-a1fe94325d67', 'BUILT IN LCD DISPLAY: The Body-Solid Crosstrainer Elliptical Machine features a user-friendly LED console on the front of the machine that makes it easy for you to keep track of your workout time, distance, speed, calories, and heart rate. This elliptical also features a wireless HRC (heart-rate control) with a chest strap that keeps users in their target zones.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1ec74267-29a7-4447-aa40-c29fddd073bf', '6e2835cc-44ee-435f-b250-a1fe94325d67', 'DIMENSIONS: This Elliptical Machine dimensions is 68"L x 31"W x 69"H and weighs 249lbs. Transport wheels allow the elliptical exerciser to be moved easily from room to room. Body-Solid offers a 15-year manufacturer''s warranty on the frame, 3 years on parts, 2 years on electronics and 1 year on labour.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7c18f7ac-d53d-437d-941d-91691634856c', '70e80b09-422d-4c03-8f31-cc3e9f5aeb6f', '[Smooth & Silent Operation]: The Bifanuo Under Desk Elliptical features ultra-smooth and quiet rollers, allowing you to exercise without disturbing others. Whether pedaling clockwise or counterclockwise, you can maintain a tranquil work or home atmosphere while benefiting from a great workout. Integrate exercise seamlessly into your daily routine');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('36d576b6-68bf-491c-b4db-cf018789cd51', '70e80b09-422d-4c03-8f31-cc3e9f5aeb6f', '[Joint-Friendly Exercise]: No matter if you are a working person, an elderly person or someone in need of rehabilitation, this under desk elliptical exercise machine is the perfect leg exerciser to relax your leg muscles and improve blood circulation. Providing a low-impact workout that aids in improving mobility. Ideal as a gift for friends, parents or grandparents. Enjoy a healthier lifestyle together with family and friends!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('11e2d3b9-3576-4d32-a342-3af2148c8f95', '70e80b09-422d-4c03-8f31-cc3e9f5aeb6f', '[Versatile Display and Adjustable Resistance]: The easy-to-read display shows 7 different data modes to keep you motivated. The adjustable knob allows you to customize the exercise intensity with 8 resistance levels to match your fitness goals. Whether you’re a beginner or an experienced user, whether you''re aiming for a slow burn or a quick workout, this elliptical caters to everyone''s needs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a7c84c98-e172-4ce3-a24a-4e643af6b424', '70e80b09-422d-4c03-8f31-cc3e9f5aeb6f', '[Portable and Hassle-Free Setup]: Say goodbye to complicated setups! The Bifanuo Under Desk Elliptical Machine is lightweight and requires no assembly—just unbox and start exercising! Its no electricity required ensures you can use it anywhere. Compact design for easy storage. Making it the perfect addition to your home or office');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0bd89bd5-d914-4617-acf5-9193e7963571', '70e80b09-422d-4c03-8f31-cc3e9f5aeb6f', '[Lifetime customer service]: Enjoy a worry-free purchase with Lifetime customer service and 24-hour after-sales support.If you have any questions about the Bifanuo ellipse leg exerciser, please contact us and we will get back to you within 24 hours');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bc9c207f-13c3-4751-8aa4-07973d5619f5', 'b200481c-f14f-4c47-bbce-a474f4bdc14c', 'Bring Home Interactive Personal Training powered by iFIT; 30 days iFIT membership included; Access live, studio, and global workouts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c486d885-906f-4fc1-871c-d2c504683a6a', 'b200481c-f14f-4c47-bbce-a474f4bdc14c', '159 kg User Capacity, Warranty - 5-Year Frame Warranty, 2-Year Parts and Labour Warranty, subject to registration within 28 days of purchase.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('afa9119f-ed77-4f53-a0bf-392887891fb4', '69111421-eb6d-4ddc-97a6-df9c99f1c5aa', '【COMPLETE BODY WORKOUT COMBO】The 2-IN-1 Stepper engages your glutes, quads, hamstrings, and calves with step-ups and downs, while the integrated arm resistance bands simultaneously challenge your biceps, triceps, shoulders, and core.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d19d72ec-928d-4d34-bc6f-21a979f8b29a', '69111421-eb6d-4ddc-97a6-df9c99f1c5aa', '【TRACK YOUR FITNESS】Stay informed and motivated with our digital monitor, displaying essential metrics including Time, Calories burned, Steps Per Minute (SPM), and Count. Track your progress in real-time and stay on target with your fitness goals.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('774ac4d0-d024-4e1b-a74d-2028f510a75c', '69111421-eb6d-4ddc-97a6-df9c99f1c5aa', '【CUSTOMIZABLE WORKOUT EXPERIENCE】Tailor your workout to your desired intensity using the adjustable hydraulic step height. Additionally, you can personalize your arm workout with the included bands. Achieve a full-body workout for any fitness level.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('55e9ff90-a8fe-4de7-95a7-dd4643fc7c19', '69111421-eb6d-4ddc-97a6-df9c99f1c5aa', '【SMOOTH AND QUIET STEPPING MOTION】Experience the smooth, quiet, and low-noise operation of two hydraulic cylinders, delivering consistent and reliable intensity while ensuring peace. Each step on the stepper is both comfortable & controlled.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('411748de-15ad-47ef-9489-8435407a9d38', '69111421-eb6d-4ddc-97a6-df9c99f1c5aa', '【COMPREHENSIVE LCD MONITOR】Easily track step count, time elapsed, calories burned, and total count on the user-friendly LCD display. Stay informed, set goals, and stay motivated during your fitness journey.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('dc750a80-6f20-4fc0-a924-04b94b45435f', '69111421-eb6d-4ddc-97a6-df9c99f1c5aa', '【HASSLE-FREE ASSEMBLY】90% pre-assembly, the stepper requires minimal effort to put together. Just attach the resistance bands and you''re ready to start stepping. Save time and avoid assembly frustration with the easy user-friendly design.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d72c6256-e79e-4a6c-9f1a-1f78feb6c6bf', '69111421-eb6d-4ddc-97a6-df9c99f1c5aa', '【SAFE & SECURE DESIGN】Non-slip pedals provide a stable footing to prevent slips or missteps. The sturdy frame also guarantees workout stability and focus on your exercise, not balance. Maximum user weight capacity: 220 LB.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bf7a6f95-897a-4739-875f-ec8a6dcdc684', '69111421-eb6d-4ddc-97a6-df9c99f1c5aa', '【Sunny Health & Fitness Commitment】A top fitness brand for 20+ years, offers superior products and a dedication to excellence. Count on our committed customer service and trainers for the best fitness experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ad1f7c67-e6e1-4e6a-a1fd-3d5e67c499e4', '3c57b09c-7f4d-4fba-8006-883fbe6249f1', 'Exercise Programs: Cross Training (3), Cross Country, Fitness Test, Gluteal (2), Interval, Hill Climb, Manual, Weight Loss, and Custom');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('279819db-e072-4718-a122-b4a4fb7497c1', '3c57b09c-7f4d-4fba-8006-883fbe6249f1', 'Cross Ramp: 15 to 40 degrees (adjustable)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ad5806b8-1a76-4b4c-8787-c8922c635bc8', '3c57b09c-7f4d-4fba-8006-883fbe6249f1', 'Stride Lengths: 21.2 to 24.7 inches');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('966e54db-b914-4a1f-9413-c1ec86debf5a', '3c57b09c-7f4d-4fba-8006-883fbe6249f1', 'Resistance: 20 Levels (18-720 watts)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d24cda82-16e3-4c00-bfaa-0933c9ed0169', '3c57b09c-7f4d-4fba-8006-883fbe6249f1', 'Heart Rate Monitor: Touch and Wireless Capabilities (Chest Strap Not Included)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b9ab675c-41f5-4e09-a0f1-013d3e553c67', '1067aa6f-6c02-4704-b41e-698886be016c', '【30-Minute Assembly & Space-Saving】Our elliptical trainer is designed to be 90% pre-assembled, making it incredibly easy for anyone to finish installation in just 30 minutes. Plus, when not in use, it can be quickly and easily folded up for compact storage, saving valuable space in your home. Perfect for busy individuals who want a convenient and effective workout solution.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ca529700-8aa5-4c5e-a66d-dce2a3772a44', '1067aa6f-6c02-4704-b41e-698886be016c', '【22 Levels of Adjustable Resistance for Every Fitness Level】Our newly upgraded elliptical workout equipment features 22 levels of adjustable resistance, providing a challenging workout for every member of your family, no matter what their fitness level may be. From beginners to fitness enthusiasts, everyone can find a suitable resistance level to meet their needs. Go ahead and challenge yourself with the highest level of resistance on our elliptical machine!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bc193d43-b019-4209-ab3a-c23363676cc9', '1067aa6f-6c02-4704-b41e-698886be016c', '【Hyper Quiet Magnetic Drive System】Our YOUNGFIT elliptical exercise machine is designed with a magnetic resistance system that provides an unbelievably smooth and nearly silent workout experience. You can exercise indoors without worrying about disturbing your family or roommates, and the machine requires virtually no maintenance. Enjoy a peaceful and effective workout in the comfort of your own home.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5bb678dc-da53-4028-ada7-b4e83f2c16f8', '1067aa6f-6c02-4704-b41e-698886be016c', '【Large Monitor and Convenient Tablet Holder】Our elliptical exercise equipment is designed with an easy-to-read LCD monitor that displays your Time, Speed, Distance, Calories Burned, Pulse Rate, and Scan. Additionally, pulse pads on the stationary handlebars allow for convenient heart rate monitoring during your workout. And for added convenience, we''ve included a tablet holder, so you can enjoy your favorite videos or music while exercising.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bccec41a-48f0-4cb9-b204-586d41f297c4', '1067aa6f-6c02-4704-b41e-698886be016c', '【Full-Body Workout for Maximum Results】Our elliptical home gym equipment is designed to engage up to 90% of your body''s muscle groups, providing a full-body workout with every use. The smooth and natural motion of the elliptical fitness is ideal for working your legs, core, and arms, while burning a high number of calories. This makes it perfect for a wide range of fitness goals, including rehabilitative treatment, weight loss, body shaping, strength training, and more.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('eaf5ebe4-5f08-41b1-949c-dfe7a7fc3739', '869f1681-676d-4d08-846f-8c65d3f2fed4', 'Made by Precor, the creator of the elliptical category');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('975e3757-35bc-421d-b9a1-1ecfdfdab2fb', '869f1681-676d-4d08-846f-8c65d3f2fed4', 'Adjustable Cross Ramp that changes the incline angle from 10-35 degrees');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('75ff24a7-6c46-4039-99ea-933bcde2e15b', '869f1681-676d-4d08-846f-8c65d3f2fed4', 'Fixed handlebars');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('31604583-5fb6-4d7d-9206-330695c370a8', '869f1681-676d-4d08-846f-8c65d3f2fed4', 'P30 console that includes an LED display with eBay-to-use-motion controls');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9e83b3ad-e632-46ba-9ca9-1df9a88f587a', '869f1681-676d-4d08-846f-8c65d3f2fed4', 'Self-powered commercial elliptical, part of the Experience Series cardio family');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d160c808-f616-46dc-8e53-79a448fee31c', 'cb8863c2-90a6-45ec-ad2d-82a93aefff74', '【Silent and Smooth Magnetic Drive】 The YAMO elliptical exercise machine is engineered with precision. Its magnetic system delivers a quiet and smooth workout experience, allowing you to focus on your training anytime without worrying about disturbing your family or neighbors.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bda59766-abd5-4b7e-a289-f9e0e07dccdf', 'cb8863c2-90a6-45ec-ad2d-82a93aefff74', '【8 Levels of Adjustable Resistance】 This elliptical machine features a 16LBS flywheel, providing ample and stable resistance. Eight adjustable resistance levels cater to the varying training stages of you and your family''s fitness journey.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4fa442f9-d113-4099-a865-d04c1e88a5de', 'cb8863c2-90a6-45ec-ad2d-82a93aefff74', '【Real-Time Data Tracking】 The multifunctional LCD display tracks time, speed, distance, calories, RPM, and pulse, allowing you to instantly grasp your exercise data and devise a more rational training plan.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('40d191f5-ffa9-451b-85d3-752464913fa0', 'cb8863c2-90a6-45ec-ad2d-82a93aefff74', '【Ergonomic Design】 The movement path of our elliptical machine is designed based on ergonomics. Every movement you make on it feels as comfortable and natural as walking, minimizing the stress on your joints.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('05aa5e1e-504e-48ae-801f-b34a4cbf711b', 'cb8863c2-90a6-45ec-ad2d-82a93aefff74', '【Suitable for Most Users】 With dimensions of 53 in × 24 in × 63 in, our elliptical trainer is suitable for users ranging from 5 ft to 6.2 ft in height. It is sturdy and durable, capable of supporting up to 300 LBS.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ff81c4db-5316-4d97-9b50-d11c98da71b8', 'c36d0247-a5bc-42c1-b84e-f160238dd7d8', '【WHISPER QUIET OPERATION】- This home office treadmill operates very quietly. Ensuring you can work, take calls, or concentrate without any disruptive noise interference.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c7e73d90-0c70-436b-95cf-ccb40f53cb94', 'cb8863c2-90a6-45ec-ad2d-82a93aefff74', '【Easy Assembly】 The YAMO elliptical training machine comes 90% pre-assembled. With a detailed user manual and all necessary installation tools included in the package, you can easily assemble the machine fully within 30 minutes.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('81e9cc68-32e4-4321-9b0a-c0ccb70ced99', 'd0ab841d-db0f-4e21-a07a-a8f491748426', '【2 IN 1 & AUTO OR MANUAL MODES】PUTNEN ellipse leg exercise has Manual (12-level speed) & Auto mode (P1-P3) for your choice. Pedals can move forward or backward. Adjust the speed to achieve the results you need, including strengthening your legs, exercising your body etc. Effectively exercise multiple muscle groups to help you achieve your fitness goals.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c6644495-99fb-46a6-a17b-bcd276c6ae13', 'd0ab841d-db0f-4e21-a07a-a8f491748426', '【LOW-IMPACT & ZERO PRESSURE】Under desk elliptical machine is ideal for sedentary office workers, seniors with leg discomfort, and individuals undergoing leg rehabilitation. PUTNEN elliptical exercise machine''s scientific motion trajectory design helps stimulate blood circulation, strengthen lower body muscles, and enhance joint flexibility.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4055fbe9-e1db-4b0d-a7c4-ec0f0adacfc4', 'd0ab841d-db0f-4e21-a07a-a8f491748426', '【SILENT EXERCISE & EASY TO MOVE】Elliptical exercise machine features a silent wheel and advanced sound-dampening technology, so it is working quietly without disturbing others, making it ideal for home and office use. Its compact design and portable features allow you to exercise anytime, anywhere.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('936cd095-6e94-48a3-89f5-a1bbce1a6198', 'd0ab841d-db0f-4e21-a07a-a8f491748426', '【LCD DISPLAY & REMOTE CONTROL】PUTNEN portable under desk elliptical with the LCD display, you can track speed, distance, counter, time and calories in real time. Pedal exerciser for seniors feature with thoughtful remote control allows you to change mode without bending over, reducing strain on your back.(Due to logistics reasons, the remote control is not equipped with batteries, you need to buy it separately)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('74026be6-2511-4e61-b42a-c561b2382887', 'd0ab841d-db0f-4e21-a07a-a8f491748426', '【LIFETIME AFTER-SALES SERVICE】PUTNEN lifetime after-sales service - everyone who owns a under desk elliptical machine can enjoy a three-month return service and lifetime after-sales service, and you can contact us through Amazon messages and emails for questions about ellipse leg exerciser.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2f8961e3-a353-4557-afef-0a7001bbcfd2', '64865a5f-55d4-49f6-aec3-c7c725c51354', 'Patented adjustable CrossRamp technology allows you to alter the height of the elliptical path');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ce1b9493-375d-43f8-8ce0-062410750a87', '64865a5f-55d4-49f6-aec3-c7c725c51354', 'Patented, low-impact EFX motion is smooth and natural');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e0f8346f-a95d-4b65-9005-a433d7e28f9c', '64865a5f-55d4-49f6-aec3-c7c725c51354', 'Touch and telemetry heart rate monitoring');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bf58d0e1-eb15-4ce9-99cd-fdcc69b66e19', '64865a5f-55d4-49f6-aec3-c7c725c51354', 'Fixed handlebars provide focuses workout on lower body');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('32c7a535-d821-4757-9feb-21f6a035f631', '64865a5f-55d4-49f6-aec3-c7c725c51354', 'Dimensions: 85 by 32 by 44 inches (L x W x H); weighs 338 pounds');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('de1c1bb7-99e9-4456-a53f-d3ba1b2ece84', 'a78b7e46-f15a-4a7d-9425-6bdf6014a50d', '【AUTO & ManualTwo Modes】Electric two motion modes: automatic mode (P1-P12) and manual mode ; Two control methods: by pressing the LED display button control; Wireless remote control without bending over;(Automatic program state to press the remote control, can not adjust the time, speed; You need to set it to manual mode to adjust it.)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('22940f47-3022-4fc0-8619-d706d431196b', 'a78b7e46-f15a-4a7d-9425-6bdf6014a50d', '【Electric & Manual 2 IN 1】 In Active Mode, operate without plugging in, relying on leg force for power, delivering an effective leg workout.In Passive Mode, when plugged in, control speed and direction via remote for a varied workout experience.burn calories, and strengthen muscles; innovative pedal straps prevent slipping, making it an ideal choice for seniors and those in leg rehabilitation');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('abf1f64f-00e4-4f9f-bce0-e10f44a7e5b3', 'a78b7e46-f15a-4a7d-9425-6bdf6014a50d', '【Intelligent Led Show】 Humanized design: The elliptical machine for home design of the 45-degree tilt panel. Ellipse leg exerciser oversized footboard design suits people of different ages and foot sizes in families. (There''s a protective film on the display. Please note that it''s not a scratch)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ee4d3a70-ee08-4dbb-903e-5aa9a5f8957d', 'a78b7e46-f15a-4a7d-9425-6bdf6014a50d', '【Safe and Good Design】 The under desk elliptical is equipped with non-slip foot pedals, the roller moves according to the groove rule providing protection for your safety. The elliptical exercise machine thread design on the foot board, the bare foot movement can have a massage-like experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c0e7dedf-5063-4aed-9776-167711f98fa3', 'a78b7e46-f15a-4a7d-9425-6bdf6014a50d', '【Low noise , quiet movement】 The elliptical machine for home has been tested by professional instruments, the sound is less than 15 decibels when used, Suitable for the office and home Settings. After receiving the ellipse leg exerciser, it can be directly plugged in and used without additional installation, making it easy to use and experience.（and with non-slip mat）');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('72d51bd3-bc60-4990-aafe-83c479acb207', 'a78b7e46-f15a-4a7d-9425-6bdf6014a50d', '【Good for you health】 under desk elliptical provides a low-impact workout that is easy on your joints. Low-intensity exercise can burn calories, improve cardiovascular health, and help the legs recover quickly. It is a good exercise option for seniors. ( with battery )');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('aef42bb2-6ebd-42f8-aba9-a0aa69e4d156', 'a78b7e46-f15a-4a7d-9425-6bdf6014a50d', '【After a sale】Kjocie lifetime after-sales service - everyone who owns a under desk elliptical machine can enjoy a three-month return service and lifetime after-sales service, and you can contact us througah Amazon messages and emails for questions about seated elliptical.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0c1c3e77-e2d3-49d6-a85b-458191fe716f', 'eccd9665-871b-425f-bb25-007c45b90efc', 'USB Charging Port for Tablet and Mobile Devices');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b3a34c8c-cff4-4a1b-b3d0-1f0169dd1e61', 'eccd9665-871b-425f-bb25-007c45b90efc', 'Tablet Shelf');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2dd33e90-4cce-49f7-ad6a-1ec32d6bcdec', 'eccd9665-871b-425f-bb25-007c45b90efc', 'FreeSync FTMS HD Smart Connectivity and Non-Coded Wireless Heart Rate Strap Included');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('df65f64b-a914-4827-a678-fbbb12b969e6', 'eccd9665-871b-425f-bb25-007c45b90efc', 'Patented / Roller-Less 3 level adjustable Stride Length (18" Walk, 20" Jog, 23" Run)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a4c1d02a-bcf9-45f8-9dc3-033cde98b6c7', 'eccd9665-871b-425f-bb25-007c45b90efc', 'Commercial Construction / Two-Stage Drive System with Poly-V Belt.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e92fce70-4745-4fe2-b0d3-13dfc56db00f', 'eccd9665-871b-425f-bb25-007c45b90efc', '32 Levels of Silent Magnetic 2-Stage 1: 16.7 Transmission Flywheel Ratio. Trust us, this is good!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('86870c9e-ec9b-4871-907d-998f0b6700d5', 'eccd9665-871b-425f-bb25-007c45b90efc', 'Smart BYOS "Bring Your Own Screen" Interactive 3rd Party Fitness App Connectivity.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9d43fa94-a76b-4235-bdd5-a6c80a625abe', 'eccd9665-871b-425f-bb25-007c45b90efc', '350lbs Max. User Weight - 5 Year Parts Warranty / 1 Year In-Home Labor Warranty / 1 Year Commercial Parts Warranty');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d869c1cd-0093-427e-bd93-e5f61bd3244b', 'eccd9665-871b-425f-bb25-007c45b90efc', 'Assembled Size: L49.2" x W 29.5" x H 65" Compact, Space Saving - In-Use Size: L 66" x W 29.5" x H 65"');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('13c2e386-0aa3-4c71-9607-9ade2afbaf34', 'eccd9665-871b-425f-bb25-007c45b90efc', 'Carton/ Box Size: L 43" x W 15" x H 31" 157 Lbs - Machine Weight: Unboxed: 143lbs / Boxed: 157lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0eb49e8b-2fd5-4b91-ad0d-185e9a9fe116', '2158f64e-be3f-4eb4-b949-4119db9d8e3c', 'Elliptical trainer with fixed arms designed for rigors of commercial gym with easy-to-use');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('752ce893-b2a3-4a00-bb6d-351c09738cda', '2158f64e-be3f-4eb4-b949-4119db9d8e3c', 'Stride lengths from 21.2 to 24.7-Inch and ramp incline from 15 to 40 degrees');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e296e78d-0531-4fe0-ad25-38eda87f70e4', '2158f64e-be3f-4eb4-b949-4119db9d8e3c', '20 levels of resistance, 10 preset programs including 3 cross training, 1 fitness test, 1 manual');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7abaea49-9320-4c1b-96c6-99f3feb1dfd3', '2158f64e-be3f-4eb4-b949-4119db9d8e3c', 'Hand held heart rate monitoring with compatibility for wireless monitors');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c41ce3b2-f2eb-40ed-b70d-e0842a07f9c6', '2158f64e-be3f-4eb4-b949-4119db9d8e3c', '350-Pound maximum user weight, 7-year warranty on frame, 2 years parts, 1 year labor');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('498d0101-f28f-4c78-ad2e-d59688e3b467', '8a7e520b-1fd4-47ea-a461-37f96e61b4fa', 'Seamless Workout Pause: Pause your workout anytime and the data will resume right where you left off. Note: Data resets when the walking pad is turned off');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c3cf4204-54c7-4731-9506-a6d0ae6ca5ce', '0caff5e6-816c-4b69-8b6a-94ea12b8ea50', '[Low-impact & Zero Pressure] Low-intensity exercise under desk elliptical machine is suitable for seniors and people in leg rehabilitation. Body friendly and safe. It can help you burn calories, promote blood circulation, prevent fascia adhesion, exercise your knees, hips, feet, leg, relieve muscle tension and help your legs adapt and recover quickly.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a3716cc6-0e74-4034-adcc-8cd8e8c54bd3', '0caff5e6-816c-4b69-8b6a-94ea12b8ea50', '[Remote Control ＆ Comprehensive Digital Monitor] Merach E32 elipse leg exerciser electric comes with a remote control, allowing you to manually adjust it without bending over, protecting your waist and back. And the LCD Monitor faces the user, clearly display your exercise data (time, distance, speed, calories, counter)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d1ed786e-00f4-4954-81e5-a5a3fa4527e3', '0caff5e6-816c-4b69-8b6a-94ea12b8ea50', '[Auto and Manual Exercise Mode] E32 under desk elliptical exercise machine has Manual (12-level speed) & Auto (P1-P12) for your choice. And the pedals can move forward or backward in both modes. You can exercise your legs while working, watching TV or reading without worrying about being interrupted or disturbing others since the quiet motor. A good choice for the whole family to exercise at home.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('716bb560-6668-4e49-84cc-8070930ee0a7', '0caff5e6-816c-4b69-8b6a-94ea12b8ea50', '[Innovative Accessories] Merach E32 ellipse leg exerciser as seen on tv upgrade anti-slip design. In addition to the floating point particle on the pedals, we also provide foot straps and anti-slip pads ensure unwavering stability. Besides, MERACH offers upper body resistance bands for a varied workout experience, allowing you to exercise your arms, shoulders, and chest.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0e5b977f-9782-4f33-8ead-4f4675cc345c', '0caff5e6-816c-4b69-8b6a-94ea12b8ea50', '[Professional Service] Enjoy a worry-free purchase with 12-month customer service and 24-hour after-sales support. Our dedicated customer service team is available via email or phone to assist you with any questions or concerns regarding Merach ellipse leg exerciser. Please have your order number and product model ready when contacting customer support for a premium purchasing experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('03e50dee-83b1-4320-9557-97dd6e421fec', 'c30069c5-d596-4c74-8f8f-71adc431c437', 'ZERO-IMPACT EXERCISE: Ideal for all fitness levels. The natural stepping motion and comfortable seated position eliminates stress on the joints and back while delivering a total body, fat-burning cardio workout. A great exercise option for those with Arthritis, Parkinson''s or MS');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9cb456e0-b991-402a-94cd-24c7be78d136', 'c30069c5-d596-4c74-8f8f-71adc431c437', 'PHYSICAL THERAPY TECHNOLOGY: The only home-use stepper with a patented natural stride licensed from commercial physiotherapy steppers. Experience the same gentle, effective exercise found in a PT office in your own home.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('eeaa8296-9e67-462d-82bf-36299213092e', 'c30069c5-d596-4c74-8f8f-71adc431c437', 'EASIER ON KNEES & BACK: Compared to typical recumbent bikes or cross trainers with a cycle motion, FreeStep aligns the joints for better muscle engagement with less stress to the hips, knees and ankles.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('011479ee-e21f-4e12-9323-e7a37c09b76e', 'c30069c5-d596-4c74-8f8f-71adc431c437', 'TOTAL BODY WORKOUT: Dual power motion works your upper and lower body, distributing muscle exertion. Your workout will feel easier while engaging all major muscle groups to build strength and burn more calories. Isolate your legs or arms to vary your workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6537ead5-f923-4f1d-a21e-0d762c1a5d3b', 'c30069c5-d596-4c74-8f8f-71adc431c437', 'LT3 PREMIUM FEATURES: UltraGlide Bearings promise long-lasting frictionless motion for fluid start up and stride transitions; SoftStep Pedals with durable grip surface for added traction and control; Larger ComfortSelect Seat with more positioning options; SureGrip handles with high-grade polyurethane coating for unmatched durability.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('73cee734-4989-4682-9b64-bb7cb23244da', 'c30069c5-d596-4c74-8f8f-71adc431c437', 'FREE PERSONAL TRAINING APP: Get results you can see and feel with Teeter Move! Our trainers make working out fun with a vast library of classes that vary in length, experience level and session type. Subscription free. iOS /Android compatible.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('55485fee-8ec7-4a22-8c8c-549569db40bb', 'c30069c5-d596-4c74-8f8f-71adc431c437', 'WHISPER-QUIET MAGNETIC RESISTANCE: 13 Levels with easy-grip adjustment lets you go from light to intense without skipping a beat. Friction-free, long-lasting performance; perfectly synchronized handles and pedals deliver a silent, fluid ride so you can workout anytime…day or night!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('186066a6-96a5-4d2b-b2ed-841666157077', 'c30069c5-d596-4c74-8f8f-71adc431c437', 'HANDLE & SEAT ADJUSTABILITY: Quick transition between 4 grip positions to add workout variety and target the back, chest, biceps and triceps. 3-position recline and variable seat height ensures the perfect posture for multi-user households.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('267ad331-8a56-4879-9878-6a42d1c5a4a1', 'c30069c5-d596-4c74-8f8f-71adc431c437', 'DIGITAL CONSOLE, MEDIA RACK & CONVENIENCE FEATURES: Track progress with the easy-to-read digital console (time, distance, speed and calorie burn); battery-operated so you can use anywhere; integrated device and water bottle holders; convenient transport wheels; low-profile footprint (54" x 38").');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ddb8397f-3f1a-402e-9b1a-d1ddb22141ea', 'c30069c5-d596-4c74-8f8f-71adc431c437', 'WE’VE GOT YOUR BACK: 40+ Years as premiere brand for inversion and joint-friendly fitness equipment; Frustration-Free Assembly w/ BILT App; US-based support; Rated for users 4 ft 11 in- 6 ft 6 in; 300 lb.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ff92cbb3-596c-4a23-969f-0b66f4946609', '887875b7-9c48-40ff-809a-4d522cd9b8ff', 'This Certified Refurbished product is tested and certified to look and work like new. The refurbishing process includes functionality testing, basic cleaning, inspection, and repackaging. The product ships with all relevant accessories, a minimum 90-day warranty, and may arrive in a generic box. Only select sellers who maintain a high performance bar may offer Certified Refurbished products on Amazon.com');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ebe0803c-a5ba-4478-8e02-c58b690f8972', '887875b7-9c48-40ff-809a-4d522cd9b8ff', 'Elliptical trainer with fixed arms designed for rigors of commercial gym with easy-to-use');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('51224a3d-878d-476d-8382-ff8cd1685232', '887875b7-9c48-40ff-809a-4d522cd9b8ff', 'Stride lengths from 21.2 to 24.7-Inch and ramp incline from 15 to 40 degrees');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('461d44d9-e297-4be0-99f8-58795ebe27af', '887875b7-9c48-40ff-809a-4d522cd9b8ff', '20 levels of resistance, 10 preset programs including 3 cross training, 1 fitness test, 1 manual');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('12c23eab-8866-47df-8266-4ab1c455cb44', '887875b7-9c48-40ff-809a-4d522cd9b8ff', 'Hand held heart rate monitoring with compatibility for wireless monitors');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c8104dab-8312-4ae0-82ca-4580fb0de1d9', 'e6652447-0bf6-45a8-8b7c-8f3c25d925a3', '【FULL MOTION WORKOUT】This rower activates multiple muscle groups, including your legs, back, core, and arms, for a comprehensive exercise thanks to 360-degree full motion arms that mimic natural rowing form for a complete range of movement.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f37b8412-98ce-40b9-83fe-6e7b2fc36a96', 'e6652447-0bf6-45a8-8b7c-8f3c25d925a3', '【350 LB WEIGHT CAPACITY & COMPACT】This rowing machine robustly accommodates all sizes yet its space-saving compact. The Digital Monitor tracks stroke rate, time, count, calories, and total strokes to simplify monitoring your rowing workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6e8423be-6282-4fcd-add9-66a269d4d500', 'e6652447-0bf6-45a8-8b7c-8f3c25d925a3', '【REAL ROWING SIMULATION】Feel like you''re rowing on water with the SunnyFit App, this machine''s realistic rowing simulation for a more engaging and effective home workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e3cdbf8e-72c2-4163-a13a-14aee9590831', 'e6652447-0bf6-45a8-8b7c-8f3c25d925a3', '【SMOOTH RESISTANCE】12 levels of smooth hydraulic resistance for your workout intensity and challenge yourself at any fitness level. Seamlessly increase or decrease the resistance with the turn of a knob to target different muscle groups.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8bafd0a4-7227-46c3-9388-81f16ea9cc2e', 'e6652447-0bf6-45a8-8b7c-8f3c25d925a3', '【COMFORT & STABILITY】Featuring an ergonomic padded seat with elevated, wider design for easy mounting, superior comfort, and no slipping during prolonged workouts. Paired with non-slip grip handlebars for added stability.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('49c0eb08-37fc-4336-9c51-e29b2a52c10c', 'c2aaf1bb-1067-49be-a562-352e3444db9d', 'VERSATILE – Use to increase the intensity of your workouts; Get a full-body workout or target specific muscle groups');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('aae81d1c-7a6c-49b5-a89f-92a5a908f450', 'e6652447-0bf6-45a8-8b7c-8f3c25d925a3', '【EASY ASSEMBLY & SAFETY FEATURES】Assemble this rowing machine easily and start working out. Large anti-slip foot pedals keep your feet secure while rowing. Adjustable straps further ensure confidence during your workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7f122ed1-393d-4eec-855a-f2dc8990bd35', 'e6652447-0bf6-45a8-8b7c-8f3c25d925a3', '【ERGONOMIC SEAT】Padded seat cushion and adjustable straps provide a comfortable and customized fit. Pivoting foot pedals with adjustable fastener straps accommodate most foot size securely during the full range of motion.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('38017d6d-59a6-433a-a45a-45244331c39d', 'e6652447-0bf6-45a8-8b7c-8f3c25d925a3', '【Sunny Health & Fitness Commitment】A top fitness brand for 20+ years, offers superior products and a dedication to excellence. Count on our committed customer service and trainers for the best fitness experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e479e6b1-1db7-4c06-923c-788271b8c295', 'f6869e96-a3e9-48e1-81b0-538169043808', '【LOW-IMPACT ELLIPTICAL, 300LB CAPACITY ENDURANCE】The elliptical exerciser is built for durability and performance, supporting users up to 300lbs. It features magnetic resistance, built-in pulse sensors, and a 12" stride. Its smart design ensures a smooth, low-impact workout with comfort and reliability.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d3bb82c1-8987-4798-80a8-c183f2df770c', 'f6869e96-a3e9-48e1-81b0-538169043808', '【FREE FITNESS APP CONNECTION】Enjoy FREE access to the SunnyFit APP with NO membership fees! Dive into 1,000+ trainer-led workouts, explore 10,000+ virtual scenic tours, track your progress, challenge others, and much more!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1584f5dc-063a-4968-b635-5eddc8e3f272', 'f6869e96-a3e9-48e1-81b0-538169043808', '【QUIET AND SMOOTH】Enjoy a low-noise workout with our elliptical’s belt drive system and 16 levels of magnetic resistance. Ideal for solo sessions and family fitness, ensuring a quiet and smooth exercise experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c99fb168-90e6-41bb-bff2-aab74a93f313', 'f6869e96-a3e9-48e1-81b0-538169043808', '【BUILT-IN PULSE SENSORS】Utilizing the Pulse & Heart Rate Sensors for real-time feedback. This feature helps with precise workout adjustments to stay in target zones & alerts you if your heart rate exceeds safe limits.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f1b36b94-78a7-4186-9a12-da44947208d3', 'f6869e96-a3e9-48e1-81b0-538169043808', '【DIGITAL MONITOR w/ TARGETING FUNCTION】Personalize your training by setting time, distance, calorie, and heart rate goals. Track progress in real-time with the advanced digital monitor and use the built-in pulse sensor for precise workout metrics.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e1b7cfcd-d594-4688-93d4-16fda06f6358', 'f6869e96-a3e9-48e1-81b0-538169043808', '【FULL-BODY WORKOUT, BI-DIRECTIONAL MOTION】Enhance your fitness routine with bi-directional motion and a standard 12" stride. Textured hand grips and arm exercisers ensure a secure hold and dynamic movement, delivering a complete upper and lower body workout for all fitness levels.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('03af563c-36a2-4f97-af25-2fe93ad16991', 'f6869e96-a3e9-48e1-81b0-538169043808', '【MICRO-ADJUSTABLE FLOOR STABILIZERS】Easily adapt to uneven surfaces with adjustable floor stabilizers—just twist to micro-adjust the height. This feature enhances safety and stability during workouts, ensuring a secure and balanced exercise experience on any flooring type.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e3175367-3825-48e4-abb0-e1022255d390', 'f6869e96-a3e9-48e1-81b0-538169043808', '【ALL-IN-ONE CONVENIENCE FEATURES】Stay entertained with the built-in device holder and keep hydrated using the convenient bottle holder. Effortlessly move your elliptical with transportation wheels, combining practicality and ease for a seamless workout experience in any space.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ff73fc4b-6cf6-434f-9305-a049630c1da2', 'f6869e96-a3e9-48e1-81b0-538169043808', '【EFFORTLESS 8-STEP ASSEMBLY】Pre-assembled main frame allows for a quick setup in just 8 steps. Most users can complete it solo with ease. Includes a user manual, adjustment guide, and video tutorial for guidance. Sunny customer service is always available to assist, so you can focus on your fitness goals right away!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cd794be2-2c87-4f1e-b441-290974424413', 'f6869e96-a3e9-48e1-81b0-538169043808', '【20+ YEARS OF EXCELLENCE】Sunny Health & Fitness, a U.S.-based company, offers top-quality equipment with a commitment to excellence. Our dedicated U.S. customer service team and certified trainers ensure a truly unmatched FIT FOR EVERYONE experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('80df01d2-e290-4f23-a043-afb32a8b0672', '2a768307-df3f-41f8-85ee-f8c23b7105ae', 'VALUE-PACKED MEMBERSHIP: A Peloton All-Access Membership must be purchased separately in order to access Peloton content on your Tread. You’ll pay $44/mo for your entire household and get unlimited access to our entire library of content available on your Tread and the Peloton App. Age, height, and weight restrictions apply. Your account can be activated on the touch screen during Tread assembly.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a6b3adb8-01e3-4404-bcc9-fa79985cb036', '2a768307-df3f-41f8-85ee-f8c23b7105ae', 'THOUSANDS OF LIVE & ON-DEMAND CLASSES: Access to thousands of classes, both on and off your Tread, like running, walking, hiking, strength, bootcamp, yoga, and more. To customize your workouts, Peloton allows you to stack classes, enabling you to transition from class to class with ease');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0afb4f0c-c7f5-4569-abf8-8cde83dcfcb9', '2a768307-df3f-41f8-85ee-f8c23b7105ae', 'IMMERSIVE, INTUITIVE RUNNING AND WALKING EXPERIENCE: Speed and incline knobs allow you to easily adjust controls without breaking your stride, or use auto-incline to automatically follow instructor cues up or downhill Use captions or receive spoken feedback from the Peloton Tread touchscreen with TalkBack Knobs with jump buttons.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('715887b9-bfe6-494e-8e27-bc32e52aabce', '2a768307-df3f-41f8-85ee-f8c23b7105ae', 'On-screen shortcuts allow you to change speeds from 0 to 12.5 MPH and incline grades from 0% to 12.5% Clip-on the safety key while running and the belt will come to a quick stop if detached. Lock your Tread with a passcode when not in use');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7ec83589-2e37-427e-9df0-1184bf052b54', '2a768307-df3f-41f8-85ee-f8c23b7105ae', 'TRACK YOUR PROGRESS & METRICS: A wide-range of on-screen, real-time metrics enable you track progress, streaks and performance across workouts Follow training programs, or set personal targets during a freestyle workout, to help you meet your running and strength goals');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8c316d8d-65ca-4a77-b30a-0a27a1d44749', '2a768307-df3f-41f8-85ee-f8c23b7105ae', 'CONNECT TO YOUR TRAINING DEVICES: Easily connect any ANT+ heart rate monitor, Apple Watch and Strava to your Peloton Tread to capture performance data, including Strive Score, an in-class metric on heart rate zones, from your workouts and track fitness goals');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7cfc0827-52e3-47b2-9ef8-95f011fd87ea', '2a768307-df3f-41f8-85ee-f8c23b7105ae', 'SPACE TO RUN ON A COMPACT FOOTPRINT: The Peloton Tread has a compact 5½'' x 2¾'' footprint that still has plenty of room for running and walking on its 59” textured, comfortable and quiet running belt Get a powerful cardio workout in less space than your average treadmill We recommend at least 24” of space to the left, right and front of the Tread, and 79” of space in the back for storing and training The ceiling height minimum is 20” greater than the user’s height');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('971621d2-35a1-49b4-b2ba-86bfafe20fd7', '8ea76a3d-8a7d-45fe-a084-d16499b1f21f', 'Interactive personal training at home powered by I fit');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('32269dc1-7d71-4a71-a004-ea891b28a90e', '8ea76a3d-8a7d-45fe-a084-d16499b1f21f', '10 inches HD smart touchscreen display for immersive trainer led workouts and stats tracking; 19 inches adjustable stride, soft touch upper body grips');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bfa60e38-f4fd-461c-a175-c11f81970bfb', '8ea76a3d-8a7d-45fe-a084-d16499b1f21f', '20 Degree adjustable power ramp; smart incline matching technology allows I fit to adjust your incline to trainer recommendations and to mimic real world terrain');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a1adfbb1-e4ca-4030-902a-756cf5038ae2', '8ea76a3d-8a7d-45fe-a084-d16499b1f21f', '26 Digital resistance levels; autobreeze workout fan, oversized cushioned pedals, and water bottle holder for a comfortable workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e3433c42-5df4-4ba9-a6ea-a542542f0ad9', '8ea76a3d-8a7d-45fe-a084-d16499b1f21f', 'Smr silent magnetic resistance delivers a smooth, quiet workout with every use; oversized levelers stabilize your elliptical trainer');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7bb2c651-d599-42ad-a5ea-cf963d9f9320', '8a7e520b-1fd4-47ea-a461-37f96e61b4fa', 'Customer-Centric: We are dedicated to your satisfaction, offering a comprehensive support program that includes a customer service team available around the clock');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('58de21e8-0a3a-46b2-a205-83b1b458957b', '43a64a8b-9daf-4953-a938-f4f50503d2d3', '【FULL BODY WORKOUT】Complete body workout that engages all major muscle groups with the smooth, hydraulic resistance that targets legs, glutes, back, arms, shoulders, and core. The low-impact rowing motion works your whole body.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ca5ce9b8-93a0-4146-aeb6-2f6daab4a57c', '43a64a8b-9daf-4953-a938-f4f50503d2d3', '【FREE CONNECTED APP】 Enjoy FREE access to the SunnyFit App with every Sunny Health & Fitness product—no membership fees! Dive into 1,000+ trainer-led workouts, explore 10,000+ virtual scenic tours, track progress, challenge others, and much more!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('38844cac-eae1-4d5f-9b42-eab21b1207d5', '43a64a8b-9daf-4953-a938-f4f50503d2d3', '【COMPACT & LIGHTWEIGHT】The portable design maximizes storage for convenience. The rower takes up minimal space for hassle-free storage when not in use. Weighing only 22.4 LB, it is light enough to carry from room to room or transport in a car.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7460bc2d-413b-4b64-8305-2c291e4af661', '43a64a8b-9daf-4953-a938-f4f50503d2d3', '【SMOOTH RESISTANCE】12 levels of smooth hydraulic resistance for your workout intensity and challenge yourself at any fitness level. Seamlessly increase or decrease the resistance with the turn of a knob to target different muscle groups.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9e8c1316-7f3c-4356-b674-c811a74c9ecc', '43a64a8b-9daf-4953-a938-f4f50503d2d3', '【INTEGRATED DEVICE HOLDER】A convenient spot to securely hold your phone, allowing you to stay motivated and entertained during your workout while monitoring your progress on the digital display.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d4e690d1-9a7c-437f-b040-eba39cafc1ca', '43a64a8b-9daf-4953-a938-f4f50503d2d3', '【QUICK & EASY ASSEMBLY】Made to be user-friendly in operation and assembling. No complicated installation or setup required, simply attach the stabilizer bars, seat, foot pedals, and monitor mount with the included instructions. Assembling time: less than 5 minutes.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('40641163-69d2-41b0-9fa4-0dd805fe0b6b', '43a64a8b-9daf-4953-a938-f4f50503d2d3', '【ENGINEERED TO LAST】 With an effective minimalistic and modern design, our Smart Rower is made of Alloy Steel, resulting in a strong, hard, and tough machine. The perfect alternative to classic rowing machines, and without compromising your cardio workout efficiency.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8f480a9d-4c5b-41b4-828b-d7e81887abdd', '43a64a8b-9daf-4953-a938-f4f50503d2d3', '【QUIET OPERATION】Optimized design for minimal noise. Developed to be mindful of those around you, our rower’s handlebar and seat movements are almost silent, perfect to utilize while virtually rowing around the world from your smart phone or watching television.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b6f6df17-5625-4fe7-b771-9dd471ec55d8', '43a64a8b-9daf-4953-a938-f4f50503d2d3', '【ERGONOMIC SEAT】Padded seat cushion and adjustable straps provide a comfortable and customized fit. Pivoting foot pedals with adjustable fastener straps accommodate most foot size securely during the full range of motion.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('151bcd5a-8b84-4c2c-aa41-af2eee6316ee', '43a64a8b-9daf-4953-a938-f4f50503d2d3', '【PREMIER U.S.-BASED BRAND】With 20+ years of excellence, Sunny Health & Fitness delivers top-notch equipment dedicated to excellence. With our devoted support team and certified trainers enjoy an unmatched FIT FOR EVERYONE experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3802e54f-762c-4461-95af-5de06c963779', '79bef7d4-70d2-4b82-ac2c-0aec6c73a631', '【EXTENDED STEP RANGE】The climbing stepper offers an extensive step range that replicates climbing movements, delivering an all-encompassing workout that targets diverse muscle groups, including the upper body, core, glutes, hamstrings, and calves.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e5e91f1f-d976-47f5-96bd-6233cffc86a2', '79bef7d4-70d2-4b82-ac2c-0aec6c73a631', '【MOUNTAIN CLIMBING SIMULATION】Emulate the challenges of outdoor mountaineering with a climber that offers adjustable step heights. Tailor the intensity of your ascent with steps ranging from a minimum height of 3.6 inches to a peak of 16.9 inches.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e926b4b4-c66d-4f89-b44c-32525f18ec55', '79bef7d4-70d2-4b82-ac2c-0aec6c73a631', '【FREE CONNECTED APP】 Enjoy FREE access to the SunnyFit App with every Sunny Health & Fitness product—no membership fees! Dive into 1,000+ trainer-led workouts, explore 10,000+ virtual scenic tours, track your progress, challenge others, and much more!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c89add15-bed7-45a2-a09a-3728d2892320', '79bef7d4-70d2-4b82-ac2c-0aec6c73a631', '【ERGONOMIC HANDLEBARS WITH PULSE SENSORS】The climber comes with sturdy and comfortable handlebars with built-in pulse sensors. This design ensures a safe and stable grip during your workout but also enables continuous monitoring of your heart rate.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('07b4eec0-4937-4bf3-ab52-29f2e1af8dee', '79bef7d4-70d2-4b82-ac2c-0aec6c73a631', '【SMOOTH & QUIET】This climber stepper has a dual hydraulic system that ensures a smooth and near-silent workout experience. Featuring hydraulic piston cylinders, it allows for adjustments in height intensity, catering to your specific fitness needs.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('226aa443-2862-4606-ba89-1b78d4e25287', '79bef7d4-70d2-4b82-ac2c-0aec6c73a631', '【ADVANCED FITNESS TRACKING】 Stay motivated with the user-friendly LCD monitor that tracks your fitness journey. Monitor key metrics such as time, strokes per minute, count, calories burned, total accumulated workout time, and pulse rate.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('adcfe247-a7f1-4df5-986e-19f8d4385b05', '79bef7d4-70d2-4b82-ac2c-0aec6c73a631', '【COMPACT & FOLDABLE DESIGN】The climber strider features minimalist design that''s perfect for space conservation. Its slender profile and lightweight construction are complemented by a foldable feature for effortless storage and space optimization.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9f91a2bb-2a24-45b4-b099-df3ca26fa528', '79bef7d4-70d2-4b82-ac2c-0aec6c73a631', '【EASY ASSEMBLY】Our stepper is designed with user-friendly assembly in mind, ensuring a quick and easy setup process for your convenience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1f64ca60-7222-4750-b9b1-22f770097ad3', '79bef7d4-70d2-4b82-ac2c-0aec6c73a631', '【SAFE AND MOBILE DESIGN】 The max climber is fitted with non-slip, secure pedals and stabilizers for a safe exercise experience, alongside built-in transportation wheels for effortless mobility and easy repositioning within your space.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('355b17b7-f0d0-4c2e-a76e-10e0bf126898', '79bef7d4-70d2-4b82-ac2c-0aec6c73a631', '【Sunny Health & Fitness Commitment】 A top fitness brand for 20+ years, offers superior products and a dedication to excellence. Count on our committed customer service and enjoy peace of mind with a 1-year warranty on the structural frame.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a5ce64e8-6046-40f8-a2d8-97f37bc584a8', '89ebbfa6-2150-44c9-9188-863a0408eca1', 'Under Desk Elliptical: Boost your productivity while staying active! Meet our essential mini elliptical for seamless workouts or rehabilitation, all from your home or office chair. Whether working, reading, or watching TV, turn sitting time into an exercise opportunity with this innovative pedal exerciser. Burn calories, shed weight, and feel fantastic with home-use elliptical machines');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('927884fe-f5c2-4dc4-93b5-b0255e36e013', '89ebbfa6-2150-44c9-9188-863a0408eca1', 'HR & Auto Mode: Exercise anytime, anywhere. In HR(Manual) mode, you can adjust workout time(15-30min), speed(1-12) and direction (forward&reverse) by remote control or button of the elliptical machine. Then switch "mode" to Auto mode that the speed and direction have been programmed. In auto mode, you can adjust P1-P12 mode by press mode button, the speed of the mini seated elliptical changes every minute, and the direction changes every 3 minutes');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c930a2eb-555d-4bbd-80f2-7a71310b9988', '89ebbfa6-2150-44c9-9188-863a0408eca1', '12 Speeds & 12 Modes: CURSOR Fitness elliptical training machine features 12 level speeds and 12 workout modes, providing diverse possibilities to elevate your exercise routine. Whether you are doing rehabilitation exercises or strengthen leg muscles and relax foot joints, choose the different speed and mode you want. You can use under desk elliptical while watching TV, reading newspapers or working');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c9b1b463-e4c1-40f3-9d5d-b87cba066b83', '89ebbfa6-2150-44c9-9188-863a0408eca1', 'Forward & Reverse: The forward and backward direction for a comprehensive leg exercise. The LCD monitor tracks time, diatance, counts and calories burned in real-time. The pedal exerciser for the elderly comes with a remote control to control the machine, allowing you to adjust it without bending over, protecting your waist and back. It is perfect for the elderly and people with limited mobility. Please do not use standing up');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7b3b61a9-b329-4ee0-bdbb-a6599fb4d0d7', '89ebbfa6-2150-44c9-9188-863a0408eca1', 'Mute Setting: CURSOR elliptical equipped with the latest mute system, which ensures a ultra quiet workout without disturbing your colleague or baby sleeping even at a high speed. When plugged in, long press the Power button to turn off the screen, and long press the Direction button on the machine for 1.5 seconds. After two beeps, cancel the sound prompt, and follow the same steps to restore normal sound');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('24a1e6f2-2a20-4f77-9deb-3ef14f87ef9b', '89ebbfa6-2150-44c9-9188-863a0408eca1', 'Ideal Gift Companion: Health is invaluable, whether you are an office worker, an elderly person, or in need of rehabilitation training, this under seated pedal exerciser is perfect leg exercise equipment to relax leg muscle and promote leg blood circulation. An ideal gift for friends, parents or grandparents, encouraging regular use to ensure foot joint and muscle group relaxation');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('325b9c28-bd3b-480c-8b84-f047c3cd26f4', '716dddbb-18d4-4312-84cc-fa73adb25656', 'ZERO-IMPACT EXERCISE: Ideal for all fitness levels. The natural stepping motion and comfortable seated position eliminates stress on the joints and back while delivering a total body, fat-burning cardio workout. A great exercise option for those with Arthritis, Parkinson''s or MS.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('824a6d32-2139-476a-a804-3bc1715c65d8', '716dddbb-18d4-4312-84cc-fa73adb25656', 'PHYSICAL THERAPY TECHNOLOGY: The only home-use stepper with a patented natural stride licensed from commercial physiotherapy steppers. Experience the same gentle, effective exercise found in a PT office in your own home.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('454e5ae9-bfbf-485d-94a5-cb2002cb5bfd', '716dddbb-18d4-4312-84cc-fa73adb25656', '"EASIER ON KNEES & BACK": Compared to typical recumbent bikes or cross trainers with a cycle motion, FreeStep aligns the joints for better muscle engagement with less stress to the hips, knees and ankles.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('dca4828c-b9e6-4e8c-bdd4-eb6ac3811124', '716dddbb-18d4-4312-84cc-fa73adb25656', 'TOTAL BODY WORKOUT: Dual power motion works your upper and lower body, distributing muscle exertion. Your workout will feel easier while engaging all major muscle groups to build strength and burn more calories. Isolate your legs or arms to vary your workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9c964002-cef4-4d93-bc73-d3ea41fad18d', '716dddbb-18d4-4312-84cc-fa73adb25656', '9” COLOR LCD SCREEN & MEDIA RACK: Inspire motivation with 7 tracking metrics and 21 pre-programmed, goal-based workouts; Bluetooth heart rate compatible (HRM sold sep); Media Rack with USB charging port and adjustable height for phone or tablet makes it easy to follow along with classes, listen to music or read during your workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b0022d51-d629-46e9-9c92-42153fd76937', '716dddbb-18d4-4312-84cc-fa73adb25656', '20-LEVEL MAGNETIC RESISTANCE: Control with console quick-keys ranging from 0-105 lb resistance; Friction-free, long-lasting performance; whisper-quiet synchronized handles and pedals so you can workout anytime…day or night!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3b69f3df-a7da-48e8-8eda-e08bf8d338ed', '716dddbb-18d4-4312-84cc-fa73adb25656', 'PERFORMANCE FEATURES: UltraGlide Bearings promise long-lasting frictionless motion for fluid start up and stride transitions; SoftStep Pedals with durable grip surface for added traction and control; Extra-Large ComfortMax Seat with more positioning options; SureGrip handles with high-grade polyurethane coating for unmatched durability.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('edc52795-18a1-4be8-9767-08d1e0a81fa6', '716dddbb-18d4-4312-84cc-fa73adb25656', 'CONVENIENCE FEATURES: Electronic Step Lock for easy entry and exit; Dual cup holders keep your water and pocket contents within easy reach; transport wheels.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5900d2aa-9deb-475d-999d-04f8e4b3c4d0', '716dddbb-18d4-4312-84cc-fa73adb25656', 'FREE PERSONAL TRAINING APP: Get results you can see and feel with Teeter Move! Our trainers make working out fun with a vast library of classes that vary in length, experience level and session type. Subscription free. iOS /Android compatible.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1820e68f-1440-4a1c-89b7-3b67273f3c9d', '716dddbb-18d4-4312-84cc-fa73adb25656', 'WE’VE GOT YOUR BACK: 40+ Years as premiere brand for inversion and joint-friendly fitness equipment; Frustration-Free Assembly w/ BILT App; US-based support; Rated for users 4 ft 11 in- 6 ft 6 in; 350 lb.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('453e087b-d605-4d00-bcc4-4492ff9765f9', '2aa8bdcd-c1f9-40b9-9ee7-cc02cee98639', 'UNDER DESK ELLIPTICAL - Love the way you move! Cubii Move is the perfect compact elliptical enabling a low impact, calorie burning home workout from the comfort of your favorite seat.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f7f1f5cb-c0ba-4f12-a687-cd17b235747e', '2aa8bdcd-c1f9-40b9-9ee7-cc02cee98639', 'WORK FROM HOME FITNESS - Stay active while sitting! Unlike other desk exercise equipment like an under desk treadmill or desk bike pedal exerciser, Cubii is compact and whisper quiet, ideal for working from home.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cc8bd214-2568-476c-981c-5a2bd9892aaa', '2aa8bdcd-c1f9-40b9-9ee7-cc02cee98639', 'LOW IMPACT, ULTRA SMOOTH EXERCISE MACHINE - The smooth elliptical motion helps increase strength and mobility without putting stress on the joints, knees, and back. Ideal for rehabbing or safely building strength.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a7af3e24-9df6-4e96-ac85-bae01ae99da7', '2aa8bdcd-c1f9-40b9-9ee7-cc02cee98639', 'BUILT IN LCD DISPLAY PROGRESS TRACKER - The easy to read LCD monitor displays your stride count, mileage, duration, and calories burned so you can track your progress. Manually enter stats to the Cubii App for an interactive fitness experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6df6b848-f3a2-4ba9-8d0d-7624525c4394', '2aa8bdcd-c1f9-40b9-9ee7-cc02cee98639', 'LEG EXERCISER - This under desk pedal exerciser activates 6 key muscle groups, strengthening leg muscles while offering an effective cardio workout for wellness seekers of all ages and abilities.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6ff971c6-977a-45c3-b7fb-cccd35b1c43d', 'cd57b225-950d-489c-a417-aa6f64928d22', '2-in-1 design combines a full body elliptical workout with the seated comfort of an upright bike');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('444301bd-40f4-48d0-ab77-76500858929c', 'cd57b225-950d-489c-a417-aa6f64928d22', '3.7 inch LCD console window is easy to read with all the necessary information - clearly displays your time, speed, distance, calories, and pulse, along with an odometer');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0da5a233-6ab2-41f1-a738-376371eb1843', 'cd57b225-950d-489c-a417-aa6f64928d22', '8 levels of calorie-burning resistance');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('796342ec-b1ec-477c-b7d9-cab1c32ef063', 'cd57b225-950d-489c-a417-aa6f64928d22', 'Hand pulse sensors enable you to monitor your heart rate at all times');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1f82876d-6ebd-4ff4-bf53-05eecd20057d', 'cd57b225-950d-489c-a417-aa6f64928d22', 'Ergonomic 13 inch stride length provides a comfortable elliptical motion in a space efficient design');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2d733b28-9790-467a-853d-f0590a5ae211', '3bf967d2-1bfd-46d0-99de-1d611ae464fe', '【16 Levels of Electro-Magnetic Resistance】 This elliptical trainer offers 16 levels of smooth, adjustable electro-magnetic resistance, providing precise control over intensity. Enjoy faster response times and more accurate adjustments for a tailored workout experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b6b36246-cd65-4766-9948-4eb879032990', '3bf967d2-1bfd-46d0-99de-1d611ae464fe', '【Advanced Programmable Performance Monitor】Track your progress with an backlit display that monitors speed, time, distance, calories burned, RPM, heart rate, watt generation, and resistance level. It also allows you to build customized workout programs to match your personal fitness level and goals.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f3e61609-a2f6-4b76-954d-c50df4046032', '3bf967d2-1bfd-46d0-99de-1d611ae464fe', '【24 Built-In Workout Programs】Achieve your fitness objectives with 24 preset workout programs, offering guided sessions to keep you motivated and on track.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3e7d1551-392b-456c-bde0-fd1ca1116b0c', '3bf967d2-1bfd-46d0-99de-1d611ae464fe', '【Extra Quiet and Smooth Operation】The electro-magnetic resistance, combined with a belt-drive mechanism, ensures an extra quiet and smooth workout experience. This system is designed for minimal maintenance and long-lasting durability in home environments.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('56e62260-a4b7-40d5-b331-47043f922b89', '3bf967d2-1bfd-46d0-99de-1d611ae464fe', '【Full-Body & Low-Impact Exercise】Reach your fitness goals with a 15.5-inch stride length that provides effective, low-impact exercise. The hand grips feature built-in pulse sensors, enabling full-body workouts while monitoring your heart rate.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9a87328f-dbcf-44e9-9d5c-eecfb17aca8a', '3bf967d2-1bfd-46d0-99de-1d611ae464fe', '【330 lbs Max User Weight】Built to support users up to 330 lbs, this elliptical is constructed with a high-quality steel frame, ensuring durability and a secure workout experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b1a96993-4088-4f11-a1f2-f4c153d8409b', '3bf967d2-1bfd-46d0-99de-1d611ae464fe', '【Stability & Durability】Ensure stability on any surface with adjustable front and rear stabilizers. Step confidently onto the wide, textured footplates and engage your upper body with large handlebars designed for balance and strength.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2f4b96e3-4be5-4c08-a18f-8354aae13e85', '3bf967d2-1bfd-46d0-99de-1d611ae464fe', '【Convenient Mobility】Keep your media devices close with the built-in holder, and easily move the elliptical between rooms using the front-loaded transportation wheels.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a89080e1-111a-4c14-94fd-eb34675d1a80', '3bf967d2-1bfd-46d0-99de-1d611ae464fe', '【Simple Assembly】Quickly set up your elliptical with the included clear, step-by-step instruction manual and video guide.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('eef168ac-a441-474b-8035-a8e991676e16', '3bf967d2-1bfd-46d0-99de-1d611ae464fe', '【About Sunny Health & Fitness】With over 20 years of experience, Sunny Health & Fitness is a U.S.-based company committed to crafting quality fitness equipment. All product claims are thoroughly tested for effectiveness and durability. Choosing Sunny means partnering with a dedicated ally in your health and fitness journey, supported by exceptional workouts and U.S.-based customer service with faster response times.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ae1323fc-4722-4c15-b704-9ada3322e68e', '6939eaec-8d91-44b4-ba9e-a6db867d8b1c', '【AUTO & Manual Exercise Modes】Electric two motion modes: automatic mode (P1-P3) and manual mode (10 speed); Two control methods: by pressing the LCD display button control; Wireless remote control without bending over;(Automatic program state to press the remote control, can not adjust the time, speed; You need to set it to manual mode to adjust it.)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cc27a801-6393-403e-b3c2-0c2e28ca972a', '6939eaec-8d91-44b4-ba9e-a6db867d8b1c', '【Electric & Manual 2 IN 1】 In Active Mode, operate without plugging in, relying on leg force for power, delivering an effective leg workout.In Passive Mode, when plugged in, control speed and direction via remote for a varied workout experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b1b7e7f9-e6c6-4d07-903f-09ad94597256', '6939eaec-8d91-44b4-ba9e-a6db867d8b1c', '【Upgrade Floating Point Particle Anti Slip Pedal】Shock absorption and anti slip foot pedals with floating particles can promote blood circulation in the soles of the feet and enhance joint flexibility. The circular motion trajectory of the compact and portable elliptical machine effectively relieves knee joint impact and protects knee soft tissue.Warm Tips: Wear socks or use barefoot for a better experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('84d4b9e2-42ac-43e7-ab1a-983027fdc139', '6939eaec-8d91-44b4-ba9e-a6db867d8b1c', '【Digital Display, Easy to Read】LCD display clearly shows your exercise data (time, distance, speed, calories, counter). Multi functional LCD screen touch usage and wireless remote control. Thoughtful remote design allows mode change without bending, reducing your back stress. Enjoy comfort with just one click.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5fc10553-909b-41aa-ac37-ae70d9527ad2', '6939eaec-8d91-44b4-ba9e-a6db867d8b1c', '【Plug and play, quiet movement】 The elliptical machine for home has been tested by professional instruments, the sound is less than 15 decibels when used, Suitable for the office and home Settings. After receiving the Elliptical Training Machines, it can be directly plugged in and used without additional installation, making it easy to use and experience. (Please do not use while standing, only when sitting. Standing on the device may cause serious injury and damage to the elliptical machine.)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ffdc7db0-fbd4-46b1-a896-017d7862b1cc', '6939eaec-8d91-44b4-ba9e-a6db867d8b1c', '【Elder Friendly】Lightweight and easy storage. It can be easily moved from one room to another. This thoughtful design makes this Elliptical Training Machines ideal for seniors and people with limited mobility. Low-intensity exercise can burn calories, improve cardiovascular health, and help the legs recover quickly. ( The remote control is not equipped with a battery due to logistics reasons and requires you to purchase it separately)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('55fa9e4e-b4e0-4f7b-9f64-64061bf0ffa7', '6939eaec-8d91-44b4-ba9e-a6db867d8b1c', '【AFTER-SALES SERVICE】After-sales service - everyone who owns a under desk elliptical machine can enjoy a three-month service and after-sales service, and you can through Amazon messages for questions about seated elliptical');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cdb42e84-9ba0-450a-856a-58116f94eafd', '5b398628-5327-45d8-a7f1-87e47ed7dee3', 'LOW-IMPACT CARDIO FITNESS - Our Elliptical Trainer provides an effective, low-impact, calorie burning, cardiovascular workout. This elliptical training machine helps you tone your lower body all in a joint-friendly way.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0b92b0b4-6f9b-463c-b097-ced150086c8d', '5b398628-5327-45d8-a7f1-87e47ed7dee3', 'DYNAMIC RESISTANCE LEVELS - This elliptical machine offers adjustable resistance for a customized training experience. The 8 different levels of smooth, quiet magnetic resistance help ensure an effective workout for users of all fitness levels.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('70f46faa-7f99-4eb2-a588-1c506cf418f4', '5b398628-5327-45d8-a7f1-87e47ed7dee3', 'SET CUSTOM WORKOUTS - This standing elliptical lets you choose your desired intensity level with a quick turn of the tension dial. Place your hands on the handlebar to monitor your heart rate using the built-in pulse sensors.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b293c501-1ece-447c-8a30-5ae39ca7ade7', '5b398628-5327-45d8-a7f1-87e47ed7dee3', 'COMFORTABLE AND SPACE SAVING - This elliptical trainer is designed with padded handles and large, textured foot plates to provide extended comfort and stability during movement. Stay hydrated with the built-in drink holder and use the built-in wheels for easy storage.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('61a02371-b6bb-415b-a62c-b9aa2b891ba0', '5b398628-5327-45d8-a7f1-87e47ed7dee3', 'SMART WORKOUT APP - Experience connected fitness with this home gym equipment with the müüv app. With smart guided coaching, exercise demo videos, personalized workouts, assembly videos, and more, müüv provides the best workout and fitness experience with your Stamina Elliptical Trainer.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ded9990f-0769-4222-bdcb-f5e68331b377', '184a5d3c-4e73-4cb5-b02c-dd366faefdd3', 'Warm Tips: The pooboo elliptical machine designed 80% pre-assembled. Say goodbye to the traditional complicated setup process. Guided by the manual or assembly video, you can easily finish it within 30 minutes. Besides, when not in use, it can be quickly and easily folded up');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('509d7c7a-9b73-4e44-9e33-7ff76f48c0db', '184a5d3c-4e73-4cb5-b02c-dd366faefdd3', 'Light Commercial Appearance Elliptical Machine:The thickened steel pipe frame contributes outstanding stability and loading capacity of 350 LBS. The 15.5" stride simulates the natural movement path of human body and height fits up to 6'' 5". The transparent non-slip and rebound pedal cushion offers a smoother motion feeling like space walk and reduce ankle&knee stress. D-shape handrail structure more like a commercial elliptical that satisfying the needs of all-round workout experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4af5330e-0df0-4a05-9882-7b43390dfc5a', '184a5d3c-4e73-4cb5-b02c-dd366faefdd3', 'Multi-function Exercise Handle Position:3 Hand Grip Positions, 3 exercise experience. ①The Fixed Low Position on fixed handlebars built-in pulse sensor for heart rate monitoring. This position use for low height, sitting back with your weight during exercise, give you a peachy hip. ②The D-shape Wide Outer Position does arm stretching exercise, suitable for users with high height and wider arm span. ③The D-shape Wide Inner Position, a comfortable handle position, exercise waist and back');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d0623639-cfc4-4873-8b4b-9b0b6086cdc1', '184a5d3c-4e73-4cb5-b02c-dd366faefdd3', '16 Adjustable Resistance Levels:Equipped with 16-Level Magnetic Resistance Knob, E399 elliptical can adjust to the target range for different members'' needs. ①0-5 Level: Soothing and Relaxing Mode, relieving your limb pressure. ②6-10 Level: Moderate Intensity Mode, improve your Physical Flexibility. ③11-16 Level: Highly Effective Fat Burning Mode, burn your calories. All stages exerciser can get efficient exercise with different resistance and no matter you''re a beginner or professionals');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c6cb2a56-a623-47fe-a27e-0430e43e22c1', 'c36d0247-a5bc-42c1-b84e-f160238dd7d8', '【REMOTE CONTROL QUICK SPEED + 6 PRE-SET PROGRAMS】-Easily switch between 2 and 3 mph with just one button for your convenience. 6 Pre-set programs provide varying levels of workouts between 30 min and 99 minutes long.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('426731a2-688e-4ebf-a372-89d016e0f913', '184a5d3c-4e73-4cb5-b02c-dd366faefdd3', 'Hyper Quiet Magnetic Rear Drive System:The pooboo E399 elliptical features a smooth and natural motion provided by a quiet magnetic drive system. The Rear Drive combined the heavy 16 LB flywheel allows the center of gravity to shift back for safer and easier workout. Functions in both forward and reverse motion. Control the sound at 20 DB, your workout will never disturb your neighbors or family, just enjoy a peaceful and effective exercise in your own home');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4e027696-7ea6-465d-8504-ae06ba1365bf', '184a5d3c-4e73-4cb5-b02c-dd366faefdd3', 'Large Monitor and Rotatable Tablet Holder:The digital monitor displays SCAN, TIME, SPEED, DISTANCE, CALORIES, PULSE and ODO, which will make you know your exercise data clearly. Help you make a more exact training schedule to achieve your exercise goal. Additionally, E399 designed with a rotatable tablet holder, can be rotated horizontally and vertically. The holder can hold tablet screen up to 11.8" in length, so you can use your smart devices to watch shows or follow workout routines');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9e1696c2-aaf1-4d84-bef8-f772584df963', '184a5d3c-4e73-4cb5-b02c-dd366faefdd3', 'Connection to Fitness APP: Built-In Sensor, compatible with KINOMAP, Zt APP. With KINOMAP/Zt Smart Fitness APP, you can record and view training data and share fitness data on social media. Make your exercise more fun');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cf892f2a-3e80-41fb-bfb7-f07897052ffd', '184a5d3c-4e73-4cb5-b02c-dd366faefdd3', 'Long-life Service: Pooboo guarantees a lifetime customer service for the E399 elliptical machine. If there is a quality or assembly problem, please don''t hesitate to contact us with your needs. All messages will get responses within 24 hours.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('53690896-4000-471f-a71e-a924f1e79a27', '34d1a6e2-2336-4dfe-a150-5b6a1a56013c', 'LOW-IMPACT& 0 PRESSURE: DUREXO under desk elliptical, improves cardiovascular health, and enhances lower body muscle strength and lower extremity mobility. It is the best choice for office workers, seniors, and those who need leg rehabilitation');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fd124cbb-18f6-4c38-9187-0445c40d733d', '34d1a6e2-2336-4dfe-a150-5b6a1a56013c', 'AUTO/MANUAL 2-IN-1: The elliptical exercise machine provides auto (P1-P3) and manual (12 speed levels) functions. The automatic program state, can not adjust the time, speed, or direction. You need to set it to manual mode to make adjustments. Provide you with diverse training possibilities to elevate your exercise routine');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9187ed56-1dc9-4791-81b4-4c4c1cd1594c', '34d1a6e2-2336-4dfe-a150-5b6a1a56013c', 'LCD DISPLAY: Multifunctional LCD touchscreen is added based on traditional exercise equipment. Equipped with a large screen with clear fonts, easy to operate and watch, it can clearly display exercise data (time, distance, speed, calories, counter). Real-time observation of workout status');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9b54d23d-3b1a-4cd6-b6c4-2c66b915adb7', '34d1a6e2-2336-4dfe-a150-5b6a1a56013c', 'SILENT OPERATION: Equipped with the latest silent system, this under-desk elliptical ensures a noiseless workout, even at a high speed. It allows you to exercise anytime and anywhere, without disturbing your co-workers or family members');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cbe3ec6e-4e49-426f-b501-d22716efbc97', '34d1a6e2-2336-4dfe-a150-5b6a1a56013c', 'FORWARD AND BACKWARD: The ellipse leg exerciser has two modes of operation, move forward and backward, targeting different muscle groups as well as ligaments for a complete workout. For a versatile workout experience (Do not use the elliptical standing up)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e0595980-8374-46f6-addc-52d9ae0e96ce', '34d1a6e2-2336-4dfe-a150-5b6a1a56013c', 'REMOTE CONTROL: The elderly seated pedal exercise machine is equipped with a remote control to control the machine, It is easy to operate, and can be switched to manual mode with one key. It allows you to change the mode without bending down and reduces the burden on your back');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d9b39831-5b2a-4e78-9a7c-4516df7c7a3c', '34d1a6e2-2336-4dfe-a150-5b6a1a56013c', 'AFTER-SALES SERVICE: After-sales service - everyone who owns a under desk elliptical machine can enjoy a three-month service and after-sales service, and you can through Amazon messages for questions about seated ellipticals');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('40392d96-a72d-4baf-8019-1e440b78b1c2', 'c332a2ce-a976-474e-ba4e-11c57f14ef25', '【2 IN 1 & AUTO OR MANUAL MODES】Morelax under desk elliptical machine has Manual (12-level speed) & Auto (P1-P3) for your choice. Pedals can forward or backward to target different muscles.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('742e32bf-91a3-49fa-86c6-d71f02e75126', 'c332a2ce-a976-474e-ba4e-11c57f14ef25', '【LOW-IMPACT& 0 PRESSURE 】Low-Intensity Exercise under the desk elliptical is especially suitable for the elderly and people who have leg rehabilitation. Low-intensity exercise can burn calories, improve cardiovascular health and strengthen muscles, and at the same time help the legs adapt and recover quickly.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('30c7ff54-06c8-4dff-98a2-ad94433f7f0b', 'c332a2ce-a976-474e-ba4e-11c57f14ef25', '【SILENT OPERATION】Equipped with the latest silent system, this under-desk elliptical ensures a noiseless workout, even at a high speed. It allows you to exercise anytime and anywhere, without disturbing your co-workers or family members.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('36db199f-27b6-47f1-852e-912f5aa7f8f2', 'c332a2ce-a976-474e-ba4e-11c57f14ef25', '【REMOTE CONTROL】Morelax pedal exerciser for seniors feature with thoughtful remote control allows you to change mode without bending over, reducing strain on your back. This means you can work or relax while seated and still get the exercise you need. Say goodbye to fatigue and hello to a healthier you.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0c6e102d-9d05-43d2-be30-c56ff04ad490', 'c332a2ce-a976-474e-ba4e-11c57f14ef25', '【AFTER-SALES SERVICE】After-sales service - everyone who owns a under desk elliptical machine can enjoy a 90days return service and after-sales service, and you can through Amazon messages for questions about seated elliptical.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('14ba3eec-8c62-474b-918a-a03b1fcc3fd9', '89400577-b17a-4716-a014-bcea8a124d2a', 'HAVE FUN AND STAY FIT: The Me-Mover FIT is the perfect stand-up bike if you are looking for outdoor body workout. Forget the boring standard machine workout and take your training to the next level while having fun.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8ae68785-87d0-424d-987c-aaabf1641c10', '89400577-b17a-4716-a014-bcea8a124d2a', 'LOW IMPACT ON JOINTS: A great alternative to running by offering intense exercise with lower impact (acceleration forces) on the joints and tendons. Ideal for both rehabilitating and preventive purposes to sport injuries.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('12e2713d-b46e-45c1-ac9f-f98495657c93', '89400577-b17a-4716-a014-bcea8a124d2a', 'BURN UP TO 50% MORE CALORIES: The Me-Mover will give you an almost full-body outdoor workout. The upright position offers ergonomic mobility with a motion resembling a mix of skiing and running - ideal for your mind and body. Get all the benefits of activating 6 major muscle groups combined with the low impact on joints, reducing the usual risk of sports injuries. Training Cardio, Core and Caloric burn has never been so fun and efficient.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1fbd39a4-1cde-4846-a072-f40ec0c03937', '89400577-b17a-4716-a014-bcea8a124d2a', 'RECOVER & REGAIN: Me-Mover will assist a faster recovery and help you regain balance, strength and stability. The upright position and low impact on joints delivers freedom to move and build muscles for recovering injuries or weaknesses in back, knees, hips, and ankles. On the Me-Mover you will be able to mind your training and get back in shape.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c9ee9344-bf2c-42dd-b77a-3c6acee5490f', '89400577-b17a-4716-a014-bcea8a124d2a', 'FOLDING MECHANISM: The easy folding mechanism allows you to bring the Me-Mover along for your trips by train, car or plane.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('204f1f99-93f1-40fd-9387-a5a4f493205b', '9d2217e0-e0c3-458e-abc9-3ec7b497fec4', '【Low-impact Exercise】Upgrade your exercise routine with our under-desk elliptical. This elliptical exercise machine is designed for low-impact workouts, helping you burn calories, tone muscles, and improve cardiovascular health without putting undue pressure on your joints.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8cb4a208-e210-456d-aa4a-633d02558af7', '9d2217e0-e0c3-458e-abc9-3ec7b497fec4', '【Silent Operation】Equipped with the latest silent system, our under-desk elliptical ensures a noiseless workout, even at high speeds. This feature allows you to exercise anytime and anywhere without disturbing coworkers or family members.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cd55e1cd-0b2b-474f-b4a2-14855aefef0a', 'c36d0247-a5bc-42c1-b84e-f160238dd7d8', '【NO ASSEMBLY REQUIRED】- This foldable treadmill is ready for use with no assembly required.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('10a40884-69f4-440d-b1f6-f8b7fe76c565', '9d2217e0-e0c3-458e-abc9-3ec7b497fec4', '【Versatile Use】This ellipse leg exerciser as seen on TV is compact and lightweight, making it perfect for versatile use. Whether you prefer sitting or standing, you can pedal forward or backward to target different muscles. Use the included resistance bands to work out your arms, back, shoulders, and chest.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e247e809-8726-44d8-84a3-34147444e43d', '9d2217e0-e0c3-458e-abc9-3ec7b497fec4', '【7-Inch Stride Length】The under desk elliptical machine has a maximum step length of 7 inches, which is effective in boosting your calorie burning rate by 50%. It provides a better lower body workout whether you are working or relaxing at your desk.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('58e9201f-f1fb-46c3-b7d6-13d417c54a12', '9d2217e0-e0c3-458e-abc9-3ec7b497fec4', '【Resistance Bands for Full-Body Exercise】The under desk elliptical with resistance bands for combined aerobic and anaerobic full-body exercise. Enhance strength and endurance in arms, back, shoulders, and chest, improving overall fitness levels.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('50904c02-a11e-440b-a884-226a736535a6', '9d2217e0-e0c3-458e-abc9-3ec7b497fec4', '【Adjustable Resistance】Customize your workouts with adjustable resistance levels. Increase resistance over time to build muscle endurance and achieve your fitness goals using this versatile piece of exercise equipment.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2a23514d-dafb-449e-9a62-ca9ba1c01b59', '9d2217e0-e0c3-458e-abc9-3ec7b497fec4', '【LCD Monitor for Tracking Progress】Keep track of your exercise progress with the built-in digital monitor. It displays exercise time, speed, distance, and calories burned, allowing you to monitor your performance easily.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4622422a-82b4-43ed-b905-997ce775e72c', '9d2217e0-e0c3-458e-abc9-3ec7b497fec4', '【Space-saving Design】With its compact and sturdy design, this elliptical is ideal for limited spaces. Enjoy high-quality cardio and lower body workouts at home with this leg exerciser while sitting for seniors, and easily store it when not in use.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('01e26d88-d21b-44e4-b3bf-febcf177cbbe', 'f25f5701-8285-4556-91e3-bcc455b77998', '3-in-1 home gym equipment: YOSUDA elliptical stepper combines vertical and horizontal stride, providing the easy, low-impact motion of an elliptical, and cardiorespiratory improving power of a stepper, with calorie burning power of a treadmill');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('526b3687-3b35-483a-a7cf-a3b5b80d3c01', 'f25f5701-8285-4556-91e3-bcc455b77998', '18 lbs flywheel with 16 resistance control: this elliptical cross trainer climber comes with 18 lbs flywheel, 16 resistance levels and 45°climbing stride motion, improves the exercise efficiency and easier sweat than the traditional elliptical machine');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('092545c4-ef26-4160-bcdb-850c4c7a54f9', 'f25f5701-8285-4556-91e3-bcc455b77998', 'Solid build: confidently enjoy long-lasting climbing and striding sessions thanks to 15mm thickened frame tube and 300lbs user weight. Heavy-duty front and rear stabilizers contribute outstanding stability, provide you a safe climbing without any wobble');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c22ec24d-20bd-4bde-a3d2-65784e72c35a', 'f25f5701-8285-4556-91e3-bcc455b77998', 'Quiet and smooth: suitable for shared spaces. We developed the latest technology magnetic system and eliminates noise, also control the sound at 26 dB even after millions of times workout. Smooth climb and stride, protecting your knees');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('716048b2-fc60-4466-8239-2d1abee483ce', 'f25f5701-8285-4556-91e3-bcc455b77998', 'Exactly calculated data: track your calories, time, speed, distance, odo and pulse.Data is dual-calibrated by serious algorithms, motivate you by visualizing your exercise effect, help set more exact target to achieve your exercise goals');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('86409044-dea6-42cf-81ff-de807e696317', 'f25f5701-8285-4556-91e3-bcc455b77998', 'Space saving: with the most compact design in the class that fits almost any space in your home, apartment, or fitness room. Only 38 x 21 x 62 inch, save 20% space at least than other cardio machines. Front rollers for easy relocation anywhere');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('53438c52-81cb-4fb0-8a18-e5292d97910f', 'f25f5701-8285-4556-91e3-bcc455b77998', 'Customer service: we provide 5 year service to YOSUDA cardio climber. We have set an online service team, your concerns are answered within 12 hours');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7c13576a-7561-4c46-a51f-db65b4d7a2a2', 'e9835f06-5798-438d-9a02-3a44a570b00b', 'Ditch the excuses - Sweat anytime, anywhere with the Stamina InMotion Compact Strider with Resistance Tubes. This portable elliptical machine offers low-impact cardio that fits your schedule. Get fit and improve stamina without stress on your joints.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('dbfb7cc0-ebe0-45af-8528-b7c26f79c619', 'e9835f06-5798-438d-9a02-3a44a570b00b', 'Breakthrough workouts - Forward-reverse foot pedal targets legs and the medium resistance tubes add upper-body toning! Track progress with a built-in monitor and adjust tension for personalized foot exercise intensity with seated or standing options.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4f39702b-5dad-4bfa-87fb-4e38c3845abe', 'e9835f06-5798-438d-9a02-3a44a570b00b', 'Thoughtfully designed - The Stamina InMotion mini elliptical fits into your life with a compact design perfect as desk exercise equipment. With sturdy steel construction, an easy carry handle and non-slip pedals for the smoothest stride.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('658017d5-c969-4dae-96fd-536600423e7a', 'e9835f06-5798-438d-9a02-3a44a570b00b', 'Smart Workouts - Tailor your exercise routine with the Stamina Inmotion Compact Strider, integrated with müüv app for personalized smart workouts! müüv seamlessly integrates with your desk elliptical for an exceptional experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c00623b1-a189-4bde-8099-eec22c1f12f2', 'e9835f06-5798-438d-9a02-3a44a570b00b', 'Ditch the Bulky Gym Equipment with Stamina - Our elliptical machines help you stay in shape, standing or sitting down. This mini elliptical fits under your desk and can be moved anywhere with ease, No more excuses, start feeling your best today!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4c1d5dc9-bb18-4481-9ef8-52badf1cc011', '2a4f1232-7426-4b10-ab81-e6db40658664', '【Advanced 2.5HP Brushless Motor】Our walking pad treadmill features an advanced 2.5HP brushless motor, ensuring ultra-quiet operation, making it perfect for under desk treadmill use without disturbing others. No more worries about smoke or burning smells(the common issues of brushed motor');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('903f5a39-5279-4d24-9eca-92ec120b81fa', '2a4f1232-7426-4b10-ab81-e6db40658664', '【Optimal Shock Absorption】Equipped with dual shock absorption technology, our walking pad treadmill offers a suspended shock-absorbing running board and high-performance TPR cushioning pad, providing optimal protection for your ankles and knee joints during exercise');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0dc55a07-79af-439c-9a9c-6b0bf2b35cb5', '2a4f1232-7426-4b10-ab81-e6db40658664', '【Lightweight & Portable Design】With its lightweight and compact design, our walking pad under desk treadmill is easy to carry and store, perfect for those looking for a mini treadmill solution. Its two front wheels ensure effortless movement and hassle-free storage under sofa');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7fc6687f-8a24-4f58-b4b2-314d19c11da4', '2a4f1232-7426-4b10-ab81-e6db40658664', '【Versatile Use & 0.5-4 MPH】With speed 0-4MPH, our treadmill for office use offers versatility, making it suitable for both walking and jogging. It''s an ideal treadmill for home small spaces or as an under desk treadmill for maintaining a balanced work and exercise routine');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2bfcc6b7-5ec7-43c7-82aa-4615262589eb', '2a4f1232-7426-4b10-ab81-e6db40658664', '【Reliable Protection & Support】Backed by a 2-YEAR Protection, ensuring peace of mind with prompt and professional assistance for any issues');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('06cc6bdb-c76a-4fd0-a949-e50c1c6fb349', 'c36d0247-a5bc-42c1-b84e-f160238dd7d8', '【400 LBS. HIGHEST WEIGHT CAPACITY】-Specially designed to handle up to 400 pounds of weight capacity, this heavy duty treadmill is perfect for those of us that are determined to reclaim our health. Exercise with confidence, knowing that this product was built to handle tough workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c7c51757-fa0d-49a6-a096-45f050783b63', 'c36d0247-a5bc-42c1-b84e-f160238dd7d8', '【2-IN-1 DESK TREADMILL & WALKING PAD】- Fold the handlebars down and it converts to an under desk treadmill with a max speed of 3 MPH, which is a very fast walk. Or leave the handlebars up for a more challenging workout with a max speed of 4 mph (slow run).');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a2a24063-935d-4783-86cd-d6ad114e9830', 'c36d0247-a5bc-42c1-b84e-f160238dd7d8', '【LONGER AND WIDER NON-SLIP BELT】-Our 43.5" x 16" belt offers superior comfort, perfect for taller users, surpassing most competitors in size.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ed795343-e1e3-4996-814c-f482f47145c2', 'c36d0247-a5bc-42c1-b84e-f160238dd7d8', '【COMPACT & CONVENIENT】- Perfect for home offices, its sleek design seamlessly fits into your workspace without dominating the room. It maximizes space with its small 55 x 25 x 4.75 inches footprint.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fe894f2d-0467-4b58-bea0-1821d4d6cd78', 'c36d0247-a5bc-42c1-b84e-f160238dd7d8', '【LARGE EASY READ LED】- Track your speed, distance, time and calories with our large and easy to read LED display.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('99a2b035-c6cb-4308-b730-d7678442f04a', '9e467800-dd51-4ed4-82fe-c2067ed15246', 'PORTABLE TREADMILL: Indoor portable treadmill, meticulously designed for compact living spaces, the exercise equipment serves as the perfect at-home workout companion');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('36e4af7c-4c62-4f0e-bae4-85377b91fef6', '9e467800-dd51-4ed4-82fe-c2067ed15246', 'BLUETOOTH CONNECTIVITY: Pair your smartphone with Bluetooth connectivity and use the Kinomap, Zwift & FitShow apps to manage fitness goals and keep track of exercise records');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5a509496-5769-4d60-bd3c-43be977429cc', '9e467800-dd51-4ed4-82fe-c2067ed15246', 'LCD DISPLAY: Knee and joint-safe treadmill with safety key for quick stopping while the LCD progress tracker display panel features built-in speakers for playing music while working out');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8a5a0cf8-31d5-4c05-b7e5-861696a04696', '9e467800-dd51-4ed4-82fe-c2067ed15246', 'ADJUSTABLE SPEEDS: Made with controllable speeds ranging from 0.60 to 8 miles per hour, 4 levels of manual inclines, and a selection of 12 presets for fitness enthusiasts of all levels');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fc5580c4-e09e-4cb1-a73a-170f4df876f7', '9e467800-dd51-4ed4-82fe-c2067ed15246', 'INCLUDED EQUIPMENT: Ideal home gym experience with all necessary equipment, including 2 small dumbbells and an ab mat for full-body workouts; Treadmill Dimensions (L x W x H): 51 x 26 x 48 inches');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('715327c8-c28a-4ffa-a878-660c35e7ed13', 'c3426853-178b-480a-bf11-958cd16f5b09', '2 in 1 Treadmill: Our under desk walking pad is designed to walk, jog and run machine. You can adjust the speed from 0-3.8 MPH according to your needs. It''s easy for you to keep exercising while working in the office.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7df67cbe-8460-4dc7-8b87-b59c2268a38b', 'c3426853-178b-480a-bf11-958cd16f5b09', 'Running belt structure: 5 layers of non-slip running belt and silicone column support can greatly absorb the impact caused by the movement, providing cushioning for the knees, muscles and ankles.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0dbff660-d88e-4648-9827-a491fcb9ed4b', 'c3426853-178b-480a-bf11-958cd16f5b09', '2.5HP Powerful Motor: The treadmill is equipped with a powerful 2.5HP motor and offers a large weight capacity of up to 265 lbs. And it is quiet while using. Using noise below 45 DB, so you can exercise while not disturbing others.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7664951a-6d29-4170-8cd9-4ca5273ab7f9', 'c3426853-178b-480a-bf11-958cd16f5b09', 'LED Display & Remote Control: Our treadmill uses LED display to clearly show the time, calories, steps, speed and distance, which is convenient for you to monitor the exercise data in real time. And with a remote control, allowing you to adjust the speed of exercise at any time.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9444ae24-5e20-477a-9a3d-3b61c542570a', 'c3426853-178b-480a-bf11-958cd16f5b09', 'Hassle-free warranty: You get a 1-year warranty and 24-hour friendly customer service. Please do not hesitate to contact us with any questions.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('db3ac92e-ec47-4158-9bcb-1ac48105461a', '120f1a22-cbfa-42cb-8424-4b73a235bd6a', 'Powerful & Quiet Motor: The walking pad is equipped with a powerful 2.5 HP motor and is able to load bear up to 320+ lbs. And it is quiet while using, making it ideal for home and office use. Using noise below 45 db, so you can exercise while not disturbing others');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('21e38ae8-2bca-48d0-aac3-024b58fb1249', '120f1a22-cbfa-42cb-8424-4b73a235bd6a', 'Adjustable Incline Levels: With 6% or 12% 2-level incline selection, the under desk treadmill''s incline function is easy to use without any tool. The 12% incline design simulate climbing effect more realistically than other regular treadmill, burning an additional 60% calories. You can choose the mode that works best for a more productive workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('34f77cd2-490d-4522-9a94-0593e1f5c75e', '120f1a22-cbfa-42cb-8424-4b73a235bd6a', 'LED Displays & Smart Remote: The LED display of the portable treadmill clearly displays speed, time, distance and calories, allowing you to grasp your exercise status in real time. Using the APP and remote control to adjust the speed within the range of 0.6-3.8 mph and start/stop the running walking pad');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a4439816-ceaa-4b9b-8a3c-ad148bc6bbfa', '120f1a22-cbfa-42cb-8424-4b73a235bd6a', 'Easy to move & Space Saver Design: Our compact treadmills for home size approx:(L*W*H) 46.5*20.7*4.9 inches and the weight is 41.4 pounds. There are two front transport wheels so that it is easy to be moved and placed under sofa, corner or bed to save your home space. Only adjustable foot pads require assembly');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3fb30b75-91a7-43eb-8a3a-069599e1dd4e', '120f1a22-cbfa-42cb-8424-4b73a235bd6a', 'Non Slip Running Belt & Shock Reduction System: This walking pad treadmill with a durable steel frame and 5 layers of non-slip running belt, 4 rubber cushions and 8 silicone shocks, it helps to shock absorbing and noise reducing, significantly reduce impact and provide cushioning for knees, ankles and joints. The runner belt area is as large as 16*41 inches');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('28d8be7c-4c91-4e11-b4b3-5e7f8d1e5892', '120f1a22-cbfa-42cb-8424-4b73a235bd6a', '3 In 1 Incline Treadmill: This desk treadmill offers a speed range from 0.6 to 3.8 mph. 0.6-1.0 mph working mode, 1.0-2.5 mph walking mode, 2.5-3.8 mph running mode, available to choose different speeds for different physical conditions and environments. Very suitable for personal use and family enjoyment, including elderly users');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c13850e7-0d46-49c0-bc22-bf470e2c37d5', '120f1a22-cbfa-42cb-8424-4b73a235bd6a', 'Customer First: If you need any assistance, you can keep in touch with the WELLFIT after-sales service team, We will answer your question within 24 hours. In addition, if you need to buy remote control and other accessories, you can go to our store or ask customer service');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ee673b59-464f-4152-8fff-54ad8a6f1732', 'fe9449cf-1ddb-44d6-afa5-f314b404e35b', 'Manual Incline for Higher Fat-burning - Our walking pad under desk is designed with a 15°manual incline, which allows you to activate the incline function in one step without any tools to simulate climbing effect more realistically, and burn an additional 60% calories. This compact treadmill meets your need for higher intensity exercise levels and calorie burning.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('23bbdf25-5859-4f62-b7ac-e14dd7738c25', 'fe9449cf-1ddb-44d6-afa5-f314b404e35b', 'Two Speed Control Methods - Our portable treadmill comes with both screen panel control and remote control, you can choose the most suitable adjusting method according to the actual use. Especially the panel control is convenient, and there is no need to worry about losing or damaging the remote control.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('277b79c0-85b1-49e5-a872-563c28fd002e', 'fe9449cf-1ddb-44d6-afa5-f314b404e35b', 'Anti-Slip & Shock-Absorbing - Our walking pad adopts 5-layer running belt and 10 shock absorbers, greatly reducing impact during exercise, fully protect knees and ankles, and avoid joint injuries. And the diamond pattern design of the running belt also greatly improves the anti-slip and wear resistance of the treadmill and increases the service life of the machine.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4f01fc40-7087-4563-b182-5ea36e464dca', 'fe9449cf-1ddb-44d6-afa5-f314b404e35b', 'Real Time Data tracking - This walking pad treadmill comes with a clear LED display and will cycle through time, speed, distance, and calories during use. Also, this walking treadmill features a pause function, which allows you to continue exercising on top of the original data after pausing.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5992c91a-9fee-4592-812e-8ee991400e1c', 'fe9449cf-1ddb-44d6-afa5-f314b404e35b', '2.5HP Power & Stable Motor - The walking pad with incline is equipped with 2.5HP motor and load a max weight capacity of 265lbs, and max 3.8mph, while keeping the noise lower than 45 db. Low noise treadmill is ideal for home and office use without worrying about disturbing others.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bff51954-5a20-4156-b929-5e49dd461709', 'fe9449cf-1ddb-44d6-afa5-f314b404e35b', 'Easy to Move and Store - Thickness of our compact treadmill is only 5.1'''', which is easy to be stored under the sofa, desk or bed, making it a great space saver. The walking pad has two wheels on the front side and the machine weighs only 37lbs, so even girls can easily move it to any position you want.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5370c7b0-3af6-47c5-88e8-d7d2c2aa311a', 'fe9449cf-1ddb-44d6-afa5-f314b404e35b', '1 Year manufacture - AXEFIT takes the responsibility of one year manufacture for our manual incline treadmills, please don’t worry, professional and friendly after-sales team will help you solve any problem, and you only need to enjoy the convenience it brings.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('691c8d3f-0b1c-4b00-b424-58fc2e080357', 'a67e5317-9f85-4637-bde4-114e2b0453c1', '【CONNECTED TREADMILL FITNESS】Treadmill with your smart devices via Bluetooth and the YPOO APP. Built-in music playback allow you to enjoy your favorite music during fitness and view a variety of training events and live racing events on the APP. You can personalize your training and track your progress in real-time as you run.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('47a34b26-086a-48d1-8e82-247aabee770c', 'a67e5317-9f85-4637-bde4-114e2b0453c1', '【HUGE WINDOWN DISPLAY】The 16 Inch multi-function LED screen of folding treadmill clearly displays time, speed, distance and calories to accurately track your exercise performance. This treadmill with handles have P-button 12 preset programs and countdown modes provide different intensities of exercise and you can choose customized one with ease.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('85230832-e60e-4757-9645-ad25ef3148d9', 'a67e5317-9f85-4637-bde4-114e2b0453c1', '【AUTO FOLDING & COMPACT 】 Treadmill folds down smoothly and safely with a soft drop mechanism, allowing for hands-free folding. Treadmill also with wheels for easy moving,and store,When folded it has a total dimension of just 10.5 ft,suitable for use in small spaces.The running belt is equipped with a 5-layer non-slip belt. Reduce force rebound, buffer ground vibration,effectively reduce joint impact,protect the knee.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f8cd8c62-c307-4f6a-bb7a-feb9ca3af93b', 'a67e5317-9f85-4637-bde4-114e2b0453c1', '【Easy To INSTALLATION】 This treadmill has mostly of it''s assembled. only need to tighten 8 screws to assemble this walking pad treadmill. We are equipped with detailed installation tutorials, so there is no need to worry about installation issues.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5feb7483-b231-4a9d-8c38-2db811ef52ec', 'a67e5317-9f85-4637-bde4-114e2b0453c1', '【TREADMILL WITH INCLINE】Quick access to 3mph, 6mph, and the maximum of 8 mph. Discover the versatility of speeds. And offers a unique manual incline with a maximum incline of 8%,boosting calorie burn by up to 60% compared to a regular walking pad for home. Whether you''re a beginner or a seasoned runner, effortlessly select the perfect pace.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('76b51e28-4f16-43ce-8935-28728e0d204b', 'a67e5317-9f85-4637-bde4-114e2b0453c1', '【Quality Awesome Service】YPOO is committed to providing every customer best possible experience and offers 24/7 support with satisfaction solutions.We provide users with high-quality after-sales service.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('53e60ba7-897f-40c2-8347-52bb41f4711f', '79c1b8c7-08f1-47a9-af8c-618da5a7a232', 'Folding Walking Pad: This walking pad treadmill offers distinct workout modes to cater to your fitness needs. You can select diverse speeds based on your exercise routine. When the handle is folded, the speed is 0.6-3.8mph. When the handle is raised, the speed is 0.6-6.2mph');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b68b5f6c-643b-4baa-bb0c-18db62a71893', '79c1b8c7-08f1-47a9-af8c-618da5a7a232', 'Safe and Stable Performance: The RuniRox inclined treadmill features an ergonomically designed frame, with a distinctive shape that can be inserted and rotated to offer three incline options. The increased incline will help you burn more fat, strengthen your glutes and leg muscles');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('04abfbd5-c565-49d6-927f-64899d619558', '79c1b8c7-08f1-47a9-af8c-618da5a7a232', 'Comfortable Sports Experience: The treadmill uses a high-quality running belt featuring 3D diamond texture and a 5-layer anti-slip design. The integrated shock absorption system can significantly reduce noise and protect your joints and muscles from pressure');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('96d95d9d-d2c9-4b71-839b-4c8970d77175', '79c1b8c7-08f1-47a9-af8c-618da5a7a232', 'Intelligent Usage: Through LED Screen, various sports modes can be switched effortlessly. The LED screen displays real-time exercise data, such as speed, distance, time, and calories. You can also customize the lighting ambiance to match your mood, creating sports atmosphere');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b62ba167-c808-4d49-8910-a849a3214cb9', '79c1b8c7-08f1-47a9-af8c-618da5a7a232', 'Save Space: Our treadmill measuring just 4.2 inches thick, allowing for easy mobility and storage beneath beds, sofas, and desks. Its built-in wheels facilitate effortless access whenever needed, ensuring it doesn’t encroach on your living area');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('47e76797-e931-4718-9346-093ac0303496', '71372459-7c7f-420e-aa74-744da2d3a508', 'Variable Speeds for Versatile Workouts ~ With a maximum speed of 6.2mph, this folding treadmill accommodates various fitness levels, allowing users to walk or run at different intensities for a customized workout experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('644ff2ea-ee9a-4792-975f-91a6ca3fd7c8', '71372459-7c7f-420e-aa74-744da2d3a508', 'Space-Saving Design ~ Effortlessly fold the 47.6"x21.6"x40.5" treadmill to a compact size of 47.6"x21.6"x4.7", providing a convenient solution for users with limited space. The folding feature ensures easy storage when not in use');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8dd90421-9a18-44d4-9090-d04b55b93471', '71372459-7c7f-420e-aa74-744da2d3a508', 'Intuitive Dual Control and LED Display ~ Enjoy flexibility in controlling the treadmill either through the included remote or the console. The LED display conveniently showcases essential workout metrics such as speed, distance, time, and calories, enhancing user convenience and tracking');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('654a6453-a645-4cd1-b4d6-e0f63ed9619d', '71372459-7c7f-420e-aa74-744da2d3a508', 'Whisper-Quiet, Long-Lasting Motor ~ Powered by a 2.25HP motor, this treadmill operates at a noise level below 45dB, ensuring a quiet workout environment.UMAY motor not only extends the lifespan fourfold compared to other motors but also aligns with eco-friendly and energy-efficient practices');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('60baa6e0-89f5-489c-8fb9-94af47a35fa0', '71372459-7c7f-420e-aa74-744da2d3a508', '16" ultra-wide running belt ~ providing ample space for comfortable and secure running. The width promotes a sense of stability, allowing users to run more freely and confidently');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9c4f0bb1-40cb-43ef-9446-55320c118b8a', '71372459-7c7f-420e-aa74-744da2d3a508', 'Advanced Shock Absorption Technology ~ Boasting a five-layer running belt and an exclusive shock-absorbing system, this treadmill prioritizes user safety and comfort. The system effectively cushions each stride, protecting ankles from impact and ensuring a more enjoyable and injury-resistant running experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b39fb283-247d-4820-a5b3-a74ad44ab5d2', '33c6270b-f829-4c34-8db7-0907b47366d7', '[Quiet High Motor and Shock Absorb System ] - Considering that many users use it in home, we equipped a High-Power quiet strong 2.5HP motor in this compact treadmill, And the strong shock absorbing running belt which made of PVC, fiber and cotton yarn can help reduce the noise and improve stability while running too. Redliro sturdy & quiet Portable treadmill will let you no longer worry about disturbing your neighbors by exercising at home.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5bdb838d-f89e-4d46-b034-f95867864cda', '33c6270b-f829-4c34-8db7-0907b47366d7', '[2-In-1 foldable treadmill] - Max weight capacity 220 lb and the run area size is 41inch X 15inch suit for most people. When slowly raise the hand rail, it will be a jogging and running treadmill. After you fold the hand rail up, it can be placed under a standing desk and used as a Under desk treadmill to walk and jog while you are working or watching to exercise your body, Raise heart rate, boost metabolism.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ef5ef0df-742a-41a8-bed8-40a70e039ced', '33c6270b-f829-4c34-8db7-0907b47366d7', '[Easy to Assemble and Space Save] - Equipped with our best technology, Redliro Portable Folding treadmill is designed to be sturdy and slim, and it has a compact size, so the flat treadmill can be used in a small space. And the hand rail can be folded up, and is very simple to be stored up, the wheels on the front help you move anywhere with ease, and ultra-thin size saves your limited space.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8e325fd4-aa7e-4caf-9ea7-3f643626cba0', 'e9d48019-d1a1-4877-94f3-903032893754', '【SPACIOUS RUNNING SURFACE】Enjoy a comfortable workout experience with the 49 x 15.5 inches running surface, providing ample room for long strides and natural movement.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ffd80be5-59a0-47ed-9550-a3c6cfd323fa', '28ae2403-44f1-4b1d-ac83-51fed66ce9b3', 'iFIT Pro Membership Required; on-demand workouts on your equipment with Global Workouts & Studio Classes; Add up to 5 users; Elite trainers adjust your equipment');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('995ad527-cc7a-45f2-a6bd-999bd52a1cd2', '33c6270b-f829-4c34-8db7-0907b47366d7', '[12 Preset Programs & Manual Modes] - In order to increase the fun of jogging and walking on the walking Pad, we preset 12 programs in the Under desk treadmill. Each program will simulate the real motion scene, it will change speed every 1.5 minutes. And if the manual standby mode, you can adjust the speed/distance/time/Calories by the remote control to meet your personal need. Multiple adjustable parameters can meet the needs of different groups of people. Make sure you can use it successfully.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('92ac2d1e-b810-4209-b975-8f664ea1c912', '33c6270b-f829-4c34-8db7-0907b47366d7', '[Muti-function Display with Remote Control] - The LED display on the Under desk treadmill clearly shows time, calories, step, speed and distance, keeping your movement data at a glance. In order to make it convenient for users to watch TV or read in the process of sports. We designed a device holder, and you can put phone on it. And when you are walking under desk, remote control also can adjust your mode easily.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f420f5ed-d2e5-47e6-b42e-7aa0e510743a', '4ad6fee1-c8a1-40f5-8cdb-f0241e44c4f0', 'EXCELLENT LED DISPLAY: AoraPulse foldable treadmill with multi-function LED display, P: 12 preset programs, M: 3 control modes, +: speed+, -: speed-. It is convenient to clearly show and track time, speed, distance, and calories, making your workouts clear at a glance to achieve different training goals. In addition, it is also equipped with a cup holder, tablet/mobile phone holder, safety key, and armrests to facilitate your exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c06543eb-fc82-472f-8b91-18f09337a32a', '4ad6fee1-c8a1-40f5-8cdb-f0241e44c4f0', 'POWERFUL BRUSHLESS QUIET MOTOR: The portable treadmill features a powerful 3.0 horsepower motor that offers a weight capacity of up to 300 pounds, allows you to run up to 6.2 mph, and quiet brushless motor produces less than 45 dB, makes sure your workout without create any noise. Designed for home/office use without disturbing your downstairs or next door.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6eb666ee-889f-4fdf-8790-dfb5041fb92a', '4ad6fee1-c8a1-40f5-8cdb-f0241e44c4f0', 'SMALL & COMPACT: The folding treadmill is equipped with knobs and moving wheels for easy folding, moving, and storage. When folded, its total dimensions are just 48.03L x 22.83W x 5.51H inches. Most parts of this walking treadmill are assembled. Assemble this walking pad treadmill in just 5 minutes! All tools, parts, and instructions are well packaged in a box. Also includes lubricants. and you can start running to music or watching videos for an enjoyable home or office workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7e5241c3-d84b-4eff-99f2-3d2878f35c89', '4ad6fee1-c8a1-40f5-8cdb-f0241e44c4f0', 'COMFORTABLE QUALITY: The electric treadmill for home is made of a 15 x 41-inch multi-layer anti-slip shock-absorbing quiet system running belt, providing ample exercise space and a more comfortable experience for your runs. Rated voltage: 110V/50/60HZ. Additionally, the electric treadmill features a non-slip running area that provides a more comfortable exercise experience for you, your family, and even your pets, providing a quiet environment for exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('afb105f8-4bf0-4acc-bd42-76e58206d8bf', '4ad6fee1-c8a1-40f5-8cdb-f0241e44c4f0', 'EXCELLENT QUALITY & GUARANTEE: AoraPulse provides excellent service. Please feel free to contact us and we will give you a satisfactory solution within 24 hours until the problem is solved. TIPS: Before using the treadmill, please make sure that the safety key is properly positioned.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8a262904-16ba-43d9-b748-e141164aa64c', '85e064cb-ff33-486d-bc02-8c2a06ea13fc', '【Powerful Quiet Motor】Treadmill for home with a powerful quiet moter, the walking pad treadmill is able to support a weight capacity of 300lbs and allows walking, jogging and running with 0.6-7.6mph speed. Moreover, the walking pad treadmill is whisper-quiet which is perfect for home, apartment or office exercise without worrying about disturbing others. Enjoy a comfortable exercise and to improve cardiovascular fitness and boost health');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c5cfa8bb-65d8-4cc8-b46d-9f1a3281bed9', '85e064cb-ff33-486d-bc02-8c2a06ea13fc', '【Wider Runing Area & Shock Absorption System】The under desk treadmill with wider 17"*41" spacious running area. It is equipped with 5-layer of anti-slip belt, 8 silicone shock absorb and 6 soft cushions. Not only it effectively reduces joint impact and protects knees and muscles. but also provide a superior running experience. The diamond texture running belt on walking pad treadmill is designed to maintain its anti-slip and wear-resistant properties even during high-frequency workouts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7c5c5222-360b-476a-b90d-7bf41a36cbf5', '85e064cb-ff33-486d-bc02-8c2a06ea13fc', '【9% Incline Treadmill with APP Log Data】 Smart treadmill come with 9% manual incline.providing users with higher exercise needs and more intense exercise experience. FitShow APP offers powerful fitness data tracking function for a personalised exercise. Intergrated with 15+ Mod, fitness training video, customized workout plan and dynamic data analysis, enjoy having a real coach at home. No subscription fee! also offers a gym-quality experience in the comfort of home for perfect workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b19bb733-f048-4c7a-b863-a6f62b438072', '85e064cb-ff33-486d-bc02-8c2a06ea13fc', '【Foldable Treadmill】It can be used as a under desk treadmill at the speed of 0.6-4MPH when the handle is placed down, and it is suit for walking and doing some work under a stand up desk. Also it can be used as a treadmill at the speed of 0.6-7.6MPH when the handle is placed up(40.6”) and it is able to running and hit the fitness goal in regardless of the elements outside');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c3f208a2-f50d-4bb7-b626-ff515c418c78', '85e064cb-ff33-486d-bc02-8c2a06ea13fc', '【LED Screen & Remote & Console Control】The folding treadmill with LED display shows time, speed, distance and calories, grasp exercise status in real time, and make exercise data clear at a glance. The walking desk treadmill experience gets a boost with the console and remote control, making speed adjustments a breeze');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2bab1ac6-6ab0-4eb3-a741-c69052b72451', '85e064cb-ff33-486d-bc02-8c2a06ea13fc', '【Installation-free & Space Saving】 The compact and foldable walking pad requires no assembly and is ready to use right out of the box. Plus, with the super space-saving design, the desk treadmill weighs only 49lbs and has a small folded size of only 48.2"L*25.2"W*4.6"H, making it easy to store in tight corners for home, office or apartment. The built-in wheels make the foldable treadmill easily lift and moved');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c42b93af-7872-4070-9191-45faed42e2e7', '85e064cb-ff33-486d-bc02-8c2a06ea13fc', '【Treadmills for Home Office】 Upgraded walking pad treadmill, versatile, sleek, adaptable, and efficient; compact design fits any space, perfect for a quick workout at home or office');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9a76c244-04e1-4946-84c8-6f9213533b53', 'e9d48019-d1a1-4877-94f3-903032893754', '【15 INCLINE LEVELS & QUICK BUTTONS】Enhance your cardio routine with 15 incline levels for varying resistance levels. Quick Buttons allow easy adjustments, with options for levels 3-6-12 and quick access buttons for 2-4-6 mph intensity changes.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b4ddb939-cd47-4401-946f-6f7cf5cad442', 'e9d48019-d1a1-4877-94f3-903032893754', '【CONNECTED FITNESS】Sync this compact treadmill via Bluetooth, access to 1000+ training videos from certified trainers. Customize your workout plans, explore 10000+ world tours videos, and access exclusive in-app social communities & leaderboards.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3ea5f14b-6a69-412d-9e8e-da4979347cad', 'e9d48019-d1a1-4877-94f3-903032893754', '【DIGITAL PERFORMANCE MONITOR】Track essential metrics like speed, time, distance, calories burned, steps, and body fat percentage on the digital monitor. Hand pulse sensors provide real-time heart rate monitoring during workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('aa197c89-711b-4c49-a1d1-b0939c7844da', 'e9d48019-d1a1-4877-94f3-903032893754', '【CONVENIENT DEVICE HOLDER】Securely place your phone or tablet on the built-in device holder for easy access during workouts. Stay hydrated with the integrated bottle storage space.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('25c4bc52-f8fa-4a6b-97d3-8276ac33e9b9', 'e9d48019-d1a1-4877-94f3-903032893754', '【PORTABLE DESIGN】Easily fold and transport the treadmill using the built-in transportation wheels and hassle-free folding mechanism. The soft-drop system ensures safe and controlled lowering of the treadmill deck to prevent floor damage or injury.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('37eacfba-5c68-43e6-b98d-dbdab5bb6a76', 'e9d48019-d1a1-4877-94f3-903032893754', '【BUILT-IN SHOCK ABSORPTION】Experience a smooth and quiet workout session with the treadmill''s built-in shock absorption system, reducing impact and noise for a more comfortable exercise experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('74ca28a5-3d5f-4fc3-91e0-67bacbcd649b', 'e9d48019-d1a1-4877-94f3-903032893754', '【9 PRE-SET PROGRAMS】Choose from nine pre-set workout programs designed to target various fitness goals and skill levels, providing versatility and challenge to your exercise routine.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('709cc132-0ca3-4fcb-9a18-893f64773a0d', 'e9d48019-d1a1-4877-94f3-903032893754', '【DURABLE CONSTRUCTION】Built with quality materials and sturdy construction, this treadmill is designed to withstand rigorous workouts while providing a stable and reliable platform for your fitness journey.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('910d3985-5108-496d-adc1-04a284ab2c53', 'e9d48019-d1a1-4877-94f3-903032893754', '【20+ YEARS OF EXCELLENCE】As a premier brand, Sunny Health & Fitness delivers top-notch equipment dedicated to excellence. With our devoted support team and certified trainers, enjoy an unmatched FIT FOR EVERYONE experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0054fd58-94e8-407c-b670-b3e3d359a21d', '08ba868b-c51c-4032-8f08-3c388b0034ff', '【POWERFUL 550W QUIET MOTOR&LOW NOISE MOTOR】：With a 550W powerful quiet Motor,the electric treadmill is perfect for running, jogging, and walking in the comfort of your home. With a durable steel frame and multi-layer shield design, the under desk treadmill''s shock-absorbing and noise-reducing, making your running quieter, safer and more comfortable.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c3f8bb43-f7b2-45bc-91f6-9bda81b46cf3', '08ba868b-c51c-4032-8f08-3c388b0034ff', '【SHOCK ABSORPTION and NOISE REDUCTION DESIGN】: The powerful 550W motor is of high quality, which will support speeds of 0.6-3.8MPH without noise exceeding 45dB. The walking treadmill is equipped with multi shock absorbers to minimize noise and joint impact. Just run freely whether it is morning or night!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('57872a73-93a9-4026-80ff-0163e6644c3b', '08ba868b-c51c-4032-8f08-3c388b0034ff', '【COMPACT and SPACE-SAVING DESIGN】: CITYSPORTS under desk treadmill is very handy and weighs 45lbs, which can be easily stored under your bed or sofa with two transport wheels. Whether it''s in your office or your bedroom, you''ll find a great place for it, as it takes up very small space.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c6cf255a-6828-4bf1-b43c-00161598838d', '08ba868b-c51c-4032-8f08-3c388b0034ff', '【RECORD YOUR EXERCISE DATA SCIENTIFICALLY】：The LCD display clearly shows time, calories, step, speed and distance, monitoring your progress in real time and keeping your movement data at a glance.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ecdbae8a-d1c7-40c9-be41-0cb2be25d193', '08ba868b-c51c-4032-8f08-3c388b0034ff', '【EASY TO MOVE AND STORE】：There are easy-to-use exercise programs help to improve your cardiovascular fitness, boost your health, and burn fat.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('70b6ec98-aea0-48f7-8d16-4e93f70669f1', '1de3f043-ca48-49f9-87a2-a717a5c44ee9', 'COMPACT & PORTABLE DESIGN: This flat walker features a slim aluminum alloy frame and compact dimensions of 45.28 x 22.00 x 4.92 inches, making it ideal for small spaces. It folds flat for easy storage under beds, sofas, or against walls, saving valuable living space.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d68c66e7-8198-45c5-b1a1-786090fc7b25', '1de3f043-ca48-49f9-87a2-a717a5c44ee9', 'LIGHTWEIGHT BUILD: Constructed with durable aluminum alloy frame, weighing only 38.58 lbs for easy mobility and storage');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('434bf990-49e0-4aca-8f9b-d12b19f6160f', '1de3f043-ca48-49f9-87a2-a717a5c44ee9', 'WORKSPACE INTEGRATION: Ideal for pairing with standing desks to create an active workstation, promoting movement during work hours');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f5b6ca73-9d24-4e1d-8282-3a7caad85854', '1de3f043-ca48-49f9-87a2-a717a5c44ee9', 'SPACE-SAVING: Flat profile with just 4.92 inches height makes it easy to slide under furniture when not in use');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6345427c-e885-4600-a5aa-ea27914c686c', '1de3f043-ca48-49f9-87a2-a717a5c44ee9', 'STURDY CONSTRUCTION: Features a robust walking surface and stable base for safe, quiet operation during indoor walking sessions');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('58f4b079-76c3-4b7b-b1a0-514ea230c33b', '55a8074b-e2b6-4b16-b458-f4c38561d662', '[30-day iFIT trial included] - Follow expert iFIT Trainers in 10,000+ outdoor workouts around the world.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3165aed0-44a7-427f-8aab-186bff4b8363', '55a8074b-e2b6-4b16-b458-f4c38561d662', '[2” built-in speakers] - Enjoy clear audio of your trainer, their environment, and music during every workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('de050589-2d97-4e21-b92a-9a432f9f1e96', '55a8074b-e2b6-4b16-b458-f4c38561d662', '[Protected by Warranty] - 10-year frame, 1-year parts and labor warranty.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('47a145c1-03c8-4f11-bcbc-f73c4b8f8f2f', '55a8074b-e2b6-4b16-b458-f4c38561d662', '[300 lb. user capacity] - Built on a strong frame.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9872bdd1-2523-4e01-b14b-39528d6e6222', '55a8074b-e2b6-4b16-b458-f4c38561d662', '[Product footprint] - 59.1” Height x 35.1” Width x 74.3” Depth.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('864a2d8a-2ef4-44ab-a98c-aae0b079613d', '55a8074b-e2b6-4b16-b458-f4c38561d662', '[Folded product footprint] - 70.4” Height x 35.1” Width x 35.3” Depth.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fcf0becc-7682-4e31-9eba-493038d34403', 'b663b03d-dd8b-4306-a592-1e1d1acb7d63', 'With Fitness APP Control & Retractable Phone Holder — With the Bluetooth, you could connect the treadmill to your mobile phone through the Gymax app, so you can control the machine and track your fitness data while exercising. Also, you can use the phone holder to listen to music / watch movies and relax yourself while you are running.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bf4b962a-41ae-4c78-b8e1-61deea98e180', 'b663b03d-dd8b-4306-a592-1e1d1acb7d63', 'Powerful & Ultra Quiet 3.0 HP Motor — Equipped with noiseless 3.0 HP motor, this running machine allows you to run or walk as much as you like without disturbing others, making it an ideal sports facility for home or office use. Premium steel structure with excellent anti-shock ability is steady and sturdy for running.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1e06a467-edb2-4782-a25c-d8bafa8de46a', 'b663b03d-dd8b-4306-a592-1e1d1acb7d63', 'Automatic/Manual Speed Settings — Quickly switch between 2 preset speeds (3 and 5 mph), or adjust the speed from 0.6 MPH to 8 MPH with the -/+ buttons to meet your different sports needs. The speed unit could be switched between mile and km in APP. No assembly required.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d8f29eb1-a818-479e-b51b-1b13cbe1e59e', 'b663b03d-dd8b-4306-a592-1e1d1acb7d63', 'Comfortable Tread Belt & HD Digital Display — The 5-layer non-slip texture running belt features a spacious running area and good shock absorption performance, providing you great running experience to better protect your knees and muscles. The high definition touch screen clearly shows time, steps, speed, distance and calories in real time.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('841b475c-db8c-48c8-aa60-38fd8e8e5ab2', 'b663b03d-dd8b-4306-a592-1e1d1acb7d63', 'Foldable & Self-Standing & Moveable Treadmill — This compact treadmill can be easily folded up by turning the side knobs, saving plenty of storage space. Self-standing without leaning against a wall, and the built-in transport wheels at the bottom make the treadmill easy to move anywhere. Also equipped with a safety key to shut down immediately in an emergency to protect your safety.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cec13e4e-9763-422c-acfe-6bed9b8f868c', '28e26270-794a-4670-9191-4a6ecf2c21c5', '4.75 HP Motor & 15% Auto Incline - Built with a powerful and quiet motor, the treadmill offers 0.6-10.8 mph adjustable speed, suitable for walking, jogging and running exercise. Besides, the treadmill is designed with 0-15% auto incline, which provides you more intensive and comprehensive body training.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('efa8c9ba-ac1e-4a9c-b68c-51b5bbddb43a', '28e26270-794a-4670-9191-4a6ecf2c21c5', '51" x 18" Running Area with Buffer System - The extra-long and extra-wide running belt not only ensures safer exercise, but also is friendly to beginners who just start running on a treadmill. The 5-layer elastic and slip-resistant belt makes running comfortable. Built in 6-point buffer system, this machine greatly absorbs the shock and protects your knees, ankles and joins.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('46a7297b-67df-4248-807f-456c8681f2fa', '28e26270-794a-4670-9191-4a6ecf2c21c5', '20 Preset Programs & Customizable Settings - This running machine features 20 preset programs to meet your various workout needs. Also, you are able to set your desired goals for exercising, such as time, speed, distance and calories consumption. Moreover, the machine is equipped with dual bluetooth speakers and the device holder for convenient entertainment during exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cb772969-04a8-4eea-8edb-915d7cd31288', '8dec29d9-f196-49b3-9836-8150bcc29a2a', 'Comes in very unique modern colors, choose you weight size, every weight size has a different color');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('28fd5923-0679-46fa-a02d-ab6b60176b08', '28e26270-794a-4670-9191-4a6ecf2c21c5', 'Compatible with Multiple Control Methods - The running machine can be controlled by LED touch screen, our official APP (Gymax) and control knob that is removable to serve as a remote control. More importantly, the control knob is designed with voice recognition function, allowing you to accomplish adjustments effortlessly.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('15f0fb91-2a52-4e72-8843-2239a9283af0', '28e26270-794a-4670-9191-4a6ecf2c21c5', 'Heavy-duty Structure with Humanized Design - The treadmill is made of premium steel and ensures a long service life for your indoor exercise. You can lightly step on the hydraulic rod to fold the treadmill and move effortlessly with wheels. The extra long handrails will increase your sense of security and they are equipped with heart rate sensors for quick monitoring while running.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('930ccaed-46f5-4c59-a325-507ec254a41f', '456eb1bc-c0b3-488d-b4be-45194858cd0f', 'CONNECT: Quick and easy app connectivity. Stream fitness classes, movies, and music via Bluetooth connection. Integrated device rest securely holds your phone or tablet. A rapid-charge USB port keeps your device powered. No subscription required!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('58ec1939-0e54-44b9-9382-ceaae3a3f709', '456eb1bc-c0b3-488d-b4be-45194858cd0f', 'BUILT FOR HOME WORKOUT PERFORMANCE: 22 x 60-inch XL running surface with 3-zone Variable Response Cushioning for flex and support in all all phases of your stride. Max user weight is 350 pounds, with assembled dimensions of 76" x 37" x 63".');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5171f0c9-606f-4efa-9154-a518ae2f04c8', '456eb1bc-c0b3-488d-b4be-45194858cd0f', 'PRECISION CONTROL: Experience fast, smooth transitions between intervals using QuickDial controls to simplify adjustments without breaking your stride. Speed range from 0.5 – 12 mph and an incline range from 0 – 15% so you can walk, jog, or run.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f684b87f-8997-47e6-b8a2-7f97ddffb92e', '456eb1bc-c0b3-488d-b4be-45194858cd0f', 'PROGRAM CHOICES: Custom Interval Keys, One-Touch Speed, and Incline Quick Keys allow you to switch between convenient programs, such as 5K, Calorie, Distance, Fat Burn, Hill Climb, Manual, and Max Heart Rate. Monitor it all with contact hand grips.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('593fac06-f491-4200-aa78-274ff2f5fe6b', '456eb1bc-c0b3-488d-b4be-45194858cd0f', 'RESPONSIVE DRIVE SYSTEM: Highly responsive Rapid Sync performance drive system delivers faster speed and incline changes, perfect for interval training. Enjoy a smooth, efficient workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0cb61c20-1c1a-42c8-af26-de4936d6bcf5', '456eb1bc-c0b3-488d-b4be-45194858cd0f', 'FOLDABLE TREADMILL: The Horizon Studio Series folding treadmills feature a rugged frame built for performance and durability. Effortlessly store between workouts with a one-step FeatherLight hydraulic folding system.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('912ba258-185a-46fa-84f0-c54fdcb21179', '456eb1bc-c0b3-488d-b4be-45194858cd0f', 'ENJOY YOUR WORKOUT: Features integrated Bluetooth speakers, in/out audio jack, water bottle holder, fan, and energy saver mode. Ideal for streaming workout classes and other media to keep you entertained while you work out.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6a127965-8a9c-4d5c-988c-552e462cfb77', '110ea6cd-016c-469b-8f2e-9e89a0429f6c', 'TURN UP THE INTENSITY - The AssaultRunner Pro is specifically designed to help you meet and exceed your fitness goals. The AssaultRunner Pro constantly demands your full attention and requires nothing less than 100% effort. Burn more calories than with a motorized treadmill.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4eaa873f-0a0c-4739-aa0c-3b7c49479fe2', '110ea6cd-016c-469b-8f2e-9e89a0429f6c', 'WIRELESS CONNECTIVITY - Connect wirelessly via Bluetooth or ANT+ for seamless tracking and integration with other fitness apps, such as Zwift or the Assault Fitness App. Unlock an array of additional features to help set and reach your objectives!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4e7d3997-7da6-447b-83f5-831396aca26a', '110ea6cd-016c-469b-8f2e-9e89a0429f6c', 'EASY SETUP AND MAINTENANCE - No more worries about assembly or maintenance with the AssaultRunner Pro. It’s quick and easy to assemble, has no electric plug in requirement, and is virtually maintenance free. Plus it''s transportable in tight spaces with its built in wheels!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('50e40a93-b800-4013-ab7b-78148241d296', '110ea6cd-016c-469b-8f2e-9e89a0429f6c', 'NO ELECTRICITY NEEDED: Like all Assault Fitness products, this machine is athlete-powered, granting you the freedom to train both indoors or outdoors – you choose.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('170e2d39-7c8c-4ca4-b5db-1f984fea3fb4', '1449e5f8-c60e-4a27-9857-9944bfeda4d2', '1. This treadmills for home ,Smart Display - 3 BIG LED display keeps tracking Speed, Time, Distance, Calories, easy operated by remote control. The compact design of our home desk treadmill allows ,Convenient to store and carry.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9a4f36f2-7238-4ae6-9bd6-c4f46a3ea3e4', '1449e5f8-c60e-4a27-9857-9944bfeda4d2', '2. Ideal for walking and light jogging, this small treadmill is perfect for any home gym equipment setup and can be tailored to a variety of exercise routines.Powerful Motor - 2.5 HP peak power of mini treadmill works smoothly for both walking and jogging workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ac51d06c-e7e8-4338-812e-7bfc9972a50f', '1449e5f8-c60e-4a27-9857-9944bfeda4d2', '3. Our at home workout equipment, The thickend structure can afford max user weight 280lbs, without much noise disturbing the families.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7ebd9673-f7cd-4aee-a57b-e55f458cf2ad', '1449e5f8-c60e-4a27-9857-9944bfeda4d2', '4. The walking treadmill adjust speed and incline with easy-to-use controls located on the console so you can seamlessly transition from work to workout without missing a beat. Big Size - The running deck width of 22.5" offers a wide and comfortatable area exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f6d21cae-5718-4e14-ad4e-8e5d9dcfc11a', '1449e5f8-c60e-4a27-9857-9944bfeda4d2', '5. Incorporating our gym equipment for home into your daily routine can boost your energy, improve your mood, and increase productivity. 3.2" X-large side rails provide a safe area when the users stop workouts temporarily or urgently.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8e3797f2-2d10-4865-94a3-5150dbd559ec', 'ac291cf1-5044-4ac3-bbc5-d0ff1334e245', '【𝐒𝐦𝐚𝐫𝐭 𝐖𝐚𝐥𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐏𝐚𝐝】 WELLFIT app upgraded version of the treadmill with AI voice control can convenient control speed, start and close. Let you focus on work. and can be used with Z Kinomap APPLE HEALTH application to enrich sports scenes and make home exercise more interesting!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5beb192c-207d-427c-a8ae-29936bf8b7d7', 'ac291cf1-5044-4ac3-bbc5-d0ff1334e245', '【𝟎-𝟔%-𝟏𝟎% 𝐈𝐧𝐜𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐞】Upgraded Incline helps to change the muscles you emphasize during your workout lets you change up your workout and burn more calories (weight loss).');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('46a0d891-f01a-4bb6-ab59-912870007699', 'ac291cf1-5044-4ac3-bbc5-d0ff1334e245', '【𝟎-𝟓%-𝟖% 𝐃𝐞𝐜𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐞】Can simulate downhill, it takes less energy, you will still be getting exercise and health benefits. Elongate Your Muscles: Treadmill running on a decline works to elongate the muscle fibers in your legs, which allows the muscles to lengthen as they utilize the natural braking mechanism in your legs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7b67d366-ffc5-4703-8533-cf17ac773666', 'ac291cf1-5044-4ac3-bbc5-d0ff1334e245', '【𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐦𝐢𝐮𝐦 𝐌𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐚𝐥】300+ lbs Load capacity, added 5 layers of anti-slip and 8 shock-absorbing running belts, can reduce the impact during exercise and provide a comfortable use experience. And equipped with 2.5HP quiet motor, 40dB low noise design, so that the machine can always run quietly, without worrying about disturbing others;');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('540a3630-4011-4cb6-a11a-3e6a45ae5787', 'ac291cf1-5044-4ac3-bbc5-d0ff1334e245', '【𝐒𝐥𝐢𝐦 𝐀𝐧𝐝 𝐋𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐰𝐞𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭】Weighing only 39 pounds, it''s very light and equipped with two front transport wheels, which can be easily carried to any small place and save space;');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1ad31a3b-3c9f-4a1a-b4ab-436df9ded9b5', 'ac291cf1-5044-4ac3-bbc5-d0ff1334e245', '【𝐓𝐫𝐞𝐚𝐝𝐦𝐢𝐥𝐥 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐅𝐫𝐨𝐦 𝐈𝐧𝐝𝐨𝐨𝐫】Incorporate the walking pad treadmill into your office,home or workplace as part of a wellness program. Encourage employees to take active breaks and walk on the treadmill to promote physical activity and productivity.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('92575b25-2ad1-4f43-8e28-1f493c03802a', 'e83cf80f-8f21-4d57-8df9-c2c143252107', '【Worry-Free Purchase】Acezoe S30-XD treadmill with incline is built to last with a sturdy steel frame. Based in the US, we provide hassle-free after-sales support—reach out anytime you need help.(Treadmill Model: S30-XD)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e18d0970-3aa2-43e1-afc6-da1f58ad7e8d', 'ac291cf1-5044-4ac3-bbc5-d0ff1334e245', '【𝟑𝟎-𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝐔𝐬𝐞 𝐄𝐱𝐩𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 & 𝟐𝟒-𝐌𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐡 𝐌𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐭𝐚𝐢𝐧】Enjoy WELLFIT''s portable treadmills indoor exercise! IF YOU ENCOUNTER ANY PROBLEMS IN USING THE TREADMILL, PLEASE TELL US, WE WILL MATCH YOU WITH THE BEST SOLUTION TO PROVIDE THE BEST USE EXPERIENCE!!!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f6be4fe2-cf54-48af-8181-f45ed98fd6bc', '8ac828a8-2a23-4b27-8e8b-5be7a17a5872', 'Safety First: UMAY Fitness designed the rehabilitation treadmill prioritizes safety. The full-size detachable handrails help maintain balance, and the 0.1-mile increment design provides a considerate low-speed start and stop. The uniquely designed safety strap can be further secured to the handrails to prevent falls. Additionally, the convenient quick buttons on the handrails allow for easy speed adjustment and start/stop control.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0cec56a1-76ac-4083-ba04-9648a7eaedbc', '8ac828a8-2a23-4b27-8e8b-5be7a17a5872', 'Multi-Function Handrail: The multifunctional handle features quick adjustment and start/stop buttons for easy speed control and machine operation. The detachable full-size extended handle provides support for balance and safety during use. The thickened foam on the handrails offers a more comfortable grip and absorbs sweat.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d2b81b46-215f-4e3d-9681-613c229c34a4', '8ac828a8-2a23-4b27-8e8b-5be7a17a5872', 'Auto-Folding: This treadmill is equipped with a hydraulic folding feature for easy storage. The running deck can be lifted and folded with just one hand. A simple kick to the hydraulic rod''s connection point will automatically lower the machine from its folded position.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7b459aa5-d47a-4a7f-98d1-b7fd9fed16a9', '8ac828a8-2a23-4b27-8e8b-5be7a17a5872', 'Pulse Sensors & Bmi Calculator: This treadmill''s handles are equipped with a heart rate monitor for real-time monitoring during use, promoting safer and more effective training. Additionally, it features BMI functionality to helping to indicate potential health risks associated with weight.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('79dfb218-eeab-4f57-93ea-3db4415b00bd', '8ac828a8-2a23-4b27-8e8b-5be7a17a5872', 'Powerful & Whisper Brushless Motor: UMAY improved brushless motor with max 3.0 HP provides efficient, reliable, and low-maintenance operation, while providing speeds of 8.7 MPH and emitting only 40-65 dB of noise, ensuring your workouts won''t disturb your downstairs or next-doors');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0eb563c5-f0b3-4d4c-bb64-a164cf3f3a57', '8ac828a8-2a23-4b27-8e8b-5be7a17a5872', '3-level Incline: The treadmill is equipped with a 3-level manual incline, allowing you to customize the incline for more efficient training and a personalized workout experience. that is ideal for a variety of rehabilitation applications.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3057a655-92a4-4860-867a-d896b7d2abb8', '8ac828a8-2a23-4b27-8e8b-5be7a17a5872', 'UMAYCARE Service: UmayCare is committed to providing exceptional customer support. Our California-based customer support team is on standby to assist with any questions or issues you may have with our equipment, guaranteeing 100% satisfaction,ensures a worry-free shopping and user experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7cd76d5b-0473-49e0-be29-e3e7b10d8388', '2716efe5-4adc-4f8c-b610-30725849e123', '3 in 1 Portable Treadmill: Orinar''s treadmills are designed to walk, jog and run machine. It''s easy for you to keep exercising while working in the office, it''s an under desk walking pad.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('12a8d0f1-f6bf-4206-8957-35e47af867a6', '2716efe5-4adc-4f8c-b610-30725849e123', 'The LED Display & Remote Control: You can change the speed and switch the machine on and off with the remote control. speed, distance, time and calories can be monitored on the LED screen.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c043745c-2f9a-43c8-aae2-21d47ea1fbbb', '2716efe5-4adc-4f8c-b610-30725849e123', '2.5HP Powerful Motor: The treadmill is equipped with a powerful 2.5HP motor and offers a large weight capacity of up to 265 lbs. You can adjust the speed from 0-3.8 MPH.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7da557c1-e6cc-4aad-b653-7ae1e303c568', '2716efe5-4adc-4f8c-b610-30725849e123', 'Running Belt Structure: 5 layers of non-slip running belt and silicone column support can greatly absorb the impact caused by the movement, providing cushioning for the knees, muscles and ankles.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4af95673-af7f-45ea-81cf-347f59062172', '2716efe5-4adc-4f8c-b610-30725849e123', 'Compact Design: With a compact design, it can be stored under the bed or sofa, and it also have wheels for moving around.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b5d8764f-80d0-417d-b939-a1c6547cf9a8', 'b8d5e9b6-4614-47c1-bff8-a6095e11ffe7', '【Three Level Incline Treadmill】The Highest 8% Incline will burns more 200 Kcal/H than a regular walking pad for the same number of steps. You can exercise in the comfort of your home office while working, voice conferencing, or watching TV.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('10531774-5b6b-4b66-a981-412b9099c625', 'b8d5e9b6-4614-47c1-bff8-a6095e11ffe7', '【Powerful But Quiet Treadmill】Rhythm Fun treadmill is equipped with a powerful 2.5HP low-noise motor.Which can withstand loads up to 300 lbs. The portable walking treadmill enables speeds ranging from 0.8 to 8.0 km/h (0.5-5 mp/h). Manual Incline adjustment can meet the fat burning effect of 50% higher than traditional treadmills.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a01e7253-bec1-4d79-8f82-085ba28924c9', 'b8d5e9b6-4614-47c1-bff8-a6095e11ffe7', '【Wide Running Belt Treadmill】The 5-layer non-slip running belt features a spacious running area(37" x 15"), features an advanced frame structure for more stable running providing an effective and safe cushion for your knees.Treadmill with handle bar can give support and security when you running.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fa089919-1907-42fb-92dc-497be1bdd516', 'b8d5e9b6-4614-47c1-bff8-a6095e11ffe7', '【RHYTHM FUN Treadmill with APP】 Connect the Ypoofit app to link our Home Office Treadmill through Bluetooth, so you can join course training and more realistic running track. Use the phone holder to watch videos or chat with friends. The remote control is convenient to adjust the speed of movement and stop instantly. Smart Ypoofit APP control is perfect to record exercise data and running with other users.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('04720a75-4c9c-4428-81f1-e11f9f3bf042', 'b8d5e9b6-4614-47c1-bff8-a6095e11ffe7', '【Satisfactory Service】Rhythm Fun treadmill is dedicated to providing high-quality treadmills and after-sales service. Consumers can contact us at any time, and we will provide satisfactory service to every customer.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('524f6033-6e15-4fe5-857d-ef722b83e381', 'e83cf80f-8f21-4d57-8df9-c2c143252107', '【10% Manual Incline Treadmill】Acezoe S30-XD walking pad treadmill has a 10% manual incline, no tools needed to set it up. It mimics climbing, helping you burn more calories, shape your legs, and build muscle—much more effective than regular treadmills for home small.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('32241322-7ef2-4a32-9a15-941fe4ee2fac', 'e83cf80f-8f21-4d57-8df9-c2c143252107', '【Compact, Portable & Standing】Just 4.5" thick and 37 lbs, this mini treadmill is perfect for small spaces. With wheels, even lifting it is a breeze—store it in your closet, under the sofa, or against the wall using the built-in standing mats. Super easy and space-saving!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('39b62ad3-16fe-4621-a9ae-8df67ca436ef', 'e83cf80f-8f21-4d57-8df9-c2c143252107', '【Easy to Use & Quiet】No setup needed—just plug in and go. Control the incline treadmill with a magnetic remote or app. The upgraded 2.5HP motor keeps it quiet at ≤45db, so you can work out at home or the office without disturbing anyone.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ecc3ea2b-8912-4082-b650-fe50e486e9c7', 'e83cf80f-8f21-4d57-8df9-c2c143252107', '【Versatile & Professional】With a 10% incline and a speed range of 0.5-4.0 MPH, this walking pad with incline adapts to your workout needs. Easily adjust speed, set goals for time, distance, or calories, and challenge yourself with 12 built-in HIIT programs available on the app.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d79517f8-6240-4f89-aded-0d8a866f38e8', 'e83cf80f-8f21-4d57-8df9-c2c143252107', '【Refuse to be Boring】Connect to Kinomap, Zwift, or Fitshow for virtual walks across streets, forests or mountains. Racing with friends is also easily accessible. Track your progress with the sleek LED display and get real-time updates on the app.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6457d0cb-2ef7-4e1a-9273-2a4a8991b60d', 'e83cf80f-8f21-4d57-8df9-c2c143252107', '【Safe & Comfortable】Dual shock-absorbing rubbers and a diamond-texture surface ensure a stable, slip-resistant run. Whether walking, jogging or running, this compact treadmill offers top-notch cushioning and support.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4d193fc2-ec14-4214-ab5b-56b474fcf2f4', 'a370626d-e580-4a30-9e1f-05331797c9b8', '【Wide & Non-Slip Running Belt】The upgraded running belt reduces the risk of deviation. The spacious running area (15.75*38.58inch) accommodates users of different sizes, making it a best fitness choice for everyone. Our 5-layer non-slip strip and advanced double-layer shock absorption technology, including 6 silicone shock absorbents, and 2 soft rubber pads, ensures maximum cushioning for your knees while minimizing noise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4e70b292-7213-411f-b65b-19de0612d063', 'a370626d-e580-4a30-9e1f-05331797c9b8', '【2 IN 1 Under Desk Treadmill for Home and Office】 Boasting a speed range of 0.6 - 4 mph, which is outshines its competitors whose speed is limited to 0 - 3.8 mph, making it perfect for walking, jogging and running. It can not only be used on rainy days, hot summers, cold winters or other adverse weather conditions, but also be used in both home and office .');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4d22a384-dbcd-42ec-8643-2ea5f6ca7a0f', 'a370626d-e580-4a30-9e1f-05331797c9b8', '【Walking Pad with 2.5HP Motor and 300 lbs Capacity】 Equipped with a 2.5HP motor, allows the weight carry up to 300 pounds, more than 220 or 265 pounds. Moreover, our motor have overheating protection and blocked operation protection, which greatly guarantees the safety of users. And the quite feature enables you to walk or run in the morning or evening without disturbing others, making it perfect for home and office.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bede281d-161c-4f9d-a583-972be1fb0e0b', 'a370626d-e580-4a30-9e1f-05331797c9b8', '【Small and Portable treadmill】HiFast walking pad is hassle-free with no assembly required. The built-in front wheels and 40.78 weight make it effortless to move and store. The slim 4.96-inch height and compact construction make it easy to store under a sofa, bed or other small space to save storage space.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a28cc9f3-1bcf-41a5-9c96-82e44bbacd42', 'a370626d-e580-4a30-9e1f-05331797c9b8', '【LED Display & 5 Data Switch】Portable treadmill with LED display allows you to accurately track speed, distance, time, calories and step in real time by press "M" button. 【Pause & Memory Function】: The remote control can easily adjust the speed, start, stop, and pause the treadmill. The Memory Function remote allows you to pause at any time, but can keep your exercise speed and mileage when pause. But the data will return to 0 after shutdown or power off.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a889f51a-032f-4d33-ba49-e9305544c7a9', '4bce8c0f-7b0f-4f78-95ee-baf3d1eeace1', 'Four Level Incline Treadmill: The Highest 9% Incline will burns more calories than a regular walking pad for the same number of steps. You can exercise in your home office while working, voice conferencing, or watching TV');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('36874cd3-af70-46b7-863c-b2764f6275f9', '4bce8c0f-7b0f-4f78-95ee-baf3d1eeace1', 'Powerful But Quiet Treadmill: This walking pad treadmill with incline operates with 2.5HP brushless motor, ensuring a disturbance-free workout experience. The portable treadmill with incline for home small enables speeds ranging from 0.5-4 mp/h. It runs smoothly for 8 hours straight without overheating, eliminating smoke or unpleasant odors');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5c99e687-82ba-42eb-a706-c86983dcee65', '4bce8c0f-7b0f-4f78-95ee-baf3d1eeace1', 'Treadmill With APP: Connect the Besyfit app to link harewares under desk treadmills through Bluetooth, so you can join course training and more realistic running track. The remote control is convenient to adjust the speed of movement and stop instantly. Smart Besyfit APP control is perfect to record exercise data and running with other users');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1e84b085-56ac-4157-90fb-2ef6f7bb838f', '4bce8c0f-7b0f-4f78-95ee-baf3d1eeace1', 'Triple Shock Absorption: Featuring suspended deck, TPR cushioning and 2 honeycomb soft rubber pads, our under desk walking pad provide effective and safe cushioning for your knees. Maximum weight capacity 265lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7b2fbdcf-1054-402a-b686-17777fe090be', '4bce8c0f-7b0f-4f78-95ee-baf3d1eeace1', 'Easy To Move And Use: This mini walking pad for home is completely assembled and ready to use right out of the box, convenient transport wheels to easily move, compact design can be placed under a sofa, corner or bed, reducing floor space and making it ideal for any room');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7c56f379-7efa-4740-ad23-9984165926d8', '4bce8c0f-7b0f-4f78-95ee-baf3d1eeace1', 'Satisfactory Service: Purchase with confidence knowing that the Hartwares desk treadmill comes with a 2-year warranty, ensuring peace of mind and prompt support for any issues');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b801211b-4531-4ef5-93a7-ec0bbd2e404c', 'c58b1267-77d2-4a9a-9f79-42a4d9e4ac64', '12% Automatic Incline And Soft Drop Platform: Our treadmil with lincline is equipped with (0-12%) auto incline which helps you personalize your workout for better results. Also, A soft drop system helps you fold and unfold the treadmill deck safely and hands-free for home, avoiding the sudden drop of the platform seen in treadmills for home. Whether for daily use or storage, these features make treadmill with incline experience more comfortable and safe');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('68bdb453-754a-431c-a028-8f0bfcc7178d', 'c58b1267-77d2-4a9a-9f79-42a4d9e4ac64', 'Multi-Functional Display And Heart Rate Sensor: The folding treadmill with Large blue backlit LCD Display can track your Time, Speed, Distance, Calorie, Incline, Heart Rate, Program and Modes. What‘s more, the handlebars of the treadmill also come with heart rate sensors, enabling you to monitor your heart rate during a workout. This treadmills for home provides a comprehensive display of various workout data, allowing you to fully understand your exercise status');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('81905eea-a754-4d83-a97a-68f273ab7e70', 'c58b1267-77d2-4a9a-9f79-42a4d9e4ac64', 'Powerful Quiet Motor And Adjustable Speed: The treadmill with an upgrade smooth and strong treadmill motor supports speeds ranging from 0.5 MPH to 8.5 MPH to help you meet a variety of fitness goals. Max Load-bearing weight of the treadmill: 220 lbs. So you have no need worry about weight capactiy with using this treadmills for home');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('14ce968d-653e-4b51-a51a-69af6f8dae62', 'c58b1267-77d2-4a9a-9f79-42a4d9e4ac64', 'Easy Assemble And Space Saver Design: The treadmill arrives 95% assembled, you only need to tighten a few screws to install treadmills for home. Storage with convenient transportation wheels makes treadmill easy to move and store. Treadmills with incline is your space-saving helper');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c39360bf-db5d-41ca-b899-b99057723e98', 'c58b1267-77d2-4a9a-9f79-42a4d9e4ac64', 'Widened Running Belt And Shock Reduction Deck: The treadmills for home with upgraded 17 inches wide running surface provides you a spacious area to run comfortably and freely. Multi-Layer shock absorption cushioned deck of the treadmill reduces the damage to knees and ankles. With using treadmill with incline, you can enjoy sports without disturbing neighbors or family members');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2f5be60c-ec87-41c7-bf72-d83ae1d3771c', '8a7e520b-1fd4-47ea-a461-37f96e61b4fa', 'Maximize Fat Burn with Incline: Utilize the YOSUDA walking pad with a 9% incline feature to boost your fat-burning potential. Burn calories rapidly and achieve your fitness goals more swiftly');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ba5d2940-c663-41a1-8b02-e94d83e8dbdc', '8a7e520b-1fd4-47ea-a461-37f96e61b4fa', 'Auto Incline at a Touch: With a 3-stage incline feature, the treadmill allows for easy adjustments through a remote control. Achieve a gradual and safe slope change with the press of a button; no need to pause or step off.Convenience meets safety, keeping your focus on the workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6dab0932-c19c-4fb9-8a73-310994ede2fa', '8a7e520b-1fd4-47ea-a461-37f96e61b4fa', 'Silent Efficiency: Experience the quiet power of a 2.5 HP motor in the walking pad treadmill. With smooth and quiet operation, it allows for uninterrupted work or online meetings while staying active');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9fc7c390-a826-4148-98d7-2d01c1581ea2', '8a7e520b-1fd4-47ea-a461-37f96e61b4fa', 'Robust and Comfy: This under desk treadmill made with premium polymers, supports 300 LBS effortlessly. The 42.5" x 16.9" 6-layer belt offers excellent knee protection and comfort');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f0e4b7bb-c121-4030-8d75-0a1171484da9', '8a7e520b-1fd4-47ea-a461-37f96e61b4fa', 'Enhanced Visibility: With larger LED screen, this walking pad ensures easy reading of your fitness data. See all your stats at once, without the hassle of switching screens, for a streamlined workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('32fa1948-ef78-4b69-80fa-1400515e4bc2', '8dec29d9-f196-49b3-9836-8150bcc29a2a', 'Every kettle is clearly marked with the weight size to make easy to identify the weight size');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('05a175e0-911e-41d0-a0f4-e55dd6abe6ca', 'cfba18a2-94e7-4ffc-8786-1ba15a6bd349', '【Foldable Treadmill with Handle Bar】The 2.5HP folding Small walking pad with Handle, has 48.4''''x21.5''''x4.5'''' mini size, 300 Lb capacity, can be placed under the sofa or any corner of the room. 38.6 "x15.4" large running area, brings you comfortable Walking, Jogging Running experience, suitable for home, office, yard, gym and so on.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('18c1241a-a55c-4993-8800-5bf434d87894', 'cfba18a2-94e7-4ffc-8786-1ba15a6bd349', '【0.6-5MPH for Walking or Running】The speed range of the desk treadmill is 0.6-5mph(1-8km/h), can meet the needs of you and your family. When you press "+" or "-" with the remote control, the speed of the walking pad will increase or decrease at 0.2 mph intervals.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c34c5a9b-0cd2-4173-95a7-48d1761ba455', 'cfba18a2-94e7-4ffc-8786-1ba15a6bd349', '【Ultra Quiet & Powerful Treadmill】The Compact walking pad is built with 2.5HP self-developed motor, which brings lower loss and longer lifespan, at the same time reduces the motor noise. 5-layer shock-absorbing running belt, allows you be in a quiet environment when you are exercising.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8dcf9616-3061-4252-932e-0938c10c460c', 'cfba18a2-94e7-4ffc-8786-1ba15a6bd349', '【Non-slip Running Belt & Safety Lock】 The 5-layer non-slip texture running belt(38.6" x15.4") provides an effective and safe cushion for your knees and muscles for a better running experience. The foldable treadmill is equipped with a safety lock so it can stop immediately in emergency situations-Double safety protection.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('49642b00-16fc-4aee-86be-75ce2862bdb6', 'cfba18a2-94e7-4ffc-8786-1ba15a6bd349', '【Installation Free & Easy to Move】The walking treadmill under desk arrives fully assembled, which can be used directly after unpacking. two wheels at the bottom, lightweight and compact, you can easily move it around your home or office. 24/7 customer service.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('15739a04-79e6-4bcb-af15-8b404d6db3d6', 'b9e86530-eb08-415e-89e1-25f4f8737cf3', 'Double Shock Absorption: walking treadmill provides a 15"*40.2" large track for free movement, and is equipped with 5 layers of anti-slip belt, 8 silicone shock absorbers and 2 soft rubber pads. It can not only provide you with a comfortable exercise experience, but also effectively reduce joint impact and protect your knees.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3dd8d137-e998-4add-96c2-eff0fa507a66', 'b9e86530-eb08-415e-89e1-25f4f8737cf3', 'Powerful Quiet Motor: The under desk treadmill features a 2.25HP motor with a maximum load capacity of 265 lbs. This walking pad operates quietly and is ideal for home and office use. You can exercise anywhere without worrying about disturbing yourself or others.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ec7d1032-91d2-4238-959a-020f63763cb3', 'b9e86530-eb08-415e-89e1-25f4f8737cf3', 'LED Display & Remote Control: The LED display clearly displays time, calories, steps, speed, and distance, allowing you to grasp your exercise status in real time and your exercise data at a glance. The remote has a mute button that silences the beeps when pressed.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1481e50c-6888-42c4-9400-91a5380902ee', 'b9e86530-eb08-415e-89e1-25f4f8737cf3', '2-in-1 Walking Pad Under Desk: Speed range 0.6-4 mph, adjustable to suit your needs. Not only suitable for jogging, but also can be used under the desk. The remote control is equipped with magnets that can be attached to the treadmill when not in use to prevent loss.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5b248283-e9d5-428d-b604-3ef4fd468712', 'b9e86530-eb08-415e-89e1-25f4f8737cf3', 'Portable Treadmill: Walking pad treadmill is lightweight and have two front wheels for easy movement. Installation-free design, ready to use right out of the box. The design is compact and easy to carry, you can place it under the bed or sofa to save space. We provide users with high-quality after-sales guarantee and one-year warranty, and any questions will be answered 100% professionally.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('07b5d68c-cbf9-4258-b4c1-628a5a2abc12', '3ebdca67-8611-4462-8810-14bb5d95789c', 'Plastic');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0e1054bf-99b8-49c9-b49f-2aa6ac571b63', '3ebdca67-8611-4462-8810-14bb5d95789c', 'Imported');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0ec8fb5d-abd6-4056-a0f2-53363d96dbef', '3ebdca67-8611-4462-8810-14bb5d95789c', 'Self-propelled or manually operated treadmill for children promotes a healthy, activity-based lifestyle that develops endurance and balance for kids from 3 to 7 years of age');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7cad1140-03c2-45aa-9938-75ed25604905', '3ebdca67-8611-4462-8810-14bb5d95789c', 'Fun workout equipment for kids that is only powered by motion while running, jogging, or walking, which makes it safe, fun, and low-impact indoor exercising equipment');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('805c1c22-3433-4498-b2e9-80e7aea18419', '3ebdca67-8611-4462-8810-14bb5d95789c', 'Kids workout equipment includes an electronic monitor featuring a timer and automatic shut-off after 10 minutes; You will need to purchase 2 AA batteries, which are not included');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('53b81b95-692b-41b1-b1c0-58f1d263ae0b', '3ebdca67-8611-4462-8810-14bb5d95789c', 'Long-lasting construction with a powder-coated steel frame with soft handles and grips for durable function, and prioritizes comfort and safety while your kids are using');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ef6d0a26-42bd-4527-a2d0-04c5f9403ac5', '3ebdca67-8611-4462-8810-14bb5d95789c', 'Features footprints on the belt to show kids where to put their feet to prevent any injury; Includes tools and easy-to-follow instructions for assembly without the need for experts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c4f4329b-2ad1-4ab9-a2d5-2ade29ed69a6', 'cf9e7b86-d88a-4a43-85ea-deedc4a2a75c', '2-in-1 Walking Pad Treadmill: This fitness equipment can be used as an under desk walking pad for a gentle walking in a 0.6-3.8 MPH speed range or a running machine for a hearty running in a 0.6-7.6 MPH speed range. Moreover, the mild incline feature adds extra intensity to your workouts without overwhelming your stride.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('03a36994-729a-498b-a23a-acc68bc17331', 'cf9e7b86-d88a-4a43-85ea-deedc4a2a75c', 'Powerful Brushless Motor: This folding treadmill is equipped with an advanced brushless motor that supports up to 300 lbs weight capacity, making it ideal for different users. What''s even better, it operates quietly at less than 45dB, allowing you to work out early in the morning or late at night without disturbing others.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('606079a9-3fcd-4aad-b7d2-970a20453d92', 'cf9e7b86-d88a-4a43-85ea-deedc4a2a75c', 'Dual Shock Absorption System: Featuring a 7-layer anti-slip, diamond-textured running belt combined with 6 strategically placed shock-absorbing rubber pads, this under desk treadmill reduces impact on your joints while providing a stable and comfortable running surface, ensuring a safer and smoother workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5d6fb1d5-b1c4-431e-94c8-95e0d79b1eb8', 'cf9e7b86-d88a-4a43-85ea-deedc4a2a75c', '10-minute Data Retention: The LED display of this desk walking pad not only tracks your workout stats (speed, time, distance and calories) but also features a 10-minute data retention. Simply press the "start/stop" button on the remote control to pause the treadmill. So you will have 10 minutes for a water break.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f60b028b-963e-42d9-898e-24a1029ac462', 'cf9e7b86-d88a-4a43-85ea-deedc4a2a75c', 'Smart App Integration: This electric running machine boasts advanced smart app connectivity, which allows you to record detailed workout data, track your progress over time and access a community of like-minded individuals. Share your milestones and stay motivated by engaging with others in the app''s dynamic community.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4e3bebe6-d776-40c7-9aec-683af92dd14f', 'cf9e7b86-d88a-4a43-85ea-deedc4a2a75c', 'Portable Folding Treadmill: This folding treadmill is equipped with 2 built-in wheels, allowing for smooth and easy movement from one room to another or into storage, making it a space-efficient addition to any home or office. Furthermore, the device holder is removable for extra convenience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('79f7cd22-8405-4e83-a7d0-f4e13f824330', '92544f6d-074a-4743-9b24-bfd94745048c', '3G Cardio, an Arizona-based company with a combined 50 years of experience in the fitness industry, provides commercial-level quality and superior value. We offer an unmatched lifetime frame warranty, 5-year parts, and 1-year in-home labor and you are only a phone call away from 5-star customer service 9-5 weekdays PST');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d5c2eaf8-1598-465e-8c0e-70d88f3e929e', '92544f6d-074a-4743-9b24-bfd94745048c', 'The perfect solution for those who want a high-end treadmill but also need to conserve space. Most folding treadmills lack the quality needed to run at higher speeds or longer distances. Our heavy-duty Ortho Flex suspension limits the initial foot strike vibration while the 20.5” x 58” running belt provides plenty of space and comfort to run.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bdb2f15f-826b-46d3-a784-a153b29068b2', '92544f6d-074a-4743-9b24-bfd94745048c', '3.0 HP motor powers the 216 lb. Pro Runner Treadmill. Max user weight 350 lbs. Quick belt speed acceleration from 0 to 12 mph in just 18 seconds – perfect for interval or H.I.I.T workouts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2c426a0e-c386-4042-8dbf-ab887a1e568e', '92544f6d-074a-4743-9b24-bfd94745048c', 'All the necessary built-in programs with numerous pre-programmed courses, fitness tests, 1-touch speed (.5 to 12 MPH) and incline levels (0 - 15), heart rate control (wireless strap optional), and the ability to custom create your workouts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e18ab459-613a-4c8b-9bb4-811b68349392', '92544f6d-074a-4743-9b24-bfd94745048c', 'NO MEMBERSHIP REQUIRED with our equipment! ! Enjoy all your music or use your tablet while watching your favorite shows or workout routines');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fcda371e-dcad-4d63-984e-b8721f7f2bde', '2ca608a2-de4b-42ee-8b2f-3d5cce9e5049', '【0-12% Auto Incline Treadmill】Walking Pad Treadmill with Handle has an 9 levels Auto Incline Function with 0-12% Adjustable Incline, The Incline Design more Realistically Simulates Climbing Scenarios and Enhances Calorie Burning, You can Foldable or Unfold The Handles Of The Treadmill Under Your Desk, The Sturdy Structure Ensures that You Will Not Encounter Shaking When Using The Auto Incline Function, Enjoy A More Flexible, Comfortable and Safe Exercise Experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8532db67-7858-4e82-b5a4-befee8adcf58', '2ca608a2-de4b-42ee-8b2f-3d5cce9e5049', '【3.0HP Powerful & Quiet Motor】Auto Incline Treadmill with Powerful 3.0 HP Motor, Even Under a 320 lb Capacity, The Treadmill Also Keeping Smooth and Quiet Performance, Treadmill Speed Range of 0.6~7.6mph, Low Noise Reduction of 45db, Allowing You to Walk or Run without Disturbing Others, Perfect for Home and Office Use, Foldable Treadmill Provides You with a Stable and Comfortable Experience, Making Your Running Quieter And Safer!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5736b555-02d8-4274-8421-a9ee181fa0c7', '2ca608a2-de4b-42ee-8b2f-3d5cce9e5049', '【Dual Shock Absorption System Protection】Treadmill with Auto Incline is Equipped with 5 Layers of Anti-Slip Belts and 8 Shock Absorbers, Which Not Only Provides You with A Comfortable Workout Experience, But Also Effectively Reduces Impact and Minimizes Stress On Your Joints And Knees. The Durable Steel Frame And Multi-Layer Shock Absorbers are Designed to Provide Protection for Knees, Muscles and Ankles, Making Your Run Quieter, Safer and More Comfortable!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6726d587-b806-48f1-82f2-46c5676304b2', '2ca608a2-de4b-42ee-8b2f-3d5cce9e5049', '【Easy to Move and Store】Walking Pad Treadmill Requires No Installation, Open the Folding Handle Out of The Box and Ready to Use, The Treadmill Weight 57 Pounds, Folded Dimensions:48.03“*23.62”5.1”Inches, The Wheels on The Bottom and The Slim Size Make it Easy to Move and Store,Under Desk Treadmill the Compact and Lightweight Design is Perfect for Home, Apartment and Office');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5cda5692-855f-488f-aa06-ae3cc3acbbc6', '2ca608a2-de4b-42ee-8b2f-3d5cce9e5049', '【LED Display and Multiple Controls】Foldable Treadmill is Equipped with a Clear LED Display Screen, Real-Time Display of Speed, Distance, Time and Calories, So that Your Workout Data at a Glance, But Also Through The Control Panel, Remote Control or Smart Apps to Adjust The Speed and Incline, The Equipment Bracket Allows You to Put Your Cell Phone or Tablet on The Bracket, Watching Videos or Listening to Music During Exercise, So That Fitness No Longer Boring');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('314810a6-58b1-466c-a857-579706aeeda0', '195ab87a-0579-4a6e-8a50-9d2144b1f0e1', '3 in 1 Treadmill: With speed range from 0.6 MPH to 7.6 MPH, GYMAX walking pad is suitable for walking, jogging and running for different workout intensity. Panel, remote and App control are available for convenient use.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2b680768-d612-47d1-8fcc-c2ff4b74cbc1', '195ab87a-0579-4a6e-8a50-9d2144b1f0e1', 'High Performance Motor: Equipped with a 2.5HP high performance brushless motor, this walking pad offer you smooth and quiet exercise (<45 dB), leaving you no worries about disturbing neighbors.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a55ae705-3d21-4194-ac82-044b80a03398', '195ab87a-0579-4a6e-8a50-9d2144b1f0e1', 'Realistic Running Experience: The running area measures 35.5” x 15”, which allows you walking, jogging or running comfortably. Diamond-textured surface avoid slip while 7-layer construction and anti-shock pads protect your joints during workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5e40041f-341f-4186-ab20-22e531a05afb', '195ab87a-0579-4a6e-8a50-9d2144b1f0e1', 'Real Time Data: Featuring a LED monitor, this under desk treadmill would give you timely feedback about your workout progress. Moreover, you could have training courses, share exercise data with community and record your progress via Gymax App.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('105bd240-e65f-45d5-81cb-6c67d6289b2f', '195ab87a-0579-4a6e-8a50-9d2144b1f0e1', 'Free Assembly & 1-Second Folding: The portable treadmill comes you fully assembled, and with 2 built-in wheels, effortless to move and relocate. Besides, the running machine can be fold or set up with the wrench on side, easy peasy lemon squeezy.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('96062d14-ba44-469a-94ae-b6fab586110a', '4d7b9a32-37c9-4788-8ede-c787e23e765d', 'Home Fitness Machine: Focus on home workout and healthy life, OMA treadmill is designed for Walking, Jogging and Running at home/office/apartment. Enjoy effective aerobic exercise, help you burn fat and lose weight');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9e0fd456-3a27-4d59-87ae-2ff3f251f400', '4d7b9a32-37c9-4788-8ede-c787e23e765d', 'Professional Quality: Made of 5 MM extra-thicken commercial steel and a high-quality motor for long-lasting durability, which makes your daily home exercise safe and stable, supporting a maximum weight capacity of 300 lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('407e58aa-d0df-460b-8e72-078e803bee09', '4d7b9a32-37c9-4788-8ede-c787e23e765d', 'Widen Belt: Ultra comfort and safety thanks to 17" x 45.5'''' large-area running belt with 6-layer shock absorption and non-slip feature; reduce impact on knee, muscle and joints');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('80b880ba-31ec-4013-9152-d44c488a7062', '4d7b9a32-37c9-4788-8ede-c787e23e765d', 'Quiet Motor: Develop with smooth drive system, 2.5HP powerful motor controls the sound at lower than 45dB and provides speed up to 10 MPH. This treadmill allows you to walk or run without disturbing others or family');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('21fec18c-2dd7-441b-ad6a-098c4baf5a48', '4d7b9a32-37c9-4788-8ede-c787e23e765d', 'Accurately Monitor Data: Multi-function LED display easy to track TIME, SPEED, DISTANCE, CALORIES, and PULSE; With 36 preset programs, 3 countdown modes, and 3 manual incline settings, help you burn more fat');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('96d9181e-d487-4a04-bc38-35c78925b467', '4d7b9a32-37c9-4788-8ede-c787e23e765d', 'Storage Anywhere: This compact treadmill with a hydraulic folding system, only require a 6 FT² small footprint, easy to fold and save space. Built-in transport wheels make it easy to move and store in corners for any home or apartment');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('94537d4e-0a25-4604-868a-13ccd6dcb708', '4d7b9a32-37c9-4788-8ede-c787e23e765d', 'Easy Assembly: All tools, parts and instructions are well packed into one box. This treadmill is designed with 90% pre-assembled in less than 30 minutes to install, you can start to run with music or watch videos for enjoyable home workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('56507d7f-0029-481e-bdf8-e74dcb6e68c5', '4d7b9a32-37c9-4788-8ede-c787e23e765d', 'Reliable Support: We strive to provide you better shopping experience and will reply to you within 24 hours. Any further questions, please let us know at any time');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b08b0958-66ce-494b-8493-f76929837863', '363be207-8a0e-4602-bfc6-7cf15e56b668', 'POWERFUL PERFORMANCE - Get a total body workout with the Assault Rower Pro. Dual stage chain and belt drive system provide smooth rowing motion. Features steel foot plates, aluminum beam, and commercial-grade inspired seat for superior comfort and durability.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ca9550a8-d122-4763-88cb-8a18091ae4d9', '363be207-8a0e-4602-bfc6-7cf15e56b668', 'REAL-TIME METRICS - Monitor your performance in real-time with the updated console. Choose from pre-programmed or customized workouts to challenge any fitness level. Enjoy an exceptional HIIT, cardio, or endurance training session right in your own home gym.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('90da8239-1ebf-4585-8d9a-fd7081a46b45', '363be207-8a0e-4602-bfc6-7cf15e56b668', 'VERSATILE USE - Train indoors or outdoors with the human powered machine that easily folds down for compact storage when not in use. Perfect for athletes of all levels looking to improve their health and get in shape faster than ever before!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8e3cb2b6-81c2-460c-a270-6cca5d4dc3f8', '8dec29d9-f196-49b3-9836-8150bcc29a2a', 'Neoprene coating: to protect flooring from getting scratched, or in case you drop the kettle-bell');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a2ee17e2-7533-4c56-8410-874664f84cac', '363be207-8a0e-4602-bfc6-7cf15e56b668', 'NO ELECTRICITY NEEDED: Like all Assault Fitness products, this machine is athlete-powered, granting you the freedom to train both indoors or outdoors – you choose.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('122a44ea-d291-4df1-afc5-70006d9ccfd1', 'e546b608-60cb-4395-8f6b-4ec28f43d55b', 'KID TREADMILL - This colorful piece of kids workout equipment helps your tyke get physical activity in any weather, with safe manual operation and an LED monitor that shows exercise time and shuts off automatically after 10 minutes of no activity.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fe193b6d-8723-4df4-8bc4-f78dce6c4629', 'e546b608-60cb-4395-8f6b-4ec28f43d55b', 'FITNESS FUN - This toddler exercise equipment will help your kiddo get their wiggles out on rainy days while establishing a healthy fitness habit. Create a kids indoor play gym to show your little one how fun it can be to incorporate movement into their day.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6517c6f8-a1f6-405b-9057-f7a444308f5c', 'e546b608-60cb-4395-8f6b-4ec28f43d55b', 'EASY TO USE - The non motorized treadmill provides the perfect child-safe indoor fitness activity, with foam-padded rails and a walking pad decorated with fun footprints that encourage little ones to march to the beat of their own drummer.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('600e5679-5c89-4161-b07a-dd0e7305b44d', 'e546b608-60cb-4395-8f6b-4ec28f43d55b', 'QUALITY CONSTRUCTION - This sturdy piece of kids gym equipment features a powder-coated alloy steel frame built to support children aged 3-7 weighing up to 150-pounds, with a stable base that allows your little one to strut their way through playtime.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('008b6d8d-d02b-4018-9250-ea3711fe4632', 'e546b608-60cb-4395-8f6b-4ec28f43d55b', 'PRODUCT DETAILS - Materials: Alloy Steel, Foam, and Plastic. Dimensions: (L) 20.25” x (W) 27” x (H) 20.5”; Capacity: 150lbs. Toddler Treadmill for Ages 3+. Display Requires 2 AA Batteries, Not Included. Color: Blue, Red, and Yellow.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d3aadddd-b693-46f5-ab7d-373ce684de12', '2098ed41-195c-4d9c-93d3-5c4d0e85be24', '--Unleash Your Potential: Experience a powerful workout with speeds up to 12.5 mph and 24 preset programs for all fitness levels. This treadmill accommodates walking, jogging, and running, making it ideal for users at any stage of their fitness journey');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1160942c-3333-46c4-82ae-3cac3793d1a8', '2098ed41-195c-4d9c-93d3-5c4d0e85be24', '--Dynamic Running: With 20 levels of auto incline, this treadmill simulates various terrains for an engaging running. Adjust the incline at the touch of a button to increase workout intensity, enhance calorie burning, and target various muscle groups');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a8e101b4-9c57-4ecd-8112-607ae664ef9a', '2098ed41-195c-4d9c-93d3-5c4d0e85be24', '--Spacious Strides: With a generous 60x23-inch running belt, this treadmill offers ample space for comfortable strides while reducing the risk of accidents. The spacious runner rack ensures stability and confidence during high-speed runs or intense walks');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('677bb293-d892-4199-973d-0012609b3fc8', '2098ed41-195c-4d9c-93d3-5c4d0e85be24', '--Stay Engaged: Stay informed during your workout with a large 25'''' digital screen that provides real-time stats, including speed, distance, time, and calories burned. One-touch speed and incline settings allow for easy customization without interruption');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cb68a6ab-a722-4379-919e-5959d96d00e9', '2098ed41-195c-4d9c-93d3-5c4d0e85be24', '--Quiet and Smart: Designed for a noise-free experience, this treadmill enables uninterrupted workouts at any time. With Bluetooth capabilities and smart knobs for easy control, it integrates seamlessly with fitness apps for a complete home gym experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('21474035-b620-4bfc-bbea-940211d6caf1', 'd6b2ad85-3a91-4fa1-bf97-92fae3cce941', 'Heavy-Duty Commercial Treadmill: This Commercial incline treadmill features a wide running belt measuring 60" x 23", providing ample space for a natural running stride; With a robust weight capacity of 400 lbs, the electric treadmill supports users of various sizes');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7f68a29c-09e2-4ad4-b03d-d54266069c22', 'd6b2ad85-3a91-4fa1-bf97-92fae3cce941', 'Dynamic Workout Experience: The heavy-duty treadmill features with 20 levels of auto incline, allowing you to tailor the intensity of your workouts; with speeds of up to 24 mph and 70 preset programs, this treadmill offers versatile training experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('09ab5fdd-5971-44c6-89f3-436e1e8e0c77', 'd6b2ad85-3a91-4fa1-bf97-92fae3cce941', 'Convenient Smart Controls: The commercial treadmill features with one-touch speed and incline settings, allowing you to seamlessly customize your workout intensity at the touch of a button, making it easy to focus on your fitness goals without interruption');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('731a59fb-b2b2-43cb-bb2f-73a71fb0c9ef', 'd6b2ad85-3a91-4fa1-bf97-92fae3cce941', '25" Large Digital Monitor: The compact treadmill features 25" large digital monitor providing effortless viewing of essential workout metrics, including program time, distance, calories burned, speed, incline and mode time');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fb8fd095-674b-4676-892c-628a5b8d9967', 'd6b2ad85-3a91-4fa1-bf97-92fae3cce941', '70 Workout Programs: Pre-set workout programs and customizable options can help to achieve their fitness goals more effectively. Integration with fitness apps, Bluetooth capabilities for streaming workouts or tracking progress. And step off for a full-body workout in classes like strength training, Tread Bootcamp, yoga, and more.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cc61de54-6f3e-40f8-99ff-cdbf98a029b5', 'bd36ebf1-50ca-4770-b989-fe91cb4b2a50', 'With Fitness APP Control & Retractable Phone Holder — With the Bluetooth, you could connect the treadmill to your mobile phone through the Gymax app, so you can control the machine and track your fitness data while exercising. Also, you can use the phone holder to listen to music / watch movies and relax yourself while you are running.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('062ed871-2ace-4a85-a249-b2526f1ccc1c', 'bd36ebf1-50ca-4770-b989-fe91cb4b2a50', 'Powerful & Ultra Quiet 3.0 HP Motor — Equipped with noiseless 3.0 HP motor, this running machine allows you to run or walk as much as you like without disturbing others, making it an ideal sports facility for home or office use. Premium steel structure with excellent anti-shock ability is steady and sturdy for running.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('86cc70c6-73dd-46cb-ba3d-fffaa711e95e', 'bd36ebf1-50ca-4770-b989-fe91cb4b2a50', 'Automatic/Manual Speed Settings — Quickly switch between 2 preset speeds (3 and 5 mph), or adjust the speed from 0.6 MPH to 8 MPH with the -/+ buttons to meet your different sports needs. The speed unit could be switched between mile and km in APP. No assembly required.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b716089b-c522-40c3-943f-8e0679f00d04', 'bd36ebf1-50ca-4770-b989-fe91cb4b2a50', 'Comfortable Tread Belt & HD Digital Display — The 5-layer non-slip texture running belt features a spacious running area and good shock absorption performance, providing you great running experience to better protect your knees and muscles. The high definition touch screen clearly shows time, steps, speed, distance and calories in real time.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3959505e-3919-4efa-8ea0-5dd77bbc2afe', 'bd36ebf1-50ca-4770-b989-fe91cb4b2a50', 'Foldable & Self-Standing & Moveable Treadmill — This compact treadmill can be easily folded up by turning the side knobs, saving plenty of storage space. Self-standing without leaning against a wall, and the built-in transport wheels at the bottom make the treadmill easy to move anywhere. Also equipped with a safety key to shut down immediately in an emergency to protect your safety.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2634fcf6-9e83-4cef-988f-718425008891', '5145082b-abb3-40ac-91c8-a1ae0ff78555', 'Portable Walking Pad: Right out of the box, no assembly required. Built-in front transport wheels make the walking pad portable and allow you to maintain a cardio routine anywhere, anytime even on rainy days, hot summers, winters, or any other bad weather. And compact design makes it easy to store in a small space at home or in the office. The 4.96" height makes it easy to place under a sofa or bed to save space');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('659c8b37-52e8-45c9-bb91-43cd84914ede', '5145082b-abb3-40ac-91c8-a1ae0ff78555', '2 In-1 Under Desk Walking Pad Treadmill: There are 2 modes, it can be used as an under-desk treadmill when working and can be used as a walking pad when walking. 0.6-3.8 MPH Speed range allows you to walk or jog and also makes you customize your exercise intensity based on your physical condition and fitness goals');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('402f92f2-bda7-4b50-a1d5-7ba16cea7977', '7465c0cb-6ce0-4d3f-9ffa-1acbbcd2f5c1', 'Durable Construction - Built with high-quality materials, this exercise rowing machine supports up to 300 lbs, ensuring long-lasting durability and reliability.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fea6b80d-1a4b-4964-83be-1ab73448f35f', '5145082b-abb3-40ac-91c8-a1ae0ff78555', 'Treadmill with Powerful 2.5HP & Quiet Motor: Equipped with a 2.5 HP motor that makes the weight support up to 300 pounds, also provides enough power to support a variety of workouts, from light walking to jogging. While the others are only 2.0 or 2.25 HP. Our quiet treadmill, allows you to walk or run in the morning or evening without disturbing others, perfect for home and office');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('06c395d2-770d-4fe1-9b7b-2af16197f025', '5145082b-abb3-40ac-91c8-a1ae0ff78555', 'Longer Running Belt & Shock Absorption: With a new structural optimization, the running belt does not shift. The belt length is 40", making the running distance longer. The belt width reaches 16 ", allowing walking more freedom. 6 silicone shock absorption to help absorb the shock of each step, reducing joint stress and minimizing the risk of injury. The 5-layer anti-slip running belt provides you with a comfortable sports Experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('efdea395-e894-4566-b01b-5a382530ea49', '5145082b-abb3-40ac-91c8-a1ae0ff78555', 'Multi-Function Display and Remote Control: The LED display clearly shows time, calories, steps, speed, and distance, grasps your exercise status in time, and makes your exercise data clear at a glance. Additionally, the speed can be conveniently adjusted using the remote control, adding to the overall convenience and safety of the treadmill');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e4038852-9248-445f-bb9b-f733ee671e93', '5145082b-abb3-40ac-91c8-a1ae0ff78555', 'Professional Customer Service: Whether you encounter any problems before or after sales, you can contact us at any time, our professional customer team provides you with email in product guides and documents');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2acf432e-9346-407b-b9e6-af6f72659fce', '0d6062ca-fb4c-4383-afc9-04c1f9bd3676', '𝐐𝐔𝐈𝐄𝐓 𝐁𝐑𝐔𝐒𝐇𝐋𝐄𝐒𝐒 𝐌𝐎𝐓𝐎𝐑 - UMAY improved brushless motor with max 3.0 HP provides efficient, reliable, and low-maintenance operation, while providing speeds of 8.7 MPH and emitting only 40-65 dB of noise, ensuring your workouts won''t disturb your downstairs or next-doors');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ddb15e1f-ffb4-415c-ac36-f7c35fc7e2d8', '0d6062ca-fb4c-4383-afc9-04c1f9bd3676', '𝐏𝐔𝐋𝐒𝐄 𝐒𝐄𝐍𝐒𝐎𝐑𝐒 - Keep track of your target heart rate in real-time with the built-in handrail heart sensors. Monitoring your pulse rate during exercise ensures you''re working out correctly and efficiently');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a119551d-a30c-4a83-bedb-ad186bc8a0a9', '0d6062ca-fb4c-4383-afc9-04c1f9bd3676', '𝐈𝐍𝐂𝐋𝐈𝐍𝐄 𝐓𝐑𝐄𝐀𝐃𝐌𝐈𝐋𝐋 - Customize the intensity of your workout with 3 different manual incline positions. Simulate the challenge of running uphill and feel the burn in your leg muscles as you push yourself to new heights');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8f53bb05-5d4b-4f10-9e81-ff8d7e43b8d0', '0d6062ca-fb4c-4383-afc9-04c1f9bd3676', '𝐅𝐎𝐋𝐃𝐈𝐍𝐆 𝐓𝐑𝐄𝐀𝐃𝐌𝐈𝐋𝐋 - The hydraulic system guarantees safe and hands-free unfolding. Say goodbye to concerns about scuffing your floors when lowering the treadmill''s base. The built-in transportation wheels allow for effortless movement or storage. Additionally, the individual easy-self lubrication hole makes maintenance a breeze');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0862f42c-8145-43de-a9f1-63a57495e439', '0d6062ca-fb4c-4383-afc9-04c1f9bd3676', '𝐔𝐌𝐀𝐘𝐂𝐀���𝐄 𝐒𝐄𝐑𝐕𝐈𝐂𝐄 - UmayCare is committed to providing exceptional customer support. Our California-based customer support team is on standby to assist with any questions or issues you may have with our equipment, guaranteeing 100% satisfaction');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('22635978-deed-42a2-bd89-9e71c625f0c6', '0d6062ca-fb4c-4383-afc9-04c1f9bd3676', 'UMAYCARE SERVICE - Our California-based team provides complete after-sales and technical support, ensuring any issues with your order or product use are resolved to your satisfaction. From shipping damage and parts issues to product usage, installation, and maintenance, we''re here to offer tailored solutions');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e34c999b-1196-41e8-b6da-dacf21009b1a', '16e180a9-3964-4292-8ce3-8475afaa34ad', 'Most Effective Running Modes of Reducing Fat: HIIT is internationally recognized as the most effective method of reducing fat. To burn calories more effectively, we specially programmed 12 different HIIT running setting, with the help of these preset training plans, you can choose the best plan to suits your need. Also, the adjustable LCD platform will keep track of your exercise data, such as speed, time, distance and calories.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f2af60c6-8b9b-408e-9261-10f49c7b4073', '16e180a9-3964-4292-8ce3-8475afaa34ad', 'Easy-to-fold Design to Improve Space Utilization: Folding it in only one step! The folding size is 48x26x5.5 inch (L x W x H). The compact design also makes it easier to store anywhere, even under the bed or sofa, taking up minimum space. UREVO new folding treadmill is now smaller and more convenient, weighing only 22.5kg.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('57cc3c97-d70b-4e4f-96ea-59e347057a54', '16e180a9-3964-4292-8ce3-8475afaa34ad', 'More Powerful Performance Makes Running Like Outdoors: 2.25 HP Motor provides speeds of 0.6-6.2 MPH which guarantee the stable operation of the machine with 220lbs weight capacity. The motor runs more quietly and will never disturb other people. Five-layer non-slip running belt is more durable and quiet. The one-piece pressing technology makes the running belt splicing smoother.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6b7e1deb-292c-4dad-9988-0c90a592d06d', '16e180a9-3964-4292-8ce3-8475afaa34ad', 'Larger Running Area for Your whole Family and Pets: The 16 inches wider anti-slip belt providing a safer and more comfortable experience for your running. What you get is not just an ordinary treadmill, but a treadmill for your pets, which meaning you, your family members, and your beloved dogs can all exercise and get fit on UREVO folding treadmill.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('77fb1f1e-9081-43a4-ba5b-ec9e2bd54e2e', '16e180a9-3964-4292-8ce3-8475afaa34ad', 'Customer Orientation: Our LCD screen can be easily rotated and adjusted, meaning no matter what height you''re, there''s an angle that ensures clear views for you. And our phone holder allows you to easily stay entertained and connected. You can also get our 100% satisfying customer service. Urevo provides professional service and all inquiries will be answered within 24 hours.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a566bf71-3f08-4062-92c3-9bcdb32f8058', '38e85588-c2af-4186-aa39-05b68129b57a', '【Hyper Powerful and Quiet Motor】Equipped with powerful 2.5HP motor, this JOROTO treadmill provides a smooth and quiet running experience. The hyper motor provides a wide speed range from 0.6 ~ 8.5 Mph or 1~ 14 km/h ( km or mile can be switched by users). Running at high speeds to burn calories or taking a leisurely walk to keep active, JOROTO F5 is always a great choice, its strong motor along with the sturdy main frame guarantees a stable and consistent running performance.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('03c7ab3f-4b0d-4a1b-8cb5-51f40a100b05', '38e85588-c2af-4186-aa39-05b68129b57a', '【No Installation and Folding Design & User Friendly】This portable treadmill is 100% pre-assembled, only need to simply unfold the treadmill, plug it in, then start your workout; When not in use, it can be folded up completely of compact size 57”*22.5”*6.5” and stored under your sofa, your bed, and your office desk easily, making it perfect for apartments, small rooms and offices; with built-in wheels, convenient for moving.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9190bcb7-2a7a-422c-923b-0a43b4750260', '38e85588-c2af-4186-aa39-05b68129b57a', '【Suit for Different Users and Broad Running Area 】JOROTO folding treadmill NOT ONLY has large range speeds, ALSO has a MAX weight capacity of 265lbs, making it suitable for a wide range of users with different weights and demands; And the large running surface of 47" x 16.5" can provide ample space for comfortable and safe running, What''s more, it is designed to prevent slipping and shock absorbing, ensuring that the runner can run with confidence and always in safe condition.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3b97ae0d-29dc-44c3-9c8b-4026a7848d85', '38e85588-c2af-4186-aa39-05b68129b57a', '【Comprehensive Display and Connectivity】JOROTO F5 Folding Treadmill features a large 22.5" x 7.8" /57cm x 19.8cm display that provides comprehensive workout information, including Speed, Distance, Time, Calories, and Pulse. The treadmill also has Bluetooth connectivity, allowing you to connect to the training apps like Kinomap and access a wide range of training programs and workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b4089c8e-ab58-4271-ba55-6e606de17143', '38e85588-c2af-4186-aa39-05b68129b57a', '【Bluetooth App Membership】JOROTO F5 treadmill With Bluetooth connectivity, compatible with most fitness apps, What’s more, JOROTO provides a 30-day APP membership and the new member 14 days at no cost. This workout app contains many training videos and virtual courses. With the APP, the workout process will be more interesting and easier to achieve goals.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4a8b9c09-0ecf-46a7-a41d-7886aad12a8c', '38e85588-c2af-4186-aa39-05b68129b57a', '【Multi-Language Manual Instruction&Excellent After-Sale Service】The JOROTO F5 treadmill includes a user manual in English, French, German, Italian, Spanish, and other languages, making it easy to use; All brand-new JOROTO row machines come with 1-year replacement parts at no cost and lifetime professional customer service, JOROTO support team is on standby 24/7, will solve any problem in time, and provide 100% satisfying solutions.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7feea3ef-4280-43d4-95bd-9a2c538fdf1f', '124e9c4d-ba08-4128-814d-4d70194309fa', '【AUTOMATIC INCLINE】Choose from 12 preset incline options (0-7 degrees) that adjust at the touch of a button, making it easy to customize each workout and continuously challenge yourself.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4d3e75ca-f9de-4256-9079-15101523ead4', '124e9c4d-ba08-4128-814d-4d70194309fa', '【CONNECTED FITNESS】Elevate workouts with the FREE SunnyFit app. Bluetooth sync offers 1,000+ trainer-led videos, 10,000+ tours, and diverse programs. Personalize training, track progress, and join community challenges on your treadmill.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e280a419-0bf0-4ad1-8b4b-1a1535a92d57', '124e9c4d-ba08-4128-814d-4d70194309fa', '【BRUSHLESS MOTOR TECHNOLOGY】These motors are fast and frictionless, offering a quieter treadmill running experience. Enjoy the feeling of running on solid ground from the comfort of your own home.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('904c94d1-d68b-428c-9617-5a0fe8ccf374', '124e9c4d-ba08-4128-814d-4d70194309fa', '【CUSHIONED DECK】The 47 x 17.3” cushioned running deck reduces impact on your joints, making your workouts more comfortable and reducing the risk of injury.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('98e0e58a-5c29-4869-83e0-aa489ce2dc82', '124e9c4d-ba08-4128-814d-4d70194309fa', '【DIGITAL MONITOR & PULSE SENSORS 】Easily keep track of your progress during your workout. The large, adjustable LED console displays Calories, Distance, Pulse, Speed, and Time. Use convenient grip sensors to track your heart rate in real-time.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3c00f2f0-d763-48ac-bc89-190703e3701a', '124e9c4d-ba08-4128-814d-4d70194309fa', '【HIGH WEIGHT CAPACITY】Built to support up to 265 LB, this treadmill accommodates users of various sizes and fitness levels, providing a sturdy and reliable workout experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d2e75bde-5265-498a-9831-d3ed59ce891c', '124e9c4d-ba08-4128-814d-4d70194309fa', '【BOTTLE HOLDER】Keep your favorite beverage within arm''s length with this convenient bottle holder. No need to stop to sip, simply reach down and grab!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3839b335-9a8d-40e6-b7cb-ca17d9053eb3', '124e9c4d-ba08-4128-814d-4d70194309fa', '【EMERGENCY STOP CLIP】Safety for our customers is our primary focus. This emergency stop clip will bring the treadmill to an immediate stop when detached.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5e0d69e2-577c-468f-888b-8de6a90a6620', '124e9c4d-ba08-4128-814d-4d70194309fa', '【TRANSPORTATION WHEELS】Avoid heavy lifting and muscle strain with the easy-to-use, built-in wheels. Simply tilt and roll out to place your treadmill in the desired location.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f5370491-f5a6-4921-8579-cb676294af6f', '124e9c4d-ba08-4128-814d-4d70194309fa', '【20+ YEARS OF EXCELLENCE】As a premier brand, Sunny Health & Fitness delivers top-notch equipment dedicated to excellence. With our devoted support team and certified trainers, enjoy an unmatched FIT FOR EVERYONE experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('da4a0966-c3e1-4c60-943b-583d27a9715d', '28ae2403-44f1-4b1d-ac83-51fed66ce9b3', 'Immersive 32-inch interactive HD touchscreen streams live and on-demand iFIT workouts directly to your equipment; Self-cooling incline motor for effective running and cardio training');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d9fe88ac-d31d-45d0-8970-e0b16b43aacc', '28ae2403-44f1-4b1d-ac83-51fed66ce9b3', '-6 to 40% OneTouch incline control; 12 MPH SMART OneTouch speed control; Your iFIT Trainer auto-adjusts your speed and incline to meet trainer requirements and match real-world terrain');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('87d6b987-e3d1-46a0-8a54-430f3deb6af0', '28ae2403-44f1-4b1d-ac83-51fed66ce9b3', 'ActivePulse; Your treadmill will auto-adjust to keep you in your target heart rate zone; Bluetooth pulse reader sold separately; 22” x 65” tread belt for leg and elbow space; Reflex deck cushioning');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4cd1826d-0102-4d81-a146-2d52e0c05253', '28ae2403-44f1-4b1d-ac83-51fed66ce9b3', '300-pound user capacity; Protected with a 10-year frame warranty, 2-year parts warranty, and 1-year labor warranty; 73" H x 40" W x 76.5" L');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7ff0dbbe-6ae4-43a2-9d95-0c13c7a66dc2', 'da5ae7d3-243f-45db-88c6-c0f59bd7745c', '【COMPACT & ERGONOMIC DESIGN】Lightweight and space-saving, this treadmill is ideal for small homes. It features a running surface of 42" x 13", making it durable for power walking or light jogging.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4225981a-87f4-4f04-a3b9-3c53e3cd668b', 'da5ae7d3-243f-45db-88c6-c0f59bd7745c', '【DUAL FLYWHEEL INCLINE BENEFITS】The fixed incline design boosts workout intensity, improving cardiovascular health and burning more calories. With dual flywheels, this treadmill provides enhanced resistance, requiring greater effort as you increase speed and power.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5b15fe28-7c91-45c2-a44a-eef7ca837294', 'da5ae7d3-243f-45db-88c6-c0f59bd7745c', '【USER-FRIENDLY LCD MONITOR】Stay motivated by easily tracking your fitness progress with a clear digital monitor that displays essential metrics like time, speed, distance, and calories burned.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0bf72b6b-4f1f-4440-aabd-f2180203d7e8', 'da5ae7d3-243f-45db-88c6-c0f59bd7745c', '【NON-ELECTRIC CONVENIENCE】Enjoy a hassle-free workout experience with this treadmill that requires no electrical outlet, making it low maintenance and suitable for any location. The easy folding functionality also ensures simple storage.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('40d4bc18-d2fa-444f-a741-6a1e2b7a3afa', 'da5ae7d3-243f-45db-88c6-c0f59bd7745c', '【SAFE NON-SLIP RUNNING SURFACE】Experience peace of mind during your workouts on the treadmill’s smooth, non-slip belt, designed for maximum stability and safety with every step.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('628ce783-c7a8-4604-8475-c98decdc0686', 'da5ae7d3-243f-45db-88c6-c0f59bd7745c', '【SOFT FOAM HAND GRIPS】Enjoy added comfort and stability with slip-resistant foam hand grips that allow you to maintain balance during your walk.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('873e358c-eea3-4c0d-a50f-3fa6d052b5e9', 'da5ae7d3-243f-45db-88c6-c0f59bd7745c', '【VERSATILE FOR HOME USE】Its compact design makes it an excellent addition to any home gym, allowing you to maximize your workout potential even in limited spaces.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a6d554c5-5053-4668-931c-bfc09f706917', 'da5ae7d3-243f-45db-88c6-c0f59bd7745c', '【DURABLE CONSTRUCTION】Built to withstand various workout intensities, this treadmill is designed for longevity, ensuring you get the most out of your exercise routine.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('589157df-2859-4072-8b27-f988f8b79382', 'da5ae7d3-243f-45db-88c6-c0f59bd7745c', '【EASY MOBILITY & STORAGE】Equipped with transportation wheels, you can easily move the treadmill wherever needed and store it without hassle.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('44809156-bdce-4261-8c70-2aa9b56368a8', 'da5ae7d3-243f-45db-88c6-c0f59bd7745c', '【20+ YEARS OF EXCELLENCE】Sunny Health & Fitness, a U.S.-based company, offers top-quality equipment with a commitment to excellence. Our dedicated U.S. customer service team and certified trainers ensure a truly unmatched FIT FOR EVERYONE experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3f3558b9-d4f5-4b81-afc5-958bcf07e88a', '157f3e2e-faf8-4818-8473-f90c225da2ac', '【Extended Treadmill Belt】This treadmill features a spacious 16" x 45.3" belt with five layers of anti-slip technology, providing a safer and more comfortable workout experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8c707bd8-9828-4466-a0ef-56419b4b9425', '157f3e2e-faf8-4818-8473-f90c225da2ac', '【Treadmill with Incline】This incline treadmill offers 4 manual incline levels to customize the intensity of your workout. P1-P36 programs personalize workouts tailored to specific goals');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('02f12ed0-870c-443f-a558-14e782933695', '157f3e2e-faf8-4818-8473-f90c225da2ac', '【300 lbs Weight Capacity】Built to support users weighing up to 300 lbs, this treadmill offers exceptional durability and reliability, making it suitable for a wide range of users with varying fitness levels');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('85bb01d6-b3aa-48e3-a550-0572acae0a23', '157f3e2e-faf8-4818-8473-f90c225da2ac', '【2.5HP Powerful Motor】Upgraded 2.5HP motor with a 8 MPH capability ensures powerful, efficient workouts with noise levels below 50dB for quiet operation');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a5fe9de2-e089-4580-8f9c-adf0e6e4d5b3', '157f3e2e-faf8-4818-8473-f90c225da2ac', '【Connectivity For APP】 This treadmill can Pairable with Kinomap and Zwift, it enhances your running experience, bringing the feel of outdoor running right into your home');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d35f44fa-4f4a-4ddd-bd85-f775c0124c48', '157f3e2e-faf8-4818-8473-f90c225da2ac', '【Easy Assembly】Set up your treadmill quickly and easily with 90% pre-assembly. With simple assembly instructions, you''ll be up and running in no time');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('084cdc2f-d6ff-431c-8361-128ce8312dfa', '157f3e2e-faf8-4818-8473-f90c225da2ac', '【Space Saving】 Space-saving portable treadmill with foldable design ideal for smaller homes, apartments, or home gyms. Offers easy storage without compromising performance or durability');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4620c899-5863-4a04-8104-caa0ebebd2e4', 'da1d762e-66e1-442f-a600-b559cee637c9', '【Wide Running Belt Treadmill】 The 5-layer non-slip running belt features a spacious running area(41.7" x 15.7"), providing an effective and safe cushion for your knees. Our under desk treadmill with LED display clearly shows time, speed, distance and calories, monitoring your progress in real time and keeping your movement data at a glance.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4df09ed0-4a1d-4ad9-8306-054aa5ffecc7', 'da1d762e-66e1-442f-a600-b559cee637c9', '【Walking Treadmill With a Powerful Motor】The powerful 2.5 Horsepower Motor provides a large carrying capacity of up to 300 pounds. The portable Walking Treadmill allows you to run up to max speed 10.8kmh / 6.7 mph and walk up to 6kmh / 3.8 mph with the remote under your desk.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4248df50-80cd-44ea-99f9-f57c7d9b53f4', 'da1d762e-66e1-442f-a600-b559cee637c9', '【RHYTHM FUN Treadmill with APP】 Connect the Ypoofit app to link our Home Office Treadmill through Bluetooth, so you can join course training and more realistic running track. Use the phone holder to watch videos or chat with friends. The remote control is convenient to adjust the speed of movement and stop instantly. Smart Ypoofit APP control is perfect to record exercise data and running with other users.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d789616d-4090-4db2-b572-7d15581b493f', 'da1d762e-66e1-442f-a600-b559cee637c9', '【NO Assembly & Space Saving Design】This 2-in-1 treadmill arrives fully assembled and can be used right out of the box, fold it up and walk away in two easy step,perfect for home,apartment,office use.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('149b3112-c33e-4850-bb15-a0be2f0fbd1f', 'da1d762e-66e1-442f-a600-b559cee637c9', '【Satisfactory Service】Rhythm Fun quiet walking pad is dedicated to providing high-quality treadmills and after-sales service. Consumers can contact us at any time, and we will provide satisfactory service to every customer.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('48ad5dbe-0287-49a1-bce3-a2f22e684cdb', '5bc6f0c8-7c67-40d9-9c8b-3e83215b51c5', '【Perfect Choice For Balancing Life And Health】: Enjoy a healthier life and work experience with the Bifanuo walking pad. Discover the high efficiency and reduced stress of walking while you work! Bifanuo treadmills for home/office - Ideal for Fitness Enthusiasts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('62495b51-6a9d-42d5-9ad0-08d63655034a', '5bc6f0c8-7c67-40d9-9c8b-3e83215b51c5', '【Portable Treadmill - Easy to Move & Store】:The treadmill arrives fully assembled and ready to use straight out of the box. The under desk treadmill with transportation wheels for easy mobility. Place it under the sofa, corner or under the bed, largely save your home space');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1878b756-19a7-4005-9d1f-012f330cb145', '5bc6f0c8-7c67-40d9-9c8b-3e83215b51c5', '【Powerful 2.25 HP Quiet Motor】: The walking pad is equipped with a powerful 2.25HP motor. Maximum weight capacity is 265 lbs. The motor of our treadmill provides great power and is also very quiet, which makes it perfect for office and home use. You can use this under desk treadmill anytime, anywhere without worrying about disturbing others');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f7485166-df8a-4a5d-9b8e-8d709eadc84d', '5bc6f0c8-7c67-40d9-9c8b-3e83215b51c5', '【Premium Anti-slip Running Belt & Shock Reduction System】: The under desk treadmill offers a large 15 inches * 37.7 inches running belt, just run as you like! Five-layer non-slip running belt with built-in shock reduction effectively reduces joint impact and protects your knees');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('66e25ea8-dd0f-4759-a551-6e7d22775742', '5bc6f0c8-7c67-40d9-9c8b-3e83215b51c5', '【Multi-function Led Display & Remote】: Multi-functional LED display that allows user to track progress in speed, distance, time and calories burned. Use the remote control to conveniently adjust the speed of the walking pad or stop the treadmill while running. 0.6-4 mph speed range, adjustable to fit your exercise needs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('79a5fc01-e715-4c5d-a9d4-aebe242bc954', 'c77dca6d-22e8-4fe1-82ba-3188de7c91e1', 'Anylife Incline Walking Pad Treadmill');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4b0998c9-1ebe-4381-87e4-5f24885f9901', 'c77dca6d-22e8-4fe1-82ba-3188de7c91e1', '5°INCLINE, EFFECTIVE FAT BURNER: The 5° manually adjustable incline can effectively increase the amount of calories burned during the workout, and you can achieve a better exercise effect compared to other treadmills. The incline angle is designed to more realistically simulate the outdoor climbing scene, making exercise challenging and fun');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('85e73ac1-84e7-4d01-a82a-39705c8af448', 'c77dca6d-22e8-4fe1-82ba-3188de7c91e1', '2.5HP BRUSHLESS MOTOR：This under desk treadmill is equipped with a 2.5HP high power brushless motor that produces no more than 45dB of sound when running, so you can enjoy your workout late at night or early in the morning without disturbing others, can load a max weight up to 330lbs capacity');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fdd6eb78-24f6-474b-a9ab-83947f3c806e', 'c77dca6d-22e8-4fe1-82ba-3188de7c91e1', 'ONLY 3.85” THICK, SPACE SAVER: At only 3.85 inches, this walking treadmill takes up hardly any extra space. The portable treadmill also comes with two wheels on the bottom, making it easy to carry effortlessly and enjoy running anytime, anywhere');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6c6cdee6-df3f-4ec0-a144-3d60c329e88a', 'c77dca6d-22e8-4fe1-82ba-3188de7c91e1', '6 SHOCK ABSORBERS: This incline walking pad has a 4 layers non-slip running belt, ensure every step of your workout is firm and comfortable. 6 shock absorbers at the bottom of the treadmill reduce the impact of running and reduce the pressure on knees and joints for a healthy workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('108c8c20-5547-45f1-b7fc-4250e5e8dd70', 'c77dca6d-22e8-4fe1-82ba-3188de7c91e1', 'ALL IN 1 TREADMILL: Anylife home treadmill have a speed range of 0.6-3.8mph, 0.6-1.5mph for walking, 1-2.5mph for jogging, and 3-4mph for running, satisfy your different exercise needs. Equipped with a remote control，change the running speed without having to bend down');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0817662a-0d55-4f45-87e9-74e86b04bee2', 'c77dca6d-22e8-4fe1-82ba-3188de7c91e1', 'RELAXED FITNESS: The display on the front of the desk walking pad clearly records the calories burned, the distance and speed of the exercise and the duration, so that you can always know the status of your exercise and experience the portability and fun brought by technology');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e045c3a7-ba37-4fc2-96bc-76e2f269791a', 'c77dca6d-22e8-4fe1-82ba-3188de7c91e1', '365 Days Worry-Free Plan: In your purchase of the under desk treadmill within 365 days time encountered machine quality problems, please contact us, we will all give you a new machine, Our customer service will respond to your questions within 24 hours');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e87d8c6d-b714-419a-9a69-e965d2087770', 'fb24e077-1a0b-4c63-ba06-341f351c7d89', '【POWERFUL DRIVE SYSTEM】Experience reliable performance with a robust 2.20 peak HP drive system, providing speeds ranging from 0.5 to 9 MPH, catering to various fitness levels.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a4998f21-cb0b-4ef2-90ed-d761ab6f446f', 'fb24e077-1a0b-4c63-ba06-341f351c7d89', '【ADJUSTABLE INCLINE LEVELS】Customize your workout with 3 manual incline options (0%, 2%, 4.37%) to meet your comfort and intensity preferences, enhancing your overall exercise experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6fb4caab-7845-42ac-985e-43ff0ce171f1', 'fb24e077-1a0b-4c63-ba06-341f351c7d89', '【EMERGENCY STOP BRAKE】Ensure safety during workouts with an emergency stop brake feature.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('eceebc1a-9cdb-4152-93c5-aab88461408a', 'fb24e077-1a0b-4c63-ba06-341f351c7d89', '【DURABLE & STABLE CONSTRUCTION】Built to accommodate different users, this treadmill is designed for various users, providing stability and durability for your fitness routine.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('67ed252a-9716-4a44-aa11-7ab6f4d59385', 'fb24e077-1a0b-4c63-ba06-341f351c7d89', '【SPACIOUS RUNNING SURFACE】Enjoy a generous running area with dimensions of 49 L x 15.5W inches, offering ample space for comfortable walking or jogging');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c96e9fda-caca-4ccc-b49c-2c7d338e7551', '39279b5c-78cd-4c0a-9061-9348e8511f22', 'Mesh Nylon Strap and foam Handles');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5cba9236-0efd-43c3-a414-f134b8d3bd89', 'fb24e077-1a0b-4c63-ba06-341f351c7d89', '【CONVENIENT STORAGE & MOBILITY】Conveniently fold and unfold your treadmill with an easy folding mechanism and soft drop system. Effortlessly transport your treadmill within your home to accommodate your preferred workout space.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ec7aa521-2778-4c8f-8e3c-e5334b16723c', 'fb24e077-1a0b-4c63-ba06-341f351c7d89', '【HANDRAIL CONTROLS】Take control of your workout with handrail controls that allow you to adjust speed, start and stop the treadmill. The pause function lets you stop the belt while preserving your running data.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7005ab06-0bc9-458f-8f10-d97a741f3ea7', 'fb24e077-1a0b-4c63-ba06-341f351c7d89', '【DIVERSE WORKOUT PROGRAMS】Choose from 9 built-in workout programs designed to add variety and challenge to your fitness routine. The large LCD displays provide real-time information on time, distance, speed, calories burned, and pulse.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fa83c206-1a89-479b-9958-e7bd39bcb863', 'fb24e077-1a0b-4c63-ba06-341f351c7d89', '【SMARTPHONE/TABLET HOLDER】Stay connected and entertained during workouts with the convenient smartphone/tablet holder included, accommodating a variety of devices for a personalized and engaging exercise experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1e706b50-a2ea-4093-a0da-ae413843c2d2', 'fb24e077-1a0b-4c63-ba06-341f351c7d89', '【Sunny Health & Fitness Commitment】A top fitness brand for 20+ years, offers superior products and a dedication to excellence. Count on our committed customer service and enjoy peace of mind with a 3-year warranty on the structural frame.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('218ea853-b892-4df7-b17a-fd80337b445e', 'bf132c7c-5356-470f-b2eb-f5c214c6ec32', '2024 Upgraded Version of Under Desk Treadmill: The 3 -in -1 Under-desk treadmill is equipped with three exercise modes, including walking, jogging, and incline modes. Speed ranges from 0.6-3.8mph and a 3° incline to increase exercise intensity. The treadmill is compatible with KINOMAP and ZWIFT apps, allowing you to join running races with your family and friends through smart programs. It is the most suitable product for home and office exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b6e95c39-0667-4b31-8263-170afaecc73c', 'bf132c7c-5356-470f-b2eb-f5c214c6ec32', 'Anti-slip belt & shock absorption system: The five-layer running belt significantly improves the treadmill''s anti-slip and durable properties. The treadmill is equipped with a complete shock-absorbing system. Not only will our treadmill provide a stable running experience, but it also effectively protects your knees and ankles during exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d65b4476-0ab9-4e76-9c43-bc2487fbde21', 'bf132c7c-5356-470f-b2eb-f5c214c6ec32', 'Powerful & silent motor: The under-desk walking pad is equipped with a powerful 2.0HP motor with a maximum load of 220 pounds. With noise levels below 45 dBs, you don''t have to worry about disturbing others. Enjoy quiet and comfortable exercise sessions when walking or jogging with the under desk treadmill.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('244364c9-ff20-4178-af35-09492bc33cc4', 'bf132c7c-5356-470f-b2eb-f5c214c6ec32', 'Remote control & LED display: Equipped with an LED display for convenient tracking of exercise data in real-time (including speed, time, distance, and calories burned via a four-data rotating display). No need to manually switch when working out. You can also use the remote control to speed up/slow down/pause, and even mute with one click.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3aafd81d-62d0-40f5-8349-83b5d96f7156', 'bf132c7c-5356-470f-b2eb-f5c214c6ec32', 'Compact & portable treadmill: The dimensions of the walking pad are 45.6" x 19.3" x 4.45", making it easy to put under a sofa or bed. The weight is only 37.5 pounds, and with two front wheels, it is even easier to move and store. Arrives fully assembled and can be used directly after unboxing.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ae105453-9c53-4f45-a0f7-a5694cf981ad', '30ac736c-b6db-4e0b-b9a0-2180c298b16e', 'INNOVATIVE 2-IN-1 FOLDING TREADMILL -- Compared to ordinary treadmills, our 2-in-1 Superfit treadmill has 2 modes to meet your different sports needs. When the riser is folded, it can be used as a jogging machine at a speed of 0.6MPH-2.5MPH, when the handrail is raised, the running speed is 0.6MPH-7.5MPH, and the speed unit could be switched between mile and km in APP.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bf67c891-5e6d-42c2-a581-02b5efedf20c', '30ac736c-b6db-4e0b-b9a0-2180c298b16e', 'POWERFUL 2.25HP -- With a powerful and ultra-quiet 2.25HP motor, this Superfit treadmill allows you to walk or run without disturbing others, making it ideal for home and office use. With a sturdy and durable steel frame and multi-layer shield design, it''s shock-absorbing and noise-reducing, making your running quieter, safer and more comfortable.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a4307d42-af38-4f94-9333-f91faf8b2e80', '30ac736c-b6db-4e0b-b9a0-2180c298b16e', 'NON-SLIP RUNNING BELT & MULTIFUNCTIONAL LED DISPLAY -- The 5-layer non-slip texture running belt features a spacious running area(39.3" x16"), providing an effective and safe cushion for your knees and muscles for a superior running experience. The LED display clearly shows time, speed, distance and calories, monitoring your progress in real time and keeping your movement data at a glance.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('764fab55-8f08-49d1-8f01-5f153b08830f', '30ac736c-b6db-4e0b-b9a0-2180c298b16e', 'WITH BLUETOOTH SPEAKER, PHONE HOLDER, REMOTE CONTROL & APP CONTROL -- Connect the Superfit treadmill to your phone through Bluetooth, so you can play music while you are exercising. You can also use the phone holder to watch videos or chat with friends. The remote control (BATTERY NOT INCLUDED) is convenient to adjust the speed of movement and stop instantly. Smart APP control is perfect to record exercise data and running with other users.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ff91f9dd-f062-41da-9d57-123bf02bbabd', '30ac736c-b6db-4e0b-b9a0-2180c298b16e', 'EASY TO MOVE AND STORE -- The compact, foldable design and built-in transport wheels make it easy to move and store this under desk treadmill to save space. And it''s out of the box and doesn''t need to be installed.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b0ab8551-2d44-4382-8448-1662427e8c0b', 'cc4486b1-1ede-43b0-9493-f03f30cc07de', '🏃【Powerful 2.5HP Quiet Motor】This walking pad is equipped with a powerful 2.5HP silent motor, keeping the noise level below 45dB. This under desk treadmill can support up to 300 lbs, and you can exercise anytime, anywhere at home or in the office without disturbing others when using this treadmill.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d8ebe131-ec33-40e8-ade2-cfcf416cf0f7', 'cc4486b1-1ede-43b0-9493-f03f30cc07de', '🏃【LED Display and Remote Control】The portable treadmill''s large LED display screen provides real-time feedback on metrics such as calories, and the speed can be easily adjusted for different exercises with the super-convenient remote control.This dual combination and stylish appearance allow you to enjoy high-quality exercise while working and relaxing.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7a77611c-1e90-4318-992f-c8603a8651f5', 'cc4486b1-1ede-43b0-9493-f03f30cc07de', '🏃【Compact & Portable Treadmill】GORISE walking pad treadmill has a compact design, with an upgraded running belt, the body size is 19*45*4.7 inches, and the weight is only 37 pounds. The slim and lightweight design of this mini treadmill can be easily placed in the closet, under the sofa, under the bed, and under the standing desk, you can work and walk at the same time while using this home treadmill.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ca333b86-94bf-48cd-9a3d-949822ee932f', 'cc4486b1-1ede-43b0-9493-f03f30cc07de', '🏃【5-Layers Running Belt & Shock Absorption Design】The walking treadmill features 5-layer non-slip and wear-resistant running belt and 2 rubber cushions to cushion your joints and muscles, provide excellent knee protection and improve overall comfort during exercise. In addition, the rubber running belt has an area of 40.55 inches x 15.35 inches, offering ample space to ensure more stable running and walking on this treadmill.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8580f2a8-683a-4d46-99f7-91ce93d4bf09', 'cc4486b1-1ede-43b0-9493-f03f30cc07de', '🏃【Portable Treadmill with APP Log Data】 The treadmill arrives fully assembled and ready to use straight out of the box and included Flexible wheels offer easy movement, making desk treadmill relocation effortless. Meanwhile APP offers fitness data tracking function for a personalised exercise. Intergrated with customized workout plan and dynamic data analysis, enjoy having a real coach at home and also offers a gym-quality experience in the comfort of home for perfect workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b8b5c6da-da6f-45f4-9459-f0f4b32885c0', '39279b5c-78cd-4c0a-9061-9348e8511f22', 'Imported');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d995aa4c-d8a9-41f5-aaf4-f3e3022ad182', 'cc4486b1-1ede-43b0-9493-f03f30cc07de', '🏃【Treadmills for Home Office】Upgraded walking pad, versatile, sleek, adaptable, and efficient; compact design fits any space, perfect for a quick workout at home or office.We also provide quality service, any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will reply within 24 hours with a satisfactory solution.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('26b69650-d3a8-488c-8309-042da2e16a31', 'e345c5d3-7362-42dc-b721-4dacdf2c30c4', 'COMPACT CARDIO FITNESS - Our Manual Treadmill is a compact exercise treadmill that provides an effective, efficient cardio workout. Tone your lower body muscle, plus support heart health and total functional strength with this fitness treadmill.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('512064eb-2df9-4a3e-ada2-23c18d0ed75f', 'e345c5d3-7362-42dc-b721-4dacdf2c30c4', 'SMOOTH AND STABLE MOTION - Simply walk at your desired pace for a smooth, consistent motion. This treadmill is equipped with dual weighted flywheels, a non-slip surface, and skid-resistant rubber floor protectors for maximized comfort and stability.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1df55142-bbc2-4fde-b875-c94f70d8cc75', 'e345c5d3-7362-42dc-b721-4dacdf2c30c4', 'TWO INCLINE POSITIONS - Our Manual Treadmill offers two incline positions for an adjustable workout intensity. Set the incline to either ten degrees or eight degrees for varied workout intensity.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cbc3c714-6191-4af5-9a2d-e4f8a2cf4824', 'e345c5d3-7362-42dc-b721-4dacdf2c30c4', 'PORTABLE TREADMILL FOR HOME - This treadmill is an affordable way to run or walk indoors. This lightweight, foldable treadmill can be used anywhere because it’s non-electric and equipped with built-in wheels for easy storage.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c5167ac7-3603-4c84-b3a6-2202fee019b6', 'e345c5d3-7362-42dc-b721-4dacdf2c30c4', 'SMART WORKOUT APP - Experience connected fitness with this home gym equipment with the müüv app. With smart guided coaching, exercise demo videos, personalized workouts, assembly videos, and more, müüv provides the best workout and fitness experience with your Stamina Inmotion Manual Treadmill.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3b00e523-95f0-4241-beef-020e24792ae5', '7cc71d7e-69aa-4a83-8597-2de945b16f0b', '【SPACIOUS 20-INCH RUNNING DECK】55 x 20-inch running space, offering ample room for a wide range of activities, ensuring a comfortable and accommodating workout experience for users of all sizes.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b5c71094-26e8-43d7-abb4-79954b6b400b', '7cc71d7e-69aa-4a83-8597-2de945b16f0b', '【15 INCLINE LEVELS & CONVENIENT CONTROLS】Enhance your fitness journey with 15 automatic incline levels on this treadmill, designed to elevate your training with ease. Quick-access buttons, effortlessly adjust the incline for a more intensity.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d267b4b7-908e-469d-9dfb-5bc5d1c546a4', '7cc71d7e-69aa-4a83-8597-2de945b16f0b', '【ADVANCED BRUSHLESS MOTOR TECHNOLOGY】Experience the efficiency of a brushless motor that delivers a faster, friction-free operation, ensuring a quieter and smoother run. This cutting-edge motor supports speeds ranging from 0.6 to 12 mph.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f7a09f91-ad70-430a-8d0a-d4aa707b37ef', '7cc71d7e-69aa-4a83-8597-2de945b16f0b', '【24 PERSONALIZED WORKOUT PROGRAMS】Accommodate up to three user profiles and store 24 tailor-made workout routines to match the unique fitness levels of each user. Progress from beginner to advanced levels, enhancing calorie burn with intensity.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6db6104a-2170-4d98-a612-87dae5e1515e', '7cc71d7e-69aa-4a83-8597-2de945b16f0b', '【CONNECTED FITNESS】Elevate workouts with the FREE SunnyFit app. Bluetooth sync offers 1,000+ trainer-led videos, 10,000+ tours, and diverse programs. Personalize training, track progress, and join community challenges on your treadmill.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('998f31ad-6c35-416c-ae1c-6b11a9826686', '7cc71d7e-69aa-4a83-8597-2de945b16f0b', '【ADVANCED DIGITAL MONITOR】This performance digital monitor features a large, backlit LED screen for effortless viewing of essential workout metrics, including heart rate time, distance, calories, speed, and steps. Enjoy real-time insights.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0b65d4aa-ef0b-412e-ba83-7674a026b382', '7cc71d7e-69aa-4a83-8597-2de945b16f0b', '【EASY SPEED SELECTION & PULSE SENSORS】Convenient quick-access buttons for instant speed adjustments to 3mph & 6mph, with a top speed of 12 mph to cater to both beginners & advanced runners. Treadmill includes pulse sensors for heart rate tracking.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('927b1a79-1404-4bfc-a550-0b38962119df', '7cc71d7e-69aa-4a83-8597-2de945b16f0b', '【ADVANCED DOUBLE DECK DESIGN & SHOCK ABSORPTION】Our treadmill features a cushioned double deck with integrated shock absorption, ensuring a low-impact, stable workout. Supports up to 300 LB, protecting joints for all fitness levels.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c3a2ea5f-4000-4e50-bff9-5f8a560838e0', '7cc71d7e-69aa-4a83-8597-2de945b16f0b', '【EASY SET-UP & FOLDABLE DESIGN】Assemble in just 20 minutes, featuring a soft hydraulic drop mechanism for safe, hands-free folding and unfolding. With built-in transport wheels, moving and storing this compact treadmill is a breeze.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('51b3f3d5-fef2-4ee5-8228-e93adfed8f2e', '7cc71d7e-69aa-4a83-8597-2de945b16f0b', '【OVER 20 YEARS OF EXCELLENCE】Sunny Health & Fitness delivers top-notch equipment dedicated to excellence. With our devoted support team and certified trainers, enjoy an unmatched FIT FOR EVERYONE experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bde72fb1-1165-4739-ad3a-7b429102d576', 'f18c67a5-cd84-465f-85cd-498f00ba224f', '【Treaflow Walking Pad】: Enhance your workout with the incline adjustment feature, which optimizes calorie burning and maximizes exercise efficiency. The 0-8% incline design facilitates increased fat burning and calorie consumption, allowing you to experience the benefits of climbing from the comfort of your home.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('efd73419-e378-4ed3-96e9-d7dcaa21fb88', 'f18c67a5-cd84-465f-85cd-498f00ba224f', '【Powerful Motor】: The under-desk walking pad with incline is equipped with a robust 2.5HP motor, supporting up to 265 lbs with superior stability and load-bearing capacity. The operating noise is less than 45 dB, ensuring minimal disruption to you and others.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('44125a5a-0108-4251-bc9e-32b1e11330dd', 'f18c67a5-cd84-465f-85cd-498f00ba224f', '【Multi-Functional Screen】: Our home treadmill is outfitted with a multi-functional screen that displays essential workout metrics, including speed, distance, time, and calories burned, providing comprehensive exercise tracking.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f6d9a58c-90ad-4970-9558-87f1687ee2a5', 'f18c67a5-cd84-465f-85cd-498f00ba224f', '【Remote Control】: The remote control offers omnidirectional functionality and an extensive range, allowing you to easily adjust settings during your workout without proximity constraints.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5be470eb-fcf8-45f7-8978-fd14640fc069', 'f18c67a5-cd84-465f-85cd-498f00ba224f', '【Shock Absorption Design】: The Treaflow Walking Pad features six shock absorbers on the base, ensuring a smooth and comfortable running experience while significantly reducing joint impact.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8fb150a4-2bf6-4315-873f-882fa80735fe', 'f18c67a5-cd84-465f-85cd-498f00ba224f', '【Easy to Set Up and Store】: Our portable treadmill is lightweight and includes two front wheels for easy mobility. It requires no installation as it comes pre-assembled. Its compact size allows for convenient storage, fitting easily under a sofa, bed, or against a wall.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('07b1e8e8-34a8-4866-b47e-9f42e54b4fcc', '1e9fdabd-ae9f-40cd-8dcf-a50217bf9efc', 'Treadmill dimensions – 50" L x 24" W x 49.2" H | Folded dimensions – 25.2” L x 24” W x 49.2” H | Weight – 60 lbs. | Maximum user weight – 220 lbs. | Tread Belt – 39.37” L x 15.74” W | Speed – 0.6 to 6.0 MPH | Inclination – 4 levels. Voltage : 120V.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5c6eef3d-a70a-4271-86ea-5052d3ccecd3', '1e9fdabd-ae9f-40cd-8dcf-a50217bf9efc', 'The compact treadmill for small spaces has LCD display with touch button controls. Displays run time, distance, speed, calories burned, heart rate with running data statistics readout and hand grip sensors for BPM pulse monitoring');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4b8c6624-3fcf-437f-abce-a3d3a7db1734', '1e9fdabd-ae9f-40cd-8dcf-a50217bf9efc', 'The SereneLife Smart Folding Treadmill with incline features a hassle-free electric motorized plug in design. This compact slim running machine is portable and has a convenient hydraulic folding style for easy setup and storage');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('888967b7-e9db-42ee-82d7-7d65de8f843c', '1e9fdabd-ae9f-40cd-8dcf-a50217bf9efc', 'Get connected with the ‘FitShow’ app on your device via Bluetooth. Allows you to record and review training data, display training stats and challenge friends, and share fitness data on social media. Works with Android, iPhone, tablet');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('333d08ca-27c3-4da3-a800-42ec2545dc57', '1e9fdabd-ae9f-40cd-8dcf-a50217bf9efc', 'Use the adjusters to manually set incline levels. Keeps you safe with integrated safety key emergency power off function. Features built-in book or magazine tray and cup holder. Used for walking, jogging, as home gym running equipment');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('78cb7412-f7dc-4fc5-981c-f4e43a2f460a', '7850ad71-acda-491a-a9ee-8c047b2ecdd8', '"INDUSTRY LEADER: For 30+ years, Best FItness by Body Solid has held the widest array of products designed to meet the demands of the ever-changing fitness industry (home gym, free weight machines, treadmills, bikes, ellipticals, weight plates, kettlebells, dumbbells, flooring, accessories and more). Our products are cutting edge and reliable and are built for Life……Your Life."');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c59ba4bf-441a-4dc1-aaa9-65b9ecb2f169', '7850ad71-acda-491a-a9ee-8c047b2ecdd8', '"ERGONOMICALLY DESIGNED: This ergonomically designed machine is built to help you tighten up your midsection, strengthen your back and improve your core stability. Its dual functionality lets you target your lower abs with knee raises and your upper abs with abdominal crunches."');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d8ad9cf0-3ded-4485-a7a3-c61851f5d49e', '7850ad71-acda-491a-a9ee-8c047b2ecdd8', '"45-DEGREE WORKOUT SEAT: This machine can provide total ab workout from a comfortable seated position. The 45-degree seat angle puts you in position to isolate your abdominal muscles, for a more efficient workout. Plus, with two additional 5-degree reclining positions, you''ll be ideally supported for an entire range of core exercises."');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('50434146-243b-4ace-9864-61cafc91713d', '7850ad71-acda-491a-a9ee-8c047b2ecdd8', '"ADJUSTABLE FOOT RESTS: The adjustable foot rests can be adjusted up to 13 different positions including 3 height adjustments and 10 slope level adjustments providing maximum comfort, stability and most importantly, target the right muscle groups for desired results. Plus, with the ergonomic handlebars and padded cushion, you''ll be able to get the most out of your session without sacrificing on comfort."');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a91efddc-6f84-4b38-a4b2-f3057c9a9462', '7850ad71-acda-491a-a9ee-8c047b2ecdd8', '"DIMENSIONS: This ab machine is perfect for those just starting out their core-training journey or for more experienced athletes, as the adjustable tension knob can be easily adjusted to match your preferred challenge level. The measures 22 x 46 x 64 inches and carries a three-year warrantty on the frame and 1 year on ALL parts."');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3327bcc2-07f7-4a9d-aabe-c284d7cdf6b3', '713075a0-930a-4d3c-a039-fa754a4ec9b4', 'Adjustable - Both Olympic Bench and Squat Rack are adjustable. Bench can be easily adjustable to incline, flat and decline chest press positions, while the rack can be adjusted to different heights');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('78c800cd-9aaf-4203-ac2b-765fea728556', '713075a0-930a-4d3c-a039-fa754a4ec9b4', 'Two-piece Design - The Olympic Bench and Squat Rack can be used together or separately or even moved out of the way, allowing you to perform squats and other exercises without obstruction');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1e8650ae-41f1-481d-a727-deea9780024c', '713075a0-930a-4d3c-a039-fa754a4ec9b4', 'Heavy Duty - Made from high quality steel, designed to support a maximum user weight of 400 lbs. and a maximum total weight of 800 lbs. Adjustable spotting arms prevent unnecessary injury while working out');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6a0aa04b-beab-4cdf-97ff-c7b241d33480', '713075a0-930a-4d3c-a039-fa754a4ec9b4', 'Additional Features - This set comes with a Preacher Curl pad and arm handle that allow you to isolate your arm movement for proper form. Leg developer is designed to target hamstrings, quadriceps and flute muscles. Weight plates holders let you store you');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f013f0cb-af4a-4f5f-a8b9-d4a19ce51687', '713075a0-930a-4d3c-a039-fa754a4ec9b4', 'Dimensions - 73" L x 46 W x (50"-65") H (Squat Rack adjustable from 50" to 65"). Product Weight: 90 Pounds (Full Station), 52 Pounds (Bench Only), 38 Pounds (Rack Only)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6bf6b0c8-d994-4a3b-aa9e-99bf27648fd2', 'b182c602-9717-4b15-8ba4-06179c38e301', 'HEAVY-DUTY CONSTRUCTION – The MD-389 is made of 14-gauge tubular steel that’s reinforced with a powdered coating; guaranteed to withstand intense use. It utilizes high-density foam for cushioning, providing you with comfortable and high-functioning gear.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8ede057a-f367-4ec3-ade8-bde894b696fe', 'b182c602-9717-4b15-8ba4-06179c38e301', 'MULTI-POSITION BACK PAD – Designed with an adjustable back pad, the four-position backrest acts as a soft cushion that supports your back during exercise sessions. It helps minimize fatigue to keep you comfortable while performing intense workout regimens');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('adf561a4-8f49-4bcd-8c99-e4e1280f2c85', 'b182c602-9717-4b15-8ba4-06179c38e301', 'DUAL-ACTION LEG DEVELOPER –This bench features a dual-functioning leg developer with comfortable roller pads. The leg developer comes with a pivot point that facilitates proper body position during workouts for maximum result on the targeted muscle groups');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6e43eafa-0a64-4f13-97cb-161cf3aa1a76', 'b182c602-9717-4b15-8ba4-06179c38e301', 'FREE-WEIGHT RACK – Engage in intense weightlifting or strength-training right in the comforts of your home with the Marcy Weight Bench. It includes a weight rack that fits standard-sized barbells and weight plates for easy accessibility and convenience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3c846a2e-7201-472f-86c2-44d267e4f507', 'b182c602-9717-4b15-8ba4-06179c38e301', 'FULL-BODY WORKOUT STATION –This complete exercise equipment features an innovative structure that combines arm and leg stations, great for strengthening various muscle groups and executing complete workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('32c8ac60-ef77-4066-a3b3-01dbc58eadc5', '199ca7c0-5588-467e-bad1-758ace74327c', 'Ideal multifunctional workout station for diverse strength training exercises, foldable design simplifies storage in home gyms accompanied by side barbell storage for organization');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('64b832ef-02d7-4b7f-ab0e-565d3e6f7ae6', '199ca7c0-5588-467e-bad1-758ace74327c', 'Enjoy comfy padded adjustable bench that adjusts flat or inclined for various exercises; Exercise bench and squat rack work for chest presses, squats, and more, alone or combined');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('21f3f9ca-d87b-453d-86f6-d9590b0eced9', '199ca7c0-5588-467e-bad1-758ace74327c', 'Barbel rack height can be adjusted in 6 positions while recliner position and seat cushion can be adjusted with 6 and 4 positions; Lockable for safety purposes');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a26df230-37e4-4bfa-84e1-5afd9dd02f29', '199ca7c0-5588-467e-bad1-758ace74327c', 'Includes thick square iron pipe construction, anti-slip rubber feet allowing quality reps without sliding and leg developer to isolate hamstrings, quadriceps, and other leg muscles');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('35d6ea7a-3c5b-4cc4-9873-11789fbdf1dd', '199ca7c0-5588-467e-bad1-758ace74327c', 'Versatile bench station with wide design for unrestricted lifting and features sturdy steel structure; Workout bench measures 40 inches long, 12 inches wide, and 40 inches tall and weighs 35 pounds');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e227bb16-aec4-4cfa-b87e-1408fe298c04', '2253b888-5922-4172-b324-231bdf563a4e', 'PREMIUM STEEL CONSTRUCTION: Made of heavy-duty steel tubing reinforced with powder coating, this bench’s structure won’t collapse under your weight. Its stabilized design, foam-roller pads, back pad, and rolled upholstery provide optimum support.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('953432f5-de50-4c43-b107-135876054d9d', '2253b888-5922-4172-b324-231bdf563a4e', 'MULTI-POSITION BACKREST: Designed with an adjustable backrest pad, this gear allows you to arrange it as you choose, laying it in an inclined, declined, or flat position. The backrest supports the back during workouts to help minimize fatigue.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b7621dd4-f826-4e22-91fd-a61e161a5a53', '2253b888-5922-4172-b324-231bdf563a4e', 'FREE-WEIGHT SET: This innovative equipment includes a complete weight set: a standard-size weight bar, two 25 lbs weight plates, two 15 lbs plates, two 10 lbs plates, and two clips. Each plate is vinyl-coated to prevent damage to the floor.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2f819e51-5ccb-4815-a46f-34f99c03ca60', '2253b888-5922-4172-b324-231bdf563a4e', 'HIGH-DENSITY UPHOLSTERY: This gear has soft foam-roller pads to facilitate safe and comfortable training. Its ergonomic design allows for an enjoyable strength-training experience, so you can push yourself as hard as you can while minimizing fatigue.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1dd5241c-3ba8-43fc-ad68-bcdb2f46febd', '2253b888-5922-4172-b324-231bdf563a4e', 'FULL-BODY WORKOUT STATION: This utility bench can help you target multiple muscle groups. It lets you perform various exercises to develop your arms, legs, chest, and core. Pair it with dumbbells to start training to a fitter body.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('87521361-8cbf-403c-ab16-925e8aa8b69b', 'df871de4-1955-4888-98bb-d831480fc20e', 'SOLID STEEL CONSTRUCTION: Constructed of heavy gauge steel and covered with a black paint coating finish, Yes4All Viking Landmine Handle Attachment stands for years without corrosion or breaking apart during your heavy workouts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('593754c2-3767-4121-98fb-33d4da4a4641', 'df871de4-1955-4888-98bb-d831480fc20e', '3 ERGONOMIC GRIP POSITIONS: The multi grip handle attachment with 1 7/8 inches diameter is equipped with 3 different grip positions to increase versatility and target specific muscle groups during your landmine workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('efc30da1-f062-4679-88bc-b46878b5012f', 'df871de4-1955-4888-98bb-d831480fc20e', 'FIT 2 INCHES OLYMPIC BARBELL: Designed with 7 inches long tube, Yes4All Landmine Attachment is compatible with 2 inches Olympic barbell; Simply slide your barbell over the Handle and then tighten the knob for a secure workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('33fd2962-13cf-4a3c-9abe-ed95ee8f1099', 'df871de4-1955-4888-98bb-d831480fc20e', '15 INCHES SPACE BETWEEN HANDLES: Unlike other products with a narrow gap between handles, our Viking Press Landmine Handle Attachment is designed with 15 inches gap to create more space for your head not to get smacked during Incline Presses');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('03d537a5-b6d7-4406-b3ad-00a2f715a719', 'df871de4-1955-4888-98bb-d831480fc20e', 'SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: Place your order and enjoy a 30-day Return policy and 1-year Warranty. Please note that barbells, weight plates, and landmine insert/T-bar row insert are NOT included.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('801f4622-fe10-4f11-9f48-90462d3e5b16', '076a0d26-582a-4332-90f1-bfdab72f61b8', 'HOME GYM EQUIPMENT: TRX’s All-in-One Suspension Trainer System has revolutionized personal fitness. It’s designed for full-body training workouts anywhere, anytime, using only your bodyweight. The kit includes the All-in-One Suspension Trainer, Indoor/Outdoor Anchors, and a Mesh Travel Bag.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('24b00f8d-2460-44f9-9bfd-fe09e1e4c89c', '076a0d26-582a-4332-90f1-bfdab72f61b8', 'BEYOND GYM STRAPS: This TRX home workout system will allow you to achieve the results you want. You will build muscle, burn fat, strengthen your core, increase cardio endurance, and improve flexibility efficiently to transform the way you look, feel, and think.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('965e6a3a-81e9-4edb-b6e1-a780759037f3', '076a0d26-582a-4332-90f1-bfdab72f61b8', 'WORKOUT ANYWHERE: TRX easily anchors to doors, rafters, or beams at home—as well as to trees, poles, or posts. Take the TRX All-in-One Suspension Training System to the beach, park, hotel, mountain, or anywhere you love to work out.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('22372a2f-ec2c-4b47-a316-d781b2c54f74', '076a0d26-582a-4332-90f1-bfdab72f61b8', 'SAFETY TESTED: TRX is safety tested to support weight up to 700 lbs. TRX has been used for over 10 years by the US Military, Pro Sports teams, and world-class athletes worldwide and comes with our full TRX two-year Superior Quality Warranty.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a2fbe511-a4d3-4567-8705-af52e134e92f', '076a0d26-582a-4332-90f1-bfdab72f61b8', 'YOUR TRIAL TO THE TRX TRAINING CLUB APP: Experience unlimited access to 500+ on-demand workouts: weight training, cardio, cross-training, sport athleticism, resistance and mobility training, and prehab and rehab. Find 100s of workouts for every goal! All workouts are guided by world-class certified TRX trainers.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b4d5ac98-bb9b-4cd3-9073-57439d39baf4', '076a0d26-582a-4332-90f1-bfdab72f61b8', 'NOTE: You no longer need a Key To Free Card to access our TRX Training Club App. You can download the app and access your free trial.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2d1b61cd-d5e1-4856-bb62-e8f0d5a8c930', 'c7714a59-9911-402a-8e2b-5e448e60c40e', 'WORK MORE MUSCLES IN LESS TIME. Build with low-impact workouts that engage more than 86% of your muscles in under 20 (yes, 20!) minutes.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d9c76e5e-01ad-41d5-a87e-1fc6f3e09dad', 'c7714a59-9911-402a-8e2b-5e448e60c40e', 'GET A MEMBERSHIP, THEN GET STARTED. For just $44/month, unlock over 5,000 at-home workouts for all fitness levels. Explore a range of workout styles, including cardio, strength, recovery, and more — all led by world-class instructors in stunning locations around the world. (NOTE: Memberships are sold separately from Hydrow rowing machines.)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ce319789-aa8d-4a2b-a7aa-ab590dbf6a77', 'c7714a59-9911-402a-8e2b-5e448e60c40e', 'ESCAPE INTO IMMERSIVE WORKOUTS. Featuring a crystal-clear 22” HD rotating touchscreen display with front-facing speakers, rowing on the Hydrow Pro rower is sure to take you places. Even better – the rower itself is designed to make indoor rowing feel like on-the-water rowing, thanks to our proprietary electromagnetic drag technology. Features include padded seat, adjustable foot straps, and a low-stress grip handle.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bc8220eb-4d84-449f-8d58-6b8387f4e108', 'c7714a59-9911-402a-8e2b-5e448e60c40e', 'FITS RIGHT IN AT HOME. This foldable rowing machine can be stored upright using our Upright Storage Kit (sold separately). Dimensions: 86” L x 25” W x 47” H; Weight: 145 lbs; Weight limit up to 375 pounds.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('50ed32e4-5db8-4050-8d56-0098fff187ea', 'c7714a59-9911-402a-8e2b-5e448e60c40e', 'CONNECT WITH YOUR GO-TO DEVICES. The Hydrow Pro at-home rower is compatible with bluetooth-based fitness devices like Apple Watch, heart-rate monitors, and wireless headphones.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('159e0723-300e-44ad-a633-a588900aef0e', '0fafb065-9f57-475f-9f12-efbe32101fbd', 'INDEPENDENT STRENGTH ARMS: This chest press machine is equipped with 2 independent converging arms and 2 safety brackets with 4 height levels, which allows you to freely adjust the arm movements during exercise, achieving higher flexibility and better muscle training effects');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('603a1ddc-0f16-4854-a7b7-3d34d5c38345', '0fafb065-9f57-475f-9f12-efbe32101fbd', 'GREAT UPPER BODY WORKOUT: This bench press machine is designed for upper body exercise, which can effectively strengthen the chest, shoulders and triceps. It''s suitable for a variety of training methods such as bench press and shoulder press, helping you to comprehensively improve the upper body muscle strength');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fe3abd73-3f5e-455d-aded-b6836e2e15a5', '0fafb065-9f57-475f-9f12-efbe32101fbd', 'HEAVY-DUTY STEEL STRUCTURE: This bench press equipment is made of high-quality steel, which is tough and stable. Each arm can withstand a maximum of 200 pounds, each bracket 200 pounds, and a bench capacity of 450 pounds. It meets the needs of users of different weights and allows you to safely perform various intensities of exercise (No weight plates in the package)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7e183135-bea5-456c-b03f-1b10f3ab769f', '0fafb065-9f57-475f-9f12-efbe32101fbd', 'SMOOTH & SILENT BEARINGS: Adopting high-quality bearings, the arms are silky smooth and almost noiseless during rotation, so you don’t have to worry about disturbing your family or neighbors when exercising at home. Enjoy a quiet exercise environment');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a29a324e-2b81-4c82-8db0-c704519b43d3', '0fafb065-9f57-475f-9f12-efbe32101fbd', 'FLEXIBLE FLAT BENCH: Equipped with a completely independent flat bench, this chest press machine allows you to flexibly adjust the position and use method of the bench, enriching your exercise options. It can also be flexibly stored after exercise to save your space');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6dcc9dfb-2245-4b45-8cce-ba8464362366', 'e487d966-b421-4f89-b549-10f3d0e9376b', '【VERSATILE STRENGTH TRAINING】Achieve full-body fitness with bench presses, squats, shoulder presses, incline bench presses, dumbbell rows, bicep curls, and deadlifts, targeting multiple muscle groups for comprehensive strength and endurance.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4479bfa5-63a2-4c7d-aecb-535923945154', 'e487d966-b421-4f89-b549-10f3d0e9376b', '【SPACE-SAVING】Maximize your workout area with our space-saving design, offering the same versatile features as a full rack. Save space without compromising on functionality, making it ideal for home gyms and limited workout spaces.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a2ab2a03-0076-41a3-b1f5-12c098e17358', 'e487d966-b421-4f89-b549-10f3d0e9376b', '【ROBUST STEEL FRAME】Experience unparalleled stability and durability with our seamless, one-piece steel construction. The steady steel frame ensures reliable support during intense workouts, enhancing your safety and confidence in every exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cd1f2dd4-06cd-4b2c-a70e-647a95d12d41', 'e487d966-b421-4f89-b549-10f3d0e9376b', '【HEIGHT ADJUSTMENT】Easily customize your workout experience by adjusting the height to accommodate exercises. This flexibility ensures optimal positioning, allowing you to perform exercises with precision and comfort.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('13042137-88be-42a4-b01f-85db8369509f', '98596a57-b6af-4355-bfcd-bc83b3b0f589', 'Ideal for full body conditioning and developing functional strength');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c0b51278-8945-4457-a1eb-250c31680676', 'e487d966-b421-4f89-b549-10f3d0e9376b', '【ENHANCED SAFETY AND SUPPORT】Our spotter arms provide top-to-bottom protection, offering a secure safety net during exercises, from the bench press to deadlifts. Push your limits with confidence, you have reliable backup to catch the weight.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6f9708eb-13b3-49ca-a1bb-69a882fcdefb', 'e487d966-b421-4f89-b549-10f3d0e9376b', '【WEIGHT STORAGE】Stay clutter-free and focused on your workout with our integrated weight holder rack. Safely store your weights within arm''s reach, ensuring quick and convenient access.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('27c6b1b3-772e-46ee-9f91-1f3c2be51676', 'e487d966-b421-4f89-b549-10f3d0e9376b', '【600 LB WEIGHT CAPACITY】With a maximum weight limit of 600 LB (275 KG), our equipment ensures robust durability and stability, accommodating users of varying fitness levels. This allows for challenging workouts and supports heavy lifting.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0063e798-eb7f-4461-9179-3777879bd85e', 'e487d966-b421-4f89-b549-10f3d0e9376b', '【EFFORTLESS ASSEMBLY】Experience hassle-free setup with our user-friendly design. Easy assembly means you can quickly enjoy your new fitness equipment, saving time and energy while ensuring a smooth start to your workout routine.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1587029b-723b-4bd8-b8a0-35fe4e3f9231', 'e487d966-b421-4f89-b549-10f3d0e9376b', '【USER-FRIENDLY ADJUSTMENTS】The rack features easy-to-use level hole indicators, simplifying bar adjustments and spotter arm positioning. Making it quick and straightforward to customize your exercises for an efficient training session.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3c16efcb-9207-48a6-8475-cd5b0f52bad1', 'e487d966-b421-4f89-b549-10f3d0e9376b', '【Sunny Health & Fitness Commitment】A top fitness brand for 20+ years, offers superior products and a dedication to excellence. Count on our committed customer service and enjoy peace of mind with a 1-year warranty on the structural frame.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9050f13c-9eb6-4337-b10e-e8391b8ed143', '3387ab96-2134-4891-9d54-29ce317408d6', 'HEAVY DUTY- Constructed with 2” x 2” steel frame with high-density, dual-layered pad measuring 44” x 9. 5” x 2”. U-shaped base ensures strength and durability throughout frame while ankle pads provide safety to user during ab crunch function.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a2254e10-4f2b-486e-8a57-3dbfb503c45a', '3387ab96-2134-4891-9d54-29ce317408d6', 'CONVERGING ARMS- Each arm operates independently of each other, allowing user to place variable weight levels on each arm if needed or simply to strengthen one side at a time. Arms converge to the middle to effectively target chest muscles. 1” plate pegs.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6d5d5b3a-673c-4390-b752-79d0fc97e7a1', '3387ab96-2134-4891-9d54-29ce317408d6', 'ADJUSTABLE- Safety catch with protective rubber strip has 9 adjustment positions for an 8” range. Adjusted with locking pin for safety. Ankle pads can be adjusted between 2 different positions.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('008f65bd-7132-4a63-8802-bd108a000334', '3387ab96-2134-4891-9d54-29ce317408d6', 'VERSATILE- Can be used as a flat bench press, incline bench press, or ab crunch board. Folding base to perform incline bench press and ab crunches. Ankle padding beneath the head of the bench supports knees and ankles and allows ab crunch function.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e2dcba86-653e-4351-8799-f097c93d4cff', '3387ab96-2134-4891-9d54-29ce317408d6', 'ADDITIONAL- Max weight load 125 lb per arm, 250 lb total. Also includes 2 plate storage pegs, each measuring 8” long and 1” in diameter, allows a clean and organized home gym. Meant for home and light-commercial use.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ca84e7e8-4cbc-4234-a2ac-cedf2214b9b3', 'd31b6098-7aba-40f4-830b-a049c301662e', 'EASY TO INSTALL: Our plastic expansion anchors make it easy to install on any type of wall, including wooden, plaster, and concrete walls.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d2cc9c6e-7aa3-4e68-a23d-a79199dd36bf', 'd31b6098-7aba-40f4-830b-a049c301662e', 'INNOVATIVE G-SHAPE DESIGN: Quickly and easily change resistance band anchor during your workout with our unique G-shape design. No more struggling to keep your bands in place!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f51f45a4-1d0b-47d9-b033-4f19870dcfd9', 'd31b6098-7aba-40f4-830b-a049c301662e', 'VERSATILE AND EASY TO INSTALL: Our wall anchors come with three hooks on plates, screws, washers, and plastic anchors for easy installation on any wall. Suitable for different kinds of walls and suitable for any home gym.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('15a2c640-6cc9-4d42-ba62-34f2faf1e476', 'd31b6098-7aba-40f4-830b-a049c301662e', 'QUALITY MATERIALS: Made of advanced stainless steel with a layer of black coating gloss finish to protect it from rust and corrosion, our exercise bands with handles are built to last. You can rely on it for all your home gym needs.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c744acfd-6a21-4062-8271-ca21d5318a7b', 'd31b6098-7aba-40f4-830b-a049c301662e', 'HIGH WEIGHT CAPACITY: Yes4All solid wall anchors for resistance bands can bear up to 300 pounds, along with three anchor arms to be hung at three height levels, meeting the needs of body plastic training for many body parts such as legs, arms, abs, chest, shoulders, back. Get the most out of your workout with our high-quality resistance band anchors.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('84d95c4f-ec41-4ef4-bdb3-624093e34aec', 'd86281a0-1912-46e1-b45f-dda017f8930d', 'Easy to Carry: This battle ropes simulates the traditional rope swinging training mode, gets rid of the bulky size of the rope swinging, and is more portable and storageable. The portable design of battle ropes for home gym allows you to exercise in any occasion');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cb59916a-6cea-46e9-8a06-6ad4dae5839c', 'd86281a0-1912-46e1-b45f-dda017f8930d', 'Durable & Wear-resistant: Our cordless battle rope is made of high-quality steel and equipped with an anti-wear protective cover. Its compact design can prevent deformation. Compared with traditional battle ropes, it is more durable and you don''t have to worry about breaking');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('da5bdc68-3ca3-4335-9035-6229a43f720b', 'd86281a0-1912-46e1-b45f-dda017f8930d', 'User-friendly Design: This workout ropes features a spiral-textured, non-slip handle that ensures a secure grip for optimal performance. It also includes a hanging rope for easy carrying. The middle protective cover safeguards the rope from damage');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('53f07312-e540-416d-a4f9-5668146ada1d', 'd86281a0-1912-46e1-b45f-dda017f8930d', 'Easy to Use: Our heavy rope does not require installation, you can exercise anytime and anywhere, no complicated installation and fixation like traditional battle ropes. It is an ideal choice for fitness enthusiasts to exercise at home and outdoor activities!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('67a13274-1408-4761-bb81-7c3976aad45d', 'd86281a0-1912-46e1-b45f-dda017f8930d', 'Suitable for All Fitness Levels: Exercise ropes are easy to use and carry, and can be safely used by men and women of all levels. Whether you are a fitness novice or a professional fitness enthusiast, whether you like to exercise in the gym or exercise at home, this battle rope is your best choice!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f2f302d5-1578-4276-b815-9e6e3ac70be3', '2f199df5-77c9-4dbc-87e0-61e08ebfaefe', 'PREMIUM QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: Yes4All Battle Rope is made of 100% poly dacron material with protective nylon sleeves to prevent friction damage, fraying as well as keeping it clean, making the rope extremely durable');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('936f1ddb-d271-4ad6-92f3-2f2a8b12bbb2', '2f199df5-77c9-4dbc-87e0-61e08ebfaefe', 'ANCHOR AND STRAP INCLUDED: Comes with an anchor and a strap to offer another way to train, easy and quick to install, these can be valuable tools to help further prevent damage to your rope as well as providing more safety and variety to your routine');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('60f91fe8-8ec8-4628-8dc0-954d0b8b40c3', '2f199df5-77c9-4dbc-87e0-61e08ebfaefe', 'VERSATILE OPTIONS: This option of Yes4All Battle Rope with Cover measures 1. 5” in diameter, 30ft in length and 16lbs in weight, great for more intense training and intermediate, higher level users');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('703acd5e-1d4e-4483-9ffa-ba99652126e1', '2f199df5-77c9-4dbc-87e0-61e08ebfaefe', '10” EXTRA LONG HANDLES: Features 10” extra-long handles made from heat shrink material, providing great protection for your hands and a more secure, firm non-slip grip during intense exercises');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('205e14dc-4516-4dc8-ae23-51003b9400f1', '2f199df5-77c9-4dbc-87e0-61e08ebfaefe', 'ANYTIME, ANYWHERE: Our battle rope is quick and easy to store as well as set up even with the included equipment, saving you time and energy later to maximize the effectiveness of your training. Provides great workouts for boxers, swimmers, martial artists, and players of baseball, basketball, tennis, MMA,... Best gift for Holiday: Fathers Day gifts, American Independence Day,....');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7b871442-aeef-480a-8033-8f4374dc0952', '98596a57-b6af-4355-bfcd-bc83b3b0f589', 'Smooth vinyl coating provides protection for wrists and palms');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b3351934-0806-4c6e-9db6-978afec8e310', 'ce5c8008-d000-4099-975e-1efa8d0703cf', '【High Quality Material】 Battle ropes is made of 100% Poly Dac, heavier than Polypropylene and Polyester. 9m battle ropes is approximately 7.7 kg. PROIRON Battle rope is odorless and environmental-friendly, perfect for both home gym or outdoor workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a2090096-0415-401e-bb6e-4e8189e8d73d', 'ce5c8008-d000-4099-975e-1efa8d0703cf', '【Durable and wear resistant】 Fitness Rope has 38mm Diameter and 3-STRAND TWISTED DESIGN. Battling rope won’t fray or leave fibers on the floor, high tensile strength. Ropes for fitness come with 40cm nylon sleeves covered to protect the rope from friction, much more durable');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d9d86fa2-ca07-451a-9388-4da439eeb21d', 'ce5c8008-d000-4099-975e-1efa8d0703cf', '【Two Size Slections: 9m & 12m】 The shorter gym training ropes 9m is suitable for those new at rope training, while the longer exercise training rope 12m is suitable for challenging rope workout');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('87a1a29b-9af1-4aef-9eda-66a8de5de5b0', 'ce5c8008-d000-4099-975e-1efa8d0703cf', '【Heat Shrink Handles】 Each end of battling rope is sealed with a heat shrink, help to keep its shape, protect your hands and offer you firm grip and better sports training experience');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fb35056b-8de3-44ea-88cc-a7762713d569', 'ce5c8008-d000-4099-975e-1efa8d0703cf', '【Versatile】 Battling rope can be used for strengthening workout, cardio exercise, coordinating and shaping arms/ abdominal / shoulders/ legs/ core muscles. PROIRON battle ropes is widely applicable for crossfit, fitness training, athlete, boxer and sport-lover');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7d250467-937a-4b3b-9ff4-ff4842eca7e5', '58921017-27c4-48aa-abca-7859d4ca1691', 'The ultimate strength and conditioning tools! Battle rope are often thought of as a tool for your upper body, which they are. However, their benefits don''t end there. It workouts work the muscles in your abs, back, and glutes, and you can incorporate movements, such as jumps, lunges, and squats, that work your legs.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('844e2d34-f4cd-4e86-85a3-cd5d61e2f4e3', '58921017-27c4-48aa-abca-7859d4ca1691', 'Durable - Super Deal UPGRADED three-strand-thick exercise rope features a durable polyester blend with high tensile strength to prevent breakage. It can be used indoors or out, and it offers reliable, long-lasting performance, so you can keep the focus on your workout. Plus, the black color makes dirt less visible and keeps your rope looking new longer.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c918841e-8f27-475b-a43d-3314160f90b6', '58921017-27c4-48aa-abca-7859d4ca1691', 'Portable - The rope’s flexible design makes it easy to roll up and take almost anywhere—from home to the gym, park, or beach and back again. All that’s needed is a stable anchor, like a tree or a pole, and it’s ready to go. It can also be rolled up and stored out of the way when not in use.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c5ce9ad6-741b-4b79-a8c8-7249fad32960', '58921017-27c4-48aa-abca-7859d4ca1691', 'Versatile - We have the full size on the market for you to choose from. With 3 different lengths and 2 thicknesses, we''ve got you covered. A 1.5" diameter is good for general fitness, while 2” is for those who want a very tough grip workout. Shorter ropes are great for beginners or home gyms, while 50'' is the most common length for box gym.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('847219af-5d9d-4cdd-8846-39b4212e4583', '58921017-27c4-48aa-abca-7859d4ca1691', 'WARRANTY: If your rope breaks during normal use as a battle rope, we''ll replace it. Grab one today and ride the waves right now!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2ab0df6e-df53-415e-ba5a-fd458f8d83ba', '20e453f0-1be4-4da4-aab8-800e04d2885f', 'Purpose - Add to your fitness equipment collection with this Battle Rope Anchor, which is designed as an accessory to the Elite Series Power Cage. This will help diversify your workout regimen and can save space in your home gym.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('46ea637e-d12b-483e-83e2-7e6e547796d8', '20e453f0-1be4-4da4-aab8-800e04d2885f', 'Increase your cardio and use resistance training to strengthen tendons as a supplement to strength training. Use only on 3” x 3” upright poles.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('da0a2473-dddc-4c85-b6d6-b270be065c2a', '20e453f0-1be4-4da4-aab8-800e04d2885f', 'Materials - Casted in steel and painted black with a low gloss, powder coat finish.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5f53aad0-dd80-4d25-add8-a5c4541beb2d', '20e453f0-1be4-4da4-aab8-800e04d2885f', 'What’s Inside - (1) Battle Rope Anchor Attachment, (2) bolts/screws, (2) hex head nuts, and (4) washers. Hardware and Instructions are included.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a02267d6-8099-4bd0-b641-e13bb65d984c', '20e453f0-1be4-4da4-aab8-800e04d2885f', 'Product Specifications - Anchor Attachment measures 11.4” x 1.9” x 4.25”. Bolt/screws measure 4.25” (L). Bolt/screw/nut head measures .75”. Total product weight of 3.1 pounds. Requires size 19 or .75” closed and or open socket wrench.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('569cd3f0-905c-4c4e-9740-34ce0b045b0e', '35d47123-82fd-4a2d-9521-a3ca0e8826a9', 'Smooth and Fast: the ball bearing system avoids the twisting, winding or bending like other fitness jump ropes, it ensures stable and relaxed rotation, as our jump rope can bear heavy load, which brings your a perfect exercise of jump rope, also provides the best fluency for elite fitness professionals.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('8eec5bfd-443a-49c9-8d82-b123db0f4fcb', '35d47123-82fd-4a2d-9521-a3ca0e8826a9', 'Sports Fitness: our exercise jump rope can shape your cardio endurance, stamina and speed, while improving the muscle tension of your whole body. A great choice for boxing, MMA and cross training.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('43989c4b-eebb-4f97-9246-550905cd2ec3', '35d47123-82fd-4a2d-9521-a3ca0e8826a9', 'PVC Embedded Wire Rope: the braided steel wire rope is coated with PVC, which features durable and smooth, ensures the maximum service life and avoids cracking or breaking.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bc5f76e0-b645-4495-8585-4977d62045a4', '35d47123-82fd-4a2d-9521-a3ca0e8826a9', 'Maximum Comfort: the gym jump rope constructed with light weight ergonomic handles coated with 6 inch soft EVA memory foam grips for extra comfortable and strong grip, so that you can You can take full advantage for doing exercise.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('380200fc-0a6e-4318-9004-7b568a1a4c33', '35d47123-82fd-4a2d-9521-a3ca0e8826a9', 'Adjustable Length: design with 9 feet long of the rope, it can be adjusted quickly according to your height. Suitable for adults and children.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('44ca9cc7-c4ef-43e9-b8ae-54318258ac78', 'cf45686d-d532-441e-b867-d062a9483b26', 'SPECS: Dimensions are 50” L x 29” W x 14” H; Loadable sleeve length is 9.5 inches; Total assembled weight is 28lb; Suggested Max Weight Capacity 500 pounds');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d664ab94-bedc-465b-835d-1c8b398d208f', 'cf45686d-d532-441e-b867-d062a9483b26', 'GRIPS: Neutral placed grip are comfortable and elevated sleeves making lifting easier on the back');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f6ea4197-ae7a-4dfb-959e-a2d7fc6d7c26', 'cf45686d-d532-441e-b867-d062a9483b26', 'COMPACT: Constructed of tubular steel, this bar takes up minimal amount of space in home gym');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f91bdc37-1f1e-42f1-bd3d-7905c2552e40', 'cf45686d-d532-441e-b867-d062a9483b26', 'STABILITY: Incorporated feet protect floors from weights and balances bar while loading and unloading; Medium carbon steel bolts are SAE 429 Grade with a tensile strength of 74,000 PSI and shear strength of 37,000 PSI');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cd2a56e8-fd30-473f-80c3-a070b42ea6d1', 'cf45686d-d532-441e-b867-d062a9483b26', 'FULL BODY WORKOUT: This bar allows for a full body workout by engaging large muscle groups thereby building strength and fueling muscle growth; For use with Olympic weights');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('50e50968-a379-409e-b5ea-3380612dfd87', 'cf45686d-d532-441e-b867-d062a9483b26', 'SPORT TYPE: Weightlifting, Exercise and Fitness');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('07b535e0-e9ff-45b6-baf6-a19aa8fd6f90', '9ce3375e-5390-4d82-b5f5-a2487cb2322e', 'PACKAGE INCLUDES: A double grip row 7.5"x6.5"x5.5" & a T-bar row platform 9.3” x 4.8” x 6”');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c1604f95-dc7a-4ec5-998d-f9ed18cc8e21', '9ce3375e-5390-4d82-b5f5-a2487cb2322e', 'HIGH QUALITY, ANTI-SLIP DOUBLE HANDLE: Made of solid steel, high polished Chrome finish, & textured hand grip for non-slipping & anti- corrosion');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('94d4928c-f7db-49b4-a651-1fca8b3c8b8d', '9ce3375e-5390-4d82-b5f5-a2487cb2322e', 'HEAVY-DUTY T-BAR ROW PLATFORM: Constructed of heavy duty steel with dual bushings fitting all 1" standard & 2" Olympic bars');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1d6631ac-0ffe-401e-8edf-29bd70ada84e', '9ce3375e-5390-4d82-b5f5-a2487cb2322e', 'EASY TO INSTALL: Simply a plug & play device by placing under rack tree or weight bench (2" tube) or bolted to the floor, easily fit it any workout spaces at home & gym');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('219733b5-8aba-44cf-88eb-4d1de47a6b79', '9ce3375e-5390-4d82-b5f5-a2487cb2322e', 'MULTI-WORKOUTS: Ideal to work out your back, traps, biceps, abs, hamstrings and more');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b4f44d45-63b0-4f4b-a127-741c7b55b8a3', '98596a57-b6af-4355-bfcd-bc83b3b0f589', 'Prevents floor damage and reduces noise');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2d7ef6fa-ccf0-43e4-9de9-84ad2b6c5d21', 'c86f6927-b8ce-433c-a8fd-89dbdda68f7d', 'INDUSTRY LEADER: For 30+ years, Body Solid has held the widest array of products designed to meet the demands of the ever-changing fitness industry (home gym, free weight machines, treadmills, bikes, ellipticals, weight plates, kettlebells, dumbbells, flooring, accessories and more). Our products are cutting edge and reliable and are built for Life……Your Life.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('11e19e74-8d41-499b-a63a-3c917b6b0aa5', 'c86f6927-b8ce-433c-a8fd-89dbdda68f7d', 'DUAL CABLE ATTACHMENT: The Body-Solid Tools Aluminum Double Swivel attaches to dual-cable functional trainers connecting to both weight stacks for smooth, unilateral movements. Constructed from high-strength, rust-proof and light-weight aluminum, built to last a lifetime. Knurled grips ensure consistent handling during intense workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a9a9cd67-9b40-48bc-8adc-beed21e5b17e', 'c86f6927-b8ce-433c-a8fd-89dbdda68f7d', 'KNURLED GRIP: The body-solid pulout Double Swivel bar is designed with knurled grips for improved and comfort to provide you with a secure and consistent hold during workouts. The grip of the straight bar makes it much easier to hold and perform different exercises for an effective workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9411b9d0-88be-4590-ad75-708527f21cd3', 'c86f6927-b8ce-433c-a8fd-89dbdda68f7d', 'EXERCISES: This fitness bar is extremely easy to assemble with minimal effort and no extra tools. Just attach it and get started. Its substantial weight ensures stability and balance during your entire workout routine, whether you''re performing triceps pushdowns, chest presses, upright rows, lat pulldowns, bench/incline/decline press as well as squats or various exercises.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c544ee7e-4aa8-423b-8e9f-392e7bd4696e', 'c86f6927-b8ce-433c-a8fd-89dbdda68f7d', 'DIMENSIONS: The user can perform all exercises with a greater range of motion, allowing them to maximize muscle activation and target key muscle groups with smooth, unilateral movements. This product weighs only 4 pounds and measures 42 x 1.50 x 1.50 in.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0351729c-235c-4c5e-85af-235a3b037e00', '13d4b51d-840b-432d-9e65-bec3c522fc62', 'Fitness: Our exercise machine attachments are perfect for developing your back, shoulders, forearms, triceps, and biceps.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ecc1ffa8-ed8c-488f-ae2a-bf6b4b5c5cd8', '13d4b51d-840b-432d-9e65-bec3c522fc62', 'Double the Fun: Our Double D design allows you to exercise both arms at once, making your workouts more efficient and effective.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4a22eff1-63b0-4d51-9e98-8b2ca953e4b1', '13d4b51d-840b-432d-9e65-bec3c522fc62', 'Durability: Made of top-quality steel with a chrome finish, our attachments are designed to withstand heavy use and prevent grip rust.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('5b46aafa-770b-4516-8e93-e00f5664a69a', '13d4b51d-840b-432d-9e65-bec3c522fc62', 'Versatile and Easy to Use: Our attachments easily attach to your home gym, smith machine, and more, making it easy to switch up your workouts and target different muscle groups.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bee3fe9a-13ec-42d7-8918-316c6dd1d2c1', '13d4b51d-840b-432d-9e65-bec3c522fc62', 'Strong and Durable: Our attachments can support up to 880 lbs (400 kg), so you can lift heavy and push up to the limit, Dimensions: 7 x 6 x 5 , weighs 3.5 lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ee22093e-48cd-4eb5-bb14-2da87ac7c85e', '445fce86-8c1a-4fe9-ab60-7c902b927c20', '【FULL BODY SQUAT MACHINE】Squat with proper form, focus on toning your glutes, engage your arms, sculpt your abs, and embrace strength training. This all-in-one squat machine delivers a comprehensive and varied workout experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3beaf41a-e1e2-4c10-a862-098b01a3c9e7', '445fce86-8c1a-4fe9-ab60-7c902b927c20', '【MULTI-PURPOSE EXERCISE MACHINE】This exercise equipment''s innovative design lets you perform a range of exercises beyond squats, including deadlifts, incline chest presses, and bent-over rows, enabling a full-body workout with just one compact machine.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d3fb339d-271b-40ad-b254-6709cb63b84d', '445fce86-8c1a-4fe9-ab60-7c902b927c20', '【3 TAILORED SQUAT ASSIST ANGLES】Fine-tune your squat exercises with squat incline settings of 30, 60, and 90 degrees, delivering a personalized workout that meets your specific fitness needs and targets.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('52804523-ee81-4fce-a990-951880c332fc', '445fce86-8c1a-4fe9-ab60-7c902b927c20', '【PREMIUM QUALITY & STURDY BUILD】Featuring a strong frame that supports up to 300 LBs, this equipment can go the distance and push you past that extra rep. The foldable squat assist exercise machine is crafted for rigorous exercise sessions.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('767e6970-1221-49c3-8335-b1443f9f7eff', '445fce86-8c1a-4fe9-ab60-7c902b927c20', '【4 ADJUSTABLE RESISTANCE LEVELS】Personalize your fitness routine using 4 resistance levels to match your current fitness level, giving you the ability to control intensity and progressively increase difficulty for a comprehensive and effective workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('55ffcc00-db45-4e06-8b22-21e77c582a96', '445fce86-8c1a-4fe9-ab60-7c902b927c20', '【FREE CONNECTED APP】Enjoy FREE access to the SunnyFit App with every Sunny Health & Fitness product—no membership fees! Dive into 1,000+ trainer-led workouts, explore 10,000+ virtual scenic tours, track your progress, challenge others, and much more!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('1f6eb6b5-ddef-4997-a1e2-2b9d9c9b5b29', '445fce86-8c1a-4fe9-ab60-7c902b927c20', '【ENHANCED ERGONOMIC COMFORT AND FIT】The curved, padded handles are ergonomically designed with four length options to accommodate any user size, ensuring a custom grip. Meanwhile, the adjustable, padded seat enhances your workout comfort and support.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('44a07db9-42bd-45b9-9b7a-c7d5ffe925e3', '445fce86-8c1a-4fe9-ab60-7c902b927c20', '【EFFORTLESS ASSEMBLY】Designed with your convenience in mind. Our squat assist machine comes easy to assemble, ensuring a simple and quick start. Be ready to use your ab and glute machine in just minutes when you open the box.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('89590748-402a-4151-bfb3-e0c0ea33ea35', '445fce86-8c1a-4fe9-ab60-7c902b927c20', '【FOLDABLE STORAGE】Foldable for easy storage in small areas like offices or apartments, this exercise rower machine for home maximizes convenience without sacrificing functionality.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2110ad7e-cb21-4d78-8b95-856ca8bd1130', '445fce86-8c1a-4fe9-ab60-7c902b927c20', '【PREMIER U.S.-BASED BRAND】With 20+ years of excellence, Sunny Health & Fitness delivers top-notch equipment dedicated to excellence. With our devoted support team and certified trainers enjoy an unmatched FIT FOR EVERYONE experience.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0abb6ed9-8461-4894-83c5-9d88eef15bf2', 'd790d403-5543-4675-af6b-689a61ea5167', 'THE PATENTED DIP STATION: The patented adjustable Dip Station with 2 width positions that correctly fits you and every member of your family. Dip Station stands 3'' tall to fit users up to 6. 5'' in height and builds up to 350 lbs');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f2f851fd-4424-4eb8-8eb2-fb5c7330a3b5', 'd790d403-5543-4675-af6b-689a61ea5167', 'EASY STORAGE: The only Dip Station that folds easily for transport or storage with fast color-coded spring-tab assembly that requires no tools. Quick-adjust leveling feet are firm on every surface');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ed296ee3-d0c0-4689-aab2-1ae2af804163', 'd790d403-5543-4675-af6b-689a61ea5167', 'BETTER FORM: Exclusive angled grips ergonomically reduce strain and support proper form to rapidly sculpt arms, chest, shoulders and core. Premium pads and thick wall steel stand up to your most rigorous workouts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6806c906-e870-42b4-a183-611de6a34816', 'd790d403-5543-4675-af6b-689a61ea5167', 'BETTER BALANCE: Bodyweight rows balance your chest results with back development. Take your workouts further with optional Bodyweight Resistance Trainers or the Weighted Dip Belt Agility Trainer for intense full body training (accessories sold separately)');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('775f2387-49e4-4143-b4ab-ff713a62cca8', 'd790d403-5543-4675-af6b-689a61ea5167', 'DESIGNED IN THE USA: Ultimate Body Press is a North Carolina company committed to delivering better workouts every day. Includes Prime eligible shipping and USA customer service.SHOP WITH CONFIDENCE: The Dip Bar Fitness Station is backed by Ultimate Body Press against manufacturer''s defects for 10 years');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f47db078-7041-4daa-9df5-b8cc18480a3d', '2fe64029-d77d-4884-8c22-536f594864c0', 'FOAM ROLLERS: Kick your feet up, decompress, and stretch using the padded foam rollers.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('630db1e8-7a66-4eb1-8e41-3c3ec52e09d9', '2fe64029-d77d-4884-8c22-536f594864c0', 'DUAL SAFETY STRAPS: 2 pairs of safety straps located on the front post of the stretch machine will help ensure the safe operation of the stretch trainer machine.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3e8014f2-6f75-4138-abdf-650c55f743f3', '98596a57-b6af-4355-bfcd-bc83b3b0f589', 'Extra-large handle for secure grip and comfort');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7cddc949-7a70-41f8-9271-b9f7bf693f14', '98596a57-b6af-4355-bfcd-bc83b3b0f589', 'For indoor and outdoor use');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('52007761-eeb1-4ad1-b083-95c6a91f8e01', '2fe64029-d77d-4884-8c22-536f594864c0', 'PIVOTING SEAT AND KNEEPAD: Go further in your stretches with a travel distance of over 24 inches. Large, cushioned seating and knee pad provide exceptional comfort and support.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('44f81e35-c387-46fa-a5a7-0f650b0d437e', '2fe64029-d77d-4884-8c22-536f594864c0', 'SELF-LEVELING PEDALS: Never lose your step and recover quickly for your next stretch position.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cb56d295-f822-42c9-8718-d9f25f979423', '2fe64029-d77d-4884-8c22-536f594864c0', 'MULTI-GRIP HANDLES: Switch grips to assist in targeting and focusing on specific areas or positions.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('cd0e8a1f-a6f3-4944-9356-42edc8793dad', '2fe64029-d77d-4884-8c22-536f594864c0', 'COMPACT DESIGN: Featuring a small footprint and lightweight design (less than 30 LB), obtain big stretches in a space-efficient form factor and it’s compact enough for easy storage.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3f20d852-2cab-47ac-9177-10272df981cd', '2fe64029-d77d-4884-8c22-536f594864c0', 'INSTRUCTIONAL PLACARD: Detailed instructions for 9 different stretches help you get started on your stretching regimen.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d93fdc0e-f41c-4a58-aa3a-b874d7e892a1', 'cb0dbc36-6e30-4a24-905d-539c815b2fe0', '【High Quality Pull Down Bar Attachment】:The Lat Attachment Pull Down Bar attaches to cable machines, seated rowing machines, and DIY pulley systems for forward pull downs and backhand pull downs. Exercises the lower side of the latissimus dorsi, arm and low back muscles');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6026c5b2-6203-4f2e-92ed-e2282613d228', 'cb0dbc36-6e30-4a24-905d-539c815b2fe0', '【Add Foam Design】: add two foam, narrow grip pulldown is better and more comfortable，The product comes with 2 mountaineering buckles');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('97c962f5-bae4-4438-936d-68a91e5832ce', 'cb0dbc36-6e30-4a24-905d-539c815b2fe0', '【Detachable Lower Rails】:The cable attachment for the gym handles only takes 1 minute to assemble! Installation tools are equipped inside the product kit');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bd89a15c-c8d9-4f77-81e2-6bb37420fd3d', 'cb0dbc36-6e30-4a24-905d-539c815b2fe0', '【Non-slip Rubber Grips】:The grips have been upgraded with a very comfortable rubberized cover to fit your hand better during exercise');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e55841d8-2cf3-4d87-9bc9-4b1982f36993', 'cb0dbc36-6e30-4a24-905d-539c815b2fe0', '【Gym Attachment】For you who love exercise and want to have a beautiful body, this 39 inch cable machine attachment is definitely a great addition to your home gym');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b7b039b3-d74a-4e9d-ba50-ce85630f02be', '507e9fce-269a-4f0f-893a-672f503b37ea', 'HEAVY DUTY- Solid Steel frame measuring 2. 75 in. X 2 in. with a Tripod Base for stability throughout the frame. Measures 42 in. high.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('151b44b5-6036-4813-ba9a-8fbc36e4463f', '507e9fce-269a-4f0f-893a-672f503b37ea', 'HIGH-DENSITY PADDING- Designed with high-density, dual layered padding to withstand intense stress and pressure during exercise. Back pad measures 19. 75 in. X 9. 5 in. X 2. 25 in. Seat pad measures 12 in. X 9. 25/6 in. X 2. 75 in.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0d40e185-5df8-4f1c-9146-8cc19d808731', '507e9fce-269a-4f0f-893a-672f503b37ea', 'TAPERED SEAT- Tapered seat allows the user to sit comfortably and naturally without the seat pad getting in the way. Measures 18. 75 in. off the ground. Back pad designed with 3-degree tilt for a ergonomically upright position.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('be140132-9bbc-44ff-90a3-66a264947c40', '507e9fce-269a-4f0f-893a-672f503b37ea', 'FOOT SUPPORT- Foot posts at the base of the unit allow for added support while lifting a heavier load. Measures 7. 5 in. long on each side.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('caa9eb3b-7f48-4a57-9f7a-e732660bf0ec', '507e9fce-269a-4f0f-893a-672f503b37ea', 'ADDITIONAL- Max weight capacity 750 lbs. Commercial grade.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7e26c3e8-8199-4a6f-a0f5-34bd2a7b0c01', '7011623f-84f0-44cc-a94d-9d52e5828de7', 'Comprehensive Upper Body Training: This chest machine combines a chest press and butterfly arm features, allowing for a versatile upper body workout in your home gym');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c0c936ad-5d22-46e3-9639-1fde0f73fa43', '7011623f-84f0-44cc-a94d-9d52e5828de7', 'Customizable Comfort: Features a 4-level adjustable seat, ensuring users of various heights can exercise comfortably and effectively');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('15c893f4-8005-4f1a-a034-bbe27ce3646a', '7011623f-84f0-44cc-a94d-9d52e5828de7', 'Gradual Resistance Adjustment: This pec deck fly machine supports adjustable resistance with compatibility for 1" opening weight plates, enabling 66 lbs. per arm and 132 lbs.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9110c499-7e47-47cb-b8a2-1f4f5331ccb6', '7011623f-84f0-44cc-a94d-9d52e5828de7', 'Solid and Stable Build: Constructed with robust 2" x 2" steel tubes and equipped with anti-slip foot bases, this strength training equipment enhances safety and stability during workouts');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fa1e5a37-5118-488f-8079-654db7ffa714', '7011623f-84f0-44cc-a94d-9d52e5828de7', 'Overall Dimensions: 38.6" L x 43.3" W x 78.1" H; Weight Capacity: 265 lbs.; Assembly required.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f3e06851-4c5d-4b53-8c17-47b78f2bc0c4', 'b3349c56-7922-4670-92dd-ea408ce268bb', 'HEAVY DUTY- Solid steel frame measuring 2.75” x 2” with a tripod frame and a rear U-shaped base for stability throughout the frame. Rubber end caps encase each foot for added stability and prevent damage to gym flooring.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('27c442dc-8e89-4604-bed6-00c9126ab26b', 'b3349c56-7922-4670-92dd-ea408ce268bb', 'HIGH-DENSITY PADDING- Designed with high-density, dual layered padding to withstand intense stress and pressure during exercise. Back pad measures 20” x 9.75” x 2.5”. Seat pad measures 12” x 9.5” x 2.5”.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b1652dbd-b697-47c4-95af-07b3bca7234d', 'b3349c56-7922-4670-92dd-ea408ce268bb', 'TAPERED SEAT- Tapered seat allows the user to sit comfortably and naturally without the seat pad getting in the way. Seat is 18.25” off the ground. Back pad designed with 3-degree tilt for an ergonomic upright position.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('b2486c58-b57c-44a3-a0b0-55e702344011', 'b3349c56-7922-4670-92dd-ea408ce268bb', 'VERSATILE- Perfect unit to perform several exercises such as seated shoulder press (both dumbbell or barbell), bicep curls, tricep extensions, and even lateral raises.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('4be30d53-244d-4d54-b2f2-0b0259bf07b3', 'b3349c56-7922-4670-92dd-ea408ce268bb', 'FOOT SUPPORT- Foot posts (6.75” each side) at the base of the unit for add support. ADDITIONAL- Footprint measures 45” x 25” x 42”. Max weight load of 500 lb. Meant for home and light-commercial use.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('945f5331-487a-46b9-a935-8a70b68018aa', 'b8a385e7-816b-4450-bf9a-e3405def9598', 'Heavy Duty: This preacher curl bench is constructed from heavy-duty 2” x 2” steel for a strong and stable frame necessary when lifting heavy weight. Option to bolt unit to the ground for further stability hardware not included');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c49a7cfc-c501-4bb9-b775-d6958198d316', 'b8a385e7-816b-4450-bf9a-e3405def9598', 'Padding: Designed with high-quality and high-density dual-layered padding that can withstand stress from intense workouts. Angled pad measures 14.5” x 24”. Straight pad measures 11.5” x 23.5”');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('af41510e-e637-4ccc-8283-d0313bbb2e9b', 'b8a385e7-816b-4450-bf9a-e3405def9598', 'Dual Positions: Allows the user the option to perform curls on both sides of the Standing Arm Curl Station for a different range of motion and focus on specific muscles. Meant to be used with an easy curl barbell');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7b6a0c47-3c3c-4976-b8fd-15850b353c73', 'b8a385e7-816b-4450-bf9a-e3405def9598', 'Long Safety Catches: This workout bench has extra-long 19.5” safety catches on both sides of the machine provide optimal security while you’re lifting heavy weight. Plastic covering on safety catch to protect bars from scratching');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a975d049-3583-48f2-b376-f4e2c4b0ef65', 'b8a385e7-816b-4450-bf9a-e3405def9598', 'Assitional: Footprint measures 45” x 31” x 45.75”. Meant for light commercial gym or home gym use');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d06d0b12-2b28-4a0d-9ddd-17485037a2d6', '7179bbda-ebf4-43c0-9964-f5d6b98f2db7', 'The Bionic Body Deluxe Exercise Bar is ideal for lats, curls, and various other exercises due to its curved shaped.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('2ad624d5-c175-4a9a-92cf-a68fe18b6aba', '7179bbda-ebf4-43c0-9964-f5d6b98f2db7', 'The exercise bar includes swivel points at where the resistance tubes are connected to easily adjust the bar as you begin your workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a0e93f44-2212-4f6c-a46f-5c74a0c83221', '7179bbda-ebf4-43c0-9964-f5d6b98f2db7', 'The Bionic Body BBEB-7355 is a durable curved bar made of steel to handle your intense workouts and coated with rubber to provide a strong grip.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f2a09839-6cab-4870-847c-c1ee570f748b', '7179bbda-ebf4-43c0-9964-f5d6b98f2db7', 'With the Bionic Body Deluxe Exercise Bar, you can turn any space in to a home gym, since bulky weights are not needed.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('43f1667c-580b-471f-8382-a519c48a723c', '7179bbda-ebf4-43c0-9964-f5d6b98f2db7', 'The Bionic Body Deluxe Exercise Bar for Lats, Curls and More BBEB-7355 is intended for use with resistance tubes which are sold separately');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('9e5cd243-3685-48b8-8d5d-403afa59724f', '14e1de93-82fb-40e8-894f-d277e1b15f72', '【Get Bigger Arms】Everyone wants bigger arms, with our preacher pad it will isolate your biceps and triceps that enables to maximize arm muscle gains faster and more efficiently.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('662e6900-efb0-4bbe-925f-92d53c0ce168', '14e1de93-82fb-40e8-894f-d277e1b15f72', '【Ideal Size and Ergonomic Design】This preacher curl bench is 24” x 8.2” x 11.6” created by fitness experts, our arm blaster for biceps is designed to fits different body shapes, and create a stable shape for bicep curls and arm curls.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('155959dd-a0de-45d3-a1a1-cc406daa7556', '14e1de93-82fb-40e8-894f-d277e1b15f72', '【Multi-Functional Bicep Trainer】Our preacher pad will take your bicep workout to the next level, simply place the Fitlaya Fitness bicep curl pad on your thighs and clench the pad with your armpits, and it precisely stimulates your biceps, triceps and back with barbells, dumbbells, cable columns or EZ bars.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('52a43fc2-f627-4c59-938e-116142d57744', '14e1de93-82fb-40e8-894f-d277e1b15f72', '【Finely Handcrafted】Our gym arm blaster is made to last, made with new technology PVC leather which is water-repellent and sweat-resistant aims to extend service life, also, the inner high-density foam has a great performance on rebound resilience that provides a durable and comfortable preacher curl workout.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('fe1e4726-d00d-4340-8122-9a9f7ab06306', '14e1de93-82fb-40e8-894f-d277e1b15f72', '【Anytime & Anywhere】Normally, a preacher curl machine will take up 8-12 square feet space and heavy to move, however, our bicep blaster weighs only 3.5 LBS and equipped with a carrying loop on the side, so you can carry it to any places you want, making it space-efficiency without sacrifice the effectiveness of biceps workout equipment.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('aa0b2bf2-ff4e-4137-95f2-e3bb2e2f4daa', '567a6e42-0281-4297-942f-5285ffbeabde', '【More Accessible & Hassle Free】The 3.2 inch dual-wheel ab roller offers extra support and stability compared to the common single ab wheel. Equipped with a knee pad, this ab roller wheel delivers comfortable workout experience and caring protection. Just embrace the freedom of more thrilling and challenging routines without the hassle of using resistance bands!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('f03ba6e9-79ab-4ad6-b9fe-bfa66ecf2afd', '567a6e42-0281-4297-942f-5285ffbeabde', '【Grow Six Packs Faster & Safer】The Vinsguir abs wheel targets your abdominals, hip flexors and back muscles. With dedicated practice, this exercise wheel will speed up your core & low back strengthening while lessoning your risk of muscle injury.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('6098e6ae-6cd0-4657-b2f3-f3e84fc51ac5', '567a6e42-0281-4297-942f-5285ffbeabde', '【Efficient Exercise Equipment】Unlike big gym machines, or heavy weight benches, dumbbells and the like, the Vinsguir ab wheel roller is portable size-wise -- a compact design that enables you to take it anywhere to exercise, be it your home, office, gym, or outdoors.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ab0a3b56-1420-4971-9ce3-2a3725c6af68', '567a6e42-0281-4297-942f-5285ffbeabde', '【Amazingly Durable & Stable】The high-strength stainless steel shaft of the ab roller for abs workout can hold a maximum weight of 440 pounds for your safety. The 3.2 inch ultra-wide abs roller ensures balance and stability as it does not deviate sideways. EVA rubber cotton handles provide nonslip and comfortable grip.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('afe63bb7-d29c-434e-adc7-51d3fcd00e09', '567a6e42-0281-4297-942f-5285ffbeabde', '【Top Gift Choice for Fitness Enthusiasts】This workout roller goes beyond working your abs and burning your fat. As a versatile roller wheel, it is of no contest when it comes to selecting an ideal gift for your family and friends; not to mention the satisfaction guaranteed after-sales services. Wish you a joyful shopping experience!');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('438595ed-722d-49d3-9d10-57dd76fd767e', '46ee7a9c-8c5f-4d7e-8a93-94456b6a1e40', 'ENHANCED COMFORT: Our bicep blaster features a double-layers EVA neck cushion for superior comfort during intense bicep and tricep workouts. It ensures a comfortable experience for men seeking to strengthen their arms with an arm blaster specifically designed for biceps and triceps.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7c1c88ba-c968-46d8-996c-a0f11e53c259', '46ee7a9c-8c5f-4d7e-8a93-94456b6a1e40', 'OPTIMAL MUSCLE BLASTING: The curved design of our arm blaster perfectly conforms to your body shape, facilitating proper form and targeting the bicep muscles effectively. The included elbow pads serve as a resting platform, enabling longer and more intense preacher curls for maximum muscle activation.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('60451be0-cfbf-4f46-a9a6-e5f39993d669', '46ee7a9c-8c5f-4d7e-8a93-94456b6a1e40', 'LIGHTWEIGHT DURABLE: Made of reinforced aluminum, our arm blaster is lightweight and portable, making it ideal for home and gym use. It provides the stability and durability needed for intense bicep and tricep workouts. Say goodbye to bulky bicep curl machines and embrace the convenience of our compact arm blaster.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('3eed7867-4392-44db-847f-6e61f99ed62e', '46ee7a9c-8c5f-4d7e-8a93-94456b6a1e40', 'ADJUSTABLE STRAP FOR CUSTOM FIT: The heavy-duty polypropylene webbing strap with a smooth buckle allows for easy adjustment, ensuring a custom fit for users of different body sizes and shapes. It securely connects the arm blaster to the bar, providing stability and support during bicep curls and preacher curls.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('06f6e573-2e0c-4877-bf96-f578183d2979', '46ee7a9c-8c5f-4d7e-8a93-94456b6a1e40', 'SPACE-EFFICIENT BICEPS WORKOUT EQUIPMENT: Our arm blaster is the addition to your biceps workout equipment collection. It takes up minimal space compared to bulkier preacher curl benches or bicep curl machines, making it suitable for compact home gyms. Enjoy a complete biceps workout without sacrificing valuable space.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bfed7e86-8fc6-48e3-8531-dbbbfc7ff6e5', '77613cd3-8293-4a40-9b5a-8c35d56e32b2', 'INDUSTRY LEADER - For 30+ years, Body Solid has held the widest array of products designed to meet the demands of the ever-changing fitness industry (home gym, free weight machine, treadmills, bikes, ellipticals, weight plates, kettlebells, dumbbells, flooring, curl bar cable attachment, and more). Our curl bar attachments are cutting-edge and reliable and are built for Life……Your Life.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('360dee76-536b-4038-a056-515b4fd7dee1', '77613cd3-8293-4a40-9b5a-8c35d56e32b2', 'DESIGNED FOR VARIOUS BICEP EXERCISES - Perfect for a range of forearm exercises mainly bicep curls, upright rows, and even tricep pull-downs or tricep extensions, this versatile attachment enhances your workout potential for building well-toned forearms. Designed with a fat grip, this revolving curl bar attachment for pulley cable machine isolates your biceps to optimize muscle engagement and growth.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('88bb1bcf-ba69-43bf-a4b2-ca73906faa95', '77613cd3-8293-4a40-9b5a-8c35d56e32b2', 'MADE FROM PREMIUM MATERIALS - Constructed with high-quality materials, this cable curl bar attachment ensures long-lasting durability and features an ergonomic design for comfortable workouts. Our revolving curl bar provides additional strength to your workout routine and is designed to allow maximum muscle activation during your bicep or even tricep workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e468eebf-6d52-4ec8-bfb5-24572e1036e2', '77613cd3-8293-4a40-9b5a-8c35d56e32b2', 'IMPROVED GRIP STRENGTH - This wide grip design not only isolates your biceps but also enhances your grip strength and stimulates the surrounding muscles, providing a more challenging and efficient workout experience. It also features a non-slip secure handle for maximum control while preventing accidental slips.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('d90628d9-276c-4a82-bcb5-e0e49a0cf9ba', '77613cd3-8293-4a40-9b5a-8c35d56e32b2', 'COMPATIBLE WITH MOST CABLE MACHINES - This curl bar attachment seamlessly integrates with various cable machines, making it an essential addition to your gym cable attachments for a comprehensive workout routine. Our cable machine attachments are designed to have a secure fit. We offer a wide range of accessories, including leg press attachments, and chest flies - giving your commercial and home gym an extra level of customization.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c443a764-1dcc-43f7-8d75-ac3398f9ce68', 'a8197776-197e-48d8-81ee-5cf00a471bd5', '【Effective Accessories】It comes with high quality collar that hold the weight plate tightly to the base to prevent movement when in use. It also comes with newly designed limit pins for double protection.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('ae3b63ce-ef34-435f-8648-0ae916d252bb', '019ea102-8a80-4322-bb5b-59fd234e6f73', 'INDUSTRY LEADER: For 30+ years, Body Solid has held the widest array of products designed to meet the demands of the ever-changing fitness industry (home gym, free weight machines, treadmills, bikes, power rack, strength training smith machine, ellipticals, weight plates, kettlebells, dumbbells, flooring, accessories and more). Our products are cutting edge and reliable and are built for Life……Your Life.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('c64e8d88-cf7d-4dc3-a3bd-4a6e36428192', '019ea102-8a80-4322-bb5b-59fd234e6f73', 'CABLE ATTACHMENT FOR VARIOUS WORKOUTS: Discover the unparalleled convenience of this lat and row bar attachment. Perform multiple high and low pulley exercises including lat pulldowns, rows, and bicep curls. Never miss a workout given your busy schedule. Unlock full-body workouts with ease and attain your fitness goals without stepping out of your comfort zone.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('461f0926-d863-46d2-84ce-205e11b4a231', '019ea102-8a80-4322-bb5b-59fd234e6f73', 'POWERFUL PERFORMANCE IN A COMPACT DESIGN: Seamlessly integrated into your GPR400 Power Rack for a more extensive workout option. Perfect for any home, from expansive gym rooms to cozy apartments. The GLA400 is a plate-loaded attachment allowing users to easily add weight plates to the GLA400. So, you can focus on multiple upper body muscles from biceps, triceps, shoulders, to back.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0475708e-951a-4649-ac61-cf64711f0e44', '019ea102-8a80-4322-bb5b-59fd234e6f73', 'COMPREHENSIVE MUSCLE TARGETING: This cable exercise attachment enables targeted strength training that promotes muscle growth and toning from the comfort of your home. Enjoy the freedom of crafting workouts that align perfectly with your fitness goals; every extension, curl, and shrug designed to elevate your physique, performance, and overall well-being.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('29f0ac8e-ee5d-4641-8ec0-c8cbb7e2df4e', '019ea102-8a80-4322-bb5b-59fd234e6f73', 'ACHIEVE UNMATCHED STABILITY AND SAFETY: With the GLA400 designed specifically for the Body-Solid GPR400 Power Rack, stability in every workout is guaranteed. Experience worry-free exercises, knowing your equipment is engineered for safety and durability.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('0c540795-ba19-4404-bdc6-fa7d97e1b597', '53f95c8f-d5b5-4038-b6c8-6ccd4e40b341', '【OPTIMIZED MOTION】: Easily sculpt a V-shaped back with our seated row machine! Replicate the traditional pulling movement towards the chest, it''s ergonomically designed to follow the body''s natural motion, ensuring maximum engagement and a full range of motion. Feel the intensity as your back muscles engage, supported by smooth-operating bearings for a seamless exercise experience. Whether you''re a beginner or a seasoned pro, mastering this back machine is effortless.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a82053a1-8374-4b7e-a601-08217f6553fe', '53f95c8f-d5b5-4038-b6c8-6ccd4e40b341', '【COMMERCIAL-GRADE MACHINE】: Upgrade to a commercial-grade fitness equipment at an affordable price! With dimensions of 58.2" x 42" x 55.9", our seated row machine plate loaded offers generous space for fluid movement. Crafted from heavy-duty 13-gauge steel, its sturdy frame supports up to 600lbs, guaranteeing stability during rigorous workouts. Plus, its extended 9.6" weight holder effortlessly holds four 35lbs weights. Experience durability, stability, and convenience all in one machine.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('a3ce03b8-970f-4ea9-97f9-4366dc05f688', '53f95c8f-d5b5-4038-b6c8-6ccd4e40b341', '【MULTIPLE GRIP HANDLES】: Featuring multiple grip handles that cater to every inch of your back, this leverage seated row machine allows you to effortlessly target various muscle groups with ease.The narrow grips for lats and mid back, while wider grips can target your upper back and delts, you can customize your workout for optimal results. Plus, our non-slip coated handles ensure comfort and safety throughout the workouts.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('bbe2c07f-ab96-41eb-aeb8-78282ba3e703', '53f95c8f-d5b5-4038-b6c8-6ccd4e40b341', '【INDEPENDENT ARMS】: Back machine’s independent mechanical arms grant you the flexibility to alternate sides or engage both simultaneously. This versatility makes the lat machine particularly advantageous for people aiming to balance unilateral strength. By adjusting the weights, customize your exercises to target specific areas effectively. Moreover, the inclusion of an Assist Handle offers additional support during single-arm exercises, promoting proper form and amplifying your results.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('7a59a210-90a2-4ccc-ae65-fa40635576f7', '53f95c8f-d5b5-4038-b6c8-6ccd4e40b341', '【COMFORT& ADJUSTABILITY】: Boasting an extra-thick seat and chest cushion for optimal comfort during intense sessions. Adjustable in four positions to suit different body types, the back row machine seamlessly transitions to a standing row with a quick-detach seat, maximizing muscle engagement. Non-slip foot pedals ensure stability and effective upper body isolation. Experience the pinnacle of seated rowing, where comfort, adjustability, and performance converge effortlessly.');
INSERT INTO public.equipment_features VALUES ('e1eb0c21-8dc3-49dd-bf6c-029f4595efc9', '9b8d62b1-746f-4e30-a4e1-d032fdd65f80', 'INDUSTRY LEADER: For 30+ years, Body Solid has held the widest array of products designed to meet the demands of the ever-changing fitness industry (home gym, free weight machines, treadmills, bikes, ellipticals, weight plates, kettlebells, dumbbells, flooring, accessories and more). Our products are cutting edge and reliable and are built for Life……Your Life.');
